�脢id�c9e52b5b18fd�body�٨机械臂每个关节都有编码器随时报告角度，控制器对照设定程序不断微调，所以每次都走到几乎完全相同的地方，比人手更稳。ٲEach joint has an encoder reporting its angle, and a controller constantly corrects against the program, so the arm reaches nearly the same spot every time, steadier than a hand.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�c9e7defb77c7�body���伯努利原理指出流体速度越大压强越小，机翼正是利用上下表面流速差产生压强差形成升力。虽然升力还来自机翼对气流的下偏作用，但伯努利效应是核心解释之一。�Bernoulli's principle states that faster fluid has lower pressure, and a wing exploits the speed difference between its surfaces to create a pressure difference and thus lift. Although lift also comes from the wing deflecting air downward, the Bernoulli effect is a core explanation.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�cbab9fa2ada4�body���储能电池在发电多时充电、用电高峰时放电，平抑电力供需的波动。它对太阳能和风能这类不稳定电源尤为重要，能提升电网的稳定性和可靠性。��A storage battery charges when generation is high and discharges at peak demand, smoothing the swings between supply and use. It is especially important for variable sources like solar and wind, improving grid stability and reliability.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�cc766008cce0�body�ٴ不锈钢在铁和碳之外加了铬等元素，铬在表面形成致密的氧化膜，阻止水和氧继续侵蚀，所以不容易生锈；普通钢缺少这层保护易生锈。ٴStainless steel adds chromium, which forms a dense oxide film on the surface that blocks water and oxygen, so it resists rust; ordinary steel lacks this shield and corrodes easily.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�cccfdef496de�body���活性污泥由大量好氧微生物（细菌、原生动物等）组成，微生物在有氧条件下把污水中的有机污染物氧化分解为二氧化碳、水和新的微生物细胞，同时部分污染物被吸附去除。曝气既为微生物提供溶解氧维持好氧代谢，又搅拌混合使污泥与污水充分接触并防止沉淀。处理后混合液进入二沉池，污泥沉降分离，上清液排出，部分污泥回流保持系统浓度。�5Activated sludge is a culture of aerobic microorganisms (bacteria, protozoa and more) that, in the presence of oxygen, oxidise the organic pollutants in wastewater into carbon dioxide, water and new biomass while also adsorbing a portion of the pollutants. Aeration supplies dissolved oxygen for aerobic metabolism and mixes the sludge with the wastewater, preventing settlement. The mixed liquor then flows to a secondary clarifier where sludge settles out, the supernatant is discharged, and part of the sludge is returned to keep the system concentration stable.�ans��src��!美国水环境联合会（WEF）�"WEF (Water Environment Federation)��id�cdf58ba11d7b�body���光纤是极细的玻璃或塑料丝，利用全反射把光信号限制在纤芯内长距离传输，几乎不受电磁干扰、损耗极低，因此能高速、大容量地传送电话和互联网数据。��An optical fiber is a thin glass or plastic thread that traps light by total internal reflection and carries it far with tiny loss and no electromagnetic interference, enabling high-speed, high-capacity data.�ans��src��9《通信原理》（樊昌信，国防工业出版社）�OA Mathematical Theory of Communication, Shannon (Bell System Technical Journal)��id�ce6823ff2249�body���它使用SLAM（同时定位与建图）技术：激光雷达或视觉传感器持续提取环境特征，机器人一边估计自身位姿，一边把特征点拼成地图，同步完成"我在哪里"和"周围长什么样"。里程计、陀螺仪与观测数据用粒子滤波或图优化融合，消除长时间行走产生的累积漂移。清扫路径因此从随机乱撞变成了规划好的全覆盖，自动驾驶车的定位也依赖同一套思路。�It uses SLAM (simultaneous localization and mapping): lidar or vision sensors keep extracting landmarks, and the robot estimates its own pose while stitching the features into a map — answering "where am I" and "what does the place look like" at the same time. Wheel odometry, gyros, and sensor measurements are fused with particle filters or graph optimization to remove the drift accumulated over long travel. That is why cleaning paths went from random bumping to planned full coverage; self-driving cars rely on the same idea.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�cf50212cadf7�body��K通过体心立方、gyroid 等周期性点阵，可在保持一定刚度和比强度的同时大幅降低零件质量，并实现能量吸收、隔热或多孔植入等功能。这类复杂内部几何传统减材工艺难以加工，而对增材制造却几乎无额外成本，因此被广泛用于航空航天与医疗部件。�xPeriodic lattices such as body-centered cubic or gyroid can sharply reduce mass while retaining stiffness and specific strength, and also provide energy absorption, thermal insulation, or porous implant functions. Such complex internal geometry is hard to machine by subtraction but nearly free with additive manufacturing, so it is widely used in aerospace and medical parts.�ans��src��-《材料科学》（多孔与点阵材料）�0Materials Science (porous and lattice materials)��id�d16bfc478107�body�ٮ变压器用两组匝数不同的线圈和铁芯，交流电在一组产生变化磁场，在另一组感应出电压；匝数多的输出高压、匝数少的输出低压。ٿIt uses two coils of different turns on an iron core; the alternating current in one coil makes a changing magnetic field that induces a different voltage in the other, set by the turn ratio.�ans��src��<Stevenson & Grainger，《电力系统分析》（第3版）�7Stevenson & Grainger, 'Power System Analysis' (3rd ed.)��id�d29e1b916e0b�body�٢冲压机用上下模具在瞬间施加巨大压力，把金属板剪切或压弯成零件形状，速度快、成本低，汽车车身很多就是这么造的。٥A stamping press slams a punch and die together with huge force, cutting or bending sheet metal into a part in an instant; it is fast and cheap, used for car bodies.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�d33a33af4288�body���切入风速是风机开始发电的最低风速；达到额定风速后输出功率稳定在额定值；超过切出风速（通常约每秒 25 米）为安全停机，避免叶片和结构过载受损。��Cut-in is the minimum wind speed to generate; at rated speed output holds at the rated power; above cut-out (about 25 m/s) the turbine shuts down to protect blades and structure from overload.�ans��src��(Burton，《风能手册》（第2版）�(Burton, 'Wind Energy Handbook' (2nd ed.)��id�d35067ab66a5�body��f鼓形增大内部空间与车体刚度，又降低气动阻力，是外形和结构的双重优化。�tThe barrel shape adds interior room and stiffness while cutting aerodynamic drag—a structural and aerodynamic win.�ans��src��LR. C. Hibbeler,《Engineering Mechanics: Statics & Dynamics》Pearson 多版�VR. C. Hibbeler, Engineering Mechanics: Statics and Dynamics, Pearson, various editions��id�d44fb10f258a�body���锂离子电池是二次电池：放电时锂离子从石墨负极脱出、穿过电解液嵌入正极金属氧化物，充电时外加电压让锂离子反向迁回负极，这是可逆的嵌入-脱出反应，因此能循环上千次。而碱性干电池的放电反应不可逆，正极活性物质一旦消耗就没了。锂电池能量密度高靠的是锂原子轻、电压高，但其寿命仍受容量衰减和析锂等问题的限制。�A lithium-ion cell is a rechargeable battery: on discharge, lithium ions leave the graphite anode, cross the electrolyte, and insert into a metal-oxide cathode; charging forces them back in reverse. This reversible intercalation-deintercalation allows thousands of cycles. An alkaline dry cell's chemistry is irreversible — once the cathode material is consumed it is gone. Lithium cells pack more energy because lithium is light and the cell voltage is high, though cycle life is still capped by capacity fade and lithium plating.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�d455c2f1d8c4�body��s电动机靠磁场相互作用转动：定子线圈通电产生旋转磁场，转子（永磁体或感应电流）处在这个磁场中，载流导体受到的电磁力让转子追逐旋转磁场，感应电机的转速略低于同步转速，同步电机则与之完全同步。直流电机靠换向器在转子转到合适角度时切换电枢电流方向，使转矩始终朝同一方向，转子才能持续旋转；交流异步电机则靠转子与旋转磁场之间的速度差（滑差）维持感应电流，同步电机靠转子磁极锁定旋转磁场。输出力矩的大小由电流与磁场强度的乘积决定。�<A motor spins through interacting magnetic fields: current in the stator windings creates a rotating field, and the rotor (permanent magnets or induced currents) sits inside it and feels electromagnetic force on its conductors, which makes the rotor chase the rotating field — an induction rotor runs slightly below synchronous speed, while a synchronous rotor locks to it exactly. In a DC motor the commutator switches the armature current direction as the rotor reaches the right angular position, so torque keeps acting in one rotational direction and the rotor keeps spinning; an induction motor relies on the speed difference (slip) between rotor and field to sustain the induced currents, while a synchronous motor locks its poles to the rotating field. Output torque is set by the product of current and field strength.�ans��src��WFitzgerald 等《电机学》(Electric Machinery)；Tesla《多相交流电机》(1888)�cFitzgerald et al., 'Electric Machinery'; Tesla, 'A New System of Alternating Current Motors' (1888)��id�d4ea462d59f3�body��经典组合是金属或陶瓷球头配超高分子量聚乙烯臼杯，也有陶瓷对陶瓷以降低磨损。通过提高表面光洁度、优化球头直径与交联聚乙烯，可将磨损颗粒减少到延长假体寿命的水平，但颗粒引发的骨溶解仍是长期隐患。�MA classic pairing is a metal or ceramic head against an ultra-high-molecular-weight polyethylene cup, and ceramic-on-ceramic is used to cut wear. Better surface finish, optimized head diameter, and cross-linked polyethylene reduce wear particles to extend implant life, though particle-induced osteolysis remains a long-term concern.�ans��src��_Ratner、Hoffman、Schoen & Lemons，《生物材料科学：医用材料导论》（第3版）�lRatner, Hoffman, Schoen & Lemons, 'Biomaterials Science: An Introduction to Materials in Medicine' (3rd ed.)��id�d55625d00510�body���流线型通过平滑的曲面减缓车身后部逆压梯度，推迟边界层分离、缩小尾流区，从而显著降低压差阻力。风阻系数越低，高速行驶时的油耗与噪声越小。��A streamlined body eases the rear adverse pressure gradient, delays boundary-layer separation, and shrinks the wake, sharply cutting pressure drag. A lower drag coefficient reduces fuel use and noise at high speed.�ans��src��VHucho《Aerodynamics of Road Vehicles》（Butterworth-Heinemann，SAE 推荐书目）�;Hucho, Aerodynamics of Road Vehicles, Butterworth-Heinemann��id�d67b818a5fb0�body���混凝土抗压很强但抗拉很弱，而钢筋抗拉性能好。把钢筋布置在构件受拉的一侧，由它承担拉应力，混凝土负责抗压，两者配合才能高效抵抗弯矩。��Concrete is strong in compression but weak in tension, while steel takes tension well. Placing rebar on the tension side lets it carry the pulling stress while concrete handles compression, efficiently resisting bending moment.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《材料力学》（第10版）�-Hibbeler, 'Mechanics of Materials' (10th ed.)��id�d6da9cb53cb1�body���Cp 用公差带宽度除以六倍过程标准差，只衡量过程的离散程度能否装进公差，完全不管分布是否居中；Cpk 取规格上下限到均值距离与三倍标准差之比中的较小者，同时反映离散与偏移，因此 Cpk 永远不大于 Cp。Cpk 等于 1.0 意味着均值到最近规格限刚好三个标准差，对应约每百万件一千三百多件超差，过程稍有漂移就会大量报废，所以汽车行业普遍要求量产 Cpk 不低于 1.33、关键特性不低于 1.67。使用前提是过程处于统计受控状态且分布近似正态，若控制图显示存在异常波动，必须先消除特殊原因，能力指数才有意义。��Cp divides the tolerance width by six process standard deviations, judging only whether the spread fits inside the specification and ignoring centring, while Cpk takes the smaller of the distances from the mean to each specification limit divided by three sigma, capturing both spread and offset so it can never exceed Cp. A Cpk of 1.0 means the mean sits exactly three sigma from the nearest limit, about 1350 parts per million beyond it, and any drift produces heavy scrap, which is why automotive practice generally requires 1.33 in production and 1.67 for critical characteristics. Both indices assume a stable, roughly normal process, so if control charts show special-cause variation those causes must be removed before a capability number means anything.�ans��src��KMontgomery，《Introduction to Statistical Quality Control》（第7版）�CMontgomery, 'Introduction to Statistical Quality Control' (7th ed.)��id�d7f9bd770720�body�٢通过抽样检测、尺寸测量和传感器监控，再把数据反馈给机器自动调整参数；发现偏差就修正，保证大批产品都符合要求。ٚSampling, measurement and sensor monitoring feed data back to machines that auto-adjust parameters, catching deviations so large batches stay within spec.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�d9a0ac4d8c24�body�ٺ黑匣子是飞机上的飞行数据记录器和驾驶舱语音记录器，通常涂成醒目的橙色。它能在坠毁后耐高温、抗冲击，帮助调查人员还原事故原因。��A black box is an aircraft's flight data recorder and cockpit voice recorder, usually painted bright orange. It survives heat and impact after a crash, helping investigators reconstruct what happened.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�da3fff47fd9e�body�ٷ稳定指系统受扰动偏离平衡后，能在有限时间内回到或接近原状态；不稳定则会持续发散或振荡。稳定性是控制器设计首先要保证的性质。��Stability means a system perturbed from equilibrium returns or stays near it in finite time; instability means it diverges or oscillates without bound. It is the first property a controller must guarantee.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�da6154a6b5f8�body���嵌入式系统是嵌入到设备内部、为特定功能服务的专用计算机，如微波炉、汽车ECU、智能手表。它资源有限、常实时运行、不追求通用，而电脑是通用平台。ٴAn embedded system is a dedicated computer inside a device for one task—microwaves, car ECUs, watches. It is resource-limited, often real-time, and not general-purpose like a PC.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�dacf4184f337�body���四冲程依次是进气、压缩、做功、排气。活塞下行吸入油气混合气，上行压缩，火花点火爆发推动活塞下行做功，再上行排出废气，曲轴转两圈完成一个循环。��The four strokes are intake, compression, power, and exhaust. The piston draws in the fuel-air mix, compresses it, is pushed down by combustion, then pushes out exhaust—two crankshaft revolutions per cycle.�ans��src��Heywood，《内燃机基础》�2Heywood, 'Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals'��id�dcb8b4cc9f73�body���精馏利用混合物中各组分沸点不同：加热使低沸点组分先汽化，经塔内多层塔板反复部分冷凝与蒸发，逐步提浓，最终在塔顶和塔底得到不同产品。��Distillation exploits different boiling points: heating vaporizes the lighter component, and repeated partial condensation and evaporation across tray stages enrich it, yielding products at top and bottom.�ans��src��AMcCabe、Smith & Harriott，《化工单元操作》（第7版）�MMcCabe, Smith & Harriott, 'Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering' (7th ed.)��id�dee04e5243fc�body���陶瓷以强离子或共价键结合，原子排列致密，所以硬度高、耐高温、耐腐蚀。但键性强而缺乏滑移系，受冲击或拉应力时裂纹易快速扩展，表现为脆性断裂。��Ceramics bond by strong ionic or covalent bonds in a dense lattice, giving high hardness, heat, and corrosion resistance. But the rigid bonds lack slip systems, so cracks spread fast under impact or tension—brittle failure.�ans��src��qCallister & Rethwisch,《材料科学与工程导论》(Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction),Wiley�VW. Callister & D. Rethwisch, Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley��id�df60b989f356�body��每个粒子是对机器人位姿的一个假设，粒子群整体近似表示位姿的概率分布，因此分布可以是多峰的，不必像卡尔曼滤波那样假设高斯形状。机器人运动时按运动模型给每个粒子加噪声推进，收到激光或视觉观测后按观测似然给粒子打权重，再按权重重采样，使假设逐步向真实位姿聚集。在长走廊等对称环境里粒子会暂时分成几团，直到出现有区分度的观测才收敛，这正是它比单峰滤波更鲁棒的地方。�{Each particle is one hypothesis about the robot's pose, and the particle set as a whole approximates the pose probability distribution, which may be multi-modal rather than the single Gaussian a Kalman filter assumes. Motion is propagated by sampling from the motion model, then laser or visual measurements assign importance weights, and resampling concentrates particles where the observation likelihood is high. In symmetric places such as long corridors the cloud legitimately splits into several clusters until a distinctive observation resolves the ambiguity, which is exactly why the method is more robust than unimodal filters.�ans��src��JThrun、Burgard、Fox，《Probabilistic Robotics》（MIT Press，2005）�@Thrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (MIT Press, 2005)��id�e126eaa40b73�body�ٺ能量密度指单位质量或单位体积所含的能量，分质量能量密度和体积能量密度。它决定燃料能跑多远、电池能多轻，是选动力源的关键指标。ٴEnergy density is energy per mass or per volume, split into gravimetric and volumetric. It decides how far a fuel goes or how light a battery is—key when choosing a power source.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�e413559081fe�body���地球内部的热量把地下水加热成热水或蒸汽，打出后可直接供暖，或推动汽轮机发电。它稳定可靠、不靠天气，但只在地质条件合适的地方好用。٬Earth's internal heat warms underground water into hot water or steam, which can heat buildings directly or spin a turbine to generate power; it is steady but site-limited.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�e55414e4dedd�body��A* 在扩展节点时除记录已走代价 g 外，还用启发函数 h 估计到目标的剩余代价，优先扩展 f=g+h 最小的节点。借助合理的启发（如欧氏距离），它能在保证找到最优路径的同时大幅减少搜索范围，比盲目搜索更高效。�!A* tracks the cost-so-far g for each node and adds a heuristic h estimating remaining cost to the goal, expanding nodes with the smallest f=g+h first. With a suitable heuristic such as Euclidean distance, it finds the optimal path while pruning the search space far more than blind search.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�e75c2546bcc4�body���当尺寸小到纳米级，表面原子比例急剧升高、量子效应显现，使材料在强度、催化、导电和光学上偏离宏观表现，例如纳米银抗菌、碳纳米管超强。��At nanometer size the surface-to-volume ratio soars and quantum effects appear, shifting strength, catalysis, conductivity, and optics away from bulk behavior—as in antibacterial nano-silver or super-strong nanotubes.�ans��src��3美国材料与试验协会（ASTM International）�ASTM International��id�e7eed0ff5ff7�body��{在基础与上部结构之间放橡胶隔震支座，拉长结构周期、避开地震主频，大幅降低传入的力。ٗRubber bearings between foundation and structure lengthen its period, avoiding the quake's main frequency and greatly cutting the force transmitted up.�ans��src��1ASCE 7-16；FEMA P-749《地震隔离与耗能》�4ASCE 7-16; FEMA P-749, Earthquake Protective Systems��id�ea1caf724ac4�body���多数腐蚀是电化学过程：金属表面形成微小原电池，活泼处作为阳极失去电子被氧化溶解，另一处阴极发生还原反应。潮湿、盐分和不同金属接触会加速腐蚀。��Most corrosion is electrochemical: tiny cells form on the surface where the anodic area loses electrons and dissolves, while reduction occurs at the cathode. Moisture, salt, and dissimilar metals accelerate it.�ans��src��3美国材料与试验协会（ASTM International）�ASTM International��id�edc09ecfe195�body�ٺ让线圈在磁场中转动（或让磁场相对线圈动），磁通量变化就会在线圈里感应出电流，这就是法拉第电磁感应，水轮、风轮都是先转再发电。٘Rotating a coil in a magnetic field changes the magnetic flux and induces a current by Faraday's law; water and wind turbines spin first, then generate.�ans��src��-Nilsson & Riedel，《电路》（第11版）�0Nilsson & Riedel, 'Electric Circuits' (11th ed.)��id�edf09623828a�body���数控机床由计算机按编好的程序自动控制刀具的运动和转速，加工精度和重复性好、能连续运行。普通机床主要靠工人手动机床操作，精度和效率受人为影响大。��A CNC machine is computer-controlled for tool motion and speed from a program, giving high precision, repeatability, and unattended runs. Ordinary machines rely on manual operation, with accuracy and efficiency heavily affected by the worker.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�ee936a5eb7e9�body�٫路口控制器按预设周期或实时车流量调整各方向红绿灯时长，并和相邻路口联动错开放行，减少停车等待，主干道常做成绿波带。ٮControllers set green times by schedule or live traffic and link neighboring intersections to release waves of cars in turn, cutting stops; main roads often run a green wave.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�eng_19_001�body���巡航推力取决于发动机质量流量与排气速度增量的乘积,涵道比增大后更多空气只经风扇适度增压加速,排气动能损失减小,推进效率随之提高。核心机维持高总压比与高涡轮前温度以保证热效率,二者叠加使单位燃油消耗率显著下降。代价是短舱直径和迎风面积增大,故涵道比的提升受全机阻力与安装空间制约。��Cruise thrust scales with mass flow times velocity increment, so routing most of the airflow through the fan with only modest acceleration cuts the kinetic energy wasted in the exhaust and raises propulsive efficiency. The core keeps a high overall pressure ratio and high turbine inlet temperature to preserve thermal efficiency, and the combination markedly lowers thrust-specific fuel consumption. The price is larger nacelle diameter and frontal area, which limits how far bypass ratio can be pushed.�ans��src�فNick Cumpsty著《Turbojets: The Development of the Turbojet and its Application in Aircraft》第2版,剑桥大学出版社,2013كNick Cumpsty, Turbojets: The Development of the Turbojet and its Application in Aircraft, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2013��id�eng_19_004�body��8捕收剂优先吸附在目的矿物表面,使接触角增大、表面由亲水转为疏水,气泡上浮时疏水颗粒附着于气泡进入泡沫层刮出,亲水脉石则沉留在矿浆中。调节pH并添加抑制剂可进一步拉开两类矿物表面润湿性的差异,据此控制精矿品位与回收率。��Collector reagents adsorb preferentially onto the target mineral, raising its contact angle so the surface turns hydrophobic; rising bubbles then carry those particles into the froth for scraping off, while wetted gangue stays suspended in the pulp. Adjusting pH and dosing depressants widens the wettability contrast between the two surfaces, which is how concentrate grade and recovery are controlled.�ans��src��WB. A. Wills 与 J. Finch《Wills' Mineral Processing Technology》(第8版)浮选章节�[B. A. Wills & J. A. Finch, Wills' Mineral Processing Technology, 8th ed., flotation chapter��id�eng_19_007�body��k各孔颈内的空气柱与背后空腔组成亥姆霍兹共振系统,当入射声频率接近共振频率时,孔颈处声阻抗与空气特性阻抗匹配,垂直入射吸声系数达到峰值;偏离该频率后法向声抗迅速增大,吸声能力急剧衰减。在空腔内填充多孔材料可引入阻尼展宽有效带宽,但峰值高度相应有所降低。��The air plug in each perforation together with the backing cavity forms a Helmholtz resonator, and near resonance the neck impedance matches the characteristic impedance of air, producing a sharp peak in normal-incidence absorption. Away from that band the normal acoustic reactance grows rapidly and absorption collapses; filling the cavity with porous material adds damping that broadens the useful band at some cost in peak value.�ans��src��e马大猷主编《噪声与振动控制工程手册》(机械工业出版社)共振吸声结构章节�sMa Dayou (ed.), Handbook of Noise and Vibration Control Engineering, China Machine Press, resonant-absorber section��id�eng_19_010�body��c叶背与导边局部压力降到饱和蒸气压以下时水体汽化成泡,气泡被扫入高压区后溃灭,微射流反复锤击表面造成剥蚀、噪声与轴系激振。空泡还改变叶剖面的有效攻角与升力分布,使推力下降而扭矩几乎不变,设计中通过增加浸深、加大盘面比和侧斜叶片布置推迟空化发生。��Where local pressure on the suction side or leading edge falls below vapour pressure, the water flashes into bubbles that collapse upon reaching higher-pressure regions, and the resulting microjets repeatedly hammer the surface, causing erosion, noise and shaft vibration. Cavitation also distorts the effective angle of attack and lift distribution of blade sections, so thrust drops while torque hardly changes; designers delay onset through greater immersion, larger expanded area ratios and skewed blades.�ans��src��^J. S. Carlton《Marine Propellers and Propulsion》(Butterworth-Heinemann,第4版)空化章节�cJ. S. Carlton, Marine Propellers and Propulsion, 4th ed., Butterworth-Heinemann, cavitation chapter��id�eng_19_011�body��A动力分散把驱动轴布置在多节车厢之下，单根动轴所需的黏着重量大幅下降，起动加速和持续爬坡不再逼近轮轨黏着的极限。全列车轴重分布均匀，对轨道的动作用力和磨耗随之降低，检修时还能按转向架模块整组更换，运用可用度明显提高。�KDistributed traction places driven axles under many cars, so each axle needs far less adhesive weight and starting acceleration or long-grade climbing never approaches the wheel-rail adhesion ceiling. The uniform axle-load spread cuts dynamic track loading and rail wear, and modular bogie swaps at depots raise fleet availability.�ans��src��O钱立新主编《世界高速铁路技术》，中国铁道出版社，2003年�O钱立新主编《世界高速铁路技术》，中国铁道出版社，2003年��id�eng_19_014�body��k籽粒潮湿时与穗轴结合牢固，需要更高的滚筒线速度才能脱净，否则未脱净损失迅速上升；籽粒干燥时同样转速会把谷粒打裂甚至脱壳，破碎率超标。实际作业通常在每分钟七百到一千一百转范围内按含水率设定，并联动放宽凹板间隙，用损失率和破碎率两个指标反复校准。��Damp grain clings tightly to the ear and demands a higher peripheral drum speed, otherwise unthreshed losses climb fast, while the same speed cracks dry kernels and pushes breakage beyond grade limits. Crews typically set the cylinder between roughly seven hundred and eleven hundred rpm according to moisture and widen the concave clearance accordingly, tuning the setting against both grain loss and kernel breakage counts.�ans��src��JGB/T 8094《收获机械 联合收割机 技术条件》脱粒性能要求َSrivastava, Goering, Rohrbach & Buckmaster, Engineering Principles of Agricultural Machines, 2nd ed., ASABE, threshing and separation chapters��id�eng_19_017�body���亚音速巡航时推进效率随平均排气速度降低而升高，大涵道比让更多空气仅经风扇适度增压后低速排出，以更小的速度增量获得同等推力，单位燃油消耗率随之下降。代价是短舱直径、重量和阻力一起上涨，风扇转速也受叶尖速度约束，所以齿轮传动风扇和开放式转子成为突破这些约束的主要路线。��In subsonic cruise propulsive efficiency rises as mean exhaust velocity falls, so a large bypass accelerates more air only moderately through the fan, buying equal thrust with a smaller velocity increment and burning less fuel per seat-mile. The price is fan-cowl diameter, weight and drag growing together, with fan speed capped by tip velocity, which is why geared fans and open rotors mark the main routes past these limits.�ans��src��i廉筱纯、吴虎《航空发动机原理》，西北工业大学出版社，循环分析与效率章节�iJ. D. Mattingly, Elements of Gas Turbine Propulsion, McGraw-Hill, cycle analysis chapters on bypass ratio��id�eng_20_001�body��随着金属层数增加,晶圆表面起伏不断累积,光刻景深无法容忍这种高度差。CMP同时利用化学腐蚀与机械磨削去除多余介质和金属,把表面恢复到纳米级平整。只有在此基础上,上层光刻才能完成亚微米图形的精确转印。�VAs metal layers stack up, wafer topography accumulates until it exceeds the depth of focus of lithography. CMP removes excess dielectric and metal through combined chemical etching and mechanical abrasion, restoring nanometer-scale flatness. Only on such a planar surface can the next lithography layer transfer submicron patterns accurately.�ans��src��lPeter Van Zant,《芯片制造:半导体工艺制程实用教程》(Microchip Fabrication),第7版,CMP章节�jPeter Van Zant, Microchip Fabrication: A Practical Guide to Semiconductor Processing, 7th ed., CMP chapter��id�eng_20_004�body��j防火分区通过耐火墙体、楼板和卷帘限制火灾在建筑内的水平与竖向蔓延,为疏散和扑救争取时间,其面积受耐火等级和层数约束。防烟分区则配合排烟设施控制烟气流动范围,通常利用挡烟垂壁在防火分区内进一步细分。前者控火,后者控烟,两者边界可以重合但功能要求不同。��Fire compartments limit horizontal and vertical fire spread within a building using rated walls, floors, and shutters, buying time for evacuation and firefighting; their allowable area depends on fire-resistance rating and story count. Smoke control zones confine smoke movement around exhaust facilities, typically subdividing a fire compartment with draft curtains. The former controls fire, the latter controls smoke; their boundaries may coincide but their functional requirements differ.�ans��src��`《建筑设计防火规范》GB 50016-2014(2018年版),第6章防火分区与防烟分区条文�~Code for Fire Protection Design of Buildings GB 50016-2014 (2018 edition), Chapter 6 provisions on fire and smoke compartments��id�eng_20_007�body��	投加不足时,铝盐/铁盐水解产物的正电荷不足以中和颗粒表面负电荷,Zeta 电位仍远离等电点,静电排斥维持胶体稳定,矾花难以形成;投加过量时颗粒表面吸附多余正电荷发生电荷反转,Zeta 电位由负转正、斥力重新占优,即再稳现象。中等剂量下则进入卷扫絮凝区,大量氢氧化物沉淀网捕细颗粒形成粗大絮体。因此最佳投药量应以 Zeta 电位滴定配合烧杯搅拌试验确定,并根据原水浊度和碱度动态调整。��When dosing is too low, the positive hydrolysis products of aluminum or iron salts fail to neutralize negative particle surfaces, the zeta potential stays far from the isoelectric point, electrostatic repulsion persists, and no floc forms. When dosing is excessive, particles adsorb surplus positive charge until the potential reverses sign, repulsion dominates again, and the suspension is restabilized. Intermediate doses enter the sweep-flocculation regime, where bulky hydroxide precipitates enmesh fine particles into large flocs, so the optimum dose must be set from zeta-potential titration backed by jar tests and adjusted for raw-water turbidity and alkalinity.�ans��src�ـDuan J, Gregory J. Coagulation by hydrolysing metal salts[J]. Advances in Colloid and Interface Science, 2003, 100-102: 475-502.َJ. Duan and J. Gregory, 'Coagulation by hydrolysing metal salts', Advances in Colloid and Interface Science, vols. 100-102, pp. 475-502, 2003.��id�eng_20_010�body���建筑冷负荷全年绝大部分时间处于设计值的 40%-80% 区间,名义满载点仅代表少数极端时刻,IPLV 按 100%、75%、50%、25% 四档负荷加权,更能反映实际电耗结构。部分负荷下冷却水温自然回落,冷凝压力降低使压缩比减小,压缩机功耗降幅大于制冷量降幅,COP 随之上升。但过低负荷会因频繁启停或热气旁通抵消这一红利,这正是变频调速机组与多机头分级调节的价值所在。�iBuilding cooling loads sit between 40 and 80 percent of design capacity for most annual hours, while the nameplate point captures only rare extremes; IPLV weights four load points at 100, 75, 50, and 25 percent and therefore tracks real energy use far better. At part load the condenser water naturally runs cooler, condensing pressure and compression ratio drop, and compressor input falls faster than delivered capacity, lifting the COP. Very low loads can erase that gain through frequent cycling or hot-gas bypass, which is precisely where variable-speed drives and staged multi-compressor plants earn their keep.�ans��src���AHRI Standard 550/590 (I-P): Performance Rating of Water-chilling and Heat Pump Water-heating Packages Using the Electrically Driven, Positive Displacement, Centrifugal or Screw Machines, Air-Conditioning, Heating, and Refrigeration Institute.ٞAHRI Standard 550/590 (I-P), Performance Rating of Water-chilling and Heat Pump Water-heating Packages, Air-Conditioning, Heating and Refrigeration Institute.��id�eng_20_011�body���精细金属掩膜版依靠微米级开孔把红、绿、蓝有机材料分别蒸镀到对应子像素上,开口位置误差会直接造成混色与暗态漏光。当 PPI 提升到数百量级时,开口尺寸缩至十余微米,掩膜自重下垂和热膨胀引起的对位偏移被急剧放大,成为良率的主要瓶颈。厂商因此采用低热膨胀合金掩膜、磁力吸附整平与实时激光对位来支撑更高分辨率产品的量产。�3A fine metal mask deposits red, green and blue organic materials onto their respective subpixels through micron-scale apertures, so positional errors of those apertures directly cause color mixing and dark-state leakage. Once PPI climbs into the hundreds, apertures shrink to roughly ten micrometers, and mask sag together with thermal-expansion misalignment grows sharply, becoming the dominant yield bottleneck. Manufacturers therefore rely on low-CTE alloy masks, magnetic flattening and real-time laser alignment to mass-produce ever higher-resolution panels.�ans��src��USID Symposium Digest of Technical Papers 中 OLED 蒸镀与 FFM 对位方向的论文�VSID Symposium Digest of Technical Papers, papers on OLED evaporation and FFM alignment��id�eng_20_014�body���同步环闭合差检验同一时段解算基线的内部一致性,能暴露周跳修复不彻底、星历或对流层模型异常等问题;异步环闭合差把不同时段的基线组合成环,可进一步发现多路径效应和观测质量差造成的系统偏差。如果含粗差的基线直接进入无约束平差,误差会被强制分配到坐标分量中,使成果呈现虚假的高精度。因此规范要求先剔除不合格基线,再依次进行三维无约束平差和约束平差。��Synchronous-loop misclosures test the internal consistency of baselines solved within one session, exposing incomplete cycle-slip repair or anomalies in ephemeris and tropospheric modeling; asynchronous-loop misclosures combine baselines across sessions and further reveal systematic biases from multipath and poor observation quality. If a baseline containing a gross error enters the unconstrained adjustment directly, its error gets forcibly distributed across coordinate components, producing deceptively good formal precision. The specification therefore requires rejecting failed baselines first and only then running the 3D unconstrained and constrained adjustments.�ans��src��YGB/T 18314-2009《全球定位系统(GPS)测量规范》外业观测与基线检核条款�xGB/T 18314-2009 Specifications for Global Positioning System (GPS) surveys, field observation and baseline-check clauses��id�eng_20_017�body���化学组分先在凸起处氧化生成一层软质反应层(如钨表面生成WO3、铜表面生成钝化膜),机械磨粒随后以微米级压力把这层软膜优先去除。单独化学腐蚀会各向同性地侵蚀并损伤介电层,单独机械研磨则会划伤且无法达到原子级平坦。两者耦合实现了凸凹选择性去除,这是多层互连大马士革工艺实现全片平坦化的关键。�The chemistry first oxidizes high spots into a soft reaction layer (such as WO3 on tungsten or a passive film on copper), and abrasive particles under micron-scale pressure then preferentially remove that softened layer. Chemistry alone attacks isotropically and corrodes the dielectric, while mechanical grinding alone scratches the surface and cannot reach atomic-level flatness. Coupling the two gives selective removal of highs over lows, which is what enables full-wafer planarization in multilevel damascene interconnect processing.�ans��src��qKrishnan et al., MRS Bulletin, 2010, 35(7): 506-513 / Oliveros et al., Tribology International, 2024, 191: 109150�pKrishnan et al., MRS Bulletin, 2010, 35(7): 506-513; Oliveros et al., Tribology International, 2024, 191: 109150��id�eng_21_001�body��d统一接口让不同厂商的模块可以直接互连,联调时还能分段注入已知信号逐级验证信号链。例如在4–20 mA回路中断开执行器、用恒流源强制注入12 mA,即可判断故障出在变送器侧还是执行器侧。许多现场总线设备还自带诊断状态字,能把断线、超量程等异常直接上报控制器。��A common interface lets modules from different vendors plug together directly, and during integration known signals can be injected section by section to verify the whole chain. On a 4–20 mA loop, disconnecting the actuator and forcing 12 mA from a constant-current source immediately reveals whether the fault sits on the transmitter or the actuator side. Many fieldbus devices also carry self-diagnostic status words that report broken wires, overrange and similar anomalies straight to the controller.�ans��src��pW. Bolton,《Mechatronics: Electronic Control Systems in Mechanical and Electrical Engineering》第7版,Pearson�nW. Bolton, Mechatronics: Electronic Control Systems in Mechanical and Electrical Engineering, 7th ed., Pearson��id�eng_21_004�body���部分负荷时转轮出口环量增大,水流在尾水管内卷成螺旋形涡带,其偏心进动使管壁压力周期性波动,并可上传至机组引发功率摆动和厂房振动。从顶盖或主轴中心孔向尾水管入口补入适量空气,气体的弹性缓冲吸收了涡带低压核的能量,削平压力峰值并瓦解其刚性旋转。补气量须经模型试验标定,补得过多反而拉低水轮机效率。�JAt part load the swirl leaving the runner intensifies and the flow winds into a helical vortex rope inside the draft tube; the rope's eccentric precession makes wall pressure oscillate periodically, feeding power swings into the unit and vibration into the powerhouse. Admitting a metered amount of air through the head cover or the shaft center hole surrounds the rope's low-pressure core with an elastic gas volume, flattening pressure peaks and disrupting its rigid rotation. The correct admission rate is calibrated by model tests, since excessive air drags down turbine efficiency.�ans��src��ZIEC 60193:2019《水轮机、蓄能泵及水泵水轮机 模型验收试验》国际标准�^IEC 60193:2019, Hydraulic turbines, storage pumps and pump-turbines — Model acceptance tests��id�eng_21_007�body��/比转速综合了流量、扬程与转速，是叶轮几何选型的首要无量纲参数：低ns泵采用窄长流道、径向出口和大出口安放角（约60°–90°），高ns泵则流道宽短、出口角减小并逐渐过渡为混流乃至轴流。性能曲线上，低ns泵扬程-流量曲线平坦且关死点扬程高，但高效区窄、易受汽蚀影响；高ns泵曲线陡降，功率曲线随流量上升平缓甚至下降，有利于电机匹配。设计时还须按ns估算效率（如Stepanoff经验式）以避免不切实际的指标。��Specific speed condenses flow rate, head, and shaft speed into the primary dimensionless parameter for impeller selection: low-ns pumps use narrow, long radial passages with large blade exit angles (~60°–90°), while high-ns pumps have wide, short passages with smaller exit angles, transitioning toward mixed-flow and axial designs. On performance curves, low-ns pumps show a flat head-flow curve with high shutoff head but a narrow best-efficiency region and greater cavitation sensitivity; high-ns pumps exhibit steeply falling head curves and power curves that flatten or drop with flow, easing motor sizing. Designers also estimate efficiency from ns correlations (e.g., Stepanoff) to keep targets realistic.�ans��src��xStepanoff,《Centrifugal and Axial Flow Pumps》(Wiley, 1957)；Gülich,《Centrifugal Pumps》第4版(Springer) 第3章�yA.J. Stepanoff, Centrifugal and Axial Flow Pumps (Wiley, 1957); J.F. Gülich, Centrifugal Pumps, 4th ed. (Springer), Ch.3��id�eng_21_010�body��逐层扫描使熔池经历极高温度梯度（10^6–10^7 K/m），柱状β晶粒沿建筑方向外延生长，粗大原始β晶界贯穿多层，导致Z向延伸率与疲劳寿命低于X/Y向；层间未再熔合区也是裂纹萌生位点。920°C左右固溶+时效可使α′马氏体分解为α+β层片组织并部分再结晶打断柱状晶列，HIP（920°C/100MPa）进一步闭合内部孔隙，显著恢复疲劳性能。残余应力则主要靠去应力退火（650°C附近）缓解，否则薄壁件易翘曲开裂。��Layer-wise scanning imposes extreme thermal gradients (10^6–10^7 K/m); columnar prior-β grains grow epitaxially along the build direction across layers, so elongation and fatigue life in Z fall short of X/Y values, and lack-of-fusion boundaries act as crack initiation sites. Solution treatment near 920 °C plus aging decomposes α′ martensite into α+β lamellae and partially recrystallizes to break up columnar colonies, while HIP (920 °C / 100 MPa) closes internal porosity and substantially restores fatigue behavior. Residual stress is mainly relieved by stress-relief annealing around 650 °C; otherwise thin walls distort or crack.�ans��src�٣《ASM Handbook Vol.23: Additive Manufacturing》；NASA MSFC-STD-3716 增材制造标准配套试验数据；Lütjering & Williams,《Titanium》第2版(Springer)ّASM Handbook Vol. 23: Additive Manufacturing; NASA MSFC-STD-3716 companion test data; G. Lütjering & J.C. Williams, Titanium, 2nd ed. (Springer)��id�eng_21_011�body���贴片可视为四周开缝的薄谐振腔,品质因数高、储存能量大而辐射损耗占比小,10 dB回波损耗相对带宽通常仅为百分之几。常用手段包括加厚基板或改用低介电常数材料、采用E形槽或L形探针馈电引入容性补偿抵消感性,以及层叠多谐振贴片构成耦合双谐振。工程上U形槽贴片配厚泡沫基板可将相对带宽做到20%以上。��A patch acts as a thin resonant cavity bounded by radiating slots; its high Q stores considerable energy while radiated loss stays small, so the 10-dB return-loss bandwidth is only a few percent. Common remedies include thicker substrates or low-permittivity materials, E-shaped slots and L-shaped probes whose capacitive loading cancels feed inductance, and stacked patches forming coupled dual resonances. In practice a U-slot patch over thick foam reaches relative bandwidths above 20%.�ans��src��?Balanis《Antenna Theory: Analysis and Design》第4版第14章�ABalanis, Antenna Theory: Analysis and Design, 4th ed., Chapter 14��id�eng_21_014�body���光学玻璃的色散使不同波长焦点沿轴分离,即便球差已校正,星像仍带彩色晕边,故先用双胶合或三片复消色差结构消除初级位置色差。阿贝正弦条件n·y·sin u=n′·y′·sin u′要求孔径边缘与小视场同时满足等光程成像,从而消除彗差,是望远与显微物镜齐明设计的判据。两者完成后,剩余二级光谱便成为大口径复消色差系统的性能瓶颈。�ROptical glass dispersion separates focal points along the axis by wavelength, so star images show colored fringes even after spherical correction; designers therefore cancel primary axial color with doublet or triplet apochromatic layouts first. The Abbe sine condition n·y·sin u=n′·y′·sin u′ demands equal optical path from aperture edge across the small field, eliminating coma and serving as the aplanatism criterion for telescope and microscope objectives. With both satisfied, residual secondary spectrum remains the performance bottleneck of large-aperture apochromatic systems.�ans��src��8Kingslake & Johnson《Lens Design Fundamentals》第2版�BKingslake & Johnson, Lens Design Fundamentals, 2nd ed., SPIE Press��id�eng_21_017�body��z预紧用于消除丝杠与螺母之间的轴向间隙,避免工作台换向时出现反向空程,直接决定定位精度与轮廓跟随质量。预紧偏小则反向死区大、跟随误差明显;预紧偏大则摩擦转矩与温升迅速上升,滚道疲劳点蚀提前发生,使用寿命缩短,工程上常从额定动载荷的百分之五到十起步再通过试验标定。��Preloading removes the axial clearance between screw and nut so the table shows no lost motion on direction reversal, which directly governs positioning accuracy and contour-following quality. Too little preload leaves a large reversal dead zone and visible tracking error, while too much inflates friction torque and temperature rise, brings forward raceway fatigue pitting, and shortens service life; engineering practice starts near five to ten percent of the rated dynamic load and calibrates by test.�ans��src�ٴYusuf Altintas著《Manufacturing Automation: Metal Cutting Mechanics, Machine Tool Vibrations, and CNC Design》(Cambridge University Press,2012年第2版)进给驱动设计章节٫Yusuf Altintas, Manufacturing Automation: Metal Cutting Mechanics, Machine Tool Vibrations, and CNC Design, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2012, feed drive chapters.��id�eng_22_001�body���铅芯橡胶支座由橡胶层与薄钢板交替叠合、中央灌入铅芯制成。橡胶层水平柔韧，把结构基本周期从约0.5–1秒延长到3秒以上，避开地震动能量集中的频段，传入上部结构的加速度随之锐减；铅芯剪切屈服后消耗振动能量并限制支座位移，同时在风载与小震下保持足够刚度，使结构近乎整体平动，避免层间集中变形。�A lead rubber bearing stacks rubber layers bonded to thin steel shims around a central lead core. The flexible rubber lengthens the building's fundamental period from about 0.5–1 s to over 3 s, away from the band where earthquake energy concentrates, so the acceleration reaching the superstructure falls sharply. The lead core yields in shear, dissipating energy and capping displacement, yet stays stiff under wind and minor tremors, letting the building sway almost rigidly instead of deforming storey by storey.�ans��src��fF.奈姆与J.M.凯利著《隔震结构设计：从理论到实践》，John Wiley & Sons，1999年。�pF. Naeim & J. M. Kelly, Design of Seismic Isolated Structures: From Theory to Practice, John Wiley & Sons, 1999.��id�eng_22_004�body���开挖卸荷后，围岩须借助一定的收敛变形完成应力重分布并形成承载拱。支护过早过硬，就要独自承担全部松散压力而极易开裂；放任变形则围岩松弛失稳。新奥法以喷混凝土、锚杆与钢拱架组成柔性初期支护，及时封闭岩面防止风化掉块，同时容许受控变形来调动围岩自身的承载能力；待变形速率收敛后再施作二次衬砌，与围岩共同承担长期荷载。�nExcavation unloads the ground, and the rock mass needs some convergence to redistribute stress and form a load-bearing arch. A support made rigid at once must carry all loosening pressure alone and cracks easily, while unchecked deformation lets the ground relax and lose stability. NATM therefore builds a flexible primary shell of shotcrete, bolts and steel sets that seals the surface promptly to prevent weathering and rockfall, yet permits controlled convergence, mobilizing the rock's own strength; once deformation rates settle, the secondary lining is placed to share the long-term loads with the surrounding rock.�ans��src��sE.T.布朗《把新奥法放到恰当的位置》，英国《隧道与隧道工程》杂志，第13卷，1981年。�VE. T. Brown, Putting the NATM into Perspective, Tunnels and Tunnelling, vol. 13, 1981.��id�eng_22_007�body���受载的纸箱像一根薄壁短柱：失效由四块侧壁板的屈曲控制。纸板边压强度越高，箱体承压越强；周长加大或纸板变厚会提高壁板的抗弯刚度，故整箱承载力近似随二者乘积的平方根增长。McKee 公式 BCT≈5.87×ECT×√(Z×d)（Z 为周长、d 为板厚）据此用简单的材料试验数据预测堆码破坏载荷，大幅减少实物试压次数，是运输包装设计的经典依据。�6A loaded box behaves like a thin-walled short column whose failure is governed by buckling of its four side panels. Higher edge crush strength lets the board carry more load, while larger perimeter or thicker board raises panel bending stiffness, so box strength grows roughly with the square root of their product. The McKee formula BCT ≈ 5.87 × ECT × √(Z×d), with Z the perimeter and d the board thickness, predicts stacking failure loads from simple board tests, greatly reducing physical compression trials—a classic basis of transport packaging design.�ans��src�فR.C.麦基、J.W.甘德与J.R.瓦楚塔《瓦楞纸箱抗压强度公式》，Paperboard Packaging，第48卷第8期，1963年。وR.C. McKee, J.W. Gander & J.R. Wachuta, "Compression Strength Formula for Corrugated Boxes", Paperboard Packaging, Vol. 48, No. 8, 1963.��id�eng_22_010�body���周期太短，每个周期都要重复支付起步损失时间，绿灯还容易放不完排队；周期太长则红灯等待被拉长，行人过街也更难安排。Webster 在1958年的信号配时研究中给出使平均延误最小的最佳周期 C₀=(1.5L+5)/(1−Y)，其中 L 为每周期总损失时间，Y 为各相位流量比之和。可见周期宜随交通负荷增大而适当延长，但不能过长。��With too short a cycle every phase pays start-up lost time again and queues risk not clearing on green; with too long a cycle red waits stretch out and pedestrian stages become hard to fit. From his 1958 signal timing study, Webster derived the optimum cycle C₀=(1.5L+5)/(1−Y) that minimizes average delay, where L is total lost time per cycle and Y sums the critical flow ratios of the phases. Cycle length should therefore grow moderately with traffic demand, but not without limit.�ans��src��qF.V.韦伯斯特《交通信号设置》，英国道路研究所技术论文第39号，HMSO，伦敦，1958年。�`F.V. Webster, Traffic Signal Settings, Road Research Technical Paper No. 39, HMSO, London, 1958.��id�eng_22_014�body���低速切削塑性金属时，前刀面与切屑之间的压力和摩擦极大，紧贴前刀面的切屑底层在高温高压下剧烈应变硬化并粘附其上，层层堆积便长成积屑瘤。它会间歇性脱落并划伤已加工表面，使粗糙度和尺寸精度恶化；但它也在一定程度上保护刀刃并增大实际前角。把切削速度提高到粘结温度区以上、使用润滑性好的切削液或涂层刀具，即可有效抑制积屑瘤。�5At low cutting speeds the pressure and friction between chip and rake face are extreme; the chip's underlayer work-hardens severely under this heat and pressure and bonds to the rake face, growing layer by layer into a built-up edge. It tears off intermittently and scratches the machined surface, worsening roughness and dimensional accuracy, although it partly protects the cutting edge and enlarges the effective rake angle. Raising the cutting speed beyond the bonding regime, applying lubricating cutting fluid, or using coated tools effectively suppresses it.�ans��src��ZBoothroyd, G.与Knight, W.A.《机械加工与机床基础》第3版，CRC Press，2006年�cBoothroyd, G. & Knight, W.A., Fundamentals of Machining and Machine Tools, 3rd ed., CRC Press, 2006��id�eng_23_001�body��_滴灌通过滴头以小流量把水直接送到根区，湿润范围只限根层，基本没有全田面蒸发、深层渗漏和尾水弃水这三类漫灌的主要损失；滴灌还能高频少量供水，使根区含水率长期接近田间持水量、水分张力低而稳定，根系吸水省力，灌溉水的有效利用率显著高于漫灌。��Drip emitters deliver small flows directly into the root zone, wetting only the soil volume the roots actually occupy, so the main losses of flood irrigation—whole-field surface evaporation, deep percolation below the root layer, and tailwater runoff—are largely avoided. Frequent, low-volume applications also keep root-zone moisture near field capacity at low, stable matric suction, so roots take up water easily and effective water-use efficiency rises markedly.�ans��src��fKeller J. & Bliesner R.D.著《Sprinkle and Trickle Irrigation》，Van Nostrand Reinhold，1990年版�eKeller, J. & Bliesner, R.D., "Sprinkle and Trickle Irrigation", Van Nostrand Reinhold, New York, 1990��id�eng_23_007�body���白炽灯靠钨丝热辐射发光，约2700 K下光谱大头落在红外区，可见光能量不足一成，光效仅约10～17流明每瓦。LED走电致发光路线：电子与空穴在氮化镓量子阱中复合直接放出光子，再由荧光粉转成白光，绕开了“先发热再辐射”的路径，商用器件光效已达100～150流明每瓦以上，故同功率亮度高出近一个数量级。��An incandescent filament emits by thermal radiation: near 2700 K most of the spectrum sits in the infrared and under a tenth of the input energy becomes visible light, roughly 10-17 lumens per watt. An LED works by electroluminescence-electron-hole recombination in GaN quantum wells creates photons directly, then phosphors convert them to white-bypassing the heat-first route, so commercial devices deliver 100-150 lm/W or more, nearly an order of magnitude more light per watt.�ans��src��F美国能源部《固态照明研发机遇》技术报告，2019年版�GU.S. Department of Energy, Solid-State Lighting R&D Opportunities, 2019��id�eng_23_010�body���同步发电机转子大而重，所储旋转动能与系统频率绑定：负荷骤增瞬间，功率缺口先由转子减速释放动能顶住，频率得以缓降，为调速器和备用机组争取响应时间，这就是系统惯量。风电、光伏经电力电子变流器并网，转速与电网解耦，替代常规机组越多，全网等效惯量越小，扰动后频率变化率越大，越易触发低频减载，需要虚拟惯量与快速一次调频加以补偿。�wSynchronous generator rotors are big and heavy, and their kinetic energy is bound to grid frequency: the instant load jumps, the shortfall is first covered by rotors decelerating, so frequency falls slowly enough for governors and reserves to respond-that buffering is system inertia. Wind and photovoltaics connect through power converters decoupled from grid speed; the more conventional units they displace, the smaller the effective inertia, the steeper the post-disturbance rate of change of frequency, and the higher the low-frequency load-shedding risk-hence the need for virtual inertia and fast primary frequency response.�ans��src�ٜP. Tielens 与 D. Van Hertem,《The relevance of inertia in power systems》,Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews,2016 (DOI: 10.1016/j.rser.2015.11.016)٘P. Tielens & D. Van Hertem, 'The relevance of inertia in power systems', Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews, 2016, DOI: 10.1016/j.rser.2015.11.016��id�eng_23_011�body���核心是切换：终端持续对服务小区和邻区进行信号强度与质量测量并上报。当满足触发条件（如3GPP定义的A3事件——邻区信号优于服务小区一个偏置量并持续一段时间），网络便命令终端改挂到新小区的无线资源上继续通信。协议还配置滞后偏置与触发时延，防止终端在边界处来回“乒乓”切换，以此在移动中维持会话连续。��The key process is handover. The handset continuously measures signal strength and quality from its serving cell and neighbours and reports the results; when a trigger such as 3GPP Event A3 fires — a neighbour staying better than the serving cell by an offset for a set time — the network moves the phone onto the new cell's radio resources. Hysteresis margins and time-to-trigger delays stop ping-ponging at the boundary, preserving session continuity.�ans��src��h3GPP TS 38.331《NR无线资源控制(RRC)协议规范》（规定Event A3等测量报告触发条件）ل3GPP TS 38.331, NR Radio Resource Control (RRC) protocol specification (defines Event A3 and related measurement reporting triggers)��id�eng_23_014�body���冻害源于毛细孔水结冰约9%的体积膨胀带来的静水压，及孔隙液盐浓度差形成的渗透压。引气剂靠表面活性作用，在拌合中形成并稳定大量20–200μm的封闭气泡。硬化后气泡密布，间距系数一般不超过250μm，冰晶旁多余水分即可就近挤入气泡泄压，切断结冰应力的累积路径，抑制微裂缝扩展与表层剥落；代价是含气量每增1%强度约降5%。��Frost damage is driven by hydrostatic pressure from the roughly 9% volume expansion of pore water freezing, plus osmotic pressure from salt concentration gradients in the pores. Air-entraining agents use surface activity to create and stabilise vast numbers of closed 20–200 μm bubbles during mixing; once hardened, the bubbles lie close together (spacing factor normally kept below about 250 μm), letting excess water near growing ice squeeze into a nearby void to relieve pressure and cut off the build-up of freezing stress behind microcracking and surface scaling. The price is about 5% compressive-strength loss per 1% of extra air.�ans��src��vMehta, P. K. & Monteiro, P. J. M.《Concrete: Microstructure, Properties, and Materials》第4版，McGraw-Hill，2014�xMehta, P. K. and Monteiro, P. J. M., Concrete: Microstructure, Properties, and Materials, 4th edition, McGraw-Hill, 2014��id�eng_23_017�body���波涌灌溉以脉冲方式分几次向沟畦供水：首次放水推进时表土被浸润、细颗粒沉降密实，土壤入渗率随之下降；停水片刻再放水时，水流在已预湿的上段快速推进，头部深层渗漏减少，节余水量被推向田尾，首尾受水差缩小。于是灌水均匀度与田间水利用系数同时提高，对渗透性强的轻质土壤和长沟长畦尤为有效。��Surge irrigation delivers water to furrows or borders in alternating on-off pulses rather than one continuous run. The first pulse wets and consolidates the soil surface, lowering infiltration; when flow resumes, water races over the pre-wetted upper reach, so less soaks away near the head end and more reaches the tail. Head-to-tail application becomes more even, lifting distribution uniformity and application efficiency, especially on long runs of permeable light soils.�ans��src��cW.R. Walker、G.V. Skogerboe《Surface Irrigation: Theory and Practice》，Prentice-Hall，1987年�ZW.R. Walker & G.V. Skogerboe, Surface Irrigation: Theory and Practice, Prentice-Hall, 1987��id�eng_24_001�body���三重保障叠加。其一是刚性:手臂多为铸钢或铝合金箱体结构,受载弹性变形很小;其二是传动:伺服电机的高转速经谐波减速器或RV减速器降速上百倍并放大扭矩,这类减速器还把齿隙压到1弧分以内,消除反向空程;其三是标定:出厂后用激光跟踪仪等设备辨识运动学参数表,控制器据此把目标位姿换算成各关节角度。重复精度因此远高于绝对精度——机器人擅长的是每次都回到上次的位置。�Three layers stack up. Rigidity: cast-steel or aluminum box structures keep load deflection small. Transmission: servomotor speed passes through harmonic or RV reducers geared down over a hundredfold to multiply torque, with backlash squeezed below one arc-minute to eliminate lost motion on reversal. Calibration: laser trackers identify the kinematic parameters after assembly so the controller converts desired pose into joint angles. Hence repeat accuracy far exceeds absolute accuracy — robots excel at returning to where they were.�ans��src��TSiciliano 与 Khatib 主编,《Springer Handbook of Robotics》第2版,Springer,2016�WB. Siciliano and O. Khatib eds., Springer Handbook of Robotics, 2nd ed., Springer, 2016��id�eng_24_004�body��*悬索桥的主缆是抛物线,锚死两岸,吊杆竖直向下只承担「提」的力,桥面荷载经由主缆传入巨大的锚碇,塔主要承受竖向压力;刚度靠桥面自身桁架提供,所以适合千米以上超大跨度,但整体较柔。斜拉索则从塔顶直连桥面,呈扇形直线张拉,每根索既是吊点又是弹性支座,给桥面多点弹簧约束,梁以压弯为主、塔还要平衡两侧水平分力。简单说:一个靠「兜住再传走」,一个靠「多点直接拎起」,决定了各自的适用跨度与造型语言。��A suspension bridge's main cable drapes in a parabola anchored at both banks; vertical hangers merely lift, sending loads through the cable into massive anchorages while towers take compression — stiffness comes from the stiffening truss, suiting spans beyond a kilometer but staying flexible. Cable-stayed fanning runs taut straight lines from tower top to deck: each stay is simultaneously hanger and elastic spring support, putting the girder in compression-bending and forcing towers to balance horizontal components. One cradles and conveys away; the other lifts directly at many points — hence their different span sweet spots and silhouettes.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�eng_24_005�body��.激光选区熔化把粉末层层熔凝,早期工艺的层间未熔合、气孔与残留应力让疲劳寿命离散巨大,适航审定无从下手。转机来自三件事:工艺窗口的系统优化(功率-速度-铺粉厚度匹配)、原位监测与X射线探伤实现全检,以及按打印特性重新设计零件——GE燃油喷嘴把二十个零件合成一体,内部冷却通道传统机加工无法完成,重量减25%、寿命提升五倍,装机已逾十万个。增材不是替代切削,而是为「一体化加内流道」的设计自由度买单。��Early laser powder-bed fusion parts suffered lack-of-fusion defects, porosity and residual stress that scattered fatigue lives too widely for airworthiness certification. Three fixes turned the tide: systematic process-window optimization matching power, speed and layer thickness; in-situ monitoring plus full X-ray inspection; and redesigning parts for the process — the GE fuel nozzle merged twenty components into one with internal cooling passages impossible to machine conventionally, cutting weight 25 percent and multiplying life fivefold, with more than a hundred thousand already flying. Additive manufacturing complements machining by buying design freedom: integration and internal channels.�ans��src��YGibson、Rosen 与 Stucker,《Additive Manufacturing Technologies》第2版,Springer,2015�`I. Gibson, D. Rosen and B. Stucker, Additive Manufacturing Technologies, 2nd ed., Springer, 2015��id�eng_24_007�body���室外二氧化碳约420 ppm,人呼出的气含4%以上。通风不良时浓度节节攀升:1000 ppm 是通行舒适上限,约2000 ppm 起多数人报告闷倦与注意力下滑,5000 ppm 才是职业限值——昏沉远早于危险出现。伦敦大学学院与伯克利实验室的对照实验发现,高浓度下复杂决策得分明显下降。对策是按每人每小时30立方米左右供给新风,或用CO2传感器联动新风,别指望鼻子报警——人嗅不出缺氧。��Outdoor CO2 sits near 420 ppm while exhaled breath carries over four percent. In poorly ventilated rooms concentration climbs: 1000 ppm is the common comfort guideline, around 2000 ppm most people report stuffiness and fading attention, though occupational limits sit at 5000 — meaning drowsiness ambushes decision quality long before danger. Controlled experiments at Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory and University College London show complex strategy scores dropping significantly at elevated levels. Fix by supplying roughly thirty cubic meters of fresh air per person per hour or wiring CO2 sensors to ventilation — do not wait for your nose; it cannot smell oxygen debt.�ans��src���Satish 等,《Is CO2 an Indoor Pollutant? Direct Effects of Low-to-Moderate CO2 Concentrations on Human Decision-Making Performance》,Environmental Health Perspectives,2012 (DOI: 10.1289/ehp.1104789)��Satish et al., 'Is CO2 an Indoor Pollutant? Direct Effects of Low-to-Moderate CO2 Concentrations on Human Decision-Making Performance', Environmental Health Perspectives, 2012, DOI: 10.1289/ehp.1104789��id�eng_24_008�body��+核心差别是氧化剂来源。涡扇发动机从前方进气道吸入空气,压气机增压后与燃料燃烧,燃气推动涡轮带动压气机再从喷口喷出——自带「呼吸系统」,只需携带煤油,结构可反复检修翻修。火箭必须自携燃料与氧化剂,因为高空与太空没有空气;储箱占掉绝大部分重量,烧完即弃(或像猎鹰九号那样回收复用以摊薄成本)。比冲对比鲜明:涡扇数千秒,液氢液氧真空约450秒。未来单级入轨空天飞机的梦想,正卡在两种模式难以合体。�7The oxidizer is the difference. A turbofan breathes: intake air is compressed, burned with fuel, exhaust drives turbines that feed the compressor, then jets out — carrying only kerosene, airframes get overhauled across decades. Rockets must haul both fuel and oxidizer since space has no air; tanks dominate mass, spent stages drop away (or land again, Falcon 9 style, to spread cost). Specific impulse contrasts sharply: turbofans reach thousands of seconds, hydrogen-oxygen vacuum about 450. Single-stage-to-orbit dreams stall precisely on marrying the two modes.�ans��src��ESutton 与 Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�eng_24_016�body��芯片功率密度逼近每平方厘米百瓦,风扇吹风的散热极限约为每平方米数千瓦,再往上只能靠液体。冷板式液冷把水路贴到CPU与GPU上,带走同等热量所需流量仅为风的百分之一量级,且允许更高的进水温度,机房可省去大部分空调、用自然冷源全年运行,PUE从1.5压到1.1附近。浸没式更彻底:整台服务器泡进介电油里。附带红利是余热回收——45度回水正适合区域供暖,北欧已有城市片区靠数据中心余热供暖。�SChip power density approaches a hundred watts per square centimeter, while fan-driven air tops out near kilowatts per square meter — only liquid goes further. Cold plates pipe water directly onto CPUs and GPUs, moving equal heat with about one-hundredth of the flow, tolerating warmer inlet water so most CRAC units vanish and free cooling runs year-round, pushing PUE from 1.5 toward 1.1. Immersion goes further, bathing whole servers in dielectric oil. A bonus: forty-five-degree return water suits district heating — districts of Nordic cities already warm themselves on data-center heat.�ans��src��bASHRAE TC 9.9,《Thermal Guidelines for Data Processing Environments》第5版,ASHRAE,Atlanta,2021�qASHRAE TC 9.9, Thermal Guidelines for Data Processing Environments, 5th ed., ASHRAE Datacom Series, Atlanta, 2021��id�eng_26_005�body��直答：CMP并非单纯机械研磨，而是化学转化与机械去除的耦合，正是这种耦合使其能兼顾全局平坦化与低粗糙度。机理：浆料中的氧化剂先将晶圆表层氧化成较软或易溶的反应层;高速旋转的抛光垫携带纳米磨粒扫过表面，凸起处接触压强大、新鲜反应物补给快而被优先去除，凹陷处接触弱、化学层得以保留，去除速率大体服从Preston经验式。铜大马士革互连与浅槽隔离的平整表面都依赖这道工序。�VCMP couples chemistry with mechanical removal rather than simply grinding harder: oxidants in the slurry first convert the wafer surface into a softer, readily soluble reaction layer. A fast-spinning pad carrying nanoparticle abrasives then sweeps the surface, where high spots see higher contact pressure and faster replenishment of reactant and are removed preferentially, while recesses barely touch the pad and survive, with removal rates roughly following Preston's empirical equation. Copper damascene interconnects and shallow trench isolation both rely on this step for their flat surfaces.�ans��src�ِJ.M. Steigerwald、S.P. Murarka、R.J. Gutmann《Chemical Mechanical Planarization of Microelectronic Materials》，John Wiley & Sons，1997年نJ.M. Steigerwald, S.P. Murarka & R.J. Gutmann, Chemical Mechanical Planarization of Microelectronic Materials, John Wiley & Sons, 1997��id�eng_26_009�body��/直答：匝道控制并非削减出行需求，而是错开汇入时刻，防止主线车流密度越过临界点后崩溃。机理：高速公路流量存在对应临界密度的最大值，一旦超限，车流从稳定态跃入拥堵态，瓶颈断面流量骤降约百分之五到十并产生向上游传播的走停激波，通行能力不升反降;控制系统依据下游检测器实测占有率实时调节红灯时长，把主线密度维持在临界值附近，富余车辆以匝道排队形式有序蓄存，主线吞吐量与车速同步提升。�AMetering does not suppress travel demand; it staggers merge instants so mainline density never crosses the point where flow breaks down. Freeway throughput peaks at a critical density, and past it traffic flips into a congested regime: bottleneck discharge falls some five to ten percent below capacity while stop-and-go shockwaves march upstream. The controller tunes red time against live occupancy readings from downstream detectors, holding mainline density near the critical value and storing the surplus as orderly ramp queues, so both throughput and speed rise together.�ans��src�٠Papageorgiou 与 Kotsialos,《Freeway ramp metering: an overview》,IEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems,2002 (DOI: 10.1109/tits.2002.806803)ٜPapageorgiou & Kotsialos, 'Freeway ramp metering: an overview', IEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems, 2002, DOI: 10.1109/tits.2002.806803��id�eng_26_011�body��直答：统一公共周期使全线绿灯启闭节拍一致，相位差按相邻路口间距除以车队平均行驶速度整定，车队到达下游时恰好赶上绿灯放行。机理：各路口周期若不统一，信号间的时间对应关系每循环漂移一次，绿波带无法稳定存在；按行程时间设定相位差后，头车抵达下游停车线的时刻落入绿波带，后车鱼贯通行，停车次数与平均延误同步下降；对向车流则用镜像相位差另设一条反向波带。�One common cycle keeps every intersection ticking in step, and the offset equals the spacing between junctions divided by the platoon's average running speed, so cars arrive downstream just as the light turns green. With differing cycles the timing alignment drifts every cycle and no stable band can exist; once offsets match travel time, the lead car reaches the downstream stop line inside the green band and followers roll through, cutting both stops and average delay, while opposing traffic gets its own band through mirrored offsets.�ans��src��g美国联邦公路管理局（FHWA）《Signal Timing Manual》，报告编号FHWA-HOP-08-024，2008年�KFederal Highway Administration, Signal Timing Manual, FHWA-HOP-08-024, 2008��id�eng_26_014�body���直答：芽孢致死速率对温度升高的敏感度远高于营养成分热降解的敏感度，用升温换缩短时间对品质极为划算。机理：以z值衡量，芽孢致死曲线z值约10℃，温度每升高10℃灭菌效率提高十倍；硫胺素等营养素z值达25至30℃，同等升温损失仅增至两三倍。因此140℃级超高温数秒即可实现商业无菌，美拉德褐变与风味劣变被压到最低，这是长时间低温灭菌难以兼顾的。�VSpore death rates respond to rising temperature far more sharply than nutrient degradation rates do, so trading time for temperature strongly favors quality. Measured by z-values, spore lethality curves sit near 10 degrees C — every ten-degree rise multiplies killing efficiency tenfold — while nutrients such as thiamine have z-values of 25 to 30 and lose only a few times more over the same rise. Seconds at ultra-high temperature therefore reach commercial sterility while Maillard browning and flavor damage are squeezed to a minimum, which long low-temperature sterilization cannot manage.�ans��src�ٷ夏文水主编《食品工艺学》，中国轻工业出版社，2007年 ; 另见: P. Fellows, Food Processing Technology: Principles and Practice, 4th ed., Woodhead Publishing, 2017ٹP. Fellows, Food Processing Technology: Principles and Practice, 4th ed., Woodhead Publishing, 2017 ; see also: 夏文水主编《食品工艺学》，中国轻工业出版社，2007年��id�eng_26_017�body��直答：碎煤自燃不需要明火，它源于煤对氧气的吸附氧化放热，而采空区恰好提供了持续供氧又难以散热的封闭环境。机理：冒落矸石间的空隙让漏风缓慢穿过遗煤堆积体，氧化产热因围岩导热差、风量小而不断积聚，煤温升高又令氧化速率指数式加快，形成正反馈直至着火；漏风过强热量被带走、过弱氧气不足，故存在最危险的风速区间，工作面推进过慢使遗煤在氧化带内滞留过久同样诱发自燃。��Spontaneous combustion needs no open flame: it begins with exothermic oxidation as coal adsorbs oxygen, and the goaf supplies exactly that — steady oxygen feed inside surroundings that cannot shed heat. Air leaking through voids between fallen roof rock creeps past the loose coal; since strata conduct heat poorly and airflow is slight, reaction heat accumulates, and rising temperature speeds oxidation exponentially in a runaway feedback toward ignition. Strong leakage carries heat away while weak leakage starves oxygen, so a dangerous velocity band exists, and a slowly advancing face leaves coal sitting in the oxidation zone far too long.�ans��src���张国枢主编《通风安全学》，中国矿业大学出版社，2007年 ; 另见: H.L. Hartman, J.M. Mutmansky, R.V. Ramani & Y.J. Wang, Mine Ventilation and Air Conditioning, 3rd ed., John Wiley & Sons, 1997��H.L. Hartman, J.M. Mutmansky, R.V. Ramani & Y.J. Wang, Mine Ventilation and Air Conditioning, 3rd ed., John Wiley & Sons, 1997 ; see also: 张国枢主编《通风安全学》，中国矿业大学出版社，2007年��id�f0c966a1156f�body���在相同材料用量下，把质量分布到离中性轴更远的位置能大幅提高抗弯刚度，所以工字梁、空心轴既轻又刚。加肋则能在不大幅增加重量的前提下抑制局部变形。��Distributing material farther from the neutral axis boosts bending stiffness for the same mass, so I-beams and hollow shafts are both light and stiff. Ribs suppress local deformation without much added weight.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�f1f644224b23�body���水中细小悬浮颗粒难以自然沉淀，加入铝盐或铁盐等絮凝剂后，颗粒脱稳聚集形成较大絮体，更容易沉降或被滤掉，从而去除浊度和部分污染物。ٽTiny suspended particles won't settle easily; adding aluminum or iron salts destabilizes and clumps them into larger flocs that settle or filter out, removing turbidity and some pollutants.�ans��src��3《给水工程》（中国建筑工业出版社）�/Water Treatment Principles and Design, AWWA/MWH��id�f23bc526c3d3�body��
职业危害控制遵循消除或替代、工程控制、管理控制、个人防护装备（PPE）的优先层级：最好从源头消除或替换危害源，其次用通风、隔离、防护罩等工程手段降低危害，再以轮岗、培训等管理措施减少暴露时间，PPE是最后一道防线。顺序的依据是可靠程度：工程控制不依赖人的行为，管理措施依赖制度执行，PPE依赖使用者正确佩戴且随时可能失效，所以越靠前的措施越有效、越应优先落实。�Hazard control follows the hierarchy of elimination or substitution, engineering controls, administrative controls and personal protective equipment: remove or replace the hazard at source first, then reduce it with ventilation, isolation or guards, then limit exposure with rotation and training, with PPE as the last resort. The ordering reflects reliability: engineering controls do not depend on human behaviour, administrative controls depend on discipline, and PPE depends on workers wearing it correctly and can fail at any moment, so the higher a measure sits in the hierarchy, the more effective it is and the higher its priority.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f25ad8f32c6b�body�ٜ船闸像带门的水箱：关上门把船关进来，再注水或放水把水位升到或降到与另一段河面齐平，开门后船就能平顺通过。ٙA lock is a gated tank: it encloses the boat, then fills or empties to match the next water level, and opens so the boat passes smoothly between heights.�ans��src��G美国陆军工程兵团，EM 1110-2-2602《通航船闸水力设计》�RUS Army Corps of Engineers, 'EM 1110-2-2602, Hydraulic Design of Navigation Locks'��id�f6939ee14bf1�body�ٺ接地把设备金属外壳连到大地，一旦内部火线碰壳，故障电流经低阻通路流入大地并触发断路器跳闸，避免人触电。它还能泄放雷击和静电。ٱGrounding connects the metal case to earth so a fault current flows safely to ground and trips the breaker instead of shocking a person; it also dissipates lightning and static.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�f737060b08ed�body���隔震支座安装在基础与上部结构之间，延长结构基本周期、避开场地震动主频，并消耗地震输入能量。它使上部结构加速度反应大幅降低，从而保护构件与内部设备。��Isolation bearings sit between foundation and superstructure, lengthening the fundamental period to avoid the dominant site frequency and dissipating input energy. They greatly reduce superstructure acceleration, protecting members and equipment.�ans��src��&《建筑抗震设计规范》GB 50011�ASCE 7 Seismic Provisions��id�f81d68401cc7�body�ٽ襟翼是机翼后缘可向下展开的活动面，能增大机翼面积和弯度，从而提高升力并增大阻力，让飞机在较低速度下仍能安全起降、缩短滑跑距离。ٷFlaps are hinged surfaces on the trailing edge that increase wing area and camber, boosting lift and drag so the plane can take off and land safely at lower speeds with shorter rolls.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�f9c60519773b�body���带宽是一段时间内能传输的数据量上限（如每秒多少兆），决定『多快能灌满』；时延是单个数据包从发到收的往返时间，决定『反应多灵敏』。两者共同影响体验。ٽBandwidth is the max data rate over time (e.g., Mbps), setting how fast you can fill the pipe; latency is the round-trip time of a packet, setting responsiveness. Both shape the experience.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�fab9186325a6�body���FPGA（现场可编程门阵列）的内部逻辑可在出厂后由用户重新配置，像用硬件搭积木实现并行电路。它开发灵活、上市快，常用于原型验证、通信和信号处理。��An FPGA's internal logic can be reprogrammed by the user after manufacture, wiring up parallel hardware like building blocks. It is flexible and fast to market, used in prototyping, comms, and signal processing.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�facbc4ad5970�body���伸缩缝释放温度胀缩引起的变形，沉降缝分隔可能产生差异沉降的部分，防震缝将长建筑分成独立单元以避免地震时相互碰撞。这些缝通过允许受约束变形自由发生，防止构件开裂或破坏。�QExpansion joints accommodate thermal expansion and contraction, settlement joints separate parts that may undergo differential settlement, and seismic joints divide a long building into independent blocks to avoid pounding during earthquakes. By allowing restrained deformations to occur freely, these joints prevent cracking and damage.�ans��src��U欧洲规范 Eurocode 2（EN 1992）；ACI 318《结构混凝土建筑规范要求》�REurocode 2 (EN 1992); ACI 318 'Building Code Requirements for Structural Concrete'��id�faee4706d78e�body���催化剂通过提供新的低活化能反应路径降低反应的能垒，使更多分子能达到反应所需的能量，因而速率提高，但催化剂在反应前后化学性质不变。工业催化剂多为负载型，活性组分（如铂、钯）以微小颗粒分散在氧化铝、沸石等高比表面积载体上，载体既提高活性组分的分散度以增大有效面积，又提供机械强度并帮助散热。��A catalyst offers an alternative reaction pathway with a lower activation energy, lowering the energy barrier so far more molecules can react, while its own chemical identity is unchanged before and after the reaction. Industrial catalysts are usually supported: active components such as platinum or palladium are dispersed as fine particles on high-surface-area carriers like alumina or zeolites, which maximise dispersion of the active phase, provide mechanical strength, and help dissipate heat.�ans��src��4Fogler，《化学反应工程原理》（第5版）�=Fogler, 'Elements of Chemical Reaction Engineering' (5th ed.)��id�fbf492423404�body�ٷ中央核心筒像脊柱一样提供主要抗侧刚度，外伸臂把外围柱与核心筒连成整体，共同抵抗风力和地震引起的倾覆力矩，从而让超高层更稳。ٹThe central core provides main lateral stiffness like a spine, and outriggers tie the perimeter columns to the core so the whole tower resists overturning from wind and quakes together.�ans��src��DSmith & Coull，《高层建筑结构：分析与设计》（1991）�ESmith & Coull, 'Tall Building Structures: Analysis and Design' (1991)��id�fd1b13a14388�body��(ISS 上的在轨制造项目用商业 3D 打印机在微重力下成型塑料工具与备件，验证了太空无需地面补给即可制造应急零件的可行性。后续还试验了光纤拉制与组织培养等，目标是降低发射质量依赖、支持长期载人任务与深空探索。�FThe ISS in-space manufacturing project used commercial 3D printers to make plastic tools and spares in microgravity, proving that emergency parts can be made in orbit without resupply. Later tests include fiber drawing and tissue culture, aiming to cut launch-mass dependence and support long-duration and deep-space missions.�ans��src���Li, Lan, Wang,《Exploration of Direct-Ink-Write 3D Printing in Space: Droplet Dynamics and Patterns Formation in Microgravity》,Microgravity Science and Technology,2020 (DOI: 10.1007/s12217-020-09820-0)��Li, Lan, Wang, 'Exploration of Direct-Ink-Write 3D Printing in Space: Droplet Dynamics and Patterns Formation in Microgravity', Microgravity Science and Technology, 2020, DOI: 10.1007/s12217-020-09820-0��id�ff5f44af95d3�body��装配式在工厂把构件标准化预制，现场仅吊装连接，受天气影响小、工期可缩短数成，且工厂环境更利于质量与精度控制。代价是运输尺寸受限、节点连接设计要求高，且需配套的吊装与施工组织。�:Prefabrication standardizes components in a factory and only assembles them on site, less weather-dependent, often cutting schedule by tens of percent, with better quality and dimensional control in the shop. The cost is transport-size limits, demanding connection design, and matching lift and logistics planning.�ans��src�٭《Analysis of prefabricated building system on construction quality and efficiency》,Journal of Civil Engineering and Urban Planning,2023 (DOI: 10.23977/jceup.2023.050906)٪'Analysis of prefabricated building system on construction quality and efficiency', Journal of Civil Engineering and Urban Planning, 2023, DOI: 10.23977/jceup.2023.050906��id�085f39f70b87�body��o定频压缩机只能全速运行或停机，靠反复开停维持温度，每次重启都要重新建立油膜与压差、承受启动电流冲击，停机期间制冷剂迁移还带来额外损失，室温也在设定值上下摆动。变频机通过改变供给压缩机的电源频率连续调节转速，长期在部分负荷下低速运行——此时换热面积相对过剩，蒸发温度升高、冷凝温度降低，压缩比减小，能效比反而高于满负荷。因此季节能效指标（如 APF、SEER）明显优于定频机，代价是电子器件更多，变频器本身也有几个百分点的损耗。��A fixed-speed compressor can only run flat out or stop, so it cycles to hold temperature, and every restart must re-establish oil films and pressure difference, endure inrush current and recover refrigerant migration losses while room temperature swings around the setpoint. An inverter varies the frequency fed to the compressor and hence its speed, letting it run slowly at part load where the heat exchangers are effectively oversized, evaporating temperature rises, condensing temperature falls, pressure ratio drops and the coefficient of performance actually exceeds the full-load value. Seasonal metrics such as APF or SEER therefore favour inverter units clearly, at the price of more electronics and a few percent of loss in the drive itself.�ans��src��TASHRAE Handbook—HVAC Systems and Equipment（2020），压缩机与制冷设备章�eASHRAE Handbook—HVAC Systems and Equipment (2020), compressors and refrigeration equipment chapters��id�0f7129737fe5�body���水结冰体积胀大约 9%，孔隙和管腔里的水被围住，膨胀无处可去只能变成压力：冰一胀孔壁就受拉，岩石、铸铁抗拉远低于抗压，裂纹尖端一楔就开。压力升高还压低冰的熔点，未冻水被挤向冻结前沿，冰透镜体越积越厚，冻胀因此是吸水再楔入的累积过程，反复冻融逐轮拆散岩体。边界在约束：膨胀有处可去就不致胀裂，水管冻裂多出在冰塞封住的一段。��When water freezes its volume grows by roughly 9%, and water in rock pores or a pipe cavity is confined, so expansion with nowhere to go becomes pressure: as ice swells the wall is loaded in tension, yet rock and cast iron are far weaker in tension than in compression, so a crack tip is driven open with little force. Rising pressure also depresses the melting point of ice, so unfrozen water is squeezed toward the freezing front and ice lenses keep thickening; frost heave is a cumulative process of drawing water in and wedging, worked through cycle by cycle. The boundary is confinement: expansion that has somewhere to go bursts nothing, and pipes usually fail in the stretch sealed by an ice blockage.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�1f800fa6104b�body��C波形断面在纵向提供高抗弯刚度、在横向允许护栏板连同立柱一起变形，车辆被接住后沿护栏滑行并逐渐减速，能量由护栏板拉伸、立柱屈曲和土体变形分散吸收，而不是把车硬弹回车道。若护栏端头直接暴露，正面撞击时端部可能像矛一样撕入车厢，因此端部要么埋入路侧土坡、向下弯曲，要么安装能沿轴向溃缩吸能的端头装置。设计还要校核护栏的工作宽度与路侧净区，保证变形空间足够，否则车辆仍会撞上被护栏保护的障碍物。��The corrugated section gives high bending stiffness along the rail while letting rail and posts deflect laterally, so a vehicle is captured and redirected along the barrier, decelerating as rail tension, post bending and soil deformation absorb energy instead of bouncing it back into traffic. An exposed rail end can spear into the passenger compartment in a head-on hit, so ends are either buried in a backslope and turned down or fitted with an energy-absorbing crash terminal that telescopes along the rail. Design must also check working width and roadside clear zone so deflection space is adequate, otherwise the vehicle still strikes the very hazard being shielded.�ans��src��.AASHTO《Roadside Design Guide》（第4版）�)AASHTO, 'Roadside Design Guide' (4th ed.)��id�20806269aaca�body��s列控系统（如CTCS）实时测距、自动限速并保持闭塞分区，车地通信确保最小安全间隔。ٙThe train-control system (e.g. CTCS) measures distances, auto-limits speed and keeps block sections, with cab–ground links enforcing minimum safe gaps.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�3c0bca34f1a2�body���二极管由一个 p 型和一个 n 型半导体形成的 pn 结组成。正向偏置时耗尽层变薄、载流子能通过；反向偏置时耗尽层变宽、几乎阻断电流，于是呈现单向导电。ٚA diode is a p-n junction. Forward bias thins the depletion region so carriers pass; reverse bias widens it and blocks current, giving one-way conduction.�ans��src��<Streetman & Banerjee，《固态电子器件》（第7版）�@Streetman & Banerjee, 'Solid State Electronic Devices' (7th ed.)��id�500f04caa54e�body���疲劳是材料在低于强度的反复应力下逐渐产生微裂纹并扩展的现象。每次弯折都在应力集中处损伤一点，裂纹长大到临界尺寸后突然断裂，即使总受力远小于静强度。��Fatigue is the gradual growth of microcracks under repeated stress below the material's strength. Each bend adds damage at stress concentrators; once a crack reaches critical size it snaps, even though loads were far below static strength.�ans��src��+Dieter，《机械冶金学》（第5版）�)Dieter, 'Mechanical Metallurgy' (5th ed.)��id�597b5ce31c73�body���铂能高效催化阴极的氧还原反应，但稀缺昂贵，占电堆成本大头。铁氮碳等非铂材料活性已接近，却在长期稳定性和抗一氧化碳中毒上仍不及铂，难以撑过数千小时寿命。��Platinum efficiently catalyzes cathodic oxygen reduction but is scarce and costly, dominating stack price. Platinum-free Fe-N-C materials approach its activity yet lag in long-term stability and CO tolerance, struggling to last thousands of hours.�ans��src��vGasteiger & Marković，《只是梦想还是未来现实？无铂氧还原催化剂》，《科学》324卷（2009）�uGasteiger & Marković, 'Just a dream—or future reality? Pt-free catalysts for oxygen reduction,' Science 324 (2009)��id�5ebd9e9c21df�body��四冲程内燃机每完成一个工作循环需要活塞往复四个冲程：进气（吸入空气或可燃混合气）、压缩、做功（火花点火或压燃膨胀作功）、排气。曲轴每完成一个循环转两圈，是目前汽车最常用的发动机形式。��A four-stroke engine completes one cycle in four piston strokes: intake (draw in air or mixture), compression, power (combustion expands and does work), and exhaust. The crankshaft turns twice per cycle, and this is the most common automotive engine type.�ans��src��V国际汽车工程师学会（SAE International）；J.B. Heywood《内燃机基础》�JSAE International; J.B. Heywood, 'Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals'��id�64a923bfcd60�body���玻璃几乎总是从表面微裂纹在拉应力作用下扩展而断裂。把含钠的铝硅酸盐玻璃浸入约 400 ℃ 的熔融硝酸钾盐浴，较大的钾离子扩散进去置换较小的钠离子，表层想膨胀却被内部约束，于是形成几十微米深、数百兆帕的压应力层，内部则以较小的拉应力平衡。外来弯曲或划伤产生的拉应力必须先抵消这层压应力才能让裂纹扩展，因此强度和跌落抗划伤性能大幅提升。代价是一旦裂纹穿过压应力层进入内部拉应力区，储存的能量会让裂纹迅速蔓延、碎得更彻底，而且切割和打孔必须在强化之前完成。�Glass almost always fails by growth of surface flaws under tension. Immersing a sodium-bearing aluminosilicate glass in molten potassium nitrate near 400 °C lets larger potassium ions diffuse in and replace smaller sodium ions, so the surface layer wants to expand but is restrained by the interior, creating a compressive layer tens of micrometres deep at hundreds of megapascals balanced by mild interior tension. Any tension from bending or a scratch must first cancel that compression before a crack can run, which is why strength and drop resistance improve dramatically. The trade-off is that once a flaw penetrates past the compressive layer into the tensile core the stored energy drives rapid fragmentation, and cutting or drilling must be finished before strengthening.�ans��src�٘Varshneya，《Chemical Strengthening of Glass: Lessons Learned and Yet To Be Learned》，International Journal of Applied Glass Science 1(2)（2010）ُVarshneya, 'Chemical Strengthening of Glass: Lessons Learned and Yet To Be Learned', International Journal of Applied Glass Science 1(2) (2010)��id�72fa7317cf2f�body���摇摆墙在墙底留一条可控水平缝，震时整墙绕墙脚如钟摆转动、一侧抬离基础，把输入能量转为刚体摆动，缝处阻尼器与预应力筋耗能并把它拉回原位。变形由转动承担，墙身不必靠开裂与钢筋屈服耗能，震后几乎无残余位移。刚性墙则靠墙脚塑性铰开裂与钢材屈服耗能，构造简单却把不可逆损伤留在主体上。更安全指震后还能用、好修复，不是位移一定更小。��A rocking wall leaves a controlled horizontal joint at its base, so in a quake the whole wall turns about its toe like a pendulum and one side lifts off the foundation, turning the incoming energy into rigid-body rocking, while dampers and tendons at the joint both dissipate that energy and pull it back. Because the deformation comes from rotation, the wall body need not crack or yield its steel to absorb energy, and almost no residual displacement is left. A rigid wall instead burns energy through a plastic hinge cracking at its toe and yielding steel, which is simple to build but keeps irreversible damage in the structure. Safer here means still usable and easy to repair after the quake, not necessarily smaller drift.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�77b2841d3b96�body���自振周期是结构在不受外力时自由摆动的固有时间，越高、越柔的建筑周期越长。地震波往往包含某些周期成分，当建筑自振周期与地震主周期接近时会发生共振，放大晃动。��The natural period is the inherent time a structure takes to sway freely; taller, more flexible buildings have longer periods. When this matches the dominant period of ground motion, resonance amplifies the shaking.�ans��src��+Chopra，《结构动力学》（第5版）�*Chopra, 'Dynamics of Structures' (5th ed.)��id�80309401af38�body�ٜ发电多于负荷时频率上升，少于负荷时频率下降；调度靠调节机组出力把频率拉回额定值，频率是系统供需的晴雨表。٥Excess generation raises frequency, shortage lowers it; dispatch adjusts output to restore the nominal value, so frequency is the barometer of supply-demand balance.�ans��src��AIEEE 电网调度标准；Kundur《电力系统稳定与控制》�HIEEE grid dispatch standards; Kundur, Power System Stability and Control��id�8a76aa5909d7�body���钠资源丰富、便宜且分布广，适合大规模储能，但钠离子更重、半径更大，导致能量密度和体积效率明显低于锂电。它更适合对重量不敏感的电网储能，而非长续航手机。��Sodium is abundant, cheap and widely available, suiting large-scale storage, but its heavier, larger ion gives lower energy and volumetric density than lithium. It fits weight-insensitive grid storage more than long-range phones.�ans��src��kYabuuchi 等，《钠离子电池的研究开发》，《化学评论》114卷，11636–11682页（2014）�eYabuuchi et al., 'Research Development on Sodium-Ion Batteries,' Chem. Rev. 114, 11636–11682 (2014)��id�9b30891c2e46�body���四杆铰接成方框是机构而非结构：边长不变也能被推扁成平行四边形，侧风一推就塌。加一道斜撑、或让两杆交叉并固定交点，方框就拆成三角形，三边一定形状唯一。载荷于是转为沿杆轴的拉压，不必逼细杆硬受弯，同粗细能担大得多的力；伞的交叉还把沿杆推转成对称张开。但要注意交叉杆主要受压，太细会失稳弯折；交点若只滑不固定，约束依旧不足。��Four bars pinned into a frame make a mechanism, not a structure: the lengths can stay the same while the shape shears into a parallelogram, so a sideways gust folds it. Add a diagonal, or cross two bars and fix the crossing, and the frame becomes triangles, whose three sides allow only one shape. Load turns into tension and compression along the bars instead of forced bending, so rods of the same thickness carry far more, and an umbrella's crossings also change a push along the shaft into a symmetric opening. Crossed bars work mostly in compression, though, so a slender one buckles, and a crossing that slides instead of being fixed leaves the constraint short.�ans��src��nHibbeler《结构分析》/《材料力学》；Shigley《机械工程设计》；Timoshenko《板壳理论》هHibbeler, Structural Analysis / Mechanics of Materials; Shigley, Mechanical Engineering Design; Timoshenko, Theory of Plates and Shells��id�af80d97ad6b5�body���这类塑料的分子链含有能被微生物或水水解切断的键，在堆肥或土壤里由细菌、真菌分泌酶逐步拆成小分子，最终变成水、二氧化碳和生物质。但要注意许多需要工业堆肥条件才能真正降解。��These plastics have bonds microbes or water can cleave; in compost or soil, bacteria and fungi secrete enzymes that chop the chains into small molecules ending as water, CO2, and biomass. Many still need industrial composting to truly degrade.�ans��src��MStevens，《绿色塑料：可生物降解塑料新科学导论》（2002）�^Stevens, 'Green Plastics: An Introduction to the New Science of Biodegradable Plastics' (2002)��id�b8f07522728f�body���放热反应在反应时释放热量，若热量积累使温度升高，而升温又加快反应，就会形成正反馈导致温度和压力骤升、甚至爆炸。冷却系统和联锁能在过热前移走热量，保证安全。��Exothermic reactions release heat; if it builds up and raises temperature, the faster reaction feeds back more heat, spiking temperature and pressure toward explosion. Cooling and interlocks remove heat before it runs away.�ans��src��4Fogler，《化学反应工程原理》（第5版）�=Fogler, 'Elements of Chemical Reaction Engineering' (5th ed.)��id�e0580e95214c�body���末端执行器是装在机械臂最前端的手，直接接触工件。抓取易碎蛋、拧螺丝、焊接需要的动作和力度完全不同，因此换上吸盘、夹钳或焊枪等专用工具才能高效完成任务。��The end-effector is the hand at the arm's tip that touches the work. Picking a fragile egg, tightening a screw, or welding need totally different motions and forces, so swapping in suction cups, grippers, or welders makes each task efficient.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�eng_25_011�body��l开工前要先做地质勘察:钻探取出不同深度的土样岩样,测出每一层能承受多少压力。软土承载不了高楼,就要打桩把重量传到深处坚硬的持力层,像把桌子腿加长踩在岩石上。上海中心大厦的桩基深达86米。地基看不见,却决定整栋楼的安危——工程的第一课是尊重看不见的部分。�eBefore building comes site investigation: drill cores test each soil and rock layer for bearing capacity. Soft ground cannot carry towers, so piles drive loads down to firm strata — table legs lengthened onto bedrock. Shanghai Tower's piles reach eighty-six meters. Foundations stay invisible yet decide safety: engineering lesson one respects the unseen.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�eng_25_012�body��O机翼产生升力靠两件事配合:翼型上弯下平让上方气流更快、压强更低(伯努利原理);同时机翼带迎角把下方空气向下推,获得反作用升力(牛顿第三定律)。两者共同贡献升力,缺一不可。起飞前机场还要算好速度、重量与天气——升力必须超过重力才能离地。�1Wings make lift two ways together: curved upper surfaces speed airflow lowering pressure above (Bernoulli), while angle of attack shoves air downward earning reaction lift (Newton's third law). Both matter. Before takeoff crews compute speed, weight and weather — lift must beat gravity to leave ground.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版航空与航天分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�gTen Thousand Whys: Aviation and Aerospace volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�eng_25_015�body��z水力发电利用水位落差推动水轮机。抽水蓄能电站更进一步:夜里电网用电少、电价低,就用多余电力把下库的水抽上高库存着;白天用电高峰放水下坡发电,像给城市配了一块巨型充电宝。它的转换效率约75%,看似亏本,实则解决了风、光发电看天吃饭的波动问题——储能是清洁能源的搭档。�pHydropower rides water falling through turbines. Pumped storage goes further: nights with cheap surplus power lift water uphill into reservoirs; daytime peaks release it down through generators — a giant power bank for cities. Efficiency near seventy-five percent sounds lossy but tames the on-again-off-again nature of wind and solar. Storage partners clean energy.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版能源与环境分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�gTen Thousand Whys: Energy and Environment volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�2b3c313526dc�body���接触比是一对齿轮啮合过程中同时参与啮合的齿数平均值。大于1说明始终有至少一对齿在传力，换齿时不会出现力中断，因此传动更平稳、噪音更小、承载更均匀。��The contact ratio is the average number of teeth in mesh at once. Above 1 means at least one tooth pair always transmits load, so there's no force gap during tooth handover—giving smoother, quieter, more evenly loaded transmission.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�3b4b74aaecf0�body���冗余机械臂关节数多于任务自由度，雅可比矩阵不是方阵。用伪逆可求出让末端以最小关节速度实现期望运动的最小二乘解，还能在零空间里加入额外任务如避障。�A redundant arm has more joints than task degrees of freedom, so its Jacobian isn't square. The pseudoinverse gives the least-squares joint velocities for a desired end-effector motion with minimal joint speed, and the null space can host extra tasks like obstacle avoidance.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�3c7530691df9�body��i它们柔性吸能、随手可布，能分散冲击波，且可按需随时增减，适合临时防护。ـThey absorb energy flexibly, are quick to deploy and can be scaled on demand, spreading blast pressure for temporary protection.�ans��src��BASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA P-749；NFPA 减灾规范�FASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads; FEMA P-749; NFPA mitigation standards��id�484d2f305e04�body��]圆滑过渡给车辆缓冲，尖锐会伤底盘、引起失控；只要提示减速就够。�qRounded bumps cushion the car; sharp ones damage the chassis and risk loss of control—gentle warning is enough.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�699ebb5a5eef�body���氧化锆在受力时会从四方相转变为单斜相，体积略有膨胀，在裂纹尖端产生压应力把裂纹夹紧，消耗扩展能量。这种相变增韧让脆性陶瓷也能承受一定冲击而不易碎裂。��Zirconia transforms from tetragonal to monoclinic phase under stress, expanding slightly and squeezing the crack tip with compressive stress that clamps it and absorbs energy. This transformation toughening lets brittle ceramic survive impacts.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�69e838863eff�body���徐变是混凝土在持续受力下随时间缓慢增加的变形。即使荷载不变，构件也会逐渐变弯或缩短，因此大跨结构和高柱需要预留额外挠度与预应力补偿。��Creep is the slow, time-dependent deformation of concrete under sustained stress. Even with constant load, members gradually sag or shorten, so long-span structures and tall columns must allow for extra deflection and prestress compensation.�ans��src��/Neville，《混凝土的性能》（第5版）�+Neville, 'Properties of Concrete' (5th ed.)��id�80b6ee8d56c7�body���变压器和电感所需磁芯体积与能量存储成正比，而储能与开关周期相关。频率越高，每个周期时间越短，需要的储能越少，因此可用更小的磁芯和更少的匝数实现同样功率。��Core size scales with the energy it must store, which relates to the switching period. Higher frequency means a shorter period and less stored energy per cycle, so the same power needs a smaller core and fewer turns.�ans��src��EMohan，《电力电子：变换器、应用与设计》（第3版）�IMohan, 'Power Electronics: Converters, Applications and Design' (3rd ed.)��id�829121a5caf2�body���每一层是新拌砂浆，靠水泥水化把上下层“粘”在一起；若下层还没硬、上层已堆叠，就会软塌或层间剥离。控制挤出节奏、加纤维和及时养护能让层间粘结更牢。�Each layer is fresh mortar that bonds to the one below through cement hydration; if the lower layer is still soft when the next is stacked, it sags or delaminates. Controlling extrusion pace, adding fibers and curing promptly strengthen inter-layer bonding.�ans��src��jGibson、Rosen & Stucker，《增材制造技术：从快速原型到直接数字化制造》（第2版）�{Gibson, Rosen & Stucker, 'Additive Manufacturing Technologies: Rapid Prototyping to Direct Digital Manufacturing' (2nd ed.)��id�9b128f23b17d�body���火箭大部分质量是燃料和空油箱，带着用不上的空壳飞到终点很浪费。多级设计在每级燃料烧完后抛掉空壳，让剩余部分用更轻的重量继续加速，从而提高最终速度和运载效率。��Most rocket mass is fuel and empty tanks, so hauling spent stages is wasteful. Multistage rockets drop empty tanks after each burn, letting the rest accelerate with less mass and reach higher speed and efficiency.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�a8d52315dfb4�body��{适度柔性把风振能量耗散掉，硬扛反而应力集中；再配阻尼器把幅度控制在舒适范围更安全。ْSome flexibility dissipates wind energy; fighting it head-on causes stress concentration. Dampers then keep the motion within a comfortable range.�ans��src���《高层民用建筑钢结构技术规程》JGJ 99-2015，中国建筑工业出版社，2015年 ; 另见: ISO 10137:2007, Bases for design of structures - Serviceability of buildings and walkways against vibrations, ISO, 2007��ISO 10137:2007, Bases for design of structures - Serviceability of buildings and walkways against vibrations, ISO, 2007 ; see also: 《高层民用建筑钢结构技术规程》JGJ 99-2015，中国建筑工业出版社，2015年��id�eng_25_008�body��F两种办法:沉管法在陆地造好巨大混凝土管,两端封门后拖到海上沉入挖好的沟槽,对接密封像海底拼乐高;盾构法用巨型盾构机像穿山甲一样边挖边砌圈。衬砌层层防水,加上排水泵站,海水被牢牢挡在外面。港珠澳大桥的海底隧道就是33节沉管接成的。�RTwo ways: immersed tubes — giant concrete segments sealed at ends, floated out, sunk into a dredged trench and joined like undersea Lego; or boring machines digging like pangolins while lining walls behind. Waterproof linings plus pump stations keep sea water locked out. The Hong Kong-Zhuhai-Macao tunnel joins thirty-three such tubes.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�eng_25_009�body��.挖掘机手臂的每个关节都藏着液压油缸:机器把油用高压压进缸里,推动像手臂骨头一样的钢杆,小小的泵就能产生大象腿般的推力。液压系统还能把力量精确分配到铲斗、大臂和小臂,所以它能又轻又准地把树苗种好,也能掀翻巨石。�Every joint hides a hydraulic cylinder: the machine pushes oil in at high pressure, driving steel rods like arm bones — a small pump makes elephant-strength pushes. Hydraulics split power precisely among bucket, arm and boom, so it plants seedlings gently yet flips boulders.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�eng_25_010�body��U冰箱里有一套搬运热的系统:制冷剂在管子里循环,在冷冻室吸走热量变成气体,再到背面的管子把热散给房间空气——它不是制造冷,而是把里面的热搬到外面。短时间停电没关系:关紧箱门,冰块帮着保温,四小时内食物依然安全;堆满东西的冰箱比空冰箱更扛饿。�1A fridge moves heat rather than making cold: refrigerant cycles through pipes, soaking up heat inside then releasing it from coils at the back into your kitchen. Short blackouts are fine — keep doors shut and ice blocks help; four hours stays safe, and a full fridge holds cold longer than an empty one.�ans��src��O韩启德总主编,《十万个为什么》第六版,少年儿童出版社,2013�bTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., editor-in-chief Han Qide, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�b4c9a9ef4384�body��t榫卯柔性连接允许层间错动耗能，斗拱像弹簧一样缓冲，整体'柔中带刚'，震力被化解。٢Flexible mortise-and-tenon joints let floors shift to dissipate energy; bracket sets act like springs. The structure is 'soft yet strong', absorbing quake forces.�ans��src��3Chen & Zhang《应县木塔》；建筑抗震设计�GChen & Zhang, Yingxian Wood Pagoda; seismic design of timber structures��id�d91d06e12ce9�body�٫叶片受风推动旋转，经主轴和齿轮箱（或直驱）带动发电机转子切割磁感线发电，控制系统随风速调节桨距和偏航以保安全高效。ٝBlades spin from wind, driving a generator, via gearbox or direct-drive, to produce electricity; controls adjust pitch and yaw for safe, efficient operation.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�01d7a75bdbe2�body���激光雷达直接测距、夜间和逆光都稳，但成本高、怕恶劣天气；纯视觉便宜且像人眼，却依赖算法和算力去“脑补”深度。成本与冗余安全的权衡让两派长期对立。�␀LiDAR measures distance directly and works in darkness and backlight but is costly and weather-sensitive; vision is cheap and human-like yet relies on algorithms and compute to infer depth. The trade-off between cost and redundancy keeps the camps opposed.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�01f254fbf882�body��l拱形薄壳把压力沿曲面分散，均匀受压时强度很高；只在一点集中受力时才易破。�oThe arched shell spreads pressure along its curve, so even squeeze load is strong; only a point load breaks it.�ans��src��dHibbeler《材料力学》；Callister《材料科学与工程》；Gibson & Ashby《多孔固体》�oHibbeler, Mechanics of Materials; Callister, Materials Science and Engineering; Gibson & Ashby, Cellular Solids��id�0872bbf6ca13�body�ل车与桩通过通信协商允许电流，电池管理系统监控每节电芯温度电压并动态限流，过热即降速保护。فCar and charger negotiate current while the BMS watches each cell's temperature and voltage and throttles to prevent overheating.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�0ac3410b91b0�body��r涂层剥落会失去不粘、还可能随食物吃下；干烧还会释放有害气体，并非锅本身有毒。فFlaking loses the non-stick and may be ingested; overheating releases fumes—not that the pan is poisonous, but misuse is risky.�ans��src��dHibbeler《材料力学》；Callister《材料科学与工程》；Gibson & Ashby《多孔固体》�oHibbeler, Mechanics of Materials; Callister, Materials Science and Engineering; Gibson & Ashby, Cellular Solids��id�0adcc986f420�body�ي角度太陡会因过热烧穿或过载过大；太浅则会被大气层弹回太空无法着陆，因此需在狭窄的走廊内再入。لToo steep overheats or overloads the craft; too shallow and it skips back into space, so reentry must stay within a narrow corridor.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�0b48ca5bd7e7�body��Z水头高达百米以上，无法一次升船，只能靠分级闸室逐段升降船舶。�hThe head exceeds 100 m, impossible to lift at once, so stepped chambers raise and lower ships in stages.�ans��src��@《内河通航标准》GB 50139-2014,中国计划出版社,2014�PNavigation Standard of Inland Waterway GB 50139-2014, China Planning Press, 2014��id�0dc27fd132aa�body�ٷ比冲是单位质量推进剂每秒产生的推力（或单位重量推进剂的冲量），数值上等于排气速度与重力加速度之比，所以常用秒表示效率高低。ٶSpecific impulse is thrust per unit propellant flow (or impulse per weight), numerically the exhaust velocity divided by gravity, so it is quoted in seconds as an efficiency measure.�ans��src��@Sutton《火箭推进原理》；NASA；Tsiolkovsky 火箭方程�ESutton, Rocket Propulsion Elements; NASA; Tsiolkovsky rocket equation��id�0f9e01e007e4�body�ف节拍由客户需求定，任一工位超时会在线旁堆积半成品、拖垮整线产出；平衡工位和防错是关键。�sTakt is set by demand; a slow station backs up WIP and drags output, so line balancing and mistake-proofing matter.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�10276dd845eb�body���工地是非结构化、灰尘多、精度差且人机混杂的环境，构件尺寸和位置都不像车间那么标准。机器人要兼顾安全避障、粗差适应和移动底盘，感知与控制难度远高于固定工位。��Sites are unstructured, dusty, imprecise and shared with humans, with non-standard part sizes and positions. Robots must handle safety, rough tolerance and mobility, making perception and control far harder than at fixed stations.�ans��src��)Bock，《建筑机器人学》（2015）�(Bock, T., 'Construction Robotics' (2015)��id�120ed3ee6999�body��D水下机器人要在六个自由度上机动，而单个推进器只能沿自身轴线产生推力。把若干推进器按不同倾角布置，各自推力的矢量合成就能同时产生前进、侧移和转艏等运动。控制器通过求解推力分配矩阵，把期望的合力与合力矩分解到每台推进器。�nAn underwater vehicle must manoeuvre in six degrees of freedom, yet a single thruster only pushes along its own axis. Mounting several thrusters at different angles lets the vector sum of their thrusts produce surge, sway and yaw at the same time. The controller solves a thrust-allocation matrix to split the desired net force and moment among the individual units.�ans��src��:Bhattacharya《海洋车辆动力学》；IMO 稳性规范�>Bhattacharya, Dynamics of Marine Vehicles; IMO stability codes��id�1255875bff2f�body���帕斯卡原理说密闭液体各点压强相等，若在面积小的活塞上施加力产生压强，大活塞上相同压强会乘上更大面积得到更大的力。能量守恒保证小活塞要移动更长的距离来补偿大力程的短位移。�'Pascal's principle says pressure is equal everywhere in a confined liquid; force on a small piston creates pressure that, on a larger piston, multiplies by the bigger area into a larger force. Energy conservation means the small piston moves farther to compensate the large force's short stroke.�ans��src��'White，《流体力学》（第8版）�"White, 'Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�12d9e3076b05�body���空气中CO2浓度仅约万分之四，要处理巨量空气且结合很弱，所以能耗和成本极高。DAC 靠高选择性固体/液体吸附剂、低温余热和风电光伏供电来压低单位成本。��Air holds only about 400 ppm CO2, requiring huge air handling with weak binding, so energy and cost are extreme. DAC relies on selective solid/liquid sorbents, low-grade heat and renewable power to cut per-ton cost.�ans��src��aLackner，《从环境空气中捕集二氧化碳》，《能源》32卷，491–495页（2007）�TLackner, K.S. 'Carbon dioxide capture from ambient air.' Energy 32, 491–495 (2007)��id�135e553f01b7�body�ٜ它要由末端目标位姿反求各关节角度，往往存在多个解甚至无解，还要在解中选最优（离当前姿态近、避开奇异点）。ٟIt solves joint angles from a desired end pose; solutions may be multiple, none, or near singularities, and one must pick the best (closest, singularity-free).�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�14024fa5b11f�body�٣普通X光是单次投影的重叠影像，CT则让X射线管绕人体旋转采集多个角度，经计算机重建出横断面图像，避免结构互相遮挡。ٜA plain X-ray is one overlapping projection; CT rotates the tube around the body and reconstructs cross-sectional images from many angles, avoiding overlap.�ans��src��^Kak & Slaney《CT 原理》；Haacke 等《MRI 原理》；超声成像（Hendee & Ritenour）هKak & Slaney, Principles of Computerized Tomographic Imaging; Haacke et al., Magnetic Resonance Imaging; ultrasound (Hendee & Ritenour)��id�157fa891aa47�body��集装箱装卸顺序与堆场位置强相关，若出口箱分散在不同贝位，龙门吊要来回长距离移动。通过把同船、同卸序的箱子集中到邻近贝位并按提箱顺序堆垛，能减少倒箱和空驶，从而压缩整体作业时间。�Handling sequence depends heavily on yard location; scattered export boxes force the gantry to travel far. Clustering same-vessel, same-discharge boxes in nearby bays and stacking by retrieval order cuts reshuffles and empty moves, shrinking total handling time.�ans��src��OSteenken、Voss & Stahlbock，《集装箱码头运营与运筹学》（2004）�YSteenken, Voss & Stahlbock, 'Container Terminal Operation and Operations Research' (2004)��id�1bbba8190a54�body���PEM 电解槽响应快、电流密度高、可在宽负荷范围快速启停，能紧跟风电光伏的波动出力。碱性电解槽惯量大、启停慢，频繁变负荷会加速电极老化和效率下降。��PEM electrolyzers respond fast with high current density and quick start-stop across wide loads, tracking variable wind/solar output. Alkaline units have large inertia and slow dynamics; frequent load swings accelerate aging and efficiency loss.�ans��src��>Larminie & Dicks，《燃料电池系统解析》（第2版）�9Larminie & Dicks, 'Fuel Cell Systems Explained' (2nd ed.)��id�1c0dec7f107a�body�ٙ它指出行星（或卫星）轨道周期的平方与轨道半长轴的立方成正比，意味着离中心天体越远，公转越慢、周期越长。٘It states the square of the orbital period is proportional to the cube of the semi-major axis, so farther objects orbit more slowly with longer periods.�ans��src��SBate, Mueller & White《天体力学基础》；NASA 轨道力学；开普勒定律�[Bate, Mueller & White, Fundamentals of Astrodynamics; NASA orbital mechanics; Kepler's laws��id�1c37eb9bd071�body��}当执行器已经到达极限却仍有偏差时，积分项还在不断累加，积分值可能涨到很大。等到偏差反向，积分需要很长时间才能退出饱和，表现为响应严重超调和长时间失控。抗饱和措施包括对积分项限幅、执行器饱和时暂停积分，或采用反算法把实际输出与期望输出之差反馈去修正积分器。��When the actuator has already hit its limit but an error persists, the integral term keeps accumulating and can grow very large. Once the error reverses, the integrator takes a long time to unwind, showing up as severe overshoot and a long period of poor control. Anti-windup measures include clamping the integral term, freezing integration while the actuator is saturated, or back-calculation, which feeds the difference between commanded and actual output back to correct the integrator.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�1c86442152a7�body�ٟ选区激光熔融（SLM）用高功率激光逐层熔化金属粉末并凝固成形，可制造复杂内腔与轻量化结构，常用于航空航天零件。ٕSelective Laser Melting (SLM) fuses metal powder layer by layer with a laser, building complex internal channels and lightweight parts for aerospace.�ans��src��VIndustry 4.0（Kagermann 等）；ISO 23247（智能制造）；MES/SCADA 工业标准�`Industry 4.0 (Kagermann et al.); ISO 23247 (smart manufacturing); MES/SCADA industrial standards��id�253edbd607d5�body���它用不可燃的固体电解质替代易燃有机液，从根源上避免漏液和燃爆。但固-固接触是“点接触”，界面缝隙让锂离子难以通过，电阻（阻抗）剧增，容量和快充性能因此受限。�It replaces flammable liquid electrolyte with a non-flammable solid, removing the root cause of leakage and fire. But solid-solid contact is point-like, and gaps block lithium-ion transport, spiking interfacial resistance and limiting capacity and fast charging.�ans��src��^Janek & Zeier，《电池发展的固态未来》，《自然·能源》1卷，16141（2016）�VJanek & Zeier, 'A solid future for battery development,' Nature Energy 1, 16141 (2016)��id�27933202a304�body���激光快速熔凝形成极大的温度梯度和残余应力，扫描路径决定了应力方向和散热。策略不当会引起球化、未熔合、裂纹和翘曲，因此常用棋盘式或旋转扫描来均衡热量。�Rapid melting creates steep temperature gradients and residual stress, and the scan path sets stress direction and heat dissipation. Poor strategy causes balling, lack of fusion, cracking and warping, so checkerboard or rotated scans are used to balance heat.�ans��src��jGibson、Rosen & Stucker，《增材制造技术：从快速原型到直接数字化制造》（第2版）�{Gibson, Rosen & Stucker, 'Additive Manufacturing Technologies: Rapid Prototyping to Direct Digital Manufacturing' (2nd ed.)��id�284585198270�body��Z干旱地区要靠深井取地下水，阶梯还能降温并兼作宗教与公共空间。�hIn arid lands they reach deep groundwater; the steps also cool the air and serve as sacred public space.�ans��src��jLehner《完整的金字塔》；Jackson 等《PNAS》2013（罗马混凝土）；中国《赵州桥志》�cLehner, The Complete Pyramids; Jackson et al., PNAS (2013, Roman concrete); Zhaozhou Bridge Records��id�28c6697e6f6d�body��W混凝土抗压不抗拉，钢筋抗拉，二者粘结互补，截面受弯才高效。�lConcrete resists compression but not tension; steel takes the tension, so the bonded pair bends efficiently.�ans��src��$ACI 318；Hibbeler《材料力学》�)ACI 318; Hibbeler, Mechanics of Materials��id�2a5ffe87190b�body�ٱ高速再入时空气被剧烈压缩产生上千摄氏度高温，返回舱用烧蚀防热层（表层材料受热分解带走热量）和隔热层保护舱内人员与设备。ٹHigh-speed reentry compresses air to over a thousand degrees; capsules use an ablative heat shield, where material chars and carries heat away, plus insulation to protect crew and gear.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�2f81b18955d9�body���金属原子在固态晶格中排列比液态更紧密，所以凝固时体积缩小。水的冰晶因氢键形成开放的六方结构，固态反而比液态占据更大空间，因此结冰膨胀、密度变小。��Metal atoms pack more tightly in the solid lattice than in the liquid, so freezing shrinks volume. Water's ice crystals form an open hexagonal structure via hydrogen bonds, occupying more space solid than liquid, so it expands and gets less dense.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�2ff193610804�body��`大拱上开小拱（敞肩）减轻自重、利于泄洪又省料，是隋代李春的巧思。�uSmall arches on the big one (open spandrel) cut weight, aid flood release and save stone—clever 7th-century design.�ans��src��@李春，赵州桥（隋，约 595–605）；《赵州桥志》�CLi Chun, Zhaozhou Bridge (Sui, c. 595-605); Zhaozhou Bridge Records��id�31c174591094�body�ٓ它用机械泵部分或完全代替衰弱心脏泵血，维持全身循环，常作为心脏移植前的过渡或终末期心衰的长期支持。ٚIt uses a mechanical pump to partially or fully replace a failing heart's pumping, maintaining circulation as a bridge to transplant or long-term support.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�3eadfd64e0b8�body�ٜ它用微型泵按算法持续皮下输注基础量胰岛素，并在餐前追加大剂量，模拟健康胰腺的分泌节律，帮助糖尿病人控糖。ٕA micro-pump delivers a continuous basal insulin dose and meal-time boluses, mimicking healthy pancreatic rhythm to control blood sugar in diabetics.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�3eb7c11a2d79�body���BEV（鸟瞰图）把所有摄像头画面统一投影到一张俯视地图里，Transformer 则像注意力机制把不同视角的特征对齐融合。这样车不再“各看各的”，而是得到一张连贯的周围环视图。��BEV (bird's-eye view) projects all camera images into one top-down map, and a Transformer aligns and fuses features across views via attention. The car no longer sees separately but gets one coherent surround view.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�408feeba2330�body�ٱ数字主线是贯穿产品从设计、制造到运维全生命周期的连续性数据流，让各环节基于同一份可追溯数据协同，区别于单点的数字孪生。٭A digital thread is the continuous data flow across a product's whole life, design, build and operate, so all stages share one traceable source, unlike a point digital twin.�ans��src��1Grieves《数字孪生》；ANSI/AMT 数字主线�.Grieves, Digital Twin; ANSI/AMT digital thread��id�462cd0a41922�body���布雷顿循环在燃烧室加热、透平做功，用燃气直接驱动；朗肯循环靠锅炉产蒸汽、汽轮机做功。联合循环把燃气轮机的高温尾气再拿去烧锅炉发电，梯级利用热量，总效率可超60%。��Brayton heats in the combustor and works in the gas turbine; Rankine makes steam in a boiler and works in a steam turbine. Combined cycle feeds the gas turbine's hot exhaust to boil steam, cascading the heat, pushing efficiency past 60%.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�468bc816fe68�body�ٙ不是。阳极氧化在铝等表面用电化学长出致密氧化层，既着色又耐磨防腐；喷漆只是外层覆盖，附着力与寿命不同。ـAnodizing grows a dense oxide layer electrochemically for color, wear, and corrosion resistance; paint merely coats the surface.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�471ce945d754�body��c锰脱氧并强化，铬形成致密氧化膜防锈（不锈钢）；微量元素调硬度韧性。لManganese deoxidizes and strengthens; chromium forms a protective film against rust (stainless); traces tune hardness and toughness.�ans��src��WASM International《金属手册》第1卷；Callister《材料科学与工程导论》�iASM International, 'ASM Handbook' Vol. 1; Callister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction'��id�4a6459a58f6c�body�ٓ立体交叉让不同方向车流分层通过、互不抢道，螺旋或环道在有限用地里用高度换平面空间，减少红绿灯停车。�yInterchanges separate flows by level so they don't conflict; spirals or loops trade height for land and cut signal stops.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�4c2a3845b037�body���往复式靠活塞间歇压缩，每级压比高、流量小但排气压力可达很高，适合小流量高压。离心式靠叶轮连续加速气体再用扩压器转成压力，流量大、压比单级有限，适合大流量中低压的连续工况。�QReciprocating compressors use pistons for intermittent compression with high per-stage ratio and small flow but very high discharge pressure—good for low-flow high-pressure. Centrifugal types accelerate gas continuously with impellers and diffusers: large flow, limited single-stage ratio, suited to high-flow medium-low pressure duty.�ans��src��'White，《流体力学》（第8版）�"White, 'Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�4c4c83243258�body��`火山灰加石灰反应生成特殊矿物，遇海水反而自我强化、裂了也能自愈。�bVolcanic ash plus lime forms minerals that actually strengthen and self-heal when hit by seawater.�ans��src��4Jackson 等《PNAS》2013（海水罗马混凝土）�4Jackson et al., PNAS (2013, Roman seawater concrete)��id�4ccef92068c6�body�ٳRO膜孔径约0.0001微米，介于水分子团和离子之间；靠高压把水压过膜，溶解的盐离子和多数污染物被截留，几乎是物理筛分加电荷排斥。١The RO pore is between a water cluster and an ion; high pressure pushes water through while dissolved ions and most contaminants are rejected by size and charge.�ans��src��-Baker，《膜技术及应用》（第3版）�7Baker, 'Membrane Technology and Applications' (3rd ed.)��id�4d618b4240b7�body���孪生体一边按物理方程推算部件应有的温度、振动和应力，一边比对实测值，二者之差（残差）异常放大就是早期故障信号。再结合寿命模型，就能在损坏前提早安排维修。��The twin computes expected temperature, vibration and stress from physics while comparing with measurements; an abnormally growing mismatch (residual) signals early faults. Coupled with life models, maintenance is scheduled before breakdown.�ans��src��SGrieves，《数字孪生：通过虚拟工厂复制实现制造卓越》（2014）�\Grieves, 'Digital Twin: Manufacturing Excellence through Virtual Factory Replication' (2014)��id�4d694c317c42�body��N真空夹层阻断传导和对流，内壁银膜反射辐射，双向隔热。�lThe vacuum stops conduction and convection, and the silvered wall reflects radiation—insulating both ways.�ans��src��/Dewar 1892 真空瓶；Incropera《传热学》�LDewar vacuum flask (1892); Incropera, Fundamentals of Heat and Mass Transfer��id�4f1f5da617d4�body��_前飞时前行桨叶的相对气流速度大、升力大，后行桨叶相反，左右升力不平衡会使机身滚转。挥舞铰允许桨叶上下自由挥舞，升力大的一侧自动向上抬起、迎角减小，从而自动平衡两侧升力。这一发明使直升机具备可控的前飞能力，同时大幅降低了桨根的弯曲应力。��In forward flight the advancing blade meets faster relative airflow and makes more lift than the retreating blade, and this asymmetry would roll the fuselage. A flapping hinge lets each blade rise and fall freely, so the side making more lift flaps up, reduces its angle of attack and automatically equalises lift. This invention made controllable forward flight possible while greatly reducing bending stress at the blade root.�ans��src��1Seddon《直升机空气动力学基础》；NASA�+Seddon, Basic Helicopter Aerodynamics; NASA��id�4fd0f573caeb�body��J惯导要把角速度和加速度积分成姿态和位置，传感器的零偏和噪声也一起被积分，误差随时间累积成漂移。工程上用温度补偿和标定压低零偏，再融合磁力计、GPS、轮式里程计或视觉进行修正。行人和机器人还常用静止时刻的零速修正来周期性归零。��Inertial navigation integrates angular rate and acceleration into attitude and position, and the sensor's bias and noise get integrated too, so error accumulates as drift. Engineers reduce bias by temperature compensation and calibration, then fuse magnetometer, GPS, wheel odometry or vision data to correct it. Pedestrian and robot systems also apply zero-velocity updates during stationary moments to reset the error periodically.�ans��src��:Thrun、Burgard & Fox，《概率机器人学》（2005）�5Thrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (2005)��id�57b9b51cd666�body��A欠驱动手指的关节数多于电机数，各关节通过连杆或绳索与弹簧耦合。一根绳收紧时，手指会自动依次贴合物体轮廓，实现自适应包络抓取，无需知道物体精确形状。代价是每个关节的力和位置不能独立指定，做精细操作时不如全驱动手灵活。��An underactuated finger has more joints than motors, with the joints coupled through linkages or tendons and springs. Pulling one tendon makes the finger close sequentially and conform to the object's contour, giving adaptive enveloping grasps without knowing the exact shape. The price is that joint forces and positions cannot be commanded independently, so dexterous in-hand manipulation is harder than with a fully actuated hand.�ans��src��FMonkman 等《机器人夹爪》(Robot Grippers)（Wiley-VCH，2007）�2Monkman et al., 'Robot Grippers' (Wiley-VCH, 2007)��id�5a4134b4d2e1�body�ٜ它要持续供给氧气、去除二氧化碳、循环与净化水、调节温湿度并处理废物；先进系统追求闭环再生以减少地面补给。ٴIt must supply oxygen, remove CO2, recycle and purify water, control temperature and humidity, and process waste; advanced systems aim for closed-loop regeneration to cut resupply.�ans��src���Perry, Sargusingh, Toomarian,《Guiding Requirements for Designing Life Support System Architectures for Crewed Exploration Missions Beyond Low-Earth Orbit》, AIAA SPACE 2016, 2016 (DOI: 10.2514/6.2016-5461)��Perry, Sargusingh, Toomarian, 'Guiding Requirements for Designing Life Support System Architectures for Crewed Exploration Missions Beyond Low-Earth Orbit', AIAA SPACE 2016, 2016, DOI: 10.2514/6.2016-5461��id�5aa1138f35c9�body���根轨迹看闭环极点随增益在复数平面上的移动，一旦越过虚轴就失稳；奈奎斯特则看开环频率响应曲线是否包围临界点来判断闭环稳定。一个在时域、一个在频域，殊途同归。�Root locus tracks how closed-loop poles move in the complex plane with gain—crossing the imaginary axis means instability. Nyquist checks whether the open-loop frequency curve encircles a critical point. One is time-domain, the other frequency-domain, but both agree.�ans��src��EK. Ogata,《现代控制工程》第5版,Pearson,2010,PID控制章节�QK. Ogata, Modern Control Engineering, 5th ed., Pearson, 2010, PID control chapter��id�6032cfef7ccb�body���高超音速下，飞行器前方空气被强烈压缩且粘性摩擦把动能转化为热能，边界层温度随马赫数平方量级升高。最尖锐的前缘驻点处气流几乎停滞，动能全部转为热能，因此温度最高。�At hypersonic speed, compressed and viscous air converts kinetic energy to heat, with boundary-layer temperature rising roughly with Mach squared. At the sharp leading-edge stagnation point the flow nearly stops, dumping all kinetic energy into heat, so it gets hottest there.�ans��src��BAnderson，《高超声速与高温气体动力学》（第2版）�BAnderson, 'Hypersonic and High-Temperature Gas Dynamics' (2nd ed.)��id�6434bb9f6b66�body��`可能用土坡、杠杆和湿沙减阻等办法逐步抬升，具体方法至今仍有争议。�fRamps, levers and wet-sand friction tricks likely raised them step by step; details are still debated.�ans��src��$Lehner《完整的金字塔》(1997)�$Lehner, The Complete Pyramids (1997)��id�691014b8ff42�body���它们是宽禁带半导体，耐更高电压、温度和开关频率，开关损耗和导通损耗都更低，所以充电器更小、车续航更长。硅器件在高频高压下损耗和发热迅速恶化，逼近极限。��They are wide-bandgap semiconductors tolerating higher voltage, temperature and switching frequency with lower loss, so chargers shrink and EV range grows. Silicon's loss and heat rise fast at high frequency and voltage, nearing its limit.�ans��src��EMohan，《电力电子：变换器、应用与设计》（第3版）�IMohan, 'Power Electronics: Converters, Applications and Design' (3rd ed.)��id�69cdbef92f48�body���晶体管越缩越短，栅极越来越难关住沟道电流，出现短沟道效应导致漏电和发热。FinFET 用竖起的鳍让栅极三面贴沟道，GAA 更进一步用纳米片把沟道四面裹住，重新夺回控制力。��As transistors shrink, the gate struggles to switch off the channel, causing short-channel leakage and heat. FinFET wraps the gate on three sides of a raised fin; GAA goes further, surrounding a nanosheet channel on all sides to regain control.�ans��src��`Ferain、Colinge & Colinge，《多栅晶体管》，《自然·材料》9卷，713页（2010）�MFerain, Colinge & Colinge, 'Multigate transistors,' Nat. Mater. 9, 713 (2010)��id�6ff44850a1f9�body��o玻璃是过冷固体（非晶态），室温下并不流动；老窗上薄下厚是当年擀制工艺所致。�}Glass is an amorphous solid, not flowing at room temperature; old window thickness differences came from old rolling methods.�ans��src��cCallister《材料科学与工程》；ACI 318《混凝土结构设计规范》；ASTM 材料标准�yCallister, Materials Science and Engineering; ACI 318, Building Code Requirements for Structural Concrete; ASTM standards��id�719e7f3aecc4�body���它们依靠惯性导航、地形或地磁匹配、以及板载任务重规划，在断联时按预设目标自行避障和决策。AUV 还能靠多普勒测速和声呐地图在水下无GPS环境定位。��They rely on inertial navigation, terrain or geomagnetic matching, and on-board mission replanning to avoid obstacles and decide on their own. AUVs additionally use Doppler velocity and sonar maps to navigate underwater without GPS.�ans��src��:Thrun、Burgard & Fox，《概率机器人学》（2005）�5Thrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (2005)��id�729fc527414d�body��P动压等于二分之一空气密度乘速度平方，上升时速度增大而密度减小，二者乘积在某一高度出现峰值，通常在起飞后一分钟多。此处箭体承受的气动载荷最大，稍有姿态偏差就可能超过结构极限。因此控制律会在这一段临时节流降速，过后再恢复全推力。��Dynamic pressure equals half the air density times velocity squared; as the rocket climbs, speed rises while density falls, so their product peaks at a certain altitude, usually a bit over a minute after liftoff. Aerodynamic loads on the vehicle are highest there, and a small attitude deviation could exceed structural limits. The control law therefore throttles back through this region and restores full thrust afterwards.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�735bfccc95ce�body��c绒朵锁住大量静止空气，空气导热差形成隔热层；保暖靠蓬松度而非厚度。�bDown traps still air; air is a poor conductor, so the loft—not thickness—makes the insulation.�ans��src��'Incropera《传热学》；纤维隔热�EIncropera, Fundamentals of Heat and Mass Transfer; fibrous insulation��id�760000903484�body���当单芯片微缩越来越难且贵，Chiplet 把不同功能的小芯片用高密度互连拼在一起，等效算力继续涨而良率更高。3D 堆叠则靠硅通孔把芯片叠高，缩短互连、提升带宽。��As single-chip scaling gets hard and pricey, Chiplets link function-specific dies with dense interconnects for rising compute at better yield. 3D stacking uses through-silicon vias to pile chips, shortening links and boosting bandwidth.�ans��src��;Lau，《芯粒设计与异构集成》（Springer, 2023）�HLau, J., 'Chiplet Design and Heterogeneous Integration' (Springer, 2023)��id�763fc4ba47c1�body�ٓ它比对方向盘意图和实际车身姿态，发现转向不足或过度时单独对某个车轮制动并调扭矩，把车拉回既定路线。�yIt compares steering intent with actual motion and brakes individual wheels or cuts torque to bring the car back on path.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�769ad8664c1e�body���太阳能电池的输出功率随电压和电流变化，存在一个最大功率点，且会随光照和温度漂移。MPPT 控制器不断调整变换器工作点，使组件始终工作在最大功率点附近，避免固定电压下的功率损失。�A solar cell's power varies with voltage and current, peaking at a maximum power point that drifts with light and temperature. The MPPT controller continuously tunes the converter operating point to stay near that peak, avoiding losses from a fixed voltage.�ans��src��@Luque & Hegedus，《光伏科学与技术手册》（第2版）�MLuque & Hegedus, 'Handbook of Photovoltaic Science and Engineering' (2nd ed.)��id�78b4f44a2274�body���厌氧消化在无氧条件下由产酸菌和产甲烷菌分阶段把有机物分解成甲烷和二氧化碳混合的沼气。沼气驱动内燃机或燃料电池发电，残余消化液还可作肥料，实现废物能源化。��Anaerobic digestion uses acidogenic and methanogenic bacteria in oxygen-free tanks to break organics into biogas, a methane-CO2 mix. The gas fuels engines or fuel cells for power, and the digestate becomes fertilizer—waste to energy.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�811442092414�body���两航天器要在轨道上把相对速度降到接近零并精确对齐接口，靠雷达、激光与视觉引导，任何偏差都可能导致碰撞，对接机构还要缓冲吸收能量。٧Two craft must null their relative velocity and align ports in orbit using radar, lidar and vision; any error risks collision, and the docking ring must absorb energy.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�82d1f109a529�body��S它走之字形'抢风'，帆成翼型借侧向风力中指向前的分量推进。�zIt zigzags upwind ('beating'); the sail acts like an airfoil, using the forward component of sideways wind to drive ahead.�ans��src�ٕBowen,《A DEMONSTRATION SAILBOAT WHICH WILL SAIL AGAINST THE WIND》, School Science and Mathematics, 1951 (DOI: 10.1111/j.1949-8594.1951.tb06788.x)ّBowen, 'A DEMONSTRATION SAILBOAT WHICH WILL SAIL AGAINST THE WIND', School Science and Mathematics, 1951, DOI: 10.1111/j.1949-8594.1951.tb06788.x��id�8421560f26dd�body���固定式基础靠打桩扎根海床，水深超过约 50 米后造价急剧上升。浮式基础用系泊缆和浮体像船一样漂浮支撑风机，不受海床深度限制，从而可利用远海更深、风资源更好的海域。��Fixed foundations are piled into the seabed and get far costlier beyond about 50 m depth. Floating platforms use mooring lines and buoys to support turbines like ships, unrestricted by depth, accessing deeper, windier far-offshore sites.�ans��src��(Burton，《风能手册》（第2版）�(Burton, 'Wind Energy Handbook' (2nd ed.)��id�883eb3ff2419�body���线性系统可凭特征值符号判定稳定，但非线性系统没有固定特征值。李雅普诺夫直接构造一个“能量函数”，只要它随时间下降就证明系统会回到平衡，不必求解方程。��Linear systems can be judged by eigenvalue signs, but nonlinear ones have no fixed eigenvalues. Lyapunov directly builds an 'energy function'; if it keeps decreasing, the system returns to equilibrium—without solving the equations.�ans��src��+Khalil，《非线性系统》（第3版）�%Khalil, 'Nonlinear Systems' (3rd ed.)��id�8cb7238fac0f�body�ِ液氢比冲高、利于上面级但密度低、储箱庞大且需极低温；煤油密度大、易储存、适合起飞级，但比冲较低。٨Hydrogen gives high specific impulse and suits upper stages but is low-density and cryogenic; kerosene is dense and easy to store, good for liftoff, but less efficient.�ans��src��@Sutton《火箭推进原理》；NASA；Tsiolkovsky 火箭方程�ESutton, Rocket Propulsion Elements; NASA; Tsiolkovsky rocket equation��id�925254ff8a8d�body��转化率主要反映反应进行程度与产量，而分子量分布决定材料的强度、粘度和加工性能。两者受温度、引发剂浓度和链转移速率的不同影响，需分别调节工艺参数才能得到既高产又性能稳定的聚合物。�2Conversion reflects how far and how much the reaction proceeded, while molecular-weight distribution sets strength, viscosity, and processability. They respond differently to temperature, initiator, and chain-transfer rates, so parameters must be tuned separately for both high yield and stable properties.�ans��src��4Fogler，《化学反应工程原理》（第5版）�=Fogler, 'Elements of Chemical Reaction Engineering' (5th ed.)��id�9802f80258d6�body�ٖ它通过电极感知心脏电活动，当节律过慢或停搏时，由脉冲发生器发出微小电脉冲刺激心肌收缩，维持正常心率。ٰElectrodes sense the heart's electrical activity, and when the rhythm is too slow the pulse generator sends tiny electrical pulses to make the muscle contract at a normal rate.�ans��src��2Medtronic 心脏起搏器；ISO 13485 医疗器械�7Medtronic cardiac pacemakers; ISO 13485 medical devices��id�a3559eecb55e�body�٫基站在同一频段布设大量天线，用波束赋形把信号精确指向各用户并复用空间维度，从而在相同频谱下服务更多用户、提升吞吐。ٕThe base station uses many antennas to beamform signals to each user and reuse space, serving more users and raising throughput on the same spectrum.�ans��src��HRappaport《无线通信》；3GPP 5G 标准；Proakis《数字通信》�VRappaport, Wireless Communications; 3GPP 5G standards; Proakis, Digital Communications��id�a3e366208376�body���深海或地层封存最怕CO2泄漏回到大气，或注入改变地应力诱发微小地震。长期监测、盖层完整性和泄漏预警是确保安全的关键，封存点要选在封闭性极好的储层之上。��Deep-sea or geological storage risks CO2 leaking back to the atmosphere or inducing small quakes by changing stress. Long-term monitoring, caprock integrity and leak warning are essential, with storage chosen above tightly sealed reservoirs.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a8584207e896�body�ٍ平时用电磁门吸敞开方便通行；火灾时断电或易熔件动作释放，闭门器把门合上，隔烟阻火形成疏散通道。�~Magnetic holders keep them open for passage; on fire, power loss or a fusible link releases the closer to seal smoke and fire.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�a8b678692998�body��固溶强化靠把异类原子溶入基体晶格，引起晶格畸变从而阻碍位错运动。析出强化则让细小第二相颗粒从过饱和固溶体中析出，位错必须切过或绕过这些颗粒，需要额外应力，因此显著提高强度。�8Solid-solution strengthening dissolves alien atoms into the lattice, distorting it and hindering dislocation motion. Precipitation strengthening lets fine second-phase particles precipitate from a supersaturated solution; dislocations must cut through or bypass them, requiring extra stress and raising strength.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�acbe6206dd04�body��~依地形和水文：东线借大运河泵提北送，中线自流引丹江口，西线补黄河上游，分线降低难度。١By terrain and hydrology: the east pumps via the old canal, the central flows from Danjiangkou, the west feeds the upper Yellow River—splitting eases the work.�ans��src��'中国水利部《南水北调工程》�OChina Ministry of Water Resources (MWR), South-to-North Water Diversion Project��id�adc07fa27394�body���湿法脱硫用石灰石浆液在吸收塔里与烟气中的二氧化硫反应，先生成亚硫酸钙，再鼓入空气氧化成稳定的硫酸钙（石膏）。这样把气态污染物固定成固体副产物，便于后续处置或利用。��Wet desulfurization sprays limestone slurry that reacts with SO2 to form calcium sulfite, then air oxidizes it to stable calcium sulfate (gypsum). The gaseous pollutant is fixed into a solid byproduct for disposal or reuse.�ans��src��5Soud，《烟气脱硫》（IEA煤炭研究，1994）�ASoud, H.N., 'Flue Gas Desulphurisation' (IEA Coal Research, 1994)��id�af896d78df4c�body�٫透析利用半透膜两侧的浓度差，让小分子代谢废物（如尿素）和多余水分扩散到透析液中，而血细胞和大分子蛋白保留在血液里。١Dialysis relies on a semipermeable membrane: small wastes like urea and excess water diffuse into the dialysate while blood cells and large proteins stay behind.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�b5893bc98a72�body���软土承载能力低且压缩性高，独立基础会产生过大沉降甚至差异沉降。桩筏基础把筏板与深入硬土层的桩结合，既由桩承担大部分荷载，又靠筏板协调各桩沉降，整体刚度与稳定性更好。�&Soft soil has low bearing capacity and high compressibility, so isolated footings cause excessive or differential settlement. A pile-raft combines a slab with piles reaching stiff strata: piles carry most load while the raft equalizes settlements, giving better overall stiffness and stability.�ans��src��+Das，《岩土工程原理》（第9版）�7Das, 'Principles of Geotechnical Engineering' (9th ed.)��id�b7273cdfe6f8�body���凸轮是具有特定轮廓的回转零件，从动件沿轮廓运动，把转动变成预设的往复运动规律。发动机凸轮轴按配气相位设计型线，使气门在正确时刻以合适升程开闭，保证进排气与活塞运动协调。�A cam is a rotating part with a designed profile; a follower rides it, converting rotation into a preset reciprocating motion. The engine camshaft's profile is shaped by valve timing so valves open and close at the right moments with proper lift, coordinating with the piston.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�b8958d7ef167�body��~地下恒温约十几度，埋管循环介质与土壤换热，冬天取热、夏天排热，效率比直接电热高数倍。ٖThe ground stays about 15°C; buried loops exchange heat with soil, heating in winter and cooling in summer far more efficiently than resistance heat.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�ba69ca2a19eb�body���刀盘切削土体，密封舱里用削出的土屑或泥浆顶住开挖面，压力刚好抵消地下水与土压，防止坍塌。土压平衡靠螺旋机排土控压，泥水平衡靠循环泥浆护壁，各适合不同地层。�The cutterhead excavates while a sealed chamber uses muck or slurry to press the face, balancing groundwater and soil pressure to stop collapse. Earth-pressure mode controls pressure via a screw conveyor; slurry mode circulates mud to support the wall—each fits different ground.�ans��src��CMaidl、Herrenknecht & Anheuser，《机械化盾构隧道技术》�>Maidl, Herrenknecht & Anheuser, 'Mechanised Shield Tunnelling'��id�bb64f4eb247f�body���氢气极轻、常压体积巨大，液化要深冷到零下253℃且耗能高。液氢适合航天等高频场景，氨和有机液体（LOHC）则在常温常压下以化合物形式安全储运，用时再释放氢气。��Hydrogen is very light and bulky at ambient pressure; liquefaction needs minus 253°C and high energy. Liquid H2 suits spaceflight; ammonia and liquid organic carriers (LOHC) store and ship it safely at room conditions, releasing H2 on demand.�ans��src��OZüttel，《储氢材料》，《今日材料》6(9)卷，24–33页（2003）�OZüttel, 'Materials for hydrogen storage,' Materials Today 6(9), 24–33 (2003)��id�bb6a501fe475�body��颤振是风致振动与结构弹性耦合后的自激发散现象，当风速超过临界值时扭转模态被持续放大，可能导致桥梁破坏。设计通过风洞试验优化断面形状、增加气动措施和扭转刚度，把临界风速提高到远超实际风速。�.Flutter is a self-excited divergence where wind-induced motion couples with elasticity; above a critical wind speed the torsional mode grows until failure. Designers use wind-tunnel tests to shape the deck, add aerodynamic devices and torsional stiffness, raising the critical speed well above reality.�ans��src��:Bisplinghoff、Ashley & Halfman，《气动弹性力学》�0Bisplinghoff, Ashley & Halfman, 'Aeroelasticity'��id�bbea9c11274c�body�ٖ化粪池靠厌氧菌先分解沉降固体，上清液再进市政污水管网到污水处理厂，经活性污泥等工艺净化后排放或回用。هA septic tank anaerobically settles and digests solids; the effluent goes to a treatment plant using activated sludge before discharge.�ans��src��<Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程》；EPA 化粪池设计指南�BMetcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering; EPA septic system guidance��id�bead3ad41310�body��N轻、吸能、隔音隔热，常用于缓冲吸能结构和轻量化部件。�`They are light, energy-absorbing and insulating, used in crash structures and lightweight parts.�ans��src��dHibbeler《材料力学》；Callister《材料科学与工程》；Gibson & Ashby《多孔固体》�oHibbeler, Mechanics of Materials; Callister, Materials Science and Engineering; Gibson & Ashby, Cellular Solids��id�c0fc4b73ae5f�body���长拉索质量轻、阻尼小，容易在风或雨激振下发生大幅横振甚至风雨振，长期会导致锚具疲劳。在索上或近锚处加装粘滞阻尼器能提高系统阻尼，快速衰减振动、保护锚固。��Long stays are light with little damping, so wind or rain excites large vibrations, even rain-wind induced, risking anchor fatigue. Adding viscous dampers near the cable raises system damping, quickly decaying motion and protecting anchors.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�c240b428ce4f�body��]水化反应需要水和时间，保湿防裂、才能达到设计强度，早干会粉化。�}Hydration needs water and time; keeping it moist prevents cracks and reaches design strength—drying early makes it crumble.�ans��src��"ACI 308（混凝土养护规范）�.ACI 308, Standard Practice for Curing Concrete��id�c2a8fd7d5403�body��]长杆增大转动惯量、降低重心晃动的频率，给人更多调整平衡的时间。�jThe long pole raises rotational inertia and slows the sway frequency, giving more time to correct balance.�ans��src��LR. C. Hibbeler,《Engineering Mechanics: Statics & Dynamics》Pearson 多版�VR. C. Hibbeler, Engineering Mechanics: Statics and Dynamics, Pearson, various editions��id�cfeb9a728262�body�ل前室和加压送风把楼梯间保持正压，烟气进不来，疏散时呼吸道不被呛；普通楼梯井会像烟囱灌烟。�rA pressurized anteroom keeps the stairwell positive-pressure so smoke can't enter, protecting evacuees' breathing.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�d4048e849630�body���生物墨水是把细胞混在温敏水凝胶里，低温和温和剪切力保护细胞不被挤死，打印后凝胶固化成支架。细胞嵌在孔隙中继续代谢，并靠营养液灌注维持成活，等待血管长入。��Bio-ink suspends cells in a temperature-sensitive hydrogel; low temperature and gentle shear protect them, and the gel solidifies into a scaffold after printing. Cells sit in pores, keep metabolizing under perfusion, and await blood-vessel ingrowth.�ans��src��rMurphy & Atala，《组织与器官的3D生物打印》，《自然·生物技术》32卷，773–785页（2014）�fMurphy, S.V. & Atala, A. '3D bioprinting of tissues and organs.' Nat. Biotechnol. 32, 773–785 (2014)��id�d67d7978bb9c�body���垃圾降解会产生含重金属和有机物的渗滤液，一旦渗入土壤和地下水将长期污染。防渗膜像不透水的底衬阻断下渗，其上的排水层把渗滤液导排到收集池处理，双保险降低环境风险。�%Decomposing waste yields leachate rich in heavy metals and organics that would pollute soil and groundwater if it seeped. The geomembrane acts as an impermeable liner blocking downward flow, while the drainage layer above routes leachate to a collection tank for treatment—double protection.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�e1429873c601�body�ٴ它先把部分推进剂在预燃室燃烧产生富燃料气体驱动涡轮，再把这些高温气体全部送入主燃烧室充分燃烧，能量利用率高，代表如RD-180。ٚIt burns some propellant in a preburner to drive the turbine, then feeds all hot gas into the main chamber, achieving high efficiency, such as the RD-180.�ans��src��@Sutton《火箭推进原理》；NASA；Tsiolkovsky 火箭方程�ESutton, Rocket Propulsion Elements; NASA; Tsiolkovsky rocket equation��id�e69c22b17d39�body�ٍ能。再生制动把电机变发电机，把动能转成电能回馈电网或被邻车吸收；无法吸收时再用电阻或风耗散掉。�pRegenerative braking turns the motor into a generator, feeding kinetic energy back to the grid or nearby trains.�ans��src��OIwnicki 主编,《Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics》第2版,CRC Press,2019�NS. Iwnicki ed., Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics, 2nd ed., CRC Press, 2019��id�e76a262dfdc7�body�ٍ市政水压一般只稳定送到低层，高楼上层需小区水箱加变频泵再加压；关键在水箱定期清洗以防二次污染。ٕCity pressure only reaches lower floors; tall buildings need tanks and variable-frequency pumps to boost, with cleaning vital to avoid contamination.�ans��src��lNFPA 消防与给水排水规范（NFPA 13/14/25/101）；Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程：处理与回用》�iNFPA fire/plumbing codes (NFPA 13/14/25/101); Metcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering: Treatment and Reuse��id�e87b04598e90�body���熔体充满模腔后开始冷却收缩，若没有保压补料，内部会形成真空凹缩产生缩痕和尺寸偏小。保压阶段用持续压力把额外熔体压入型腔补偿收缩，从而保证表面平整和尺寸稳定。��After the cavity fills, the melt cools and shrinks; without hold pressure the interior vacates, causing sink marks and undersize parts. The holding phase keeps pushing extra melt in to compensate shrinkage, ensuring flat surfaces and stable dimensions.�ans��src��>Kalpakjian & Schmid，《制造工程与技术》（第7版）�IKalpakjian & Schmid, 'Manufacturing Engineering and Technology' (7th ed.)��id�e96056aa8bb6�body�ف汽车尾气含一氧化碳等，积聚会致命；机械通风把污浊空气抽走并补进新风，火灾时还要强排烟。ـVehicle exhaust builds up dangerous CO; ventilation extracts it and supplies fresh air, and boosts smoke extraction during fire.�ans��src��lNFPA 消防与给水排水规范（NFPA 13/14/25/101）；Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程：处理与回用》�iNFPA fire/plumbing codes (NFPA 13/14/25/101); Metcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering: Treatment and Reuse��id�eebcaabdcaa3�body��Q柔性木架、榫卯和轻自重允许摆动耗能，体现了隔震的思想。�uFlexible timber frames, joints and light weight let them sway and dissipate energy—an early seismic-isolation idea.�ans��src��'日本建筑学会《日本建筑史》�BArchitectural Institute of Japan, History of Japanese Architecture��id�eff3ca0f1e26�body��G奇异位形是指雅可比矩阵降秩的姿态，例如手臂完全伸直或两个关节轴共线。此时机器人在某个方向上失去运动能力，而按逆运动学求解会要求关节以极大速度旋转，导致报警或剧烈抖动。规划时要留出裕度，或采用阻尼最小二乘等方法平滑通过。��A singular configuration is a pose where the Jacobian loses rank, for example when the arm is fully stretched or two joint axes line up. In that pose the robot cannot move in some direction, yet inverse kinematics demands enormous joint velocities, causing faults or violent shaking. Planners therefore keep a margin away from singularities, or pass through them smoothly using methods such as damped least squares.�ans��src��JCraig，《Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control》（第3版）�BCraig, 'Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control' (3rd ed.)��id�f1ee4f2a949b�body���当杆足够细长和柔，侧向弯一点所需的弯曲刚度，会小于继续正直受压的趋势，于是它走“弯着更省力”的捷径失稳。欧拉公式说明临界力反比于长度平方、正比于弯曲刚度。�When a member is slender, the stiffness to bend slightly is less than the urge to keep compressing straight, so it takes the 'easier' bowed path and buckles. Euler's formula shows critical load scales with bending stiffness and inversely with length squared.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《材料力学》（第10版）�-Hibbeler, 'Mechanics of Materials' (10th ed.)��id�f205507a3f80�body��T白天燃烟、夜里举火，按敌情增减烽数，一座接一座快速传讯。�eBy day they burned smoke, by night lit fires; the number signaled the threat, relayed tower to tower.�ans��src��jLehner《完整的金字塔》；Jackson 等《PNAS》2013（罗马混凝土）；中国《赵州桥志》�cLehner, The Complete Pyramids; Jackson et al., PNAS (2013, Roman concrete); Zhaozhou Bridge Records��id�f21d13063d15�body��r静轨和倾斜轨增强亚太覆盖与短报文，中圆轨负责全球定位，组合提高精度与可用性。ٗGEO and IGSO orbits boost Asia-Pacific coverage and short-message service; MEO handles global positioning—together raising accuracy and availability.�ans��src��(Curtis，《轨道力学》（第4版）�>Curtis, 'Orbital Mechanics for Engineering Students' (4th ed.)��id�f2f597009c80�body���要把电路刻到几纳米，必须用波长约13.5纳米的极紫外光，没有天然材料能透射它，只能用多层钼硅镜反射。光源靠用激光轰击锡液滴产生高温等离子体发射，整套系统极其复杂昂贵。��Patterning nanometer circuits needs about 13.5 nm EUV light that no material transmits, so multilayer Mo-Si mirrors reflect it. The source fires lasers at tin droplets to make hot plasma, making the whole system hugely complex and costly.�ans��src��CPorter & Levinson，《极紫外光刻》（第2版，SPIE, 2018）�:Porter & Levinson, 'EUV Lithography' (2nd ed., SPIE, 2018)��id�f74016049193�body��`大跨度空间网架轻、覆盖广、可自然采光，曲面还能抗风并显轻盈美观。�uA large-span space frame is light, covers wide areas and admits daylight; the curve also resists wind and looks airy.�ans��src��nHibbeler《结构分析》/《材料力学》；Shigley《机械工程设计》；Timoshenko《板壳理论》هHibbeler, Structural Analysis / Mechanics of Materials; Shigley, Mechanical Engineering Design; Timoshenko, Theory of Plates and Shells��id�00eac5784022�body���传统模型只有自由流和拥堵两态，三相理论加入同步流作为中间态，车速相近、密度中等但不稳定。微小扰动在同步流中会被放大成局部停走波并向上游传播，于是没有明显原因也会出现堵车。��Classic models have only free and jammed flow; three-phase theory adds an unstable synchronized flow where speeds are similar at medium density. Tiny disturbances amplify into stop-and-go waves propagating upstream, explaining jams with no obvious cause.�ans��src��(Kerner，《交通物理学》（2004）�-Kerner, B.S., 'The Physics of Traffic' (2004)��id�01ac48f9cea1�body�ٍ金属弹性部分在卸载后会部分恢复，使折角小于模具角；要靠补偿角度、加压矫形或选材来控制回弹误差。ـElastic recovery after unloading springs the bend back, so dies must over-bend or coining and material choice control the error.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�03a6245ec7f3�body���单车巡航只看前车雷达，协同巡航还接收前车加速度广播，反应更快更平顺。多车近距离编队能共享“破风”尾流，卡车编队风阻大降，油耗可省一成到两成。��Solo cruise only sees the front radar; cooperative cruise also gets the leader's acceleration broadcast, reacting faster and smoother. Close platooning shares the slipstream, cutting truck aerodynamic drag so fuel use drops by roughly 10 to 20 percent.�ans��src��RShladover，《网联与自动驾驶汽车：过去、现在与未来》（2018）�SShladover, S., 'Connected and Automated Vehicles: Past, Present, and Future' (2018)��id�0415f9a22251�body��早先用理想无黏流理论算不出物面附近的阻力，普朗特在 1904 年提出边界层：贴近壁面很薄一层黏性主导、速度从零渐增到主流。这把黏性影响局限在薄层内，使外流可用势流求解，奠定了现代空气动力学。�&Ideal inviscid theory could not predict drag near surfaces; Prandtl proposed in 1904 a thin boundary layer where viscosity dominates and velocity rises from zero to the freestream. Confining viscosity to that layer lets the outer flow be treated as potential flow, founding modern aerodynamics.�ans��src���Prandtl《论极小摩擦下的流体运动》(Über Flüssigkeitsbewegung bei sehr kleiner Reibung, 第三届国际数学家大会, 1904)；Anderson《空气动力学基础》(Fundamentals of Aerodynamics)��Prandtl, 'Über Flüssigkeitsbewegung bei sehr kleiner Reibung' ('On fluid motion with very small friction', 3rd International Congress of Mathematicians, 1904); Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics'��id�0477c7b4ca96�body��B锂离子在充放电时于石墨负极与含锂正极之间来回嵌入脱出，锂的原子量极小、电势高，因此质量比能量突出。但过充、过放或短路会令枝晶生长、热失控，所以必须有电池管理系统。Goodenough、Whittingham 与 Yoshino 因相关贡献获 2019 年诺贝尔奖。��During charge/discharge, lithium ions shuttle between a graphite anode and a lithium-containing cathode; lithium's very low atomic weight and high potential give outstanding gravimetric energy. But overcharge, over-discharge, or short circuit can grow dendrites and trigger thermal runaway, so a battery-management system is mandatory. Goodenough, Whittingham, and Yoshino won the 2019 Nobel Prize.�ans��src�٧瑞典皇家科学院《2019 年诺贝尔化学奖科学背景：锂离子电池》；Reddy 主编《Linden 电池手册》(Linden's Handbook of Batteries)，第 4 版ٯRoyal Swedish Academy of Sciences, 'Scientific Background on the Nobel Prize in Chemistry 2019: Lithium-ion Batteries'; Reddy (ed.), 'Linden's Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�04820252c46a�body���石墨烯是仅一层碳原子组成的二维蜂窝状薄片，导电导热极快、强度极高又几乎透明。它有望用于更快的芯片、柔性屏和高效电池，但大面积廉价制造仍难。��Graphene is a one-atom-thick honeycomb of carbon with superb conductivity, heat transport and strength yet transparency; it promises faster chips, flexible screens and better batteries, though cheap large-scale making remains hard.�ans��src��_Geim & Novoselov，《石墨烯的崛起》，《自然·材料》6卷，183–191页（2007）�IGeim & Novoselov, 'The rise of graphene,' Nat. Mater. 6, 183–191 (2007)��id�07fe55543250�body���废气推动涡轮旋转，涡轮同轴带动压气机把更多空气压入气缸，使每循环能喷更多燃料、输出更大功率。它本质上是用排气中的废热和动能驱动一台小型燃气轮机。�␀Exhaust gas spins a turbine, which on the same shaft drives a compressor that forces more air into the cylinders, allowing more fuel per cycle and more power. It is essentially a small gas turbine driven by the waste heat and kinetic energy of the exhaust.�ans��src��hWatson 与 Janota《内燃机涡轮增压》(Turbocharging the IC Engine)；Heywood《内燃机基础》�sWatson & Janota, 'Turbocharging the Internal Combustion Engine'; Heywood, 'Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals'��id�081afb2ae8ac�body�٥电池里氢气在阳极分解成质子和电子，质子穿过膜、电子走外电路形成电流，在阴极与氧结合生成水，只排放水而不排废气。��Hydrogen splits into protons and electrons at the anode; protons cross a membrane while electrons travel the external circuit as current, and at the cathode they join oxygen to form only water.�ans��src��>Larminie & Dicks，《燃料电池系统解析》（第2版）�9Larminie & Dicks, 'Fuel Cell Systems Explained' (2nd ed.)��id�09aec24614cb�body��2汉明码把校验位放在2的幂次位置（1、2、4、8等），第i个校验位负责所有编号的二进制第i位为1的位置，接收端重新计算各组校验并对照收到的校验位，得到出错位置的二进制编号，称为校正子。n个校验位可以定位2的n次方减1个位置，因此要满足2的n次方大于等于m加n加1，其中m是数据位数，例如m为11时n等于4，构成(15,11)汉明码。校正子为0表示无错，非零值直接指出错误位，翻转即可纠正，这就是它纠正单比特错误的原理。��Hamming codes place parity bits at power-of-two positions (1, 2, 4, 8 and so on), and parity bit i covers all positions whose binary index has bit i set; the receiver recomputes the parity groups and compares them with the received parity bits, and the pattern of mismatches, called the syndrome, gives the binary index of the erroneous bit. With n parity bits, 2^n minus 1 positions can be located, so the requirement is 2^n greater than or equal to m plus n plus 1 for m data bits; for m equal to 11, n equals 4, giving the (15,11) code. A zero syndrome means no error, and a non-zero syndrome directly names the flipped bit, which is then inverted, which is how single-bit errors are corrected.�ans��src��9《通信原理》（樊昌信，国防工业出版社）�OA Mathematical Theory of Communication, Shannon (Bell System Technical Journal)��id�09cb1a99b50f�body��Y每层快速熔化的金属冷却收缩时受到已凝固层的约束，产生拉应力，逐层累积形成宏观残余应力场。当应力超过材料的屈服强度便发生翘曲变形，超过断裂韧性则在应力集中处萌生裂纹，尤其在高强度铝合金和钛合金中常见，需靠预热、扫描策略或热处理缓解。��Each rapidly melted layer shrinks on cooling but is constrained by the already solidified layers below, generating tensile stress that accumulates into a macroscopic residual stress field. When it exceeds yield strength the part warps, and when it exceeds fracture toughness cracks initiate at stress concentrations—common in high-strength aluminum and titanium alloys—requiring preheating, scan strategies, or heat treatment to mitigate.�ans��src�٨Li 等,《Efficient predictive model of part distortion and residual stress in selective laser melting》,Additive Manufacturing,2017 (DOI: 10.1016/j.addma.2017.08.014)٩Li et al., 'Efficient predictive model of part distortion and residual stress in selective laser melting', Additive Manufacturing, 2017, DOI: 10.1016/j.addma.2017.08.014��id�0b0741a33e09�body���车路协同让车辆与车辆、道路、行人和网络实时交换信息，提前感知盲区风险和交通状态。它是自动驾驶和主动安全的重要支撑，可显著降低事故率。��V2X lets vehicles exchange information in real time with other vehicles, roads, pedestrians, and networks, sensing blind-spot risks and traffic states early. It underpins autonomous driving and active safety, markedly cutting crash rates.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�0bad249e0971�body���逆运动学是根据期望的末端位置姿态反求各关节角度的问题，与正运动学相反。由于多解、奇异点和非线性，常需迭代数值方法或优化算法才能稳定求解。� Inverse kinematics finds the joint angles needed to place the end effector at a desired position and orientation, the reverse of forward kinematics. Multiple solutions, singularities, and nonlinearity mean iterative numerical or optimization methods are often needed for stable solutions.�ans��src��JCraig，《Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control》（第3版）�BCraig, 'Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control' (3rd ed.)��id�0cdc1ba3abe3�body���Kilby 在 1958 年用一块锗把晶体管、电阻和电容做进同一衬底，Noyce 在 1959 年提出用平面工艺和铝互连实现的硅单片集成电路。此后靠光刻把电路图形转移到硅片，再经氧化、掺杂、金属化在平面上批量做出成千上万个器件与互连。Kilby 因这项发明获 2000 年诺贝尔物理学奖（Noyce 已于 1990 年去世，未能同获）。��Kilby built a circuit in 1958 that integrated a transistor, resistor, and capacitor on one germanium substrate, and Noyce proposed the monolithic silicon IC in 1959 using the planar process with aluminum interconnects. Photolithography then transfers circuit patterns onto silicon while oxidation, doping, and metallization batch-fabricate thousands of devices and interconnects in a plane. Kilby received the 2000 Nobel Prize in Physics for the invention; Noyce had died in 1990 and could not share it.�ans��src�ٰKilby《小型化电子电路》专利(US3138743, 1959 年申请)；Noyce《半导体器件与引线结构》专利(US2981877, 1959)；2000 年诺贝尔物理学奖官方公告��Kilby, 'Miniaturized Electronic Circuits' patent (US3138743, filed 1959); Noyce, 'Semiconductor Device-and-Lead Structure' patent (US2981877, 1959); Nobel Prize in Physics 2000 official announcement��id�0d3737b9ac86�body���把玻璃加热到接近软化再快速冷却，表面先变硬收缩、内部后冷却，形成表面压应力；这让它更抗冲击，破碎时会裂成圆钝小粒而非尖刀状碎片。ٷHeating then rapidly cooling glass puts the surface under compression; this makes it impact-resistant and, if it breaks, it shatters into small blunt granules instead of sharp shards.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�0e57858ffe48�body���结构可靠度指结构在规定时间内、规定条件下完成预定功能的概率。工程上采用分项系数设计法，考虑荷载和抗力的不确定性，使失效概率控制在可接受范围内。�Structural reliability is the probability that a structure performs its intended function over a given time under stated conditions. Engineers use partial-factor design methods that account for uncertainty in loads and resistance, keeping failure probability within acceptable limits.�ans��src��L《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012,中国建筑工业出版社,2012�hLoad Code for the Design of Building Structures GB 50009-2012, China Architecture & Building Press, 2012��id�0f5c078ee786�body���它给出不同温度和含碳量下铁素体、奥氏体、渗碳体等相的稳定区域；通过控冷可得到珠光体、马氏体等不同组织，从而决定硬度与韧性。这是钢铁热处理与合金设计的基础。�It maps the stable regions of phases like ferrite, austenite, and cementite across temperature and carbon content; controlled cooling yields pearlite, martensite, and other microstructures that set hardness and toughness. It underpins heat treatment and alloy design.�ans��src�فCallister《材料科学与工程导论》(Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction)；Askeland《材料科学基础》�uCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction'; Askeland, 'The Science and Engineering of Materials'��id�10416be47aac�body�٨燃气在喉部被加速到音速，之后在扩张段继续膨胀加速到超音速，把热压高效转化为向前喷出的高速气流，从而获得更大推力。ٷGas reaches the speed of sound at the throat and then expands in the diverging section to supersonic speed, efficiently converting pressure into a fast forward jet for greater thrust.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�118668897d92�body���自适应控制在运行中在线估计系统参数并自动调整控制器，使对象特性随时间或工况变化时仍保持良好表现，常用于飞行器、机器人和工况多变的工业过程。��Adaptive control estimates parameters online and retunes itself during operation, keeping performance as the plant changes over time or conditions—used in flight, robotics, and varying industrial processes.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�12b5ee4f1438�body��UPID控制按偏差工作：比例项的输出与当前误差成正比，负责快速响应；积分项累积历史误差，用来消除稳态偏差，否则系统会始终存在静差；微分项预测误差的变化趋势，抑制超调。只要把三个参数按被控对象调好，温度、转速、位置就能快速稳定。它不需要知道系统的精确数学模型，用一个经验整定法则就能工作，所以电机调速、恒温器、自动驾驶仪都用它。它的局限在于高度非线性或大滞后的对象，这类场合需要模型预测控制等更高级的方法。��PID acts on the error: the proportional term is proportional to the current error for fast response; the integral term accumulates past error to eliminate steady-state offset, without which a persistent static error remains; the derivative term anticipates the error's slope to damp overshoot. With just three tuned gains it can settle temperature, speed, or position quickly. It needs no precise model of the plant — an empirical tuning rule suffices — which is why motor drives, thermostats, and autopilots all use it. Its limits appear in strongly nonlinear or long-delay plants, which call for advanced methods like model predictive control.�ans��src��EK. Ogata,《现代控制工程》第5版,Pearson,2010,PID控制章节�QK. Ogata, Modern Control Engineering, 5th ed., Pearson, 2010, PID control chapter��id�1505fbef656a�body��*SLAM（同步定位与建图）利用传感器（激光、相机）观测路标，在估计自身位置的同时推断路标位置，两者互为前提、迭代收敛。Thrun 等的《概率机器人》把粒子滤波与扩展卡尔曼滤波等方法系统化，是无人车与扫地机的核心。�OSLAM (simultaneous localization and mapping) uses sensor observations of landmarks to estimate the robot's pose while inferring landmark positions, the two problems bootstrapping each other iteratively. Thrun et al.'s 'Probabilistic Robotics' systematized particle and extended-Kalman methods, central to self-driving cars and vacuums.�ans��src��qThrun、Burgard 与 Fox《概率机器人》(Probabilistic Robotics, 2005)；Durrant-Whyte《SLAM 基础》(2006)�tThrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (2005); Durrant-Whyte, 'Simultaneous Localisation and Mapping' (2006)��id�165772d7c565�body��`POGO 是结构与推进系统构成的闭环耦合：箭体纵向弹性振动使推进剂管路入口压力波动，泵入口压力变化引起推力脉动，推力脉动又反过来激励箭体纵向模态，若相位形成正反馈，振幅可在几秒内急剧增长。土星五号第一级和双子星-泰坦飞行中都出现过明显纵向振荡，严重时会损坏结构、破坏发动机或让乘员无法操作。典型抑制手段是在氧化剂或燃料管路上加装充气蓄压器（POGO 抑制器），改变管路的等效柔度与谐振频率，把推进系统响应与结构模态解耦。��Pogo is a closed loop between structure and propulsion: longitudinal elastic vibration modulates propellant pressure at the pump inlet, that inlet variation modulates thrust, and the thrust pulsation re-excites the longitudinal mode, so amplitude can grow explosively within seconds when the phase relationship is regenerative. Saturn V first-stage and Gemini-Titan flights both showed pronounced longitudinal oscillation, which at high amplitude can damage structure, wreck engines or leave the crew unable to operate controls. The standard fix is a gas-filled accumulator in the oxidizer or fuel feedline that retunes the line's effective compliance and resonance, decoupling propulsion response from the structural mode.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�16bfeaa390a7�body��rDH 约定规定每个连杆坐标系的 z 轴取在关节轴线上、x 轴取在相邻两轴线的公垂线方向，这样一般需要六个参数的刚体变换被约束到只剩连杆长度 a、连杆扭角 α、关节偏置 d 和关节角 θ 四个。相邻坐标系间的齐次变换于是写成两次旋转加两次平移的固定乘积，整条手臂的正运动学变成矩阵连乘，便于统一推导雅可比与动力学。代价是坐标系放置不自由，遇到平行或相交的轴线会出现参数不唯一与表示奇异，所以实际标定常改用带完整六参数的修正模型来吸收制造误差。��The DH convention forces each link frame's z axis onto the joint axis and its x axis along the common normal between consecutive axes, which reduces a general six-parameter rigid transform to four: link length a, twist α, offset d and joint angle θ. Consecutive frames are then related by a fixed product of two rotations and two translations, so forward kinematics becomes a chain of matrix multiplications from which Jacobians and dynamics follow systematically. The price is that frame placement is constrained and parallel or intersecting axes give non-unique parameterizations, so calibration often switches to a full six-parameter model to absorb manufacturing errors.�ans��src��JCraig，《Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control》（第3版）�BCraig, 'Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control' (3rd ed.)��id�18bc96614bff�body��疲劳破坏是指材料在远低于其静强度的反复交变应力下，经过许多循环后突然断裂的现象。工程上通过优化几何形状避免应力集中、表面强化处理、限制工作应力以及定期无损检测来预防疲劳失效。�5Fatigue failure is the sudden fracture of a material under repeated cyclic stresses far below its static strength, after many load cycles. Engineers prevent it by avoiding stress concentrations through geometry, surface hardening, limiting operating stress, and performing periodic non-destructive inspection.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�19d064332149�body���比例项按当前误差大小给出纠正力度；积分项累计历史误差以消除稳态余差；微分项依据误差变化率提前抑制超调。三者配合可在多数过程控制中取得平稳响应。��The proportional term reacts to current error; the integral accumulates past error to wipe steady-state offset; the derivative anticipates via error rate to curb overshoot. Together they give smooth control in many processes.�ans��src��EK. Ogata,《现代控制工程》第5版,Pearson,2010,PID控制章节�QK. Ogata, Modern Control Engineering, 5th ed., Pearson, 2010, PID control chapter��id�19f9255ee346�body���列车减速时把牵引电机切换成发电机模式，轮对的转动带动电机发电，产生的电能送回接触网供其他列车使用或存入储能装置。相比单纯用闸瓦摩擦生热，这种方式显著节能并减少磨损。��When slowing, the traction motors switch to generator mode, turning wheel rotation into electricity fed back to the overhead line for other trains or storage. Unlike friction brakes that waste heat, this saves energy and cuts wear.�ans��src��9Iwnicki 编，《铁路车辆动力学手册》（2006）�@Iwnicki, S. (ed.), 'Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics' (2006)��id�1a96678f2bb5�body���微纳制造是在微米到纳米尺度加工结构的技术，涵盖光刻、电子束刻蚀和原子层沉积等。它支撑芯片、MEMS传感器和微流控器件。挑战在于尺度效应和良率控制。�Micro-nano manufacturing fabricates structures at micron to nanometer scales, including lithography, electron-beam etching, and atomic layer deposition. It underpins chips, MEMS sensors, and microfluidic devices. Challenges are scale effects and yield control.�ans��src��EB.J. Lin《Optical Lithography: Here Is Why》，SPIE Press，2009年�<B.J. Lin, Optical Lithography: Here Is Why, SPIE Press, 2009��id�1d59bf7bb19d�body���蠕变是材料在恒定应力下随时间的缓慢塑性变形，通常在高温（对金属）或长期荷载（对混凝土、塑料）下显著。它会导致涡轮叶片、管道和预应力构件逐渐失效。��Creep is slow time-dependent deformation under constant stress, significant at high temperature for metals or under long loads for concrete and plastics. It can gradually fail turbine blades, pipes, and prestressed members.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�1eac978c252b�body���鲁棒性指控制器在模型不准、参数漂移或存在外界扰动时仍能保持良好性能的能力。设计鲁棒控制器就是要让系统在不确定性下也不易失稳或失效。ٺRobustness is a controller's ability to keep performing well despite model error, parameter drift, or disturbances. Robust design keeps the system stable and effective under uncertainty.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�1f984ed678c9�body���晶体缺陷是材料原子排列中偏离理想周期性的地方，包括空位、位错和晶界等。位错的运动决定了金属的塑性变形能力，而控制缺陷数量和类型可以调控材料的强度与韧性。�Crystal defects are departures from the ideal periodic atomic arrangement, including vacancies, dislocations, and grain boundaries. Dislocation motion governs a metal's plastic deformation, and controlling defect type and density tunes strength and toughness.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�20cdbca0c81c�body��=行人步行除竖向力外还有约 1 Hz 的横向摆动分力，而桥的几阶侧向模态频率恰好落在这个范围。桥面一旦轻微横移，行人会本能调整步伐维持平衡，结果步频与桥的摆动同步，持续沿摆动方向做功，形成同步侧向激励的正反馈；这是人与结构相互作用而非简单共振，响应在人数超过临界值后突然放大。整改方案不是增加刚度，而是安装三十七个粘性阻尼器和多个调谐质量阻尼器大幅提高侧向阻尼比，使临界人数远高于实际通行量。�wWalking produces not only vertical force but a lateral component near 1 Hz, close to several of the bridge's lateral mode frequencies. Once the deck moved sideways slightly, pedestrians instinctively adjusted their gait to keep balance, synchronized with the motion and kept feeding energy into it — a pedestrian-structure interaction with positive feedback rather than simple resonance, amplifying abruptly once crowd size passed a critical value. The retrofit did not stiffen the bridge but added thirty-seven viscous dampers plus tuned mass dampers to raise lateral damping so the critical crowd size far exceeds real traffic.�ans��src��_Dallard 等，《The London Millennium Footbridge》，The Structural Engineer 79(22)（2001）�YDallard et al., 'The London Millennium Footbridge', The Structural Engineer 79(22) (2001)��id�21f67e11d9d2�body���活塞发动机靠气缸里来回运动的活塞把燃烧变成旋转；涡轮则让燃气持续冲击叶片连续旋转，没有往复部件，适合高转速、大功率和稳定气流的场合。��A piston engine converts combustion to rotation via reciprocating pistons in cylinders, while a turbine has gas continuously spinning blades with no back-and-forth parts, suiting high-speed, high-power, steady-flow use.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�239a287a3fa3�body���铁碳相图显示不同温度和含碳量下钢铁组织的平衡相（如铁素体、奥氏体、渗碳体）。据此可预测淬火、退火等热处理后的组织与性能，是钢铁冶金的基础工具。��The iron–carbon diagram shows equilibrium phases (ferrite, austenite, cementite) at each temperature and carbon level, predicting the microstructure after heat treatment—a foundation of steel metallurgy.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�24bc7352b3ff�body���回流比是回流液量与塔顶产品量的比值，增大回流比意味着塔内液气流量都增加，塔板间传质推动力更大、所需理论塔板数减少，产品纯度提高。但回流液由塔顶蒸气冷凝而来，要汽化更多上升蒸气就需在再沸器消耗更多热量，冷凝器负荷也相应增加，因此操作费用随回流比近似线性上升。设计常取最小回流比的1.2至2倍作为经济回流比。�The reflux ratio is the ratio of reflux returned to the column over the distillate product. Raising it increases internal liquid and vapour flows, giving stronger stage-to-stage mass-transfer driving force, fewer required theoretical stages, and purer products. But the reflux is condensed from overhead vapour, so producing more vapour requires more heat at the reboiler and more duty at the condenser, making operating cost rise roughly linearly. Designs typically use 1.2 to 2 times the minimum reflux ratio as the economical choice.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�25e98960de2c�body��S决定翼型气动特性的主要是垂直于机翼前缘的法向速度分量。把机翼后掠，法向分量比飞行速度小，机翼上出现局部超声速和激波的时机被推迟，临界马赫数因此提高。代价是同样升力下翼根弯矩更大，低速时容易翼尖先失速，需要靠扭转和增升装置补偿。��The aerodynamic behaviour of an aerofoil is governed mainly by the velocity component normal to the leading edge. Sweeping the wing back makes that normal component smaller than the flight speed, delaying the onset of local supersonic flow and shock waves and thus raising the critical Mach number. The costs are higher root bending moment for the same lift and a tendency to stall at the tips first at low speed, which twist and high-lift devices must offset.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�271127a521f5�body�٥空船太轻会重心高、易翻且螺旋桨吃水不够，向底部压载舱注海水可压低重心、保持吃水深度和平稳，装货后排出水来调节。��An empty ship is too light with a high center of gravity and poor propeller depth; flooding ballast tanks with seawater lowers the center of gravity, keeps draft and stability, then water is pumped out as cargo loads.�ans��src��.Tupper，《船舶原理导论》（第5版）�6Tupper, 'Introduction to Naval Architecture' (5th ed.)��id�2764b1390460�body�ٱ列车和轨道上的超导或电磁铁同性相斥（或吸吊）使车悬浮离轨，再用沿线变化的磁场推着车厢前进，没有轮轨摩擦所以又快又安静。ٴRepelling or attracting magnets lift the train off the track, and a traveling magnetic field along the guideway pushes the car forward; with no wheel friction it is fast and quiet.�ans��src��#Moon，《超导悬浮》（1994）�/Moon, F.C., 'Superconducting Levitation' (1994)��id�27ef9ddff145�body���理想 CMOS 在静态时一个网络导通、另一个关断，没有直流通路，开关功耗只在充放电瞬间产生。但随着工艺微缩，亚阈值和栅极漏电流显著增大，使静态漏电流成为待机功耗的主要来源。��In ideal CMOS one network is on and the other off in steady state, so there's no DC path and switching power occurs only during transitions. As processes shrink, subthreshold and gate leakage grow, making standby leakage the dominant static power.�ans��src��<Streetman & Banerjee，《固态电子器件》（第7版）�@Streetman & Banerjee, 'Solid State Electronic Devices' (7th ed.)��id�285593541e16�body���降落伞靠大气阻力减速，只适用于有稠密大气的行星（如地球、火星）；在没有大气或需要精准软着陆的地方（如月球），只能用反推火箭向下喷气来减速。��Parachutes rely on atmospheric drag, so they work only where there is thick air like Earth or Mars; with no atmosphere or for precise soft landings such as on the Moon, retro-rockets firing downward are required.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�2b0878a3023f�body���固结是饱和软黏土在荷载下孔隙水缓慢排出、土体被压缩的过程，沉降往往持续很久。太沙基一维固结理论用微分方程描述孔隙水压力随时间消散的规律，是软基沉降预测的基础。�;Consolidation is the slow process in which saturated soft clay expels pore water and compresses under load, so settlement can last a long time. Terzaghi's one-dimensional consolidation theory uses a differential equation to describe pore-pressure dissipation over time and underlies soft-soil settlement prediction.�ans��src��8Das《土力学与基础工程》；ACI/API 桩基规范�JDas, Principles of Geotechnical Engineering; ACI/API pile foundation codes��id�2c6bc233f6d4�body���在喉部之前气流为亚音速，收缩使其加速至音速；喉部之后截面扩张，根据可压缩流特性，超音速流在扩张段继续加速，从而把热能高效转化为动能，用于火箭和涡轮机。��Upstream of the throat the subsonic flow speeds up to Mach 1 at the throat; downstream the diverging section accelerates the supersonic flow further, converting heat to kinetic energy in rockets and turbines.�ans��src��'White，《流体力学》（第8版）�"White, 'Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�2d6148774b82�body���IBVS 直接在图像平面上定义误差（如特征点像素坐标之差），用交互矩阵（图像雅可比）把像素误差映射成相机速度，因此对相机标定和目标模型误差不敏感，但相机在三维空间的轨迹不可控，大角度旋转时可能退化甚至让特征跑出视野。PBVS 先从图像重建目标相对位姿，再在笛卡尔空间做位姿控制，轨迹平滑直观，但依赖精确的内参和目标三维模型，标定误差会直接变成定位误差。工程上常用混合（2.5D）视觉伺服，把平移误差留在图像域、旋转误差放到位姿域，兼顾鲁棒性与轨迹品质。��IBVS defines the error directly in the image plane and maps pixel errors to camera velocity through the interaction matrix, so it tolerates calibration and model errors well but leaves the camera's 3-D path uncontrolled and can degenerate or drive features out of the field of view during large rotations. PBVS first reconstructs the target pose from the image and regulates pose in Cartesian space, giving predictable motion but inheriting every error in intrinsic calibration and in the target's 3-D model. Hybrid or 2.5-D visual servoing combines the two, controlling translation in the image and rotation in pose space to keep robustness while making the trajectory well behaved.�ans��src��Chaumette 与 Hutchinson，《Visual Servo Control, Part I: Basic Approaches》，IEEE Robotics & Automation Magazine（2006）�tChaumette & Hutchinson, 'Visual Servo Control, Part I: Basic Approaches', IEEE Robotics & Automation Magazine (2006)��id�2d6f1d670fdb�body��该理论认为工作记忆容量有限，内在、外在与关联三类负荷共同消耗资源。界面应减少非必要外在负荷（如一致布局、渐进披露），把资源留给关联负荷（真正的学习理解），避免一次性堆砌信息。�$The theory holds working memory is limited, with intrinsic, extraneous, and germane loads competing for resources. Interfaces should cut extraneous load (consistent layout, progressive disclosure) and free capacity for germane load (real understanding), avoiding information overload at once.�ans��src��-《人机交互》（清华大学出版社）�9Sweller, Ayres & Kalyuga, Cognitive Load Theory, Springer��id�2e3aa07bc4d9�body���有限元法把复杂结构划分为网格单元，逐单元求解位移和应力后再拼合成整体响应。它能处理不规则几何、非均匀材料和复杂边界条件，是现代结构分析软件的核心。�%The finite element method divides a complex structure into a mesh of elements, solves displacement and stress per element, then assembles the global response. It handles irregular geometry, non-uniform materials, and complex boundaries, forming the core of modern structural analysis software.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�2e437f377044�body���古代分三路。一是密砌干摆：石块磨配成缝，靠自重与摩擦承载，灰浆只填缝均摊应力，如金字塔严接石面。二是石灰砂浆：生石灰熟化成浆，上墙后吸收二氧化碳、变回碳酸钙而硬化。三是复合配方：熟石灰掺糯米汤汁成三合土，更韧、黏结更好，罗马混凝土以火山灰拌石灰，在海水中仍能硬化。要害是石灰浆怕水，碳化只能由表及里，厚墙中心久久不结实。�Ancient builders had three routes. The first was tight dry masonry: blocks were ground to fit one another, load was carried by self-weight and friction, and mortar only filled joints and spread stress, as in the closely joined facing stones of the pyramids. The second was lime mortar: quicklime was slaked into a paste, and on the wall it absorbed carbon dioxide and hardened by turning back into calcium carbonate. The third was composite mixes: sticky-rice broth stirred into slaked lime made a tougher mortar with a better grip on the interface, and Roman concrete, lime mixed with volcanic ash, could keep hardening under seawater. The catch is that lime mortar is water-sensitive and carbonation creeps only inward from exposed surfaces, so the core of a thick wall stays soft for a long time.�ans��src��jLehner《完整的金字塔》；Jackson 等《PNAS》2013（罗马混凝土）；中国《赵州桥志》�cLehner, The Complete Pyramids; Jackson et al., PNAS (2013, Roman concrete); Zhaozhou Bridge Records��id�311c0c55231f�body���活性污泥依靠曝气池中混合菌群吸附氧化有机物，并在二沉池分离回流污泥。较长的污泥龄富集硝化菌完成氨氮氧化为硝酸盐；配合缺氧段反硝化可实现生物脱氮，泥龄过短则硝化不稳。�MActivated sludge uses aerated mixed cultures to adsorb and oxidize organics, with sludge separated and returned in a secondary clarifier. A longer sludge age enriches nitrifiers to oxidize ammonia to nitrate; with an anoxic zone denitrification achieves biological nitrogen removal, while too short an age destabilizes nitrification.�ans��src��3《排水工程》（中国建筑工业出版社）�'Metcalf and Eddy Wastewater Engineering��id�3184fb7f7f13�body��.传统设计按规范公式保证不倒的最低安全；PBSD 则明确不同地震水准下的性能目标（如正常使用、可修复、防倒塌），并通过非线性时程分析与损伤控制反向优化结构。这使投资与风险可量化权衡，但对模型与不确定性要求更高。�uTraditional design uses code formulas for a minimum no-collapse safety; PBSD explicitly sets performance goals under different seismic levels (e.g., operational, repairable, collapse-prevention) and optimizes the structure via nonlinear time-history analysis and damage control. It makes cost-risk trade-offs quantifiable but demands better models and uncertainty handling.�ans��src��~美国钢结构学会（AISC）AISC 341《抗震规定》；Paulay & Priestley《钢筋混凝土与砌体建筑抗震设计》٠American Institute of Steel Construction (AISC) AISC 341 'Seismic Provisions'; Paulay & Priestley, 'Seismic Design of Reinforced Concrete and Masonry Buildings'��id�31c9c15c5f6f�body��三相定子绕组产生以同步转速旋转的磁场，转子导条相对磁场运动时感应出电流，电流在磁场中受力产生转矩。如果转子转速追平同步转速，转子与磁场的相对运动为零，感应电流消失、转矩归零，所以转子永远以一定的"滑差"落后，实际转速等于同步转速乘以一减滑差率，滑差率一般在1%到5%。负载越重，需要的转矩越大，滑差也越大。正是这个"跟不上"才让电机能带负载运行，也是"异步"名称的由来。��The three-phase stator windings create a field rotating at synchronous speed; the rotor bars move relative to it and have currents induced, and those currents experience force in the field to produce torque. If the rotor ever matched synchronous speed, relative motion would vanish, induced current would die, and torque would go to zero — so the rotor always lags by a "slip", with actual speed equal to synchronous speed times one minus the slip fraction, typically 1-5%. Heavier load needs more torque, hence more slip. That very "lagging behind" is what lets the motor drive loads, and where the name induction/asynchronous comes from.�ans��src��6《费曼物理学讲义》第二卷（感应电流）�:The Feynman Lectures on Physics, Vol. 2 (induced currents)��id�323d253b8ee7�body���升力线理论把机翼用一根沿展向绑定环量的涡线表示，并拖出自由涡系形成尾涡面。由毕奥-萨伐尔定律求得下洗，诱导阻力正比于环量沿展向分布的二阶矩，椭圆载荷分布时诱导阻力最小。�Lifting-line theory models the wing as a spanwise bound vortex carrying circulation, trailing a free vortex sheet. Biot-Savart law gives the downwash, and induced drag is proportional to the second moment of the circulation distribution; an elliptic loading minimizes it.�ans��src��0《空气动力学》（国防工业出版社）� Introduction to Flight, Anderson��id�33291b1ffa04�body���盾构把破岩、出渣、支护、衬砌接成连续流水线：滚刀压裂岩体，螺旋机或皮带出渣，盾尾拼装管片成永久衬砌，钢壳此前顶住围岩；掌子面靠渣土或泥浆平衡水土压力，河底才稳得住。相比钻爆法炸一茬、支护一轮的断续循环，它振动小、工序不停，长隧道才推得动。边界不在功率而在地质：软硬交替、破碎带、高水压与刀具磨损定成败，机型按地层定制。�!A shield machine strings breaking rock, removing muck, supporting the ground and building the lining into one continuous production line: disc cutters fracture the rock, a screw conveyor or belt clears the muck, the shield tail assembles segments into the permanent lining, and the steel shell holds the ground until that lining takes load; the face is steadied by soil or slurry balancing groundwater and earth pressure, which is what keeps a river crossing from collapsing. Against drill-and-blast, which cycles a charge then a round of support, it runs on with little vibration, so a long tunnel can advance at all. The limit is geology, not horsepower: alternating soft and hard rock, fault zones, high water pressure and cutter wear decide the outcome, and machines are configured for the ground.�ans��src��CMaidl、Herrenknecht & Anheuser，《机械化盾构隧道技术》�>Maidl, Herrenknecht & Anheuser, 'Mechanised Shield Tunnelling'��id�34605abc6def�body���当传输线特性阻抗与负载阻抗不相等时，行进的电压波在负载处无法被完全吸收，多余部分会反向反射形成驻波，造成功率损失和信号失真。匹配到相同阻抗可让能量最大传输、反射最小。�When a line's characteristic impedance differs from the load, the traveling wave isn't fully absorbed at the load and the excess reflects back, forming standing waves that waste power and distort signals. Matching minimizes reflection and maximizes transfer.�ans��src��-Nilsson & Riedel，《电路》（第11版）�0Nilsson & Riedel, 'Electric Circuits' (11th ed.)��id�34bf25fbb395�body���电流环最内，快速调节转矩、抑制电流波动；速度环居中，跟踪指令速度并改善动态；位置环最外，保证末端按指令定位。由内到外带宽递减，形成级联以保证精度与刚度。�1The innermost current loop quickly regulates torque and suppresses current ripple; the middle speed loop tracks commanded velocity and improves dynamics; the outer position loop ensures the end effector follows position commands. Bandwidth decreases outward, forming a cascade for precision and stiffness.�ans��src��E《机电传动控制》（邓星钟，华中科技大学出版社）�;Bose, Modern Power Electronics and AC Drives, Prentice Hall��id�36536c2b3d1b�body��回流把部分塔顶冷凝液送回塔内，提供更多气液接触次数，使轻重组分分得更干净，纯度上升。但回流占用塔内上升蒸气的能力，可用于采出产品的蒸气减少，因此单位时间产量下降、能耗增加。�Reflux returns some condensed overhead to the column, giving more vapor-liquid contacts so components separate cleaner and purity rises. But reflux consumes the column's vapor-handling capacity, leaving less vapor for product draw, so throughput and energy cost worsen.�ans��src��AMcCabe、Smith & Harriott，《化工单元操作》（第7版）�MMcCabe, Smith & Harriott, 'Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering' (7th ed.)��id�38d21b6e4494�body���多层布线后表面坑洼，CMP 用研磨液在化学腐蚀和机械摩擦双重作用下把凸起先磨掉、留下凹陷填平，得到全局平整。没有它，上层光刻就会因焦距偏差而失败。��After multilayer wiring the surface is uneven; CMP combines chemical etching and mechanical abrasion to wear down highs first and planarize, yielding global flatness. Without it, upper-layer lithography fails from focus error.�ans��src��YSteigerwald、Murarka & Gutmann，《微电子材料的化学机械平坦化》（1997）�gSteigerwald, Murarka & Gutmann, 'Chemical Mechanical Planarization of Microelectronic Materials' (1997)��id�3926dfab582c�body��f后掠翼把来流分解为垂直于前缘（弦向）和沿前缘（展向）两个分量，只有较小的弦向分量 V·cosΛ 决定压缩性效应，从而把激波出现和阻力发散推迟到更高马赫数；面积律要求全机横截面积沿纵轴平滑变化，以减小跨音速波阻。两者都是突破跨音速阻力急升的关键设计。��A swept wing splits the oncoming flow into a chordwise component normal to the leading edge and a spanwise component along it; only the smaller chordwise component V·cosΛ drives compressibility effects, pushing shock formation and drag rise to higher Mach numbers. The area rule requires the whole aircraft's cross-sectional area to vary smoothly along its axis to cut transonic wave drag. Both were key to overcoming the transonic drag rise.�ans��src�٠Küchemann《飞机气动设计》(The Aerodynamic Design of Aircraft)；Whitcomb《近声速翼身组合零升阻力上升特性研究》(NACA RM L52H08, 1952)ٹKüchemann, 'The Aerodynamic Design of Aircraft'; Whitcomb, 'A Study of the Zero-Lift Drag-Rise Characteristics of Wing-Body Combinations Near the Speed of Sound' (NACA RM L52H08, 1952)��id�39671fb57bc4�body�ل用防火板、混凝土或膨胀型涂料，遇火膨胀成隔热炭层；按耐火极限设计，给疏散和救援争取时间。لFire-rated boards, concrete, or intumescent coatings that swell into insulation meet ratings like two hours, buying evacuation time.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�3b11b96566c9�body�ٱ炉面下的线圈通交变电流产生变化磁场，在铁质锅底感应出涡电流，电流因锅底电阻发热，所以热直接在锅里产生，炉面本身并不烫。��Coils under the glass carry alternating current creating a changing magnetic field that induces eddy currents in a ferromagnetic pan; the pan's resistance heats it directly while the surface stays cool.�ans��src��-Nilsson & Riedel，《电路》（第11版）�0Nilsson & Riedel, 'Electric Circuits' (11th ed.)��id�3b94deeb6fe6�body��A机械臂的伺服电机只认关节角度，所以控制末端姿态必须解逆运动学：已知末端的位置和姿态，求各关节变量。正运动学是由关节角求末端位姿，相对简单；逆解则是非线性方程，可能有多解、无解或奇异位形——比如手臂完全伸直时就失去了某些方向的运动能力。6自由度机械臂利用腕部结构解耦可得到解析解，冗余机械臂则要用雅可比求逆等数值迭代方法，在无穷多个解里选出最优的一个。逆运动学是轨迹规划与操作控制的基础。��A robot arm's servo motors only understand joint angles, so commanding the end-effector requires solving inverse kinematics: given the desired position and orientation, find the joint variables. Forward kinematics — joint angles to pose — is straightforward; the inverse is a set of nonlinear equations with possible multiple solutions, no solutions, or singular configurations, such as a fully extended arm losing the ability to move in certain directions. Six-axis arms get closed-form solutions by decoupling at the wrist, while redundant arms iterate numerically (e.g., Jacobian inversion) to pick the best among infinitely many solutions. Inverse kinematics underpins trajectory planning and manipulation control.�ans��src��?Craig，《机器人学导论：力学与控制》（第4版）�BCraig, 'Introduction to Robotics: Mechanics and Control' (4th ed.)��id�3cdc5432a8fa�body��*三相制的三个相位相差120度，各相功率的脉动互相抵消，合成瞬时功率恒定，电机输出转矩没有波动，这是单相或两相做不到的。用同样三根导线，在三相对称时零线电流为零，输送的功率可达单相系统的约1.732倍，导线材料利用率最高。三相绕组还能天然产生旋转磁场，让三相异步电动机无需启动装置就能自行启动。相数再多（如六相）对功率品质的提升微乎其微，却要多花导线成本，所以三相是综合最优的选择。��Three phases spaced 120 degrees apart cancel each other's power pulsations, giving constant instantaneous total power and ripple-free motor torque — something single-phase or two-phase cannot achieve. With the same three conductors, and zero neutral current when the system is balanced, you can deliver about 1.732 times the power of single-phase, the best utilization of conductor material. Three-phase windings also naturally produce a rotating magnetic field, so three-phase induction motors start by themselves with no starting hardware. More phases (say six) improve power quality only marginally while requiring extra conductors, which is why three-phase is the optimum compromise.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�3e72d5749330�body���SCR向烟气中喷入氨（或尿素水解的氨），在催化剂表面把氮氧化物选择性还原成氮气和水，反应温度通常在300至420摄氏度，常用钒钛类催化剂。温度低于窗口时反应速率骤降且氨盐析出堵塞催化剂，温度过高则催化剂烧结失活并可能产生更多一氧化二氮。因此锅炉负荷变化导致烟温波动时，常需调节喷氨量或采用省煤器旁路，避免催化剂失效并控制氨逃逸。�BSCR injects ammonia (or ammonia from urea hydrolysis) into the flue gas and, on the catalyst surface, selectively reduces nitrogen oxides to nitrogen and water, typically at 300 to 420 degrees Celsius over vanadia-titania catalysts. Below the window the reaction slows sharply and ammonium salts deposit on and plug the catalyst; above it the catalyst sinters and deactivates and more nitrous oxide may form. Because boiler load swings move the flue-gas temperature, operators adjust ammonia injection or use economiser bypasses to protect the catalyst and control ammonia slip.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�3e9c0ac1ea65�body�� 传统流程里开发和运维分属两个团队，开发把代码"扔过墙"，运维负责上线，导致交付慢、环境不一致、上线事故频发。DevOps是文化、流程与工具的结合：让同一批人从代码提交一路负责到生产环境，用基础设施即代码管理服务器配置，用CI/CD流水线让每次提交自动构建、测试、部署，用容器化统一开发与生产环境，再配合监控和日志做到快速回滚。核心收益是缩短交付周期、提高发布可靠性与故障恢复速度。�UIn the old model developers and operators lived in separate teams — devs threw code "over the wall" and ops ran it, causing slow delivery, environment drift, and release-night disasters. DevOps combines culture, process, and tooling: the same people own code from commit to production, using infrastructure-as-code to manage server config, CI/CD pipelines to auto build, test, and deploy on every commit, containerization to unify dev and production environments, plus monitoring and logging for fast rollback. The payoff is shorter delivery cycles, more reliable releases, and quicker recovery.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�3f8a81d48460�body��重力坝依靠自身的巨大自重抵抗水压力，坝体与地基接触面的抗滑摩擦是稳定的关键，要求地基有足够的抗剪强度，因而坝体断面大、混凝土用量多。拱坝则主要把水荷载通过坝体拱圈传递到两岸山体，属于空间壳体受力，坝体可以做得薄得多。但拱坝要求河谷狭窄、两岸岩体完整坚硬且无软弱结构面，否则拱座一旦失稳就会导致整体破坏，因此其对地形地质条件的依赖远高于重力坝。�TA gravity dam resists water pressure through its own enormous dead weight, so sliding resistance at the foundation interface is critical and the section must be massive. An arch dam instead transfers most of the water load through arching action into the abutments on both banks, acting as a thin spatial shell, which allows a much thinner section. However, arch dams require a narrow valley with strong, intact abutment rock free of weak structural planes; if the abutments yield, the whole structure fails, so their dependence on topography and geology is far greater than that of gravity dams.�ans��src��1SL 319—2018《混凝土重力坝设计规范》�\SL 319-2018, Design Specification for Concrete Gravity Dams (China Energy Industry Standard)��id�3fd5227a83d5�body�ٷ在海湾口建坝，涨潮蓄水、落潮放水，利用两侧水位差推动水轮机发电；也可用水下涡轮直接被潮流推动，能量来自月球引力引起的潮汐。��A barrage across a bay stores water at high tide and releases it at low tide through turbines, or underwater turbines are driven by the current; the energy comes from tidal forces of the Moon.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�4018308bdfca�body���核聚变是轻原子核结合成较重原子核并释放能量的过程，正是太阳发光的方式。它与裂变相反，燃料丰富、不产生长寿命高放废料，但需要上亿度高温和强约束，目前尚未实现商用发电。�MNuclear fusion is the joining of light nuclei into heavier ones with energy release, the process that powers the Sun. Opposite to fission, its fuel is abundant and it produces no long-lived high-level waste, but it needs temperatures of hundreds of millions of degrees and strong confinement, so commercial power is not yet achieved.�ans��src��0Krane，《原子核物理导论》（第3版）�/Krane, 'Introductory Nuclear Physics' (3rd ed.)��id�41dd1ddde715�body�ٖ位置控制给定目标位置，力控则给定或限制接触力；装配、打磨、抓取易碎物等需要力控以避免损坏工件或环境。ٟPosition control commands a target location, while force control commands or limits contact force; needed for assembly, polishing and handling fragile objects.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�4328d4de2c2d�body���当信号源、传输线与负载阻抗不相等时，部分电磁波会在接口处反射，造成功率损失和信号失真。阻抗匹配使入射波被完全吸收，最大化功率传输并减少回波。��When source, line, and load impedances differ, part of the wave reflects at junctions, wasting power and distorting signals. Matching absorbs the incident wave fully, maximizing transfer and minimizing echo.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�463477c37ec6�body���公式 C = B log2(1+S/N) 表明，在给定带宽 B 与信噪比 S/N 下，无差错传输速率存在上限。它指导工程师在带宽、功率与可靠性之间权衡，且仅靠增加带宽在噪声受限时收益递减。��C = B log2(1+S/N) shows that with given bandwidth B and SNR S/N there is a hard upper bound on error-free rate. It guides trade-offs among bandwidth, power, and reliability, and reveals diminishing returns from bandwidth alone when noise-limited.�ans��src��9《通信原理》（樊昌信，国防工业出版社）�OA Mathematical Theory of Communication, Shannon (Bell System Technical Journal)��id�47c28379682a�body���三轴试验通过对圆柱形土样施加围压和轴向荷载，测定土的抗剪强度指标——内聚力与内摩擦角，并绘出应力—应变关系，是地基与边坡设计的关键依据。��A triaxial test subjects a cylindrical soil sample to confining and axial stress to determine shear strength parameters—cohesion and friction angle—and the stress–strain curve, essential for foundations and slopes.�ans��src��3美国材料与试验协会（ASTM International）�ASTM International��id�4807bc87d994�body���大规模 MIMO 在基站部署数十至数百天线，利用信道空间维度同时服务多用户（空分复用），成倍提升频谱效率。波束赋形增益提高信干噪比，并能用信道硬化抑制小尺度衰落。�	Massive MIMO deploys tens to hundreds of base-station antennas, exploiting spatial dimensions to serve multiple users simultaneously (spatial multiplexing) and multiply spectral efficiency. Beamforming raises SINR and channel hardening mitigates small-scale fading.�ans��src�ٷMarzetta,《Noncooperative Cellular Wireless with Unlimited Numbers of Base Station Antennas》,IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications,2010 (DOI: 10.1109/twc.2010.092810.091092)ٵMarzetta, 'Noncooperative Cellular Wireless with Unlimited Numbers of Base Station Antennas', IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications, 2010, DOI: 10.1109/twc.2010.092810.091092��id�481c346b3c4f�body��接收机测量多颗卫星信号的传播时延算出距离，再经三边交会确定位置；卡尔曼滤波则把带噪声的连续观测与运动模型融合，平滑估计并预测位置、速度。Kalman 在 1960 年提出这一递推最优估计方法。�!The receiver measures signal travel time from several satellites to get distances, then trilaterates position; the Kalman filter fuses noisy sequential observations with a motion model to smooth and predict position and velocity. Kalman introduced this recursive optimal estimator in 1960.�ans��src��}Kaplan 与 Hegarty《GPS 原理》(Understanding GPS)；Kalman《新线性滤波方法》(Journal of Basic Engineering, 1960)�ZKaplan & Hegarty, 'Understanding GPS'; Kalman, 'A New Approach to Linear Filtering' (1960)��id�48ca67f4f26c�body���它在建筑底部与地基之间加入橡胶或滑动支座，把结构自振周期拉长，使其避开地震主频、显著减小传入的加速度。本质是用一个『软垫』把地面运动与上部结构解耦。�It inserts rubber or sliding bearings between the building base and foundation, lengthening the structure's natural period so it misses the earthquake's dominant frequency and receives far less acceleration. In effect a 'soft pad' decouples ground motion from the superstructure.�ans��src��fNaeim《抗震设计手册》(The Seismic Design Handbook)；美国 NIST《建筑隔震技术指南》�QNaeim, 'The Seismic Design Handbook'; US NIST, 'NEHRP Seismic Isolation Guidance'��id�493c3f96766d�body��>强化策略多在仿真中训练，而仿真与真实在动力学、摩擦、传感器噪声上存在差异，学到的策略一旦上机容易失效或失稳。常用域随机化（在仿真中加随机扰动）、系统辨识与真实数据微调来弥合差距，但这些方法仍难完全覆盖现实多样性。�ORL policies are mostly trained in simulation, yet sim and reality differ in dynamics, friction, and sensor noise, so learned policies often fail or destabilize on real hardware. Domain randomization, system identification, and real-data fine-tuning bridge the gap, but they still struggle to cover the full diversity of the real world.�ans��src��6Nature Machine Intelligence（机器人强化学习）�ANature Machine Intelligence (reinforcement learning for robotics)��id�4a0aec0fc90e�body���TBM 前端的旋转刀盘切削岩土，渣土经输送机运出，紧随其后的一环液压千斤顶把预制管片拼装成衬砌并顶推机身前进。它把开挖、出渣、支护集成在一台设备里，适合长隧道高效施工。�A TBM's rotating cutterhead excavates rock or soil while conveyors remove muck; trailing hydraulic jacks erect precast segments into a lining and push the machine forward. It integrates excavation, removal, and support in one device for efficient long tunnels.�ans��src�ٱBickel、Kuesel 与 King《隧道工程手册》(Tunnel Engineering Handbook)，第 2 版；国际隧道与地下空间协会(ITA)《隧道掘进机(TBM)推荐与指南》(2000)ٵBickel, Kuesel & King, 'Tunnel Engineering Handbook' (2nd ed.); International Tunnelling Association (ITA), 'Recommendations and Guidelines for Tunnel Boring Machines (TBMs)' (2000)��id�4cd709f626d7�body���塑性铰是构件在弯矩作用下截面屈服、形成可转动的塑性区，但仍能保持抗弯承载力。抗震设计通过让塑性铰在梁端等延性部位有控制地形成，耗散地震输入的能量，保护主体结构不倒塌。�6A plastic hinge is a region of a member that yields under bending and rotates plastically while still retaining its moment capacity. In seismic design, intended plastic hinges form in ductile locations such as beam ends to dissipate the energy input by an earthquake and prevent collapse of the main structure.�ans��src��~美国钢结构学会（AISC）AISC 341《抗震规定》；Paulay & Priestley《钢筋混凝土与砌体建筑抗震设计》٠American Institute of Steel Construction (AISC) AISC 341 'Seismic Provisions'; Paulay & Priestley, 'Seismic Design of Reinforced Concrete and Masonry Buildings'��id�4e085e0d051e�body��R铁心磁通是电压的积分，稳态时与电压相差九十度；若在电压过零附近合闸，磁通必须从合闸瞬间的剩磁出发单向累积，峰值可达稳态磁通两倍以上，铁心深度饱和后励磁电感急剧下降，励磁电流出现数倍甚至十几倍额定值的单向尖峰。涌流富含二次谐波和直流分量，衰减时间常数由绕组电阻与电感决定，大型变压器可持续零点几秒到数秒。为避免误跳闸，差动保护采用二次谐波闭锁或波形识别，并用合闸电阻和按剩磁选相合闸来抑制涌流幅值。�Core flux is the integral of applied voltage and lags it by ninety degrees in steady state, so closing near a voltage zero forces flux to build one-sidedly from whatever residual flux remains, peaking above twice the normal value; the core saturates deeply, magnetizing inductance collapses and current spikes to several or even more than ten times rated. The inrush is unidirectional and rich in second harmonic and DC offset, decaying with a time constant set by winding resistance and inductance, which for large units lasts from a fraction of a second to several seconds. To avoid nuisance tripping, differential protection uses second-harmonic restraint or waveform identification, while pre-insertion resistors and controlled point-on-wave closing matched to residual flux limit the peak.�ans��src��8Heathcote，《The J&P Transformer Book》（第13版）�0Heathcote, 'The J&P Transformer Book' (13th ed.)��id�4e0d4f03b327�body��&太空中无重力支撑，机械臂与目标件之间作用力会反作用于自身引起整体漂移，且大柔性结构在扰动下持续振动难以快速衰减。控制需在零基座位姿扰动、柔体振动抑制与视觉伺服之间协调，对建模精度与实时性要求很高。�hWith no gravity to react against, interaction forces between the arm and the workpiece push the whole base around, and large flexible structures keep vibrating under disturbance with slow decay. Control must coordinate zero-disturbance base attitude, flexible-vibration suppression, and visual servoing, demanding high model accuracy and real-time performance.�ans��src��Chaumette 与 Hutchinson，《Visual Servo Control, Part I: Basic Approaches》，IEEE Robotics & Automation Magazine（2006）�tChaumette & Hutchinson, 'Visual Servo Control, Part I: Basic Approaches', IEEE Robotics & Automation Magazine (2006)��id�4ea72fc8bfb6�body���鲁棒控制研究当系统存在模型误差、参数漂移和外部扰动时仍能保持性能的控制设计方法。它不依赖精确模型，适合航空航天、过程和机器人等不确定性强的场合。��Robust control designs controllers that keep performance despite model error, parameter drift, and external disturbances. It does not rely on an exact model and suits aerospace, process, and robotics applications with strong uncertainty.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�504fa0e187ad�body���氢能以氢气作燃料或储能介质，燃烧只生成水，是潜在的零碳能源。绿色氢指用可再生电力电解水制取的氢，全程无碳排放，可用于难以电气化的工业和交通领域。�Hydrogen energy uses hydrogen as fuel or storage medium, burning to water only, a potentially zero-carbon source. Green hydrogen is made by electrolyzing water with renewable electricity, producing no carbon emissions, and can serve industry and transport that are hard to electrify.�ans��src��>Larminie & Dicks，《燃料电池系统解析》（第2版）�9Larminie & Dicks, 'Fuel Cell Systems Explained' (2nd ed.)��id�51851cd4a1f3�body��S芯粒把不同功能模块（CPU、I/O、内存、加速器）用成熟且各自最优的制程分别制造，再通过先进封装（如 2.5D 硅中介层或 3D 混合键合）互连。这种方式绕开了单颗大尺寸 SoC 在良率与光罩面积上的限制，降低了单芯片成本，并允许混用不同工艺节点与材料。�{Chiplets are separately built in the most suitable, often mature process nodes for each function (CPU, I/O, memory, accelerator) and then interconnected by advanced packaging such as 2.5D silicon interposers or 3D hybrid bonding. This sidesteps reticle-size and yield limits of a single large SoC, lowers cost per die, and permits mixing of different process nodes and materials.�ans��src��;Lau，《芯粒设计与异构集成》（Springer, 2023）�HLau, J., 'Chiplet Design and Heterogeneous Integration' (Springer, 2023)��id�55aaba3a3d42�body�٫反应堆里铀原子核裂变释放巨大热能，把水加热成高温高压蒸汽，蒸汽推动汽轮机带动发电机发电，裂变链式反应由控制棒调节。١Uranium fission in the reactor releases heat that makes high-pressure steam, which spins a turbine driving a generator; control rods regulate the chain reaction.�ans��src��6Lamarsh & Baratta，《核工程导论》（第3版）�BLamarsh & Baratta, 'Introduction to Nuclear Engineering' (3rd ed.)��id�5998312310b0�body���当物体速度超过音速时，前方的压力扰动无法及时散开，会叠加形成突然的压强、温度和密度跳变的激波。激波带来强烈的波阻和气动加热，并要求机体结构承受额外载荷。�When an object exceeds the speed of sound, pressure disturbances ahead cannot disperse in time and pile up into a shock wave with abrupt jumps in pressure, temperature, and density. Shock waves cause strong wave drag and aerodynamic heating and demand extra structural strength.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�5a10e0048586�body���OFDM 把宽带信道划分为大量正交窄带子载波，将频率选择性衰落转化为若干平坦子信道。配合循环前缀吸收多径时延，并在各子载波独立编码与均衡，显著降低均衡复杂度。�OFDM splits a wideband channel into many orthogonal narrow subcarriers, turning frequency-selective fading into several flat subchannels. A cyclic prefix absorbs multipath delay, and per-subcarrier coding and equalization greatly reduce equalizer complexity.�ans��src���Weinstein, Ebert,《Data Transmission by Frequency-Division Multiplexing Using the Discrete Fourier Transform》,IEEE Transactions on Communication Technology,1971 (DOI: 10.1109/tcom.1971.1090705)��Weinstein and Ebert, 'Data Transmission by Frequency-Division Multiplexing Using the Discrete Fourier Transform', IEEE Transactions on Communication Technology, 1971, DOI: 10.1109/tcom.1971.1090705��id�5b317ef16098�body��UWAAM 以焊丝为材料、电弧为热源，沉积速率可达千克级每小时，非常适合米级大型构件且材料利用率高、成本低。但电弧热输入大导致热累积明显、尺寸精度与表面质量较差，通常需要后续机加工，且晶粒粗大、各向异性更强，需通过工艺与热处理调控性能。��WAAM uses welding wire and an electric arc, achieving deposition rates on the order of kilograms per hour, ideal for meter-scale parts with high material use and low cost. But the large heat input causes significant thermal accumulation, poorer dimensional accuracy and surface finish that often require machining, plus coarser grains and stronger anisotropy that must be controlled by process and heat treatment.�ans��src��&Elsevier（CIRP Annals 制造技术）�1Elsevier (CIRP Annals - Manufacturing Technology)��id�5c0e8384e5d3�body��5热失控通常始于 SEI 膜在约 80–120 摄氏度分解，随后负极与电解液反应、正极释氧并与电解液剧烈氧化，放热迅速抬升温度并引燃可燃气体。链式放热一旦越过临界点便自我维持，因此电池包依赖热隔离、泄压阀与热管理来阻断传播。��Thermal runaway usually begins with SEI decomposition around 80–120 °C, followed by anode-electrolyte reactions and cathode oxygen release driving violent oxidation with the electrolyte, rapidly raising temperature and igniting flammable gases. Once past the critical point the exothermic chain is self-sustaining, so packs rely on thermal isolation, pressure relief, and thermal management to stop propagation.�ans��src��+Nature Energy（锂电池热失控机理）�:Nature Energy (lithium battery thermal runaway mechanisms)��id�5ca76addbe03�body��功率因数是有功功率与视在功率的比值，反映电能被有效利用的程度。较低的功率因数意味着电网需要输送更多电流来传输同样的真实功率，会增加线路损耗和设备负担，因此电力公司常对低功率因数用户收费。�(Power factor is the ratio of real power to apparent power, reflecting how effectively electrical energy is used. A low power factor means the grid must deliver more current to transmit the same real power, increasing line losses and equipment stress, so utilities often penalize low power factor.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�5caf3f19937c�body�ٷ传质是物质因浓度差从一处迁移到另一处，如吸收、萃取、干燥中的扩散与对流。它常与传热耦合，是分离、反应和环保设备设计的核心。��Mass transfer is the movement of species driven by concentration differences—diffusion and convection in absorption, extraction, drying. Coupled with heat transfer, it underpins separation and reactor design.�ans��src��:ASHRAE Handbook—Fundamentals,ASHRAE,Atlanta 年度更新�8ASHRAE Handbook - Fundamentals, Atlanta, recent editions��id�5d4235962702�body���垂度小则主缆更平、水平拉力更大，需要更强锚碇和更多钢材，但桥面竖向刚度好、变形小；垂度大则缆力缓和、省钢，却刚度下降、容易在活载下挠曲。设计要在经济性与刚度间权衡。� Low sag flattens the cable, raising horizontal tension so stronger anchors and more steel are needed, but deck stiffness and small deflection improve. High sag eases cable force and saves steel yet lowers stiffness and allows more live-load sag—a trade-off between economy and rigidity.�ans��src��+Hibbeler，《结构分析》（第10版）�*Hibbeler, 'Structural Analysis' (10th ed.)��id�5d6c700789b4�body��J涡轮喷气发动机近似布雷顿循环：空气经进气道和压气机连续增压，在燃烧室近似定压加热，再经涡轮和尾喷管膨胀做功并排出。提高总增压比和涡轮前温度可提升热效率与推力，而涡轮叶片的耐温能力是主要约束，这正是燃气轮机设计的核心矛盾。��A turbojet approximates the Brayton cycle: air is compressed continuously by the inlet and the compressor, heated at roughly constant pressure in the combustor, then expanded through the turbine and nozzle before exhausting. Raising the overall pressure ratio and the turbine-inlet temperature improves efficiency and thrust, while blade temperature capability is the main constraint—the central trade-off of gas-turbine design.�ans��src��iMattingly《燃气轮机推进原理》(Elements of Gas Turbine Propulsion)；Cengel《工程热力学》�jMattingly, 'Elements of Gas Turbine Propulsion'; Cengel & Boles, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach'��id�5fc54dad1f9d�body�٣A星适合已知栅格地图的全局最优路径搜索；RRT等采样法适合高维、复杂约束下的快速可行路径，常用于机械臂与动态环境。ٸA* finds optimal global paths on known grids, while sampling methods like RRT quickly find feasible paths in high-dimensional or constrained spaces, common for arms and dynamic scenes.�ans��src��*LaValle《规划算法》(2006, Cambridge)�.LaValle, Planning Algorithms (2006, Cambridge)��id�5fe75aff7a57�body��奈奎斯特判据看开环频率响应的复平面轨迹如何绕过点 (-1,0)，结合右半平面开环极点数判断闭环是否稳定，无需先求出闭环特征方程。它在存在时延和不确定时尤其有用。Nyquist 在 1932 年提出这一思想。�=The Nyquist criterion looks at how the open-loop frequency-response locus encircles the point (-1,0) and, with the count of right-half-plane open-loop poles, decides closed-loop stability without solving the characteristic equation. It is valuable when delays and uncertainty are present. Nyquist proposed it in 1932.�ans��src��oNyquist《再生理论》(Bell System Tech J, 1932)；Ogata《现代控制工程》(Modern Control Engineering)�^Nyquist, 'Regeneration theory' (Bell System Tech J, 1932); Ogata, 'Modern Control Engineering'��id�6140131d98f2�body��C正运动学由已知的各关节角度算出末端执行器在空间中的位置与姿态；逆运动学则相反，由目标位姿反求所需关节角，通常存在多解、奇异位形甚至无解。Denavit 与 Hartenberg 在 1955 年提出用统一矩阵描述连杆坐标变换的方法，至今仍是建模基础。�.Forward kinematics takes given joint angles and computes the end-effector's position and orientation; inverse kinematics does the reverse—finding joint angles for a desired pose, often with multiple or no solutions. Denavit and Hartenberg gave a unified matrix convention for link transforms in 1955.�ans��src��hCraig《机器人学导论》(Introduction to Robotics)；Denavit 与 Hartenberg《连杆变换》(1955)�VCraig, 'Introduction to Robotics'; Denavit & Hartenberg, 'A kinematic notation' (1955)��id�644bbb4be79d�body���菲茨定律指出目标获取时间随目标距离增大、尺寸减小而变长，呈对数关系。据此应把常用或危险操作的目标做得更大、更靠近操作起点，并加大点击热区以降低误触与时间成本。��Fitts's Law states the time to acquire a target grows logarithmically with distance and shrinks with target size. Hence frequently used or dangerous controls should be larger, nearer the action origin, with enlarged hit areas to cut error and time.�ans��src�٨Fitts,《The information capacity of the human motor system in controlling the amplitude of movement.》,Journal of Experimental Psychology,1954 (DOI: 10.1037/h0055392)٦Fitts, 'The information capacity of the human motor system in controlling the amplitude of movement.', Journal of Experimental Psychology, 1954, DOI: 10.1037/h0055392��id�66d6146c5940�body���HTU 表示完成一个传质单元所需的填料高度，等于塔高除以理论传质单元数 NTU。HTU 越小，说明单位高度的填料传质越充分、分离效率越高，受气液流量、填料类型和分布均匀性影响。�HTU is the packing height needed for one transfer unit, equal to column height divided by the number of transfer units (NTU). A smaller HTU means each meter of packing transfers more mass and the column is more efficient, depending on flow rates, packing type, and distribution.�ans��src��AMcCabe、Smith & Harriott，《化工单元操作》（第7版）�MMcCabe, Smith & Harriott, 'Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering' (7th ed.)��id�672c6a526845�body���铬对氧的亲和力高于铁，钢见空气便自发生成一层几个纳米厚、连续致密的氧化铬钝化膜，隔断氧和水、挡住离子穿膜，腐蚀速率因此下降几个数量级；划伤后只要有氧，铬重新氧化便把膜补上。普通钢的铁锈疏松含水、比基体大又易剥落，腐蚀层层向内推进。不锈钢不是不腐蚀而是靠钝化：缺氧缝隙、氯离子或酸性环境会破膜起点蚀，铬含量得先过一道门槛。��Chromium's affinity for oxygen beats iron's, so on contact with air the steel grows a continuous, dense chromium-oxide passive film only a few nanometers thick, shutting out oxygen and water and blocking ions across it, which cuts the corrosion rate by orders of magnitude; where it is scratched, chromium re-oxidizes and reseals the film as long as oxygen is present. Rust on ordinary steel is porous hydrated iron oxide, bulkier than the metal beneath, poorly bonded and flaking, so corrosion presses inward layer by layer. Stainless is not immune but passive: oxygen-starved crevices, chloride or acid service break the film and start pitting, and chromium content must first pass a threshold.�ans��src��6Callister《材料科学》；ASTM A240（不锈钢）�9Callister, Materials Science; ASTM A240 (stainless steel)��id�6806660fbaa4�body��W微服务把一个大系统按业务边界拆成许多独立部署的小服务，各自拥有独立的数据库，服务之间用HTTP/RPC或消息队列通信。好处是：不同团队能独立开发、测试、上线，互不阻塞；各服务可以按自身负载单独扩容，比如把访问量大的服务多开几个实例；单个服务故障被隔离，不会拖垮整个系统。代价是分布式带来的难题——网络延迟、部分失败、数据一致性、服务发现与监控成本，远比单体架构复杂。所以只有当规模和团队达到一定程度才值得拆分。��Microservices split a large system along business boundaries into many independently deployable services, each with its own database, communicating over HTTP/RPC or message queues. The benefits: teams develop, test, and ship independently without blocking each other; each service scales separately under its own load, e.g., running more instances of a hot service; one failing service is contained instead of taking down the whole system. The price is distributed-systems pain — network latency, partial failures, data consistency, service discovery, and monitoring overhead — far more complex than a monolith. That is why you split only once scale and team size justify it.�ans��src��bFielding《基于网络的软件架构风格》(博士论文, 2000)；IETF《HTTP/1.1》(RFC 2616)�kFielding, 'Architectural Styles for Network-based Software' (PhD thesis, 2000); IETF, 'HTTP/1.1' (RFC 2616)��id�692797c33941�body��	疲劳破坏在低于静强度的循环应力下萌生微裂纹并逐步扩展，通常无明显塑性预兆、断口可见疲劳辉纹。S-N 曲线给出应力幅与失效循环数的关系，设计取低于疲劳极限或规定寿命对应应力以确保安全。�)Fatigue failure initiates and grows microcracks under cyclic stress below static strength, often with little plastic warning and fatigue striations on the fracture. The S-N curve relates stress amplitude to failure cycles; design uses stress below the fatigue limit or the value for a target life.�ans��src��E刘鸿文 主编,《材料力学》第6版,高等教育出版社,2017�NLiu Hongwen ed., Mechanics of Materials, 6th ed., Higher Education Press, 2017��id�69dc64f769ad�body���积分项消除稳态误差，但在大偏差或执行器饱和时会持续累积，产生积分饱和（windup），导致超调与恢复缓慢。工程上常用抗积分饱和（clamping 或 back-calculation）限制积分累积。�
The integral term removes steady-state error but, under large error or actuator saturation, keeps accumulating and causes integral windup, leading to overshoot and slow recovery. Practitioners use anti-windup (clamping or back-calculation) to limit integral buildup.�ans��src��B《现代控制工程》（绪方胜彦，电子工业出版社）�0Ogata, Modern Control Engineering, Prentice Hall��id�6a8870213b5c�body���碳中和指一定时期内人为二氧化碳排放与清除量相抵、净排放为零。实现路径依赖可再生能源、终端电气化、碳捕集利用与封存（CCUS）、植树造林与绿氢等技术。��Carbon neutrality means that over a period, human CO2 emissions are balanced by removals, giving net-zero emissions. The pathway relies on renewable energy, electrification, carbon capture utilization and storage (CCUS), reforestation, and green hydrogen.�ans��src��<Davis & Cornwell，《环境工程导论》（McGraw-Hill）�KDavis & Cornwell, 'Introduction to Environmental Engineering' (McGraw-Hill)��id�6bfd13fabbb4�body�ٟ为隔离漏点必须把上下游阀门关掉形成可控区段，避免整网失压；关阀范围越大影响越多，所以要靠分区计量精准定位。لCrews isolate the break by closing valves to a district to avoid system-wide pressure loss, balancing repair access against outages.�ans��src��lNFPA 消防与给水排水规范（NFPA 13/14/25/101）；Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程：处理与回用》�iNFPA fire/plumbing codes (NFPA 13/14/25/101); Metcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering: Treatment and Reuse��id�6c0b36ae94b3�body��␀需求一旦落入设计、代码、测试，就会层层固化：改一个需求可能牵动架构假设、数据库结构、界面和文档。在需求阶段修改只需改几行描述，到了测试阶段再改则要重新设计、改代码、改测试并做回归验证，成本相差可达几十上百倍。这就是软件工程里著名的"缺陷放大曲线"。所以业界强调尽早澄清需求、用原型验证想法、采用迭代式开发和架构评审，把错误拦截在成本最低的阶段。��Once a requirement sinks into design, code, and tests it solidifies layer by layer: changing it may ripple through architectural assumptions, database schemas, user interfaces, and documentation. A change during the requirements stage costs a few edited lines of description; the same change in the testing stage means redesign, recoding, rewriting tests, and regression checks — tens to hundreds of times more expensive. This is the famous "defect amplification curve" of software engineering. That is why the industry pushes early requirement clarification, prototype validation, iterative development, and architecture reviews to catch errors at the cheapest stage.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6c372785180a�body��'此时依赖自身传感器：视觉惯性里程计用相机与 IMU 估计相对位姿，激光雷达或 UWB 信标提供绝对参照，配合地图匹配修正漂移。多传感器紧耦合融合可在无卫星信号时维持连续定位，但对计算资源与场景特征丰富度有要求。�DIt then relies on onboard sensing: visual-inertial odometry fuses camera and IMU for relative pose, while LiDAR or UWB beacons supply absolute references, with map matching correcting drift. Tightly coupled multi-sensor fusion maintains continuous localization without satellites but demands compute and feature-rich scenes.�ans��src��lCraig《机器人学导论》；Siegwart《自主移动机器人导论》；Thrun《概率机器人》(2005)�yCraig, Introduction to Robotics; Siegwart, Introduction to Autonomous Mobile Robots; Thrun, Probabilistic Robotics (2005)��id�6cee6a94e60f�body��j低温马氏体相时合金很容易被变形，加热回到高温奥氏体相后晶格自动恢复母相形状，这就是形状记忆效应。当温度高于奥氏体转变终了点时，加载会诱发应力马氏体、卸载后立即回复，表现为超弹性（伪弹性）。Buehler 等人在 1960 年代初于美国海军军械实验室发现镍钛诺。��In the low-temperature martensitic phase the alloy deforms easily, and heating it back into the high-temperature austenitic phase makes the lattice recover the parent shape—the shape-memory effect. Above the austenite finish temperature, loading induces stress-induced martensite that reverts on unloading, giving superelasticity (pseudoelasticity). Buehler and colleagues discovered Nitinol at the US Naval Ordnance Laboratory in the early 1960s.�ans��src��dOtsuka 与 Wayman《形状记忆材料》(Shape Memory Materials)；Buehler 等《镍钛诺》(1963)�KOtsuka & Wayman, 'Shape Memory Materials'; Buehler et al., 'Nitinol' (1963)��id�6d178da79045�body��n铀-235吸收一个中子裂变时平均放出2到3个快中子，如果每次裂变恰好留下一个中子引发下一次裂变，链式反应就以恒定功率自持，这对应有效增殖因子k等于1的临界状态。控制棒用硼或镉制成，强烈吸收中子，插入越深中子损失越多；慢化剂（轻水、重水或石墨）把快中子减速成热中子，因为铀-235对热中子的裂变截面大得多。反应堆通过升降控制棒、调节冷却剂中硼浓度和控制慢化剂量来微调k，再依靠功率负反馈（多普勒展宽使吸收增强）天然稳定，防止功率失控。�When uranium-235 absorbs a neutron it fissions and releases 2-3 fast neutrons on average; if exactly one neutron per fission triggers the next fission, the chain sustains itself at constant power, corresponding to an effective multiplication factor k of 1 — criticality. Control rods made of boron or cadmium absorb neutrons strongly, so deeper insertion means more neutron loss; moderators (light water, heavy water, or graphite) slow fast neutrons to thermal energies, where U-235's fission cross section is far larger. Reactors tune k by moving rods, adjusting dissolved boron concentration, and controlling moderator volume, then rely on negative power feedback — Doppler broadening that increases absorption as temperature rises — for inherent stability against runaway power.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�708d94a08ab5�body�ٷBRT是用专用车道、水平登乘、优先信号和封闭站台模拟地铁服务的公交系统。它以远少于地铁的造价提供大容量、准点、快速的公共交通。پBRT uses dedicated lanes, level boarding, signal priority, and enclosed stations to mimic metro service by bus. It delivers high-capacity, punctual, fast transit at a fraction of metro cost.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�733dadc56acf�body���以双极型晶体管为例，发射结把载流子注入极薄的基区（它们在基区中是少数载流子），大部分来不及复合便扩散到集电结并被收集，因此微小的基极电流即可控制大得多的集电极电流。Bardeen 与 Brattain 在 1947 年做出点接触晶体管，Shockley 随后提出结型晶体管，三人共获 1956 年诺贝尔物理学奖，微电子时代由此开启。��In a bipolar transistor the emitter junction injects carriers into a very thin base, where they are minority carriers; most diffuse across before recombining and are collected at the collector, so a tiny base current controls a much larger collector current. Bardeen and Brattain demonstrated the point-contact transistor in 1947 and Shockley then proposed the junction transistor; the three shared the 1956 Nobel Prize in Physics, launching microelectronics.�ans��src�قStreetman 与 Banerjee《固态电子器件》(Solid State Electronic Devices)；Bardeen 等《晶体管》(1947, 获 1956 诺奖)�yStreetman & Banerjee, 'Solid State Electronic Devices'; Bardeen, Brattain & Shockley, 'The transistor' (1947, Nobel 1956)��id�7406fab45c14�body���碳纤维是极细的碳晶体沿纤维方向高度排列，碳原子键很强且材料密度低；沿纤维方向抗拉强度高，常用树脂粘成层板，在飞机和赛车中替代金属减重。��Carbon fiber is tiny carbon crystals aligned along the filament with strong atomic bonds and low density; its tensile strength along the fiber is high, and resin-bonded layers replace metal to save weight in aircraft and race cars.�ans��src��;Callister，《材料科学与工程导论》（第10版）�JCallister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction' (10th ed.)��id�746ecee3da94�body���屈服强度是材料开始发生塑性变形时的应力，对无明显屈服平台的金属常取0.2%残余应变偏移法确定。极限抗拉强度是拉伸曲线上最大工程应力，出现在颈缩之前；二者均由单轴拉伸试验得到。�#Yield strength is the stress at which a material begins plastic deformation; for metals without a clear yield point it is found by the 0.2% offset method. Ultimate tensile strength is the maximum engineering stress on the tensile curve before necking; both come from a uniaxial tensile test.�ans��src�ف美国材料与试验协会（ASTM）ASTM E8/E8M《金属材料拉伸试验方法》；Callister《材料科学与工程导论》١ASTM International ASTM E8/E8M 'Standard Test Methods for Tension Testing of Metallic Materials'; Callister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction'��id�75f0614bc3b2�body�ٍ在楼体和地基间垫橡胶隔震层，拉长结构周期、避开地震主频，像给楼装软鞋，大幅减小传到上部的晃动。�Rubber bearings between building and ground lengthen its period to dodge the quake's frequency, like soft shoes damping motion.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�76ba4ab01406�body��MOSFET 是金属—氧化物—半导体场效应晶体管，由栅极电压在沟道中感应出导电层来控制漏源电流，属于电压控制、功耗极低的器件。它是几乎所有微处理器和存储器中 CMOS 逻辑的基本单元，可随工艺持续微缩。�=A MOSFET is a metal-oxide-semiconductor field-effect transistor whose gate voltage induces a conducting channel to control drain-source current; it is voltage-controlled and very low power. It is the building block of CMOS logic in virtually all microprocessors and memories and scales well with fabrication advances.�ans��src��i电气与电子工程师协会（IEEE）电子器件学会；Streetman & Banerjee《固态电子器件》�UIEEE Electron Devices Society; Streetman & Banerjee, 'Solid State Electronic Devices'��id�77808f68b9a8�body���活塞运动不是纯简谐：由于连杆长度有限，其加速度可展开为频率等于曲轴转速的一阶项，加上频率为两倍转速的二阶项，二阶项幅值大致按曲柄半径与连杆长度之比缩放。直列四缸相邻曲拐相位相差一百八十度，一阶惯性力互相抵消，但四个活塞的二阶分量同相叠加，形成沿气缸轴线、频率为转速两倍的合力，曲轴配重无法消除。因此排量较大的四缸机常加两根以两倍转速反向旋转的 Lanchester 平衡轴，用偏心质量抵消这一激励，代价是增加零件、摩擦与成本；直列六缸和水平对置布局则从相位上天然抵消该项。� Piston motion is not purely sinusoidal: because the connecting rod has finite length, acceleration expands into a first-order term at crank speed plus a second-order term at twice crank speed whose amplitude scales roughly with the ratio of crank radius to rod length. In an inline four the crank throws are 180 degrees apart so first-order forces cancel, but all four second-order components act in phase and sum into a net force along the cylinder axis at twice engine speed, which crankshaft counterweights cannot remove. Larger four-cylinder engines therefore add two Lanchester balance shafts counter-rotating at twice crank speed whose eccentric masses oppose that excitation, at the cost of extra parts, friction and money, while inline sixes and flat layouts cancel the term by phasing alone.�ans��src��[Taylor，《The Internal-Combustion Engine in Theory and Practice, Vol. 2》（MIT Press）�STaylor, 'The Internal-Combustion Engine in Theory and Practice, Vol. 2' (MIT Press)��id�78b7354c4f6f�body���负反馈把输出的一部分减去后送回输入端，从而减小对参数变化的敏感度、拓宽带宽并降低失真。但若相位滞后过大则可能引发振荡，需用奈奎斯特/伯德判据分析稳定性。�Negative feedback subtracts a portion of the output from the input, reducing sensitivity to parameter variations, widening bandwidth, and lowering distortion. But excessive phase lag can cause oscillation, so stability is analyzed with Nyquist or Bode criteria.�ans��src��ZIEEE 控制系统学会；Franklin, Powell & Emami-Naeini《动态系统的反馈控制》�dIEEE Control Systems Society; Franklin, Powell & Emami-Naeini, 'Feedback Control of Dynamic Systems'��id�79d819dcaa05�body���CSTR依靠搅拌使釜内组成均匀，出口组成与釜内相同，这意味着整个反应都在出口的低浓度下进行。反应物一进入就被釜内大量产物稀释，所以推动反应的浓度水平始终较低；同等转化率下CSTR需要的反应体积往往大于活塞流反应器（PFR）。但均匀的浓度和温度使其易于控制，特别适合强放热反应，可避免局部过热。�-Because the impeller keeps the tank contents uniform, the outlet composition equals that inside, so all the reaction proceeds at the low outlet concentration. Fresh feed is instantly diluted by the large mass of product already in the tank, so the driving concentration stays low; for the same conversion a CSTR therefore usually needs a larger volume than a plug-flow reactor (PFR). Its uniform concentration and temperature, however, make it easy to control, which is advantageous for strongly exothermic reactions where local overheating must be avoided.�ans��src��4Fogler，《化学反应工程原理》（第5版）�=Fogler, 'Elements of Chemical Reaction Engineering' (5th ed.)��id�7a6bb80908c7�body��有限元分析是一种把复杂结构离散成许多小单元、再用数值方法求解应力应变分布的工程计算方法。设计者用它来预测零件在载荷下的变形、强度和疲劳寿命，从而在没有实物样机前就优化结构。�7Finite element analysis is a computational method that discretizes a complex structure into many small elements and solves for stress and strain distributions numerically. Designers use it to predict deformation, strength, and fatigue life under loads, optimizing structures before building physical prototypes.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�7b4d19d87f2c�body��单一传感器都有盲区：摄像头对光线敏感、测距不精确，毫米波雷达分辨率低、难以分辨静止物体，激光雷达昂贵且受雨雾影响。多传感器融合利用各自的互补性，在时间同步和空间对齐（外参标定）的前提下，把检测结果或原始数据组合成统一的环境模型。融合可分为数据级、特征级和目标级三类，目标级融合把各传感器识别出的目标关联匹配后合成航迹，鲁棒性高、计算量可控，是主流方案。�FEvery sensor has blind spots: cameras are light-sensitive and poor at ranging, mmWave radar has low resolution and trouble with stationary objects, and LiDAR is costly and degraded by rain and fog. Sensor fusion exploits their complementarity, combining detections or raw data into one environmental model after time synchronisation and spatial calibration. Fusion happens at data, feature or object level; object-level fusion matches and merges the targets each sensor detects into unified tracks, offering high robustness at manageable compute cost and is the mainstream approach.�ans��src��iMaurer、Gerdes、Lenz & Winner，《自动驾驶：技术、法律与社会视角》（Springer, 2016）�iMaurer, Gerdes, Lenz & Winner, 'Autonomous Driving: Technical, Legal and Social Aspects' (Springer, 2016)��id�7c98f7c6b4a4�body��高速旋转的转子因角动量守恒倾向于保持转轴方向不变，外力矩不会立刻把它推倒，而是引发进动——角动量沿力矩方向变化，使转轴绕垂直于力矩的方向缓慢转动。这一特性被用于惯性导航和航天器姿态稳定。�eA fast-spinning rotor tends to keep its spin axis fixed by conservation of angular momentum; an applied torque does not tip it over at once but causes precession—the angular momentum changes along the torque direction, so the axis slowly swings about an axis perpendicular to the torque. This underlies inertial navigation and spacecraft attitude control.�ans��src�ٓHughes《航天器姿态动力学》(Spacecraft Attitude Dynamics)；Goldstein、Poole 与 Safko《经典力学》(Classical Mechanics)，第 3 版�aHughes, 'Spacecraft Attitude Dynamics'; Goldstein, Poole & Safko, 'Classical Mechanics' (3rd ed.)��id�7d78962cfbc6�body���电磁兼容性是指电子设备在电磁环境中既能正常工作，又不对其他设备产生不可接受的干扰的能力。它涉及屏蔽、滤波、接地和合理布线，是现代电子产品认证的重要内容。�,Electromagnetic compatibility is the ability of electronic equipment to function correctly in an electromagnetic environment without causing unacceptable interference to other devices. It involves shielding, filtering, grounding, and careful layout, and is a key part of modern product certification.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�7f81bfb2adfb�body��ISO 26262根据危害分析确定ASIL等级（A到D四级，D最高），评定依据是严重度、暴露率和可控性三个因素，等级越高要求越严。标准把安全生命周期贯穿概念、开发、生产、运行与报废各阶段，采用V模型规定每个环节的安全活动、文档和验证，并用安全机制（如双通道冗余、自检、故障检测）把残余风险降到可接受水平。不同ASIL等级对应的硬件失效率指标（如PMHF）和软件独立性要求也不同。�jISO 26262 derives ASIL levels A to D (D the most stringent) from hazard analysis, rating severity, exposure and controllability, with stricter demands at higher levels. The standard threads a safety lifecycle through concept, development, production, operation and decommissioning, using the V-model to define safety activities, artefacts and verification at every stage, and safety mechanisms such as dual-channel redundancy, self-tests and fault detection reduce residual risk to an acceptable level. Different ASIL levels impose different hardware failure metrics (e.g. PMHF) and software independence requirements.�ans��src��$国际标准化组织（ISO 26262）�,ISO 26262 (Road vehicles, Functional safety)��id�818f7654cf26�body���尺寸公差只约束孔轴等要素的大小，几何公差则用公差框格控制形状、方向、位置和跳动，比如平面度、垂直度、位置度，能更明确地表达装配功能要求。位置度以理论正确尺寸定位基准，允许公差带为一个圆柱区，轴或孔在该圆柱内即合格。最大实体原则（MMC）在要素处于最大实体状态时给最小公差，尺寸偏离时公差随之放大，既保证装配不干涉，又放宽加工成本。�[Size tolerances only bound features such as hole or shaft diameter, whereas GD&T uses feature control frames to limit form, orientation, location and runout, for example flatness, perpendicularity and position, expressing assembly requirements precisely. Position tolerance locates a feature with basic dimensions and allows a cylindrical tolerance zone the axis must lie in. The maximum material condition (MMC) gives the tightest tolerance when the feature is at its largest material size and enlarges the zone as size departs, guaranteeing assembly without interference while relaxing machining cost.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�82ff5582023b�body���应力集中是指构件几何不连续处（如孔、缺口、台阶、圆角）局部应力显著高于名义应力，因为力线在此拥挤。其程度用理论应力集中系数 K_t 量化，疲劳裂纹往往从这些高应力点萌生。�.Stress concentration is the local elevation of stress around geometric discontinuities such as holes, notches, fillets, and steps, where stress flow lines crowd together. It is quantified by the theoretical stress concentration factor K_t, and fatigue cracks often initiate at these high-stress points.�ans��src��I《Peterson 应力集中系数手册》；Shigley《机械工程设计》�[Pilkey, 'Peterson's Stress Concentration Factors'; Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design'��id�83450d269b99�body��/PWM 逆变器输出的三相电压之和不为零，产生高频共模电压，它通过定子绕组与转子、机壳之间的寄生电容耦合到转轴上形成轴电压。当轴电压超过轴承润滑油膜的击穿强度时发生放电，在滚道和滚珠表面熔出微坑，长期积累成搓板状条纹，伴随振动噪声上升并很快导致轴承失效。抑制措施包括安装导电碳刷或轴接地环旁路电流、采用绝缘或陶瓷球轴承切断回路，以及使用对称屏蔽电缆和共模电抗器降低共模电压与 dV/dt。��A PWM inverter's three output voltages do not sum to zero, producing a high-frequency common-mode voltage that couples through parasitic capacitances between stator winding, rotor and frame to appear as shaft voltage. When it exceeds the dielectric strength of the bearing's lubricant film, a discharge melts micro-craters in raceways and balls, which accumulate into washboard fluting with rising noise and vibration and rapid bearing failure. Countermeasures include conductive brushes or shaft grounding rings to bypass the current, insulated or ceramic-ball bearings to break the loop, and symmetrical shielded cable plus common-mode chokes to cut common-mode voltage and dV/dt.�ans��src�ـBusse 等，《Bearing currents and their relationship to PWM drives》，IEEE Transactions on Power Electronics 12(2)（1997）�zBusse et al., 'Bearing currents and their relationship to PWM drives', IEEE Transactions on Power Electronics 12(2) (1997)��id�845109b89f53�body���高速旋转的陀螺具有保持自转轴方向不变的定轴性。将其装于飞行器，转轴相对机身的变化就能反映俯仰、横滚和偏航姿态，是惯性导航的核心元件。ٮA fast-spinning gyro resists changes to its spin axis. Mounted on a craft, shifts of that axis against the airframe reveal pitch, roll, and yaw—core to inertial navigation.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�86efdb08d3b4�body���状态空间法用一组一阶微分方程描述系统内部状态，并写成矩阵形式进行设计和分析。它能方便地处理多输入多输出、时变和非线性系统，是现代控制理论的核心工具。�The state-space method describes a system's internal states with first-order differential equations in matrix form for design and analysis. It readily handles multiple-input multiple-output, time-varying, and nonlinear systems and is central to modern control theory.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�8771d2340db3�body��热机靠高温热源与低温冷源之间的温差做功，热力学第二定律规定：一部分热量必须作为废热排给冷源。理想卡诺热机的效率等于1减去冷源温度与热源温度之比，是任何实际热机的上限。热源温度越高、冷源温度越低，效率越高——这就是为什么燃气轮机、超临界锅炉都在追求更高的初温，冷源则尽量利用低温海水。实际热机还要扣除各种不可逆损失：汽油机约25%到30%，现代联合循环燃气轮机可达60%左右。��A heat engine works from the temperature difference between a hot reservoir and a cold one, and the second law of thermodynamics dictates that some heat must be dumped to the cold reservoir as waste. The ideal Carnot efficiency, 1 minus the cold-to-hot temperature ratio, is the upper bound no real engine can exceed. Higher hot-source temperature and lower cold-source temperature raise efficiency — which is why gas turbines and supercritical boilers chase ever-higher inlet temperatures while cold sinks use cold seawater. Real engines lose more to irreversibility: gasoline engines manage about 25-30%, while modern combined-cycle gas turbines reach around 60%.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�885c458cf038�body��基孔制以基准孔H为基准，改变轴的公差带位置得到不同配合；基轴制以基准轴h为基准，改变孔的公差带。配合按间隙分为三类：间隙配合（恒有间隙，可相对运动）、过盈配合（恒有过盈，靠变形传递力）、过渡配合（可能间隙可能过盈，用于定位）。孔一般用铰刀、镗刀等定尺寸刀具加工，改变孔径要换刀，而轴由车刀调整即可，所以优先固定孔、调整轴，这就是基孔制更常用的原因。��In the hole-basis system the basic hole H is fixed and shaft tolerance zones are varied to create different fits; the shaft-basis system fixes the basic shaft h and varies the hole. Fits divide into three classes by clearance: clearance fits (always a gap, allowing relative motion), interference fits (always tight, transmitting load by deformation) and transition fits (either, used for location). Holes are usually made with fixed-size tools such as reamers or boring bars, changing hole size means changing tooling, while the shaft is sized simply by adjusting the lathe tool, so it is cheaper to hold the hole and vary the shaft, which is why the hole-basis system dominates.�ans��src��"国际标准化组织（ISO 286）�'ISO 286 (ISO system of limits and fits)��id�8ec9e8077569�body���Fazlur Khan 在芝加哥提出把建筑外围密柱与深梁组成整体『外筒』，像一根空心管筒抵抗风与地震的水平力，内部空间因此可自由布置。束筒、框筒等变体让 100 层以上的建筑成为现实。�Fazlur Khan in Chicago grouped perimeter closely-spaced columns and deep beams into an integral 'outer tube' that resists wind and seismic lateral loads like a hollow tube, freeing the interior. Bundled and framed-tube variants made 100-plus-story towers feasible.�ans��src��OKhan《高层结构体系》(1972)；美国 CTBUH《高层建筑结构设计》�jKhan, 'Influence of design on tall steel buildings' (1972); CTBUH, 'Structural Systems for Tall Buildings'��id�8faf8c2bd08a�body���增材制造按三维模型逐层堆积材料，几乎不受复杂内腔与拓扑优化的几何限制，且材料浪费少；Hull 在 1984 年发明立体光刻(SLA)。它适合小批量、个性化与一体化构件。�Additive manufacturing builds material layer by layer from a 3D model, free of most geometry limits imposed by internal cavities and topology optimization, and wastes little material. Hull invented stereolithography (SLA) in 1984. It suits low-volume, personalized, and integrated parts.�ans��src�ٌGibson, Rosen & Stucker,《Additive Manufacturing Technologies》,2021 (DOI: 10.1007/978-3-030-56127-7)；Hull《立体光刻专利》(1986)ٍGibson, Rosen & Stucker, 'Additive Manufacturing Technologies', 2021, DOI: 10.1007/978-3-030-56127-7; Hull, 'Stereolithography patent' (1986)��id�907cb79c665b�body���渗流控制的核心是延长渗径、减小水力坡降和渗透压力，使渗流既不带走地基颗粒（管涌）也不产生过高的扬压力。上游不透水铺盖加长水平渗径，齿墙和灌浆帷幕形成垂直防渗体切断渗流通道，降低坝基扬压力并防止管涌。排水减压设施（减压井、反滤层）则把已渗入的水安全排出，两者配合才能保证大坝稳定。�.The essence of seepage control is lengthening the seepage path to reduce hydraulic gradient and uplift pressure, so that flow neither carries away foundation particles (piping) nor builds excessive uplift under the dam. An impervious upstream blanket lengthens the horizontal path, while a cutoff wall or grouting curtain forms a vertical barrier that interrupts flow paths, lowering uplift and preventing piping. Relief drains, such as relief wells and filters, then discharge the infiltrated water safely, and the two systems together ensure dam stability.�ans��src��8美国陆军工程兵团（USACE，坝工设计手册）�6USACE (US Army Corps of Engineers, Dam Design Manuals)��id�921b6ecc4f49�body��j单结电池的极限主要来自光谱失配：能量低于带隙的光子完全不被吸收，高于带隙的光子多余能量以热载流子弛豫成热，两项损失把 1.1 eV 硅的理论效率压在约 33% 以内。叠层把带隙约 1.6–1.7 eV 的钙钛矿放在顶层吸收蓝绿光并输出更高电压，让红外光透射到底部硅电池吸收，热化损失大幅减少，双结理论极限提高到 40% 以上。工程上两个子电池串联，需要电流匹配、透明复合（隧穿）层以及钙钛矿在湿热与紫外下的稳定性，目前实验室两端叠层认证效率已超过 30%。��The single-junction ceiling comes mainly from spectral mismatch: photons below the band gap are not absorbed at all, while excess energy of higher-energy photons thermalizes as heat, capping 1.1 eV silicon near 33 percent. A tandem puts a wide-gap perovskite of about 1.6–1.7 eV on top to harvest blue-green light at higher voltage and transmits infrared light to the silicon bottom cell, cutting thermalization losses and lifting the two-junction theoretical limit above 40 percent. In practice the sub-cells are series connected, so current matching, a transparent recombination or tunnel layer, and perovskite stability against humidity, heat and UV govern real devices; certified two-terminal tandems have now passed 30 percent.�ans��src��tShockley 与 Queisser，Journal of Applied Physics 32, 510（1961）；NREL《Best Research-Cell Efficiency Chart》�jShockley & Queisser, Journal of Applied Physics 32, 510 (1961); NREL 'Best Research-Cell Efficiency Chart'��id�9367b20ff8bb�body��8燃烧室内温度可达三千摄氏度以上，远超金属熔点。再生冷却在室壁内开出许多细密通道，让低温燃料先流过通道带走热量，再进入喷注器燃烧。这样壁面被持续冷却，同时燃料被预热，燃烧更完全，热量没有白白浪费，因此称为再生。��Combustion gases can exceed three thousand degrees Celsius, far above the melting point of metals. Regenerative cooling runs many fine channels through the chamber wall so that cold fuel flows through them, carries heat away, and only then enters the injector to burn. The wall is continuously cooled while the fuel is preheated, improving combustion, so the heat is recycled rather than wasted, which is why it is called regenerative.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�93aec28e033e�body���ZMP 是地面上合压力中心的等效点；只要它落在支撑脚的多边形内，地面就能提供不引起翻倒的力和力矩。控制器实时调整步态与躯干姿态，把 ZMP 保持在支撑域内以维持平衡。��The ZMP is the point where the net ground reaction's moment is zero; if it stays inside the support polygon, the ground can supply forces without tipping. The controller adjusts gait and torso posture to keep ZMP within the support region for balance.�ans��src��QVukobratović & Borovac，《零力矩点——三十五年的发展》（2004）�UVukobratović & Borovac, 'Zero-Moment Point — Thirty Five Years of Its Life' (2004)��id�9433057ce764�body��t反作用轮通过改变自身转速与星体交换角动量，实现精细无污染的姿态控制，但长期受重力梯度、气动等干扰力矩作用会不断加速，最终饱和。磁力矩器让线圈电流与地磁场作用产生外力矩，把多余角动量卸掉，使轮子回到低转速。这种组合在低轨卫星上很常见，几乎不消耗工质。�Reaction wheels exchange angular momentum with the spacecraft by changing their own speed, giving fine, contamination-free attitude control, but persistent disturbance torques from gravity gradient and aerodynamics keep spinning them up until they saturate. Magnetic torquers pass current through coils that interact with Earth's magnetic field to produce an external torque, dumping the excess momentum and returning the wheels to low speed. This pairing is common on low-Earth-orbit satellites and consumes almost no propellant.�ans��src��,Wertz《航天器姿态动力学与控制》�/Wertz, Spacecraft Attitude Dynamics and Control��id�94f5c431fdb7�body���用光刻法：在硅片上涂感光胶，用掩模把电路图案曝光到胶上，再腐蚀或沉积出层层导线和晶体管，每层都要反复曝光对齐，线宽可细到几纳米。��Photolithography coats the wafer with light-sensitive resist, exposes the circuit pattern through a mask, then etches or deposits layers of wires and transistors, repeating and aligning many times down to nanometer features.�ans��src��SPlummer、Deal & Griffin，《硅VLSI技术：基础、实践与建模》（2000）�^Plummer, Deal & Griffin, 'Silicon VLSI Technology: Fundamentals, Practice and Modeling' (2000)��id�9574cd6d4285�body���自动喷淋由管网、水源、报警阀和喷头组成，火灾初期热烟气上升，喷头处的玻璃球或易熔合金受热达到额定动作温度（如68摄氏度）时破裂或熔化，喷头开启喷水，同时水流启动报警装置。水直接冷却火焰和周围表面、抑制烟气蔓延，系统持续供水直到火灾被控制。关键在于喷头只在局部高温区域开启、响应快，能在火势蔓延前压制火灾，并配合疏散和排烟降低伤亡。��An automatic sprinkler system comprises piping, a water supply, alarm valves and sprinkler heads. As a fire builds, hot smoke rises; when a head's glass bulb or fusible link reaches its rated activation temperature (e.g. 68 degrees Celsius) it bursts or melts, water discharges from that head, and flow triggers the alarm. The water cools the flames and surrounding surfaces and suppresses smoke spread, and the system keeps supplying water until the fire is controlled. The key is that only heads near the fire open, responding in seconds to suppress the fire before it grows, working alongside evacuation and smoke control to reduce casualties.�ans��src��lNFPA 消防与给水排水规范（NFPA 13/14/25/101）；Metcalf & Eddy《废水工程：处理与回用》�iNFPA fire/plumbing codes (NFPA 13/14/25/101); Metcalf & Eddy, Wastewater Engineering: Treatment and Reuse��id�977759967d20�body�ٓ靠超级保温、无热桥、气密性和热回收新风，把冷热需求压到极低，主要靠环境得热和人体设备散热维持舒适。كExtreme insulation, airtightness, and heat-recovery ventilation shrink demand so comfort comes from passive gains, not active HVAC.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�984e2ed913db�body��3RISC（精简指令集）采用固定长度、少而规整的指令，靠load/store与大量寄存器并易于流水化，如 ARM、RISC-V。CISC（复杂指令集）指令功能强、长度可变、寄存器较少且多靠微程序，如 x86；现代 x86 内部仍解码为微操作，二者走向融合。�'RISC uses a small, regular, fixed-length instruction set with load/store and many registers that pipelines easily, e.g., ARM and RISC-V. CISC has powerful, variable-length instructions, fewer registers, and microcode, e.g., x86; modern x86 still decodes to micro-operations, so the two converge.�ans��src��OACM/IEEE；Hennessy & Patterson《计算机体系结构：量化研究方法》�PACM/IEEE; Hennessy & Patterson, 'Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach'��id�98dd7be0b95d�body���六西格玛是一套以数据驱动的质量管理方法，目标是在考虑1.5σ偏移时每百万机会缺陷数不超过3.4。它用 DMAIC 流程与统计过程控制（SPC）持续降低过程变异。��Six Sigma is a data-driven quality methodology aiming for no more than 3.4 defects per million opportunities (with a 1.5σ shift). It uses the DMAIC roadmap and statistical process control (SPC) to continuously reduce process variation.�ans��src��A美国质量学会（ASQ）；Harry & Schroeder《六西格玛》�hAmerican Society for Quality (ASQ); Harry & Schroeder, 'Six Sigma: The Breakthrough Management Strategy'��id�9a4e69155b4b�body�٥无人机边飞边用摄像头或激光测距拍下大量重叠照片，软件把照片拼合并用三角测量算出每个点的高度，生成三维地形模型。ٲFlying overhead, a drone takes many overlapping photos or laser range scans; software stitches them and uses triangulation to compute each point's height into a 3D terrain model.�ans��src��:Thrun、Burgard & Fox，《概率机器人学》（2005）�5Thrun, Burgard & Fox, 'Probabilistic Robotics' (2005)��id�9a9beead09e0�body��"SLAM 通过递推估计机器人位姿，误差会随路径累积漂移；闭环检测在重访已建区域时识别出重复场景，用约束把累积误差全局修正回零点。没有闭环，长期运行的地图会严重失真，因此它是实现一致、可复用地图的关键。�)SLAM estimates pose recursively, so error drifts cumulatively along the path; loop closure recognizes a revisited area and applies a constraint that corrects accumulated error globally back to zero. Without it, long runs yield severely distorted maps, so it is key to consistent, reusable mapping.�ans��src��*Science Robotics（SLAM 与自主导航）�1Science Robotics (SLAM and autonomous navigation)��id�9c68af8675ea�body��>金属永久支架长期留存可能引发慢性炎症、晚期血栓与服药依赖；可降解支架在血管修复完成后逐渐吸收，恢复血管自然舒缩。难点在于聚乳酸等材料的降解速率要与内皮愈合匹配，且在支撑期内保持足够径向强度，降解产物还需生物相容。�jPermanent metal stents can provoke chronic inflammation, late thrombosis, and lifelong medication; a biodegradable stent is absorbed after the vessel heals, restoring natural compliance. The challenge is matching polymer (e.g., PLLA) degradation to endothelial healing while keeping enough radial strength during support, with biocompatible degradation products.�ans��src��_Ratner、Hoffman、Schoen & Lemons，《生物材料科学：医用材料导论》（第3版）�lRatner, Hoffman, Schoen & Lemons, 'Biomaterials Science: An Introduction to Materials in Medicine' (3rd ed.)��id�9ecff8db0521�body���这是氯离子引起的应力腐蚀开裂：拉应力（包括焊接残余应力）、敏感材料与氯离子介质同时存在时，氯离子在局部击穿钝化膜，裂尖金属持续溶解而侧壁重新钝化，裂纹便以极窄的分支形态穿晶扩展。宏观上几乎没有失重和塑性变形，外观看不出腐蚀，却可能在远低于屈服强度的应力下穿透管壁，典型场景是保温层下的 304/316 管道和泳池上方的不锈钢吊挂件。对策包括改用高钼、双相或超级奥氏体钢，焊后消除残余应力，控制保温层浸水与氯含量，并避免不锈钢长期停留在 50–150 ℃ 的含氯冷凝环境。��This is chloride stress-corrosion cracking, which needs tensile stress (including welding residual stress), a susceptible alloy and chloride ions together: chlorides locally break down the passive film, the crack tip keeps dissolving while flanks repassivate, and a very narrow branching transgranular crack advances. There is almost no weight loss or visible deformation, yet a wall can be penetrated at stresses far below yield, the classic cases being 304/316 piping under wet insulation and stainless suspension parts above swimming pools. Countermeasures are higher-molybdenum, duplex or super-austenitic grades, post-weld stress relief, keeping insulation dry and low in chloride, and avoiding prolonged service in chloride condensate around 50–150 °C.�ans��src��Q《ASM Handbook, Vol. 13A: Corrosion — Fundamentals, Testing, and Protection》�M'ASM Handbook, Vol. 13A: Corrosion — Fundamentals, Testing, and Protection'��id�a080084507a6�body��&月球几乎没有大气与液态水，无法像地球那样用水泥或沥青黏结，且能源受限难以达到常规烧结高温。研究用微波、聚焦太阳能或选择性烧结使月壤中玻璃相与氧化物局部熔融黏结，但需低能耗工艺并对月壤成分差异鲁棒。�vThe Moon has essentially no atmosphere or liquid water, so Earth-like cement or asphalt binders are unavailable, and limited energy makes conventional high-temperature sintering hard. Research uses microwave, concentrated solar, or selective sintering to locally melt the glassy and oxide phases in regolith, but needs low-energy processes robust to compositional variation.�ans��src�ټKaczmarzyk,《Preliminary feasibility analysis of microwave sintering of lunar regolith simulant at glass softening temperature》, MATERIAŁY BUDOWLANE, 2025 (DOI: 10.15199/33.2025.06.14)ٸKaczmarzyk, 'Preliminary feasibility analysis of microwave sintering of lunar regolith simulant at glass softening temperature', MATERIAŁY BUDOWLANE, 2025, DOI: 10.15199/33.2025.06.14��id�a0f96e80f298�body���三个环带宽依次降低，最内的电流环直接控制转矩，响应最快，负责抑制电压扰动并限制过流；中间速度环控制转速，抑制负载扰动；最外位置环保证最终定位精度。分层设计让每一环只面对被内环整理过的简洁对象，参数调试可以由内向外逐层进行。若内环带宽不足，外环无论怎么调都难以稳定。�The three loops have successively lower bandwidth: the innermost current loop directly controls torque, responds fastest, and rejects supply disturbances while limiting overcurrent; the middle speed loop regulates rotational speed and rejects load disturbances; the outer position loop delivers final positioning accuracy. This layering lets each loop face a simple plant already tamed by the loop inside it, so tuning proceeds from inside out. If the inner loop lacks bandwidth, no amount of outer-loop tuning will make the system stable.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�a14ad729613e�body�ٽMRI利用强磁场使体内氢原子自旋对齐，再用射频脉冲扰动，停止后氢原子释放电磁波信号，由接收线圈和算法重建出软组织图像，无电离辐射。ٹMRI aligns hydrogen atoms with a strong magnet, perturbs them with radiofrequency pulses, then detects the emitted signals to reconstruct soft-tissue images, with no ionizing radiation.�ans��src��^Kak & Slaney《CT 原理》；Haacke 等《MRI 原理》；超声成像（Hendee & Ritenour）هKak & Slaney, Principles of Computerized Tomographic Imaging; Haacke et al., Magnetic Resonance Imaging; ultrasound (Hendee & Ritenour)��id�a27acaf4fb58�body�ٷ电容器由两片导体中间夹绝缘层构成，能快速充放电储存电能。它常用来滤波平滑电压、耦合信号、定时，以及在断电瞬间提供短暂电力。ٱA capacitor is two conductors separated by insulation that stores charge and releases it quickly; it smooths voltage, couples signals, sets timing, and bridges brief power gaps.�ans��src��-Nilsson & Riedel，《电路》（第11版）�0Nilsson & Riedel, 'Electric Circuits' (11th ed.)��id�a355b0319356�body��n预应力混凝土是在承受外荷载前预先对混凝土施加压应力，以抵消服役期的拉应力、延缓开裂。先张法是先张拉钢筋再浇筑混凝土，待混凝土硬化后放张，靠粘结力传递预压应力；后张法是先浇筑并预留孔道，混凝土硬化后再穿筋张拉并用锚具锁定，预压应力靠锚具直接传递。��Prestressed concrete is pre-compressed before service loads to counteract tensile stresses and delay cracking. In pretensioning, tendons are tensioned before the concrete is cast and the stress is transferred by bond after hardening; in post-tensioning, tendons are tensioned after the concrete hardens inside ducts and anchored with end fittings, transmitting the stress directly through the anchors.�ans��src��d美国混凝土学会（ACI）ACI 318；国际结构混凝土联合会（fib）《Model Code 2010》�sAmerican Concrete Institute (ACI) ACI 318; fib (International Federation for Structural Concrete) 'Model Code 2010'��id�a392eb1a944d�body��;服务航天器需在轨道上与失稳、可能无动力的客户星对接并锁固，二者耦合后质心、惯量突变，任何相对运动都会通过引力梯度与推力耦合放大。控制必须同时保证相对位姿稳定、避免碰撞并补偿燃料消耗带来的质量变化，容错要求极高。�oThe servicer must dock and lock with an unstable, possibly powerless client in orbit; once coupled, the combined center of mass and inertia shift abruptly, and any relative motion is amplified through gravity-gradient and thrust coupling. Control must hold relative pose, avoid collision, and compensate mass change from fuel use, with extremely high fault tolerance.�ans��src��,Wertz《航天器姿态动力学与控制》�/Wertz, Spacecraft Attitude Dynamics and Control��id�a52a064ec48e�body��状态估计利用冗余的遥测与支路潮流量测，以量测误差方差的倒数作为权重，最小化量测值与模型计算值之差的加权平方和，从而求得最可信的电压幅值与相角。其前提是网络拓扑与线路参数已知。�MState estimation uses redundant telemetry and branch-flow measurements, weighting each by the inverse of its error variance, to minimize the weighted sum of squared differences between measurements and model outputs, yielding the most reliable bus voltage magnitudes and angles. It assumes known network topology and line parameters.�ans��src��dAbur & Expósito《Power System State Estimation: Theory and Implementation》，Marcel Dekker, 2004�_Abur & Expósito, Power System State Estimation: Theory and Implementation, Marcel Dekker, 2004��id�a5fb46c1d358�body��
气孔源于熔池中溶解的气体（氢、氮或一氧化碳）在快速凝固时来不及逸出而被困在焊缝中，氢的主要来源是水分和油污，因此焊前清理和干燥极为重要。夹渣是熔渣未充分浮出或前道焊渣未清净被夹在焊道之间，多因焊接速度过快、电流过小或坡口清理不彻底。热裂纹发生在凝固末期，因晶界存在低熔点共晶（如硫磷偏析物），在收缩应力下沿晶界开裂，与硫磷含量和接头拘束度密切相关。��Porosity forms when dissolved gases in the pool (hydrogen, nitrogen or carbon monoxide) are trapped as the weld metal solidifies quickly; hydrogen comes mainly from moisture and oil, so pre-cleaning and drying matter greatly. Slag inclusions result when slag fails to float out or previous weld slag is not fully removed and gets trapped between passes, typically from excessive speed, low current or poor groove cleaning. Hot cracking occurs at the end of solidification when low-melting-point eutectics (e.g. sulphur and phosphorus segregates) along grain boundaries tear under shrinkage stress; it is closely tied to S and P content and joint restraint.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�aa8b46ebc191�body���当飞行速度超过声速，前方压力信息来不及向前传播，被压缩堆积成一道近似不连续的激波，导致压强、温度和密度骤升。所有扰动被限制在机后一个以马赫角为半顶角的圆锥（马赫锥）内。�Once flight exceeds the speed of sound, pressure information cannot propagate ahead, so disturbances pile up into a near-discontinuous shock where pressure, temperature, and density jump. All disturbances are confined behind a cone of half-angle equal to the Mach angle.�ans��src��\Anderson《现代可压缩流动》(Modern Compressible Flow)；Mach《激波研究》(1887)�SAnderson, 'Modern Compressible Flow'; Mach, 'On supersonic projectile shock' (1887)��id�ac2d7688a28a�body���当逆压梯度足够大时，边界层内靠近壁面的流体动能被耗尽、出现回流，边界层从壁面脱离形成分离区与尾涡。分离显著增大压差阻力，并可能导致失速。�␀Under a sufficiently strong adverse pressure gradient, near-wall fluid in the boundary layer loses momentum and reverses, causing the layer to detach and form a separated wake with vortices. Separation sharply increases pressure drag and can trigger stall.�ans��src��HSchlichting & Gersten《Boundary-Layer Theory》（Springer，第8版）�6Schlichting & Gersten, Boundary-Layer Theory, Springer��id�acc10a8d08f4�body��S纯力控制直接把接触力当作被控量，力指令给定后位置随环境变化。阻抗控制则规定机器人末端表现出的刚度、阻尼和惯量，像一个可调的弹簧阻尼器，位置偏差自然转换为力。这样在环境刚度未知或接触瞬间也能保持稳定，更适合打磨、装配等接触作业。��Pure force control makes the contact force itself the controlled variable, letting position drift with the environment once a force command is given. Impedance control instead prescribes the stiffness, damping and inertia the end effector appears to have, behaving like an adjustable spring-damper in which position error naturally becomes force. This stays stable even when environment stiffness is unknown or at the instant of impact, which suits polishing and assembly tasks.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�ad2e5cc4b893�body���强夯法用重锤从高处自由下落，冲击地面产生强烈应力波，使疏松土体颗粒重新排列、孔隙减小、强度提高，常用于填土、砂土和湿陷性黄土的加固。��Dynamic compaction drops a heavy weight from height; the impact sends stress waves that rearrange loose soil particles, reduce voids, and raise strength, often used for fills, sands, and collapsible loess.�ans��src��+Das，《岩土工程原理》（第9版）�7Das, 'Principles of Geotechnical Engineering' (9th ed.)��id�ad7f71d29a46�body��李雅普诺夫思想是不直接解微分方程，而构造一个随状态趋近平衡点而递减的能量型函数（正定且导数负定）来判定稳定。第二法只需验证函数性质，无需知道系统轨迹，特别适合非线性与时变系统。�ZLyapunov's idea is to avoid solving differential equations and instead construct an energy-like function that decreases toward the equilibrium (positive definite with negative-definite derivative) to prove stability. The second method only checks the function's properties without knowing trajectories, suiting nonlinear and time-varying systems.�ans��src��6Khalil《非线性系统》（电子工业出版社）�Nonlinear Systems, Khalil��id�af7fbc8d31d1�body���反应堆里铀-235 受中子轰击发生链式裂变，释放的热由冷却剂带走，经蒸汽发生器产生蒸汽驱动汽轮机发电。Fermi 在 1942 年建成首座可控链式反应堆，控制棒和吸收体用来调节功率与安全停堆。�In the reactor, uranium-235 fissions in a chain reaction when struck by neutrons; the released heat is carried by coolant to a steam generator that drives a turbine. Fermi built the first controlled chain reactor in 1942; control rods and absorbers regulate power and safe shutdown.�ans��src��uLamarsh《核工程导论》(Introduction to Nuclear Engineering)；Fermi《首座反应堆》(1942, 获 1938 诺奖)�aLamarsh, 'Introduction to Nuclear Engineering'; Fermi, 'First nuclear reactor' (1942, Nobel 1938)��id�afaa740b2284�body���弯曲时中性面附近几乎不受力，材料离中性面越远越出力。瓦楞和蜂窝把两张薄皮撑开，让皮承担拉压，几乎全是空气的芯只传剪力并防皮起皱。薄皮的抗弯贡献随它到中性面的距离平方增长：皮间距拉远到三倍，同样多的纸抗弯约涨九倍，重量增得很少。但要注意省的是同重量，同体积实心板仍更硬；它只在垂直于波纹的方向强，横向压、压痕与受潮先失效。��Bending leaves the middle of a section nearly unloaded and puts the work on material far from that neutral surface. Corrugation and honeycomb stand two thin skins apart so the skins take tension and compression while the near-air core only carries shear and props them against wrinkling. A skin's contribution grows with the square of its distance from the neutral surface: skins three times farther apart make the same paper roughly nine times as bend-resistant, with little added weight. The saving is per unit weight—a solid slab of the same volume is stiffer—and the panel is strong only across its corrugations, since sideways compression, dents and damp fail first.�ans��src��&Gibson & Ashby《多孔固体》(1997)�&Gibson & Ashby, Cellular Solids (1997)��id�afe1b1532dc2�body���这是切削中的再生颤振：刀齿在上一转留下的波纹表面上切削，切厚随之波动，切削力波动又激起机床—刀具系统的模态振动，若相邻两转之间振动相位不利，振幅就自激放大。稳定性取决于主轴转速与结构模态频率之比，因此在转速—切深平面上存在交替的稳定与不稳定区（稳定性叶瓣图），转速落在叶瓣峰值处可用的极限切深比谷底大出数倍。工程上通过锤击试验测出频响函数算出叶瓣图来选转速，或采用不等齿距刀具和变转速调制打破再生反馈，而单纯减小进给对颤振门限影响很小。�:This is regenerative chatter in cutting: each tooth machines a surface already waved by the previous pass, so chip thickness oscillates, the fluctuating force excites the machine-tool structure's modes, and an unfavourable phase between successive revolutions makes the vibration self-amplify. Stability depends on the ratio of spindle speed to modal frequency, producing alternating stable and unstable regions in the speed-depth plane — the stability lobe diagram — where sitting on a lobe peak allows several times the limiting depth of cut available in a valley. Practice measures the frequency response by tap testing to compute those lobes and select speed, or breaks the regenerative feedback with variable-pitch cutters and spindle-speed modulation, whereas simply reducing feed barely moves the chatter threshold.�ans��src�ًAltintas，《Manufacturing Automation: Metal Cutting Mechanics, Machine Tool Vibrations, and CNC Design》（第2版，Cambridge，2012）فAltintas, 'Manufacturing Automation: Metal Cutting Mechanics, Machine Tool Vibrations, and CNC Design' (2nd ed., Cambridge, 2012)��id�b024934395b7�body��z白炽灯靠电流把灯丝加热到高温、以热辐射发光，绝大部分电能变成热；LED 则是电子与空穴在半导体 pn 结复合时把能量直接转成光子，属于电致发光，发热少、光效高得多。赤崎勇、天野浩与中村修二研制出高效蓝光 LED，使白光半导体照明成为可能，三人共获 2014 年诺贝尔物理学奖。��An incandescent bulb heats a filament until it glows by thermal radiation, wasting most of the energy as heat; an LED instead converts energy directly into photons when electrons and holes recombine at a semiconductor p-n junction—electroluminescence, with far less heat and much higher efficacy. Akasaki, Amano, and Nakamura developed the efficient blue LED that made white solid-state lighting possible and shared the 2014 Nobel Prize in Physics.�ans��src���Nakamura 等《蓝光 LED 与激光》(1990s)；Holonyak & Bevacqua,《COHERENT (VISIBLE) LIGHT EMISSION FROM Ga(As1− x P x ) JUNCTIONS》,Applied Physics Letters,1962 (DOI: 10.1063/1.1753706)；2014 诺贝尔奖委员会��Nakamura et al., 'Blue LEDs and lasers' (1990s); Holonyak & Bevacqua, 'COHERENT (VISIBLE) LIGHT EMISSION FROM Ga(As1− x P x ) JUNCTIONS', Applied Physics Letters, 1962, DOI: 10.1063/1.1753706; Nobel Committee 2014��id�b0292a2959af�body��M植物生长通过光合作用把大气二氧化碳固定进生物质，燃烧这些生物质发电时再把碳释放，若配套捕集并地质封存所排放的二氧化碳，整个链条从大气中净移除碳。其负排放能力取决于可持续生物质供应、土地与水的真实核算，以及封存的长期可靠性。�lPlants fix atmospheric CO2 into biomass via photosynthesis; burning that biomass for power releases the carbon, and if the emitted CO2 is captured and geologically stored, the chain yields a net removal from the atmosphere. Its negative-emission potential depends on sustainable biomass supply, honest land- and water-accounting, and long-term storage reliability.�ans��src��9Twidell & Weir，《可再生能源资源》（第3版）�6Twidell & Weir, 'Renewable Energy Resources' (3rd ed.)��id�b045a1f09326�body���VCU是整车动力系统的决策中枢，采集加速和制动踏板、挡位、车速、电池及电机状态等信息，根据驾驶员意图和车辆安全边界计算电机扭矩指令并下发给电机控制器。扭矩请求综合考虑踏板开度与速率、当前车速和电池允许功率：低速起步大扭矩、高速适度降扭，同时必须受电机峰值扭矩特性和电池放电能力约束，并协调能量回收制动与液压制动的分配。�?The VCU is the decision centre of the EV powertrain: it reads the accelerator and brake pedals, gear, vehicle speed, battery and motor states, computes a motor torque command from driver intent and safety limits, and sends it to the motor controller. Torque demand weighs pedal position and rate, current speed, and the battery's allowable power, high torque for launch at low speed and reduced torque at high speed, while always respecting the motor's torque envelope and the battery's discharge capability, and it also arbitrates between regenerative and hydraulic braking.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�b17743098efd�body��链路预算把发射功率、天线增益、自由空间损耗、大气吸收、雨衰和接收机灵敏度等叠加起来计算链路余量。自由空间损耗随频率的平方和距离的平方增大，静止轨道卫星距离远，单跳损耗巨大。雨衰源于雨滴对电磁波的吸收和散射，频率越高波长越短，雨滴尺寸越接近波长，衰减越严重，因此Ku/Ka频段大雨时可能损失数dB甚至十几dB。工程上用衰减余量、自适应编码调制和上行功率控制来对抗。�WA link budget sums transmit power, antenna gains, free-space loss, atmospheric absorption, rain fade and receiver sensitivity to yield the link margin. Free-space loss rises with the square of both frequency and distance, and geostationary satellites are so far away that one hop loses tens of dB. Rain fade comes from absorption and scattering by raindrops; as frequency rises, drop size approaches the wavelength, so attenuation grows, and in the Ku/Ka bands heavy rain can cost several to over ten dB. Fade margins, adaptive coding and modulation, and uplink power control are used to counter it.�ans��src��+Clarke 1945（地球静止轨道）；Wertz�AClarke (1945, geostationary orbit); Wertz, Space Mission Analysis��id�b1e237e43a8a�body���相图用温度和成分等坐标描述合金在不同条件下由哪些相组成，例如钢的铁碳相图。工程师依据相图选择热处理工艺和成分，以获得所需的组织和性能。�A phase diagram shows which phases an alloy consists of under different conditions such as temperature and composition, like the iron-carbon diagram for steel. Engineers use it to choose heat treatments and compositions that yield desired microstructures and properties.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�b325327875fa�body��3渐开线是"线绕圆无滑动展开时端点留下的轨迹"，它有一个独特性质：两个渐开线齿廓啮合时，公法线始终是两基圆的公共内公切线，啮合线是一条固定直线。这意味着瞬时传动比恒定，传动平稳无冲击；而且即使中心距因轴承磨损或装配误差略有改变，传动比仍然不变，这叫传动的可分性。此外啮合过程以纯滚动为主、兼有少量滑动，便于油膜润滑。直线或圆弧齿形会在节圆附近产生冲击和干涉，因此很少用于动力传动。��An involute is the curve traced by the end of a string unwinding without slipping from a circle, and it has a unique property: as two involute profiles mesh, their common normal is always the internal common tangent of the two base circles, so the line of action is a fixed straight line. That means the instantaneous velocity ratio is constant, giving smooth shock-free transmission; and the ratio stays constant even if the center distance shifts slightly due to bearing wear or assembly error — the property of separability. Meshing is mostly pure rolling with a little sliding, which helps oil-film lubrication. Straight or circular teeth would impact and interfere near the pitch circle, so they are rarely used for power transmission.�ans��src��《机械设计基础》�Fundamentals of Machine Design��id�b327358d2e14�body��Z切尔诺贝利用的是苏联RBMK型反应堆，它有一个致命设计缺陷，即正空泡系数：冷却水汽化形成气泡反而会增加反应性，功率越高这种正反馈越强。事故当晚操作员在计划外的低功率、低水流量状态下试验，把安全棒大部分抽出，加上操纵员干预跳闸保护，导致反应堆进入功率快速攀升的正反馈状态，瞬间功率飙升引发蒸汽爆炸，摧毁堆芯并掀翻堆顶。大量放射性物质泄漏，成为人类历史上最严重的核事故，事故分析和IAEA的报告深刻改变了核安全理念。��Chernobyl used a Soviet RBMK reactor with a fatal design flaw, a positive void coefficient: when coolant water boils into steam bubbles, reactivity increases, and the feedback strengthens with power. On the night of the accident operators ran an unapproved test at low power and low water flow, withdrawing most of the control rods and overriding trip protection, pushing the reactor into a rapidly escalating positive-feedback state. Power surged out of control, causing a steam explosion that destroyed the core and blew the lid off the reactor building, releasing huge amounts of radioactivity. The accident and IAEA analyses fundamentally reshaped nuclear safety philosophy.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�b6631a6c83da�body���屈曲是受压细长构件在远未达到材料强度时，因侧向挠曲而突然丧失承载能力的现象。欧拉临界荷载公式表明，柱的临界力与长度平方成反比、与刚度成正比，所以越细长越容易失稳。�<Buckling is the sudden loss of load capacity of a compressed slender member through lateral bowing, long before material strength is reached. Euler's critical-load formula shows buckling load is inversely proportional to length squared and proportional to stiffness, so the slimmer the column, the easier it buckles.�ans��src��E刘鸿文 主编,《材料力学》第6版,高等教育出版社,2017�NLiu Hongwen ed., Mechanics of Materials, 6th ed., Higher Education Press, 2017��id�b69b9aba375f�body��光子能量若高于半导体带隙，多余部分以热的形式损失；低于带隙的光子又无法激发电子，因此单结电池的理论效率约 33%。Shockley 与 Queisser 在 1961 年给出这一根本极限，多结和聚光技术用来逼近或突破它。�&Photons with energy above the semiconductor bandgap waste the excess as heat, while photons below it cannot excite electrons, so a single-junction cell tops out near 33%. Shockley and Queisser derived this fundamental limit in 1961; multijunction and concentrator designs approach or exceed it.�ans��src���Shockley, W., Queisser, H.J.,《Detailed Balance Limit of Efficiency of p-n Junction Solar Cells》, Journal of Applied Physics, 1961 (DOI: 10.1063/1.1736034)；Green《太阳能电池原理》٦Shockley, Queisser, 'Detailed Balance Limit of Efficiency of p-n Junction Solar Cells', Journal of Applied Physics, 1961, DOI: 10.1063/1.1736034; Green, 'Solar Cells'��id�b97083437b9a�body���点蚀属于接触疲劳：齿面在赫兹接触应力下反复受载，次表层最大剪应力处萌生裂纹并扩展剥落成麻点，是随循环次数累积的疲劳过程，取决于接触应力水平、材料硬度与钢材洁净度。胶合（擦伤）则是润滑失效引起的瞬时黏着：滑动速度与载荷使油膜过薄、闪温过高，微凸体金属直接黏焊后又被撕开，几分钟内就能毁掉齿面。因此对策方向不同：抗点蚀靠渗碳淬火提高硬度、改善表面粗糙度和降低接触应力；抗胶合靠极压添加剂与合适黏度、降低齿面滑动率、齿形修形和加强冷却。��Pitting is contact fatigue: repeated Hertzian loading nucleates cracks near the depth of maximum shear stress, which grow and spall into small craters, an accumulating process governed by contact stress, hardness and steel cleanliness. Scuffing is instantaneous adhesive failure of the lubricant film: high sliding speed and load thin the film and raise flash temperature until asperities weld and tear, ruining a flank within minutes. The remedies diverge accordingly — pitting resistance comes from case carburizing, higher hardness, smoother finish and lower contact stress, while scuffing resistance comes from extreme-pressure additives and viscosity, lower sliding ratio, profile modification and better cooling.�ans��src��NStachowiak 与 Batchelor，《Engineering Tribology》（第4版，Elsevier）�CStachowiak & Batchelor, 'Engineering Tribology' (4th ed., Elsevier)��id�ba058b7628b5�body��S根本原因是大气中二氧化碳分压极低，必须把海量空气与吸附剂充分接触并以高温或真空解吸，导致风机与再生能耗巨大。降温方向包括开发低再生热、高选择性的固体吸附剂，利用余热或低碳电，以及把捕集与高值利用（如燃料合成）耦合以提高经济性。�wThe root cause is the extremely low CO2 partial pressure in air, forcing huge air contact with sorbents and high-temperature or vacuum desorption, so fan and regeneration energy dominate. Promising reductions include low-regeneration-heat, highly selective solid sorbents, waste heat or low-carbon electricity, and coupling capture with high-value use such as fuel synthesis.�ans��src��#Science（DAC 能耗与经济性）�&Science (DAC energy use and economics)��id�ba7a896cae3e�body��␀它表明火箭能达到的速度增量只取决于排气速度与质量比（起飞质量/末质量）的自然对数，与推力大小无关。这意味着要想高速，必须尽量提高比冲或减轻结构质量，因此多级火箭才成为必然。��It shows the achievable velocity change depends only on exhaust velocity and the natural log of the mass ratio (initial/final), not on thrust magnitude. To go fast you must raise specific impulse or cut structural mass, which is why staging is essential.�ans��src��xSutton 与 Biblarz《火箭推进元件》(Rocket Propulsion Elements)，第 9 版；Tsiolkovsky《太空火箭》(1903)�kSutton & Biblarz, 'Rocket Propulsion Elements' (9th ed.); Tsiolkovsky, 'Exploration of Cosmic Space' (1903)��id�bbe219572a32�body���EPB盾构把刀盘切削下来的土体充满土舱并保持一定压力，使土舱压力与开挖面前方的水土压力平衡，从而防止掌子面坍塌或涌水。螺旋输送机排土量与掘进速度的匹配决定土舱压力：排土过快导致压力下降、地层塌陷，排土过慢则压力升高，可能引起前方地表隆起或对周边结构产生过大推力。现代盾构还通过注入泡沫等添加剂改善土体塑流性，使压力控制更稳定。�UAn EPB shield fills the excavation chamber with the soil cut by the cutterhead and maintains a set pressure so that the chamber pressure balances the in-situ water and earth pressure ahead, preventing face collapse or water inflow. Matching screw-conveyor discharge to advance speed sets the chamber pressure: discharging too fast drops the pressure and allows ground subsidence, while discharging too slowly raises it and can heave the ground surface or impose excessive thrust. Additives such as foam are often injected to improve the soil's plastic flow behaviour for steadier pressure control.�ans��src��CMaidl、Herrenknecht & Anheuser，《机械化盾构隧道技术》�>Maidl, Herrenknecht & Anheuser, 'Mechanised Shield Tunnelling'��id�bc632580193e�body���高比例新能源经电力电子并网后，系统转动惯量下降、频率稳定性变差。虚拟同步机通过模拟同步发电机的转子惯量与阻尼特性，使逆变器输出具备等效惯量支撑，缓解频率突变。�6High shares of renewables connected via power electronics reduce system rotational inertia and worsen frequency stability. A virtual synchronous machine emulates the inertia and damping of a synchronous generator in the inverter, providing equivalent inertia support and mitigating sudden frequency deviations.�ans��src�٠Zhong, Weiss,《Synchronverters: Inverters That Mimic Synchronous Generators》,IEEE Transactions on Industrial Electronics,2011 (DOI: 10.1109/tie.2010.2048839)ٞZhong, Weiss, 'Synchronverters: Inverters That Mimic Synchronous Generators', IEEE Transactions on Industrial Electronics, 2011, DOI: 10.1109/tie.2010.2048839��id�bcf5d07c060a�body��p人想动手时，大脑的运动指令沿神经传到残肢残留的肌肉，肌肉收缩产生微弱的电信号（肌电，幅值约微伏级）。肌电假肢在残肢表面贴电极捕捉这些信号，经过放大、滤波后提取特征（如幅值和频谱模式），再用模式识别判断使用者的动作意图——是握拳、伸腕还是旋前。控制器再把意图映射为微型直流电机或伺服驱动的假手动作。因为信号来自使用者本人的神经肌肉系统，动作自然、无需切换开关；但肌电信号易受出汗和电极移位干扰，识别准确率仍是研究重点。��When you intend to move, motor commands travel down nerves to the muscles left in the residual limb, which contract and emit faint electrical signals (EMG, on the order of microvolts). A myoelectric prosthesis picks these up with surface electrodes, then amplifies, filters, and extracts features such as amplitude and spectral patterns, and uses pattern recognition to infer the intent — grasp, wrist extension, or pronation. A controller then maps that intent to micro DC motors or servos moving the hand. Because the signals come from the user's own neuromuscular system, the motion feels natural and needs no switch training; but EMG is disturbed by sweat and electrode shift, so recognition accuracy remains an active research focus.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�bd012cbc4812�body��确定性做法只取某条断层的最大可信地震，无法回答这种地震动多久遇到一次，也难以综合多条潜在震源和场地条件的联合影响。PSHA 把震源几何、震级—频度关系、地震动衰减模型及其不确定性组合起来积分，给出场地在给定时间内超越某一加速度水平的年超越概率，即危险性曲线，Cornell 于 1968 年提出了这一框架。工程上据此按后果严重程度选取重现期——一般建筑常用 475 年，重大设施可到数千甚至上万年——并通过危险性解耦找出主控震级与距离，用于挑选输入地震时程。��A deterministic maximum credible earthquake on one fault cannot say how often such motion occurs, nor combine the joint influence of many potential sources and site conditions. PSHA integrates source geometry, magnitude-frequency relations, ground-motion attenuation models and their uncertainties to yield the annual rate at which a site exceeds a given acceleration — the hazard curve — a framework introduced by Cornell in 1968. Engineers then choose a return period according to consequence, typically 475 years for ordinary buildings and up to thousands or tens of thousands of years for critical facilities, and use hazard deaggregation to identify the controlling magnitude and distance for selecting input time histories.�ans��src��tCornell，《Engineering Seismic Risk Analysis》，Bulletin of the Seismological Society of America 58(5)（1968）�kCornell, 'Engineering Seismic Risk Analysis', Bulletin of the Seismological Society of America 58(5) (1968)��id�bd867be817ef�body���脑机接口（BCI）采集脑电信号并解码意图。非侵入式方案用头皮电极帽记录脑电图（EEG），信号弱、噪声大，主要利用事件相关电位（如P300）或运动想象时的感觉运动节律；侵入式方案把电极阵列植入皮层（如犹他阵列），直接记录神经元的锋电位，空间分辨率和信息量大得多，但需要开颅手术，还面临长期生物相容性风险。信号经预处理、特征提取后交给分类器（线性判别分析、支持向量机或深度学习）解码成动作意图，再映射到机械臂或光标。目前受限于信噪比、训练成本和长期稳定性，脑机接口仍主要处于科研与临床试验阶段。��A brain-computer interface (BCI) records brain signals and decodes intent. Non-invasive caps record EEG at the scalp — weak and noisy — relying on event-related potentials like P300 or sensorimotor rhythms during motor imagery; invasive implants such as the Utah array sit on the cortex and record spike trains with far higher spatial resolution and information, but require surgery and carry long-term biocompatibility risks. After preprocessing, feature extraction, and classifiers (LDA, SVMs, or deep networks), the signal is decoded into motor intents and mapped to a robot arm or cursor. Limited by signal-to-noise, training cost, and long-term stability, BCIs still live mainly in research and clinical trials.�ans��src��JBronzino《生物医学工程手册》；医疗器械标准（ISO 13485）�OBronzino, Biomedical Engineering Handbook; medical device standards (ISO 13485)��id�be6028f7a755�body��@某些材料降到临界温度以下时电阻突变为零，且能承载巨大持续电流；BCS 理论用电子配对（库珀对）解释这一现象。液氦冷却的铌钛超导线圈因此能长期维持强磁场供 MRI 使用。Onnes 1911 年发现超导，Bardeen、Cooper、Schrieffer 获 1972 年诺贝尔奖。�mBelow a critical temperature some materials drop to zero resistance and carry huge persistent currents; BCS theory explains this via electron pairing (Cooper pairs). Liquid-helium-cooled niobium-titanium coils thus sustain strong MRI magnetic fields indefinitely. Onnes discovered superconductivity in 1911; Bardeen, Cooper, and Schrieffer won the 1972 Nobel Prize.�ans��src��fBardeen、Cooper 与 Schrieffer《BCS 理论》(Physical Review, 1957)；Onnes《汞的超导》(1911)�zBardeen, Cooper & Schrieffer, 'Theory of Superconductivity' (Phys Rev, 1957); Onnes, 'Superconductivity of mercury' (1911)��id�bfe0ddb6f70c�body��U随高度上升空气密度下降，维持升力所需的真空速升高，失速边界随之上移；同时高空气温低、音速小，飞机更早接近临界马赫数，出现激波诱导分离造成的马赫抖振。两条边界一升一降，在某个高度附近合成很窄的可用速度带，即棺材角，稍慢会失速、稍快会抖振，而转弯时载荷因数增大又会抬高失速速度，进一步压缩余量。因此运行上按重量与温度确定最大巡航高度（含 1.3g 抖振余量），并用自动油门与阶梯爬升把飞机保持在这个安全窗口内。��As altitude rises, thinner air raises the true airspeed needed for lift so the stall boundary climbs, while colder air lowers the speed of sound so the aircraft meets its critical Mach number and shock-induced separation buffet sooner. The two boundaries converge into a narrow usable band — the coffin corner — where flying slightly slower stalls and slightly faster buffets, and the increased load factor of any turn raises stall speed and squeezes the margin further. Operationally a maximum cruise altitude is derived from weight and temperature with a 1.3g buffet margin, and autothrottle plus step climbs keep the aircraft inside that window.�ans��src��}Anderson，《Fundamentals of Aerodynamics》（第6版）；FAA《Airplane Flying Handbook》(FAA-H-8083-3C) 高空运行章�|Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.); FAA 'Airplane Flying Handbook' (FAA-H-8083-3C), high-altitude operations��id�bff054c9b852�body��?固态电池的固-固界面接触差、离子在电极与电解质间的迁移阻力大，导致界面阻抗远高于液态体系，并使倍率性能受限。解决思路包括引入超薄缓冲层、调控界面化学以及用硫化物等更高离子电导的电解质，但仍难兼顾稳定性与量产一致性。��Solid-state cells suffer from poor solid-solid contact and large ion-migration resistance at electrode-electrolyte interfaces, giving far higher interfacial impedance than liquid systems and limiting rate capability. Approaches include ultrathin interlayers, interface chemistry control, and higher-conductivity sulfide electrolytes, but balancing stability with manufacturing consistency remains hard.�ans��src��%Nature Energy（固态电池界面）�.Nature Energy (solid-state battery interfaces)��id�c2bb2697d422�body���太赫兹频段带宽极大但路径损耗与大气吸收随频率急剧上升，传播距离极短且易被障碍物阻断。器件方面高效功放与低噪声接收尚不成熟，波束管理与时频同步也更为苛刻。�Terahertz bands offer huge bandwidth but path loss and atmospheric absorption rise steeply with frequency, giving very short range and easy blockage. Efficient power amplifiers and low-noise receivers are immature, and beam management and synchronization are far stricter.�ans��src�ٽRappaport, Xing, Kanhere, Ju,《Wireless Communications and Applications Above 100 GHz: Opportunities and Challenges for 6G and Beyond》,IEEE Access,2019 (DOI: 10.1109/access.2019.2921522)ٻRappaport, Xing, Kanhere, Ju, 'Wireless Communications and Applications Above 100 GHz: Opportunities and Challenges for 6G and Beyond', IEEE Access, 2019, DOI: 10.1109/access.2019.2921522��id�c34d1af53f1b�body��太沙基有效应力原理指出：土中任一点的总应力等于有效应力与孔隙水压力之和，即 σ' = σ − u。土的强度与变形只取决于有效应力而非总应力，因此排水固结会提高有效应力、增强地基承载力。�MTerzaghi's effective stress principle states that the total stress at a point in soil equals the sum of the effective stress and the pore-water pressure: σ' = σ − u. Soil strength and deformation depend only on the effective stress, not the total stress, so drainage that lowers u increases effective stress and bearing capacity.�ans��src��NK. 太沙基《理论土力学》（1943）；ASTM 土力学相关试验标准�RK. Terzaghi, 'Theoretical Soil Mechanics' (1943); ASTM geotechnical test standards��id�c40bb4ca6a46�body�ٺ在建筑物与地基之间安装橡胶或滑动支座，像软垫一样延长结构周期、吸收地震能量，使上部楼体随地面运动大幅减弱，从而减少震动破坏。ٱFlexible rubber or sliding bearings between the building and ground lengthen its period and absorb seismic energy, so the upper structure moves far less than the shaking ground.�ans��src��+Chopra，《结构动力学》（第5版）�*Chopra, 'Dynamics of Structures' (5th ed.)��id�c6fe02330295�body�ٙ把电力、通信、给水、热力等管线集中放进可通行的隧道，便于检修和扩容、减少反复开膛破路；造价高但寿命长。�~It bundles utilities in a walkable tunnel for easy maintenance and expansion, cutting repeated road digging despite high cost.�ans��src�ٱBickel、Kuesel 与 King《隧道工程手册》(Tunnel Engineering Handbook)，第 2 版；国际隧道与地下空间协会(ITA)《隧道掘进机(TBM)推荐与指南》(2000)ٵBickel, Kuesel & King, 'Tunnel Engineering Handbook' (2nd ed.); International Tunnelling Association (ITA), 'Recommendations and Guidelines for Tunnel Boring Machines (TBMs)' (2000)��id�c7ec2873d0dc�body��&这是疲劳失效。金属在循环应力下，即使峰值远低于屈服强度，微裂纹也会在应力集中处萌生；每一次循环都让裂纹尖端的塑性区反复滑移，裂纹以每循环若干纳米的速率扩展。当裂纹长到临界长度，裂尖应力强度因子K超过材料的断裂韧性Kc时，剩余截面瞬间失稳断裂，宏观上毫无预兆。断口上的贝壳状疲劳辉纹可以反推裂纹的扩展历史。飞机、桥梁、涡轮叶片因此必须按"无限寿命"或"损伤容限"设计并定期检修。��This is fatigue failure. Under cyclic stress — even when the peak is far below yield — microcracks nucleate at stress raisers, and each cycle drives repeated slip in the plastic zone at the crack tip, advancing the crack a few nanometers per cycle. Once the crack reaches a critical length where the stress-intensity factor K exceeds the material's fracture toughness Kc, the remaining section snaps instantly with no macroscopic warning. Clam-shell fatigue striations on the fracture surface can reveal the crack's growth history. Aircraft, bridges, and turbine blades are therefore designed for infinite life or damage tolerance and are inspected on strict schedules.�ans��src��E刘鸿文 主编,《材料力学》第6版,高等教育出版社,2017�NLiu Hongwen ed., Mechanics of Materials, 6th ed., Higher Education Press, 2017��id�c8502af03f69�body���PFR中物料以活塞式流动通过管段，没有轴向混合，反应物浓度沿管长连续下降，反应速率也随之下降，理论上每一微分段都保持较高的推动力。因此在相同转化率下PFR所需体积小于CSTR，且不存在返混造成的转化率损失。缺点是温度控制较困难，强放热反应易出现热点，需要分段冷却或外部换热。��In a PFR the fluid moves like a plug along the tube with no axial mixing, so reactant concentration falls continuously along the length and the reaction rate follows suit; each differential section retains a high driving force. At equal conversion a PFR therefore needs a smaller volume than a CSTR and loses none of the conversion to back-mixing. Its drawback is harder temperature control, strongly exothermic reactions can create hot spots, so staged cooling or external heat exchange is required.�ans��src��4Fogler，《化学反应工程原理》（第5版）�=Fogler, 'Elements of Chemical Reaction Engineering' (5th ed.)��id�ca79714c0622�body���MBR 用微滤或超滤膜取代二沉池，出水悬浮物近零、可直接回用，且污泥浓度高、占地小。代价是膜污染需频繁清洗、能耗与换膜成本高，且对运行维护要求更严。�0MBR replaces the secondary clarifier with micro- or ultrafiltration membranes, giving near-zero suspended solids effluent for direct reuse, high biomass concentration, and small footprint. The cost is membrane fouling needing frequent cleaning, higher energy and replacement cost, and stricter operation.�ans��src��0《膜分离技术》（化学工业出版社）�%Judd, The MBR Book, 2nd ed., Elsevier��id�ce67502f1c66�body��n压气机叶片本质是一排排小机翼，当来流迎角过大或背压过高时叶片会气流分离，失去压升能力。分离扩散到整级后，气流会沿轴向前后剧烈脉动甚至反流，这就是喘振，伴随巨响和推力骤降。它会造成叶片高周疲劳和超温，因此发动机设有可调静叶、放气活门和防喘控制律。��Compressor blades are essentially rows of small aerofoils, and if the incoming flow angle is too large or the back pressure too high the flow separates and the blades stop raising pressure. When separation spreads across a whole stage the flow pulsates violently along the axis and may even reverse, which is surge, accompanied by a loud bang and sudden thrust loss. It causes blade fatigue and overtemperature, so engines fit variable stator vanes, bleed valves and anti-surge control laws.�ans��src��i廉筱纯、吴虎《航空发动机原理》，西北工业大学出版社，循环分析与效率章节�iJ. D. Mattingly, Elements of Gas Turbine Propulsion, McGraw-Hill, cycle analysis chapters on bypass ratio��id�ceffd1ec8b06�body��时效强化先把合金固溶处理成过饱和固溶体，再在室温或升温下时效，析出细小弥散的第二相颗粒以阻碍位错运动，从而提高强度。例如 Al-Cu 系（如2024）在约190℃时效析出 θ' 相，强度显著提升。�TPrecipitation hardening first forms a supersaturated solid solution by solution treatment, then aging at room or elevated temperature precipitates fine, dispersed second-phase particles that impede dislocation motion and raise strength. For example, Al-Cu alloys such as 2024 aged near 190 ℃ form θ' precipitates and gain large strength.�ans��src��PASM International《金属手册》；Callister《材料科学与工程导论》�bASM International, 'ASM Handbook'; Callister, 'Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction'��id�d129cc5bf1dd�body���风轮机要减速气流才能提取动能，但若把风完全拦停，下游空气无法流出、反而无风可吸；Betz 在 1919 年算出能提取的最大功率约为来流动能的 59.3%。实际机组因损耗只能接近这一极限。� A turbine must slow the air to extract kinetic energy, but if it stopped the air completely, downstream flow would stall and no wind would follow; Betz calculated in 1919 that at most about 59.3% of the incoming kinetic power can be captured. Real machines only approach it due to losses.�ans��src��nBetz《风力机最大出力》(1919)；Manwell 等,《Wind Energy Explained》,2002 (DOI: 10.1002/0470846127)�pBetz, 'Maximum of windmill power' (1919); Manwell et al., 'Wind Energy Explained', 2002, DOI: 10.1002/0470846127��id�d160c9f2264e�body���滚动轴承用滚珠或滚子把轴与座圈之间的滑动变为滚动，摩擦系数因此远低于滑动轴承。但载荷集中在极小的赫兹接触椭圆上，接触应力可达 GPa 量级，所以材料和几何精度要求极高。�!Rolling bearings replace sliding between shaft and race with rolling via balls or rollers, giving a much lower friction coefficient than plain bearings. Yet the load concentrates on a tiny Hertzian contact patch, producing gigapascal-level stress, so material and geometry must be precise.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�d2456a4779f0�body��温度、风速、荷载等环境因素会显著改变结构模态频率，其量级常与早期损伤引起的变化相当甚至更大，造成误报。解决依赖长期基线建模、机器学习区分环境效应，或用应变、声发射等多源信息交叉验证损伤。�7Temperature, wind, and loading shift modal frequencies markedly, often as much as or more than early damage does, causing false alarms. Solutions rely on long-term baseline modeling, machine learning to separate environmental effects, or cross-validating with strain and acoustic emission from multiple sources.�ans��src���Le 与 Siedziako,《Finite element-based evaluation of minimum detectable damage in the Magerholm Linkspan under environmental, noise, and damage asymmetry effects》,Structural Health Monitoring,2026 (DOI: 10.1177/14759217261431577)��Le & Siedziako, 'Finite element-based evaluation of minimum detectable damage in the Magerholm Linkspan under environmental, noise, and damage asymmetry effects', Structural Health Monitoring, 2026, DOI: 10.1177/14759217261431577��id�d2a264247c0a�body��␀高纯石英光纤把光约束在纤芯内以全反射传播，并在 1550 nm 附近有极低的本征吸收窗口；配合掺铒光纤放大器可数千公里不靠电信号再生。Kao 在 1966 年论证低损耗光纤可行，获 2009 年诺贝尔奖。�9High-purity silica fiber confines light in the core by total internal reflection and has a very low intrinsic-loss window near 1550 nm; erbium-doped fiber amplifiers let signals span thousands of kilometers without electrical regeneration. Kao proved low-loss fiber feasible in 1966, winning the 2009 Nobel Prize.�ans��src���Kao & Hockham,《Dielectric-fibre surface waveguides for optical frequencies》,Proceedings of the Institution of Electrical Engineers,1966 (DOI: 10.1049/piee.1966.0189)；Keck 等《低损耗光纤》(1970)；IEEE 光子学会��Kao & Hockham, 'Dielectric-fibre surface waveguides for optical frequencies', Proceedings of the Institution of Electrical Engineers, 1966, DOI: 10.1049/piee.1966.0189; Keck et al., 'Low-loss fiber' (1970); IEEE Photonics Society��id�d316b909c187�body���强化学习让机器人通过试错获得奖励信号来逐步学会复杂动作策略，例如行走和抓取。它在仿真中训练后再迁移到真实机器人，可减少对人工编程的依赖。��Reinforcement learning lets a robot learn complex action policies through trial and error guided by reward signals, such as walking and grasping. Trained in simulation and transferred to real robots, it reduces reliance on hand-coded programs.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�d354121ae7c5�body��j实现碳中和要在能源全链条发力：把电力系统的化石燃料换成风、光、水、核等零碳电源，再让交通、供暖、工业"电气化"——电动车、热泵、电炉，这又依赖大规模储能和特高压电网来支撑波动的新能源。钢铁、水泥、航空、化工等难减排行业需要氢冶金、碳捕集利用与封存（CCUS）等尚在商业化早期的技术。还要计算全生命周期排放，最后剩下的少量排放用生态碳汇或碳移除抵消。难点不只是技术，还有电网稳定性、成本以及数十年期能源基础设施的更新换代。��Reaching carbon neutrality demands action across the whole energy chain: replace fossil-fuel generation with zero-carbon wind, solar, hydro, and nuclear, then electrify transport, heating, and industry — EVs, heat pumps, electric furnaces — which in turn relies on massive storage and UHV grids to balance intermittent renewables. Hard-to-abate sectors like steel, cement, aviation, and chemicals need hydrogen metallurgy and carbon capture, utilization and storage (CCUS), still early in commercialization. Life-cycle emissions count too, and the small remainder is offset by carbon sinks or removal. The difficulty is not just technology but grid stability, cost, and replacing decades of energy infrastructure.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d409360b98b0�body���Dijkstra 对所有节点盲目扩展，A* 引入启发函数估计到目标的代价，仅优先扩展有希望的方向，显著减少搜索节点数。在可采纳启发下 A* 仍能保证最优，效率远高于 Dijkstra。��Dijkstra expands nodes blindly, while A* adds a heuristic estimating cost to the goal and prioritizes promising directions, greatly reducing explored nodes. With an admissible heuristic A* still guarantees optimality but is far more efficient.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�d8d0e8ecc775�body���传统直流输电依赖电网换相，需坚强交流系统支撑且无法向无源网络供电。柔性直流采用自换相结构，可独立控制有功与无功，能向孤岛、海上风电场等弱网或无源系统可靠供电。�Conventional line-commutated HVDC relies on line commutation and needs a strong AC system, and cannot supply passive networks. VSC-HVDC is self-commutated, independently controls active and reactive power, and can feed weak or passive systems such as islands and offshore wind farms.�ans��src�ٰFlourentzou、Agelidis 与 Demetriades,《VSC-Based HVDC Power Transmission Systems: An Overview》,IEEE Transactions on Power Electronics,2009 (DOI: 10.1109/tpel.2008.2008441)٫Flourentzou, Agelidis & Demetriades, 'VSC-Based HVDC Power Transmission Systems: An Overview', IEEE Transactions on Power Electronics, 2009, DOI: 10.1109/tpel.2008.2008441��id�db8f46a43663�body���难点在电池能量密度有限导致航程短、噪声扰民、以及任何单点失效都要能安全降落。还需低空交通管理和避撞体系，否则密集楼间飞行风险极高。��Limited battery energy density gives short range, noise annoys, and any single failure must still allow safe landing. It also needs low-altitude traffic management and collision avoidance, or dense flight between buildings is too risky.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�dd6d34f59d6d�body��K标准拓扑优化只追求刚度/重量最优，常生成极薄悬垂与复杂内腔，难以实际打印。工程做法是在优化目标中嵌入制造约束（如最小尺寸、自支撑角度、可移除支撑限制），或用基于机器学习的生成式设计，使所得构型同时满足力学最优与打印可行性。��Standard topology optimization only seeks stiffness-to-weight optimality and often yields ultra-thin overhangs and complex cavities that are hard to print. Engineering practice embeds manufacturing constraints (minimum member size, self-supporting angles, support-removal limits) into the objective, or uses generative design with learned rules, so the result is both mechanically optimal and printable.�ans��src���Rosnitschek, Baumann, Orgeldinger, Alber-Laukant,《Manufacturing Constraints in Topology Optimization for the Direct Manufacturing of Extrusion-Based Additively Manufactured Parts》,Designs,2023 (DOI: 10.3390/designs7010008)��Rosnitschek, Baumann, Orgeldinger, Alber-Laukant, 'Manufacturing Constraints in Topology Optimization for the Direct Manufacturing of Extrusion-Based Additively Manufactured Parts', Designs, 2023, DOI: 10.3390/designs7010008��id�de5c6e32c37e�body���疲劳指材料在循环载荷下，表面微裂纹萌生并逐步扩展，最终在远低于静强度时断裂。工程中用 S-N 曲线描述应力幅与寿命的关系，因此关键承力件都要按疲劳极限而非静强度来设计。�Fatigue is failure under cyclic loading where surface microcracks initiate and grow until the part breaks well below its static strength. Engineers use S-N curves relating stress amplitude to life, so critical parts are designed to a fatigue limit rather than static strength.�ans��src�فSuresh《材料疲劳》(Fatigue of Materials)，第 2 版；Schijve《疲劳损伤机理》(Fatigue of Structures and Materials)�XSuresh, 'Fatigue of Materials' (2nd ed.); Schijve, 'Fatigue of Structures and Materials'��id�deacbda5ec2d�body�ٱ摄像头把画面变成数字像素，算法做边缘、形状和颜色等特征提取，再用训练好的模型分类或定位目标，从而完成检测、识别和引导。ٯA camera turns a scene into pixels; algorithms extract features like edges, shapes and color, and a trained model classifies or locates targets to inspect, recognize or guide.�ans��src��fSiciliano、Sciavicco、Villani & Oriolo，《机器人学：建模、规划与控制》（Springer）�^Siciliano, Sciavicco, Villani & Oriolo, 'Robotics: Modelling, Planning and Control' (Springer)��id�debe62706164�body�ِ靠黑启动：先用自带小电源（柴油机或水电）的电站起孤网，再逐级带起大机组和负荷，像多米诺恢复全网。ىBlack start uses plants with their own power to build a small grid, then cascades up to large units, like dominoes restoring the network.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�df0e9320c64b�body���理论最小分离功等于可逆分离该混合物所需的自由能，不低于混合过程的吉布斯自由能增量。实际精馏需远高于此的再沸器与冷凝器热负荷，主要由组分相对挥发度和回流比决定。�The theoretical minimum separation work is the reversible work needed to separate a mixture, no less than the Gibbs free energy of mixing. Real distillation needs far more reboiler and condenser duty, set mainly by the relative volatility of components and the reflux ratio.�ans��src��3Smith, Van Ness & Abbott《化工热力学导论》�OSmith, Van Ness & Abbott, 'Introduction to Chemical Engineering Thermodynamics'��id�e021a8be5389�body�٨围堰是用钢板桩或土石在水里围出一道临时挡水墙，把中间的水抽干，工人才能在干涸的坑里浇筑桥墩或地基，完工后再拆除。ٮA cofferdam is a temporary watertight wall of sheet piles or earth that pumps out the enclosed water so workers can build piers or foundations in the dry, then it is removed.�ans��src��5美国陆军工程兵团，EM 1110-2-2901《围堰》�8US Army Corps of Engineers, 'EM 1110-2-2901, Cofferdams'��id�e1dbee4389a4�body��#高压气态（70 MPa）储氢体积密度有限且需厚重耐压容器；低温液态体积密度高但液化能耗大、存在蒸发损失；金属氢化物体积密度高且安全（常温常压吸附），但质量储氢密度低、吸放氢伴随显著热效应，制约车载应用。�QCompressed gas at 70 MPa has limited volumetric density and needs heavy pressure vessels; cryogenic liquid is dense but energy-intensive to liquefy and suffers boil-off; metal hydrides are dense and safe at ambient conditions but have low gravimetric capacity and strong heat effects during absorption/desorption, limiting vehicular use.�ans��src��Z陈敏恒 丛德滋 方图南 等 编,《化工原理》第3版,化学工业出版社,2006�\Chen Minheng et al., Chemical Engineering Principles, 3rd ed., Chemical Industry Press, 2006��id�e2e824d15e90�body���LCA 量化产品从原料获取、制造、使用到废弃全过程的环境影响。ISO 14040/14044 规定四个阶段：目标与范围定义、清单分析（LCI）、影响评价（LCIA）与结果解释。�LCA quantifies a product's environmental impacts across its whole life, from raw materials through manufacturing, use, and disposal. ISO 14040/14044 define four phases: goal and scope definition, inventory analysis (LCI), impact assessment (LCIA), and interpretation.�ans��src��?国际标准化组织（ISO）ISO 14040:2006 与 ISO 14044:2006�VInternational Organization for Standardization (ISO) ISO 14040:2006 and ISO 14044:2006��id�e41dcee1ed5e�body��bTransmon 通过增加约瑟夫森结并联的接地电容，把能级间距设计为对电荷噪声极不敏感，使工作点落在电荷不敏感区。这样单比特门的操控频率远离易出错的电荷涨落态，从而把退相干时间从早期电荷比特的纳秒级提升到百微秒量级，是目前超导量子计算机的主流方案。��The transmon adds a shunt capacitance to the Josephson junction so its level spacing becomes nearly insensitive to charge noise, placing the operating point in a charge-insensitive regime. This detunes gate operations from error-prone charge fluctuations, extending coherence from the nanosecond scale of early charge qubits to around a hundred microseconds, making it the leading superconducting qubit design.�ans��src��,Nature Physics（超导量子比特综述）�-Nature Physics (superconducting qubit review)��id�e743e1a3f3d3�body��3DBS 通过植入电极向丘脑底核等靶点发送高频电脉冲，调节异常神经振荡。频率、脉宽与幅度的设定决定能否抑制震颤又避免言语、步态等副作用，需在疗效窗口与不良反应间精细权衡，并常结合个体化的靶点定位与自适应闭环刺激。�gDBS sends high-frequency pulses to targets such as the subthalamic nucleus to modulate abnormal neural oscillations. Frequency, pulse width, and amplitude determine whether tremor is suppressed without speech or gait side effects, requiring fine trade-offs within a therapeutic window, often with individualized targeting and adaptive closed-loop stimulation.�ans��src��1Nature Neuroscience（脑刺激与神经调控）�;Nature Neuroscience (brain stimulation and neuromodulation)��id�e7e4bb55e748�body���在开环频率特性上，增益穿越一倍时对应的相位距离负一百八十度还差多少，就是相位裕度；相位到负一百八十度时增益比一倍小多少，就是增益裕度。两者衡量系统距离不稳定还有多远，裕度太小意味着轻微的参数漂移或额外滞后就会自激振荡。经验上相位裕度取三十到六十度、增益裕度六分贝以上比较稳妥。�4On the open-loop frequency response, phase margin is how far the phase is from minus one hundred and eighty degrees at the frequency where gain crosses unity, while gain margin is how far below unity the gain is when the phase reaches minus one hundred and eighty degrees. Together they measure how close the system is to instability, and margins that are too small mean slight parameter drift or extra delay will cause self-sustained oscillation. As a rule of thumb a phase margin of thirty to sixty degrees and gain margin above six decibels are considered safe.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�e7ea357d4434�body���临界转速是转轴系统的固有弯曲振动频率对应的转速。当转速接近该频率时，不平衡质量激发的离心力与轴的变形相互加强，发生共振，振幅急剧放大，可能损坏设备。��Critical speed is the rotation rate matching the shaft's natural lateral vibration frequency. Near it, centrifugal force from unbalance reinforces shaft deflection, causing resonance with sharply growing amplitude that can destroy the machine.�ans��src��0Shigley，《机械工程设计》（第10版）�3Shigley, 'Mechanical Engineering Design' (10th ed.)��id�e858ea870fa2�body��2010年深水地平线事故的链条很长：固井质量差且水泥胶结测试被判读失误，负压测试未识别流体侵入风险，井口被大量流体突袭时，防喷器虽有闸板但未能在剪切头切断钻杆，且切断后仍未形成密封，BOP控制系统的电池耗尽也使其无法应急启动。多项机械与程序缺陷叠加导致井喷失控，最终平台爆炸沉没、约490万桶原油泄漏。事故调查促成了行业对井控、BOP冗余设计和应急响应能力的全面改革。�\The 2010 Deepwater Horizon disaster was a long chain of failures: poor cementing with a wrongly interpreted cement bond test, a negative-pressure test that failed to flag the risk of influx, and a blowout preventer that, though equipped with rams, did not shear the drill pipe and seal, with the BOP's emergency-control battery also depleted. The compounding mechanical and procedural failures left the well out of control, the platform exploded and sank, and roughly 4.9 million barrels of oil spilled. The investigation drove industry-wide reform of well control, BOP redundancy and emergency response.�ans��src�٨Finneran, Thompson, Padgett, Rollins,《Forensic Investigation of the Deepwater Horizon Blowout Preventer》, Materials Performance, 2013 (DOI: 10.5006/mp2013_52_12-30)٤Finneran, Thompson, Padgett, Rollins, 'Forensic Investigation of the Deepwater Horizon Blowout Preventer', Materials Performance, 2013, DOI: 10.5006/mp2013_52_12-30��id�e85e0dcda989�body���它以系统状态方程和带噪声的量测为输入，每步先由模型预测、再用新量测做最优加权修正，递推得到均值与协方差最小均方误差估计。广泛用于导航、制导和信号去噪。��Given a state model and noisy measurements, it predicts forward each step then optimally blends the new measurement, yielding a minimum-variance estimate of the mean and covariance recursively. It is widely used in navigation, guidance, and denoising.�ans��src�ٷKalman《线性滤波与预测问题的新方法》(Journal of Basic Engineering, 1960)；Maybeck《随机模型、估计与控制》(Stochastic Models, Estimation, and Control, 1979)٧Kalman, 'A New Approach to Linear Filtering and Prediction Problems' (Journal of Basic Engineering, 1960); Maybeck, 'Stochastic Models, Estimation, and Control' (1979)��id�e91eb0ea84e0�body��<MRI依赖氢核的核磁共振。人体含大量水，氢原子核（质子）自带自旋磁矩，在强磁场中沿磁场方向取向并绕其进动。射频脉冲以共振频率激发质子，使其相位一致并偏转；脉冲停止后质子弛豫回到平衡态并释放射频信号。不同组织的T1、T2弛豫时间不同，接收线圈测得信号后经傅里叶变换重建出图像。通过调整脉冲序列的加权（T1加权或T2加权）可以突出不同组织的对比，对脑、脊髓、关节等软组织分辨率极高，而且没有电离辐射。�IMRI exploits nuclear magnetic resonance of hydrogen. The body is mostly water, and protons spin with a magnetic moment, aligning with and precessing about a strong field. A resonant RF pulse tips them into coherence and deflection; when the pulse stops, they relax back and emit RF signals. Tissues differ in T1 and T2 relaxation times, and receiver coils capture the signals for Fourier reconstruction into images. Weighting the pulse sequence (T1- or T2-weighted) emphasizes different contrast, giving superb soft-tissue detail in brain, spine, and joints with no ionizing radiation.�ans��src��^Kak & Slaney《CT 原理》；Haacke 等《MRI 原理》；超声成像（Hendee & Ritenour）هKak & Slaney, Principles of Computerized Tomographic Imaging; Haacke et al., Magnetic Resonance Imaging; ultrasound (Hendee & Ritenour)��id�e9cb04cbf150�body���比冲 I_sp 是单位推进剂重量流量产生的推力，单位为秒，数值越大效率越高。化学火箭的 I_sp 约250–450 s，离子推力器可达数千秒但推力很小，因此比冲与推力需权衡。�Specific impulse I_sp is the thrust per unit propellant weight flow, in seconds; a higher value means greater efficiency. Chemical rockets have I_sp of about 250–450 s, while ion thrusters reach thousands of seconds but with very low thrust, so I_sp and thrust must be traded off.�ans��src��M美国航空航天学会（AIAA）；Sutton & Biblarz《火箭推进基础》�iAmerican Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics (AIAA); Sutton & Biblarz, 'Rocket Propulsion Elements'��id�ee543876063b�body�� 关闭发动机后的探测器只在太阳引力下飞行，轨迹是以太阳为焦点的椭圆轨道。霍曼转移取一个近日点在地球轨道、远日点在火星轨道的椭圆：第一次点火在近地轨道加速进入转移椭圆，抵达远日点后再点火把轨道圆化成火星轨道。虽然是绕远路，但这两次点火所需的速度增量总和最小，能省下大量燃料。代价是飞行时间长达6到9个月，而且发射窗口每26个月才出现一次，因为地球与火星的相对位置必须合适。�bOnce its engines shut off, a probe flies only under solar gravity along an ellipse with the Sun at one focus. A Hohmann transfer picks an ellipse whose perihelion touches Earth's orbit and aphelion touches Mars': the first burn accelerates the probe onto the ellipse, and at aphelion a second burn circularizes it into Mars orbit. It is the long way around, but the sum of the two burns' velocity changes (delta-v) is the minimum possible, saving enormous fuel. The cost is 6-9 months of flight time, and launch windows recur only every 26 months because Earth and Mars must be in the right relative positions.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�eef63aab025f�body�ٟ标定得到相机的内参（焦距、畸变）和外参（位姿），把图像像素映射到真实世界坐标，才能保证尺寸测量与定位准确。٬Calibration yields intrinsic (focal length, distortion) and extrinsic (pose) parameters, mapping pixels to real-world coordinates for accurate measurement and localization.�ans��src��^Six Sigma（Pyzdek & Keller）；ISO 9001；机器视觉检测（Davies《Machine Vision》）�YSix Sigma (Pyzdek & Keller); ISO 9001; machine vision inspection (Davies, Machine Vision)��id�efc2dd808250�body��!再入时的极端热量主要不是来自摩擦，而是激波压缩：飞行器以高超音速挤压前方空气，弓形激波后的空气被绝热压缩到几千摄氏度，高温气体再对飞船表面加热。航天飞机的陶瓷隔热瓦靠极低的热导率把热量挡在外面；载人飞船则用烧蚀热防护——酚醛树脂等材料表面熔化、气化时吸热并带走热量，烧蚀层自身不断"牺牲"以保护内部。从水星、阿波罗到神舟都采用烧蚀方案，它简单可靠，只是不能重复使用。�pThe extreme heat of re-entry comes mainly not from friction but from shock compression: at hypersonic speed the vehicle shoves air ahead of it, and behind the bow shock the air is adiabatically compressed to thousands of degrees, then heats the surface. The Space Shuttle's silica tiles block heat with very low thermal conductivity; crew capsules instead use ablative shielding — phenolic resin chars, melts, and vaporizes, absorbing and carrying heat away while the ablator sacrifices itself to protect the interior. From Mercury and Apollo to Shenzhou, capsules chose ablation: simple and reliable, though not reusable.�ans��src��BAnderson，《高超声速与高温气体动力学》（第2版）�BAnderson, 'Hypersonic and High-Temperature Gas Dynamics' (2nd ed.)��id�eng_19_003�body��v锥形踏面使轮对在高速下可能发生自激蛇行运动,一旦振幅发散即为蛇行失稳,对应的线性临界速度须明显高于运营速度并留裕量。减振器串联于车体与构架之间,小幅振动时提供大阻尼保证直线运行稳定性,大幅运动时卸荷阀使阻尼力饱和,避免曲线通过时轮轨横向力过大和连接件疲劳。��Conical wheel treads make hunting a self-excited risk at speed, and the linear critical speed must sit well above operating speed with margin. Mounted between carbody and frame, the yaw damper supplies large damping for small oscillations to stabilise straight running, while its relief valve saturates the force during large motions so curve negotiation neither overloads the wheel-rail interface nor fatigues the mounting.�ans��src��aA. H. Wickens《Fundamentals of Rail Vehicle Dynamics》(Swets & Zeitlinger)稳定性分析章节�\A. H. Wickens, Fundamentals of Rail Vehicle Dynamics, Swets & Zeitlinger, stability chapters��id�eng_19_006�body��I波纹切茬盘先切断表层残茬并开出窄缝,双圆盘开沟器随后在未翻动的湿土中开出V形种沟,排种器将种子定量投到沟底。带设定下压力的V形镇压轮把沟壁湿土挤向种子实现种土密接并减少水分散失,液压或弹簧仿形机构则维持播深随地表起伏基本不变。��A fluted coulter first slices through surface residue and slits the stubble, double-disc openers then cut a narrow V-furrow in undisturbed moist soil, and the metering unit delivers seed precisely to its base. Downforce-loaded V-shaped press wheels squeeze the wet furrow walls against the seed for firm contact with limited moisture loss, while hydraulic or spring parallelogram linkages keep depth essentially constant over uneven ground.�ans��src��gC. J. Baker 与 K. E. Saxton《No-Tillage Seeding in Conservation Farming》(Nottingham大学出版社)�rC. J. Baker, K. E. Saxton & W. R. Ritchie, No-Tillage Seeding in Conservation Farming, Nottingham University Press��id�eng_19_009�body���压气机引气经叶身内部蛇形通道流向倾斜小孔,出流以合适动量比贴附在叶片外表面形成连续低温气膜,将高温燃气与金属壁面隔开,孔内对流又额外带走热量。吹风比过大会使射流脱离壁面反而强化局部换热,故孔的位置、角度与吹风比须同热障涂层一起协同优化,才能支撑持续提高的涡轮前温度。�Compressor bleed air travels through internal serpentine passages into small inclined holes, and the exiting jets attach to the outer surface at a suitable momentum ratio to form a continuous cool film separating hot gas from the metal, while convection inside the holes removes additional heat. An excessive blowing ratio lifts the jet off the wall and worsens local heat transfer, so hole position, angle and blowing ratio are optimized jointly with the thermal barrier coating to support ever-higher turbine inlet temperatures.�ans��src��kJ.-C. Han 等《Gas Turbine Heat Transfer and Cooling Technology》(CRC出版社,第2版)气膜冷却章节�~J.-C. Han, S. Dutta & S. V. Ekkad, Gas Turbine Heat Transfer and Cooling Technology, 2nd ed., CRC Press, film-cooling chapters��id�eng_19_013�body���牵伸把大分子链段拉向纤维轴向，诱导规整片晶生成，结晶度与晶区取向同步上升，强度和初始模量随之提高。非晶区可伸展的连接链变少，断裂伸长率相应下降，过度牵伸还会萌生微孔和原纤化损伤。工业上常把总牵伸倍数控制在约三点五至五倍，并配合热定型松弛内应力以平衡强伸指标。��Drawing stretches chain segments along the fibre axis and induces ordered lamellae, so crystallinity and crystal orientation climb together with tenacity and initial modulus. Stretchable tie chains in the amorphous phase grow scarce, dropping elongation at break, while over-drawing seeds voids and fibrillation. Mills therefore hold total draw ratios near 3.5 to 5 and heat-set the yarn to relax residual stress and balance strength against extensibility.�ans��src��`董纪震等《合成纤维生产工艺学》第二版，中国石化出版社，熔体纺丝章ٔA. Ziabicki, Fundamentals of Fibre Formation: The Science of Fibre Spinning and Drawing, John Wiley & Sons, orientation and crystallization sections��id�eng_19_016�body��b当气动刚度和气动阻尼随风速增长把竖弯与扭转两个模态耦合成一体，结构从风中净吸收能量时，振幅按指数发散，即发生弯扭颤振。流线型断面借助风嘴推迟气流分离、压低升力矩斜率，中央稳定板又进一步削弱两模态耦合，使颤振临界风速稳定高于设计检验风速。��Flutter erupts when aerodynamic stiffness and damping fuse the vertical-bending and torsional modes so the section draws net energy from the flow and vibration amplitudes diverge exponentially. A streamlined profile uses nose fairings to delay separation and shrink the lift-moment slope, while central stabilizers decouple the two modes further, holding the critical speed above the design checking value.�ans��src�ٵR. H. Scanlan、J. Tomko,《Theoretical and Experimental Studies of Bridge Deck Aerodynamic Stability》,Journal of the Engineering Mechanics Division (ASCE),1971年,第97卷第1期٥R. H. Scanlan & J. Tomko, Theoretical and Experimental Studies of Bridge Deck Aerodynamic Stability, Journal of the Engineering Mechanics Division, ASCE, 97(1), 1971��id�eng_19_019�body���锥形踏面的重力刚度使轮对在直线上自发横移并与摇头耦合，轮轨蠕滑向系统输入负阻尼；当这部分能量超过一系与二系悬挂的耗散能力时，摆动振幅持续放大直至轮缘贴靠钢轨。工程上通过提高一系定位刚度、加装抗蛇行油压减振器、优化踏面等效锥度和转向架回转阻力，把线性临界速度抬到最高运营速度之上并留足裕量。��Conical treads give wheelsets gravity stiffness that couples lateral shift with yaw on tangent track, and wheel-rail creep feeds negative damping into the system; once that input outgrows dissipation in primary and secondary suspensions, sway amplitude keeps swelling until flanges strike the rails. Engineers stiffen primary positioning, fit yaw hydraulic dampers, tune tread equivalent conicity and bolster rotation resistance, lifting the linear critical speed above top service speed with ample margin.�ans��src���翟婉明《车辆-轨道耦合动力学》，科学出版社，车辆横向稳定性章节 ; 另见: A. H. Wickens, Fundamentals of Rail Vehicle Dynamics: Guidance and Stability, Swets & Zeitlinger, 2003��A. H. Wickens, Fundamentals of Rail Vehicle Dynamics: Guidance and Stability, Swets & Zeitlinger, 2003 ; see also: 翟婉明《车辆-轨道耦合动力学》，科学出版社，车辆横向稳定性章节��id�eng_20_003�body���液滴蒸发时接触线钉扎驱动内部毛细流,把溶质携带到边缘沉积,形成边缘厚中心薄的环状形貌,破坏活性层厚度一致性。抑制手段包括升高基板温度加快马兰戈尼对流、添加高沸点共溶剂改变接触线行为,以及用表面活性剂使接触线去钉扎。成分梯度调控还可诱导反向马兰戈尼流,让颗粒重新向中心聚集。�During droplet evaporation, a pinned contact line drives internal capillary flow that carries solute to the perimeter, producing ring-like deposits thick at the edge and thin at the center, which degrades active-layer thickness uniformity. Suppression approaches include raising substrate temperature to strengthen Marangoni convection, adding high-boiling cosolvents to alter contact-line behavior, and using surfactants to depin the line. Compositional gradients can even reverse the Marangoni flow so particles accumulate toward the center.�ans��src�مHu & Larson,《Marangoni Effect Reverses Coffee-Ring Depositions》,The Journal of Physical Chemistry B,2006 (DOI: 10.1021/jp0609232)كHu & Larson, 'Marangoni Effect Reverses Coffee-Ring Depositions', The Journal of Physical Chemistry B, 2006, DOI: 10.1021/jp0609232��id�eng_20_006�body��␀载波相位以周为单位度量站星距离,双差消去卫星钟和接收机钟差后,剩余未知数是信号传播整周数加接收机初始相位偏差,物理上只能取整数。浮解把该值当实数与坐标一同做最小二乘估计,模糊度误差被吸收进基线分量,精度停在分米级;整数约束经 LAMBDA 等搜索正确恢复后,毫米级噪声的相位观测值被充分利用,基线即可达厘米级。工程上以 Ratio 检验和验后单位权中误差控制固定解可靠性。�bCarrier phase measures range in whole cycles, and after double differencing removes satellite and receiver clock errors, the remaining unknown per observation is an integer cycle count plus a receiver phase offset. The float solution estimates that value as a real number together with the coordinates, so its error leaks into the baseline components and accuracy stalls at the decimeter level. Once the integers are correctly recovered by a search such as LAMBDA, millimeter-noise phase observations are fully exploited and centimeter baselines follow, guarded by the ratio test and posterior unit-weight RMS.�ans��src�٦Teunissen P J G. The least-squares ambiguity decorrelation adjustment: a method for fast GPS integer ambiguity estimation[J]. Journal of Geodesy, 1995, 70(11): 65-82.ٳP.J.G. Teunissen, 'The least-squares ambiguity decorrelation adjustment: a method for fast GPS integer ambiguity estimation', Journal of Geodesy, vol. 70, no. 11, pp. 65-82, 1995.��id�eng_20_009�body��J几乎所有材料对 13.5 nm 极紫外光吸收极强且折射率实部趋近于 1,不存在任何厚度的可用透镜,只能依靠单层约 7 nm 的 Mo/Si 交替膜通过布拉格反射实现约 70% 的峰值反射率。常规增益介质没有极紫外波段的跃迁,故以 CO2 激光轰击约 25 μm 锡液滴产生高温等离子体,其高价锡离子的密集谱线恰好叠加出 13.5 nm 附近的有效辐射。这决定了 EUV 光路全程真空运行、反射镜面形与多层膜周期误差须压至皮米级,也带来收集效率低、功率链损耗大的工程代价。��Essentially all materials absorb 13.5 nm light extremely strongly with refractive-index real parts near unity, so no usable lens exists at any thickness; reflective optics rely on Mo/Si bilayer stacks roughly 7 nm per period acting as Bragg mirrors with peak reflectivity around 70 percent. Ordinary gain media offer no transitions at extreme-ultraviolet wavelengths, so a CO2 laser vaporizes tin droplets about 25 micrometers wide, and dense emission lines of highly charged tin ions combine into useful radiation near 13.5 nm. This physics forces an all-vacuum beam path, picometer-level control of mirror figures and multilayer periods, and the well-known penalties in collection efficiency and source power.�ans��src��~Wu B, Kumar A. Extreme ultraviolet lithography: A review[J]. Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology B, 2007, 25(6): 1743-1761.ُB. Wu and A. Kumar, 'Extreme ultraviolet lithography: A review', Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology B, vol. 25, no. 6, pp. 1743-1761, 2007.��id�eng_20_013�body���顶升阶段上部回转结构与待接标准节的连接尚未形成,倾覆力矩只能经套架导向机构传给已安装塔身,传力路径本就处于最不利状态。此时任何起升或回转都会叠加附加力矩和水平力,使套架单侧受力,可能引起顶升油缸失稳乃至整体倒塔。把小车固定在说明书规定的配平幅度,是为了让上部结构重心落在顶升油缸轴线上,使过渡状态受力最小。�\During jacking, the connection between the slewing upper structure and the new mast section is not yet made, so the overturning moment passes only through the climbing-frame guides into the installed mast — already the weakest load path. Any hoisting or slewing at that moment adds extra moments and horizontal forces that load the frame eccentrically, which can destabilize the jacking cylinder or topple the whole crane. Fixing the trolley at the counterbalance radius given in the manual keeps the center of gravity of the upper works on the cylinder axis, minimizing forces in this transient state.�ans��src��]GB 5144-2019《塔式起重机安全规程》及主流塔机使用说明书顶升加节章节�^GB 5144-2019 Safety rules for tower cranes; tower-crane manufacturer manuals, jacking sections��id�eng_20_016�body���下压量增大使轴肩与工件接触面积增加,摩擦产热量近似随压力和转速乘积上升,而焊接速度决定单位长度材料接收的热量。热输入不足时前进侧易出现隧道型孔洞和未熔合缺陷;热输入过高则导致晶粒严重长大及轴肩前沿材料挤出形成的飞边。工程上常用每转进给量(焊接速度/转速)作为综合控制指标,铝合金典型范围约0.5–1.2 mm/r。�YIncreasing plunge depth enlarges the shoulder-workpiece contact area, so frictional heat rises roughly with the product of axial force and rotation speed, while travel speed sets how much heat each unit length of material receives. Insufficient heat input produces tunnel porosity and lack-of-fill defects on the advancing side; excessive heat input causes pronounced grain growth and flash expelled from the shoulder's leading edge. In practice engineers use feed per revolution (travel speed divided by rotation speed) as a combined control index, typically about 0.5-1.2 mm/rev for aluminum alloys.�ans��src�يMishra, Ma,《Friction stir welding and processing》,Materials Science and Engineering: R: Reports,2005 (DOI: 10.1016/j.mser.2005.07.001)وMishra, Ma, 'Friction stir welding and processing', Materials Science and Engineering: R: Reports, 2005, DOI: 10.1016/j.mser.2005.07.001��id�eng_21_003�body��z在指定副瓣电平约束下,切比雪夫分布给出最窄的主瓣宽度,即等纹波意义下的最优解。代价主要有三点:波束展宽使增益和孔径效率下降;两端单元激励幅度最大,对馈电网络精度和功率容量要求苛刻;被压低的副瓣呈等纹波分布,远离主瓣方向也不快速衰减。实际设计常取−30 dB左右作折中。��Under a prescribed sidelobe level, the Chebyshev distribution yields the narrowest attainable main beam—the optimum in the equal-ripple sense. The cost comes threefold: the broadened beam erodes gain and aperture efficiency; end elements require the largest excitation amplitudes, stressing feed-network accuracy and power handling; and the suppressed sidelobes ripple rather than decaying quickly far off boresight. Practical designs typically settle near −30 dB as a compromise.�ans��src��`C. A. Balanis,《Antenna Theory: Analysis and Design》第4版,Wiley,线阵与面阵综合章节�qC. A. Balanis, Antenna Theory: Analysis and Design, 4th ed., Wiley, chapters on linear and planar array synthesis��id�eng_21_006�body��重力作用下，三点支承会在镜面内产生较大的弯曲应力，使镜面偏离理想抛物面，引入以三重对称(trefoil)形变和像散为主的低阶像差，且该误差随镜筒指向变化、无法靠重新调焦消除。多点浮动支承把镜子自重分配到更多接触点上，单点载荷下降，面形RMS误差随支承点数近似按幂律降低。对300mm口径、厚径比约1:6的常用镜坯，18点支承通常能把重力面形误差压到衍射极限对应的λ/20 RMS以内。��Under gravity loading, a three-point support induces significant bending stress within the mirror blank, deforming it away from the ideal paraboloid and introducing low-order aberrations dominated by trefoil (threefold-symmetric) deformation and astigmatism — errors that vary with tube pointing and cannot be removed by refocusing. A multi-point floating support distributes the mirror's weight over many contact points, reducing the load per point; figure RMS error falls roughly as a power law with support count. For a 300 mm blank with a typical 1:6 thickness-to-diameter ratio, 18-point support usually holds gravity-induced figure error below λ/20 RMS, matching the diffraction limit.�ans��src�وWilson,《Reflecting Telescope Optics II》(Springer, 1999) 第3章 镜面支承；PLOP 镜面支承有限元文档（David Lewis 等）وR.N. Wilson, Reflecting Telescope Optics II (Springer, 1999), Ch.3 Mirror Supports; PLOP mirror-cell FEA documentation (D. Lewis et al.)��id�eng_21_009�body��d半闭环只反馈电机转子位置，滚珠丝杠或联轴器的反向间隙、弹性变形和热伸长都不在环内，定位精度通常只能到几十微米；直线电机直接驱动配合光栅尺全闭环可消除这些中间环节，达到亚微米级。但全闭环把柔性机械环节纳入控制回路，位置环带宽受限，过高增益会激发传动系统固有模态，表现为高频振荡。工程上通过陷波滤波器（Notch）压制主导谐振峰、双反馈（电机+光栅）融合控制、以及加速度前馈提高响应而不抬升环路增益来兼顾速度与稳定裕度。��Semi-closed loops sense only rotor position; backlash, elasticity, and thermal drift of ball screws or couplings stay outside the loop, limiting accuracy to tens of micrometers. Direct-drive linear motors with linear encoders remove these intermediate elements, reaching sub-micrometer positioning. Yet full closure brings flexible mechanics inside the control loop, constraining position-loop bandwidth — excessive gain excites structural modes as high-frequency oscillation. Practitioners suppress the dominant resonance with notch filters, blend motor and stage feedback (dual-feedback control), and add acceleration feedforward to raise responsiveness without inflating loop gain.�ans��src���ISO 230-2 机床定位精度评定标准；K. K. Tan、S. Huang、T. H. Lee 等,《Precision Motion Control: Design and Implementation》第2版(Springer) 双反馈章节；西门子 SINAMICS V90 应用文档��ISO 230-2 positioning accuracy evaluation standard; K.K. Tan, S. Huang, T.H. Lee et al., Precision Motion Control: Design and Implementation, 2nd ed. (Springer), dual-feedback chapter; Siemens SINAMICS V90 application documentation��id�eng_21_016�body��s柴油机将空气压缩到很高的压缩比(通常14至22),缸内温度升到500摄氏度以上,雾化燃油喷入高温高压空气中自行着火,完全不需要火花塞。喷油提前角决定滞燃期长短与放热重心:过早喷油会使压力升高率过大、工作粗暴且NOx排放增多,过晚喷油则后燃加重、排气温度升高、热效率下降。�A diesel engine compresses intake air to a high compression ratio, typically 14 to 22, pushing in-cylinder temperature above about 500 degrees Celsius, so atomized fuel injected into the hot charge autoignites without any spark plug. Injection timing sets the ignition delay and the center of heat release: fuel delivered too early produces an excessive rate of pressure rise, rough running, and higher NOx, while fuel delivered too late intensifies afterburning, raises exhaust temperature, and cuts thermal efficiency.�ans��src��rJohn B. Heywood著《Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals》(McGraw-Hill,2018年第2版)第10章柴油机燃烧�}John B. Heywood, Internal Combustion Engine Fundamentals, 2nd ed., McGraw-Hill, 2018, Chapter 10 on diesel engine combustion.��id�eng_22_003�body���风暴与涌浪的能量集中在周期约6–15秒的波段。若导管架自振周期落入其中，接续到来的波峰波谷会激起共振，动力放大系数陡增，构件应力与疲劳损伤都难以控制。因此设计上通过增强撑杆刚度、限制甲板组块质量，把基本周期压缩到约3–5秒，令波浪载荷接近准静态作用；动力效应减小后，疲劳谱分析与极端波强度校核才有可靠依据。�Storm-sea energy concentrates at wave periods of roughly 6–15 s. If the jacket's natural period fell inside that band, arriving crests and troughs would excite resonance, multiplying dynamic stresses and fatigue damage beyond control. Designers therefore stiffen the bracing and cap topside mass to push the fundamental period down to about 3–5 s, so wave loads act almost quasi-statically. With dynamic amplification suppressed, spectral fatigue analysis and extreme-wave strength checks rest on predictable behaviour.�ans��src�َ美国石油学会标准API RP 2A-WSD《固定式海洋平台的规划、设计与建造——工作应力设计法》，第22版，2014年。ٗAPI RP 2A-WSD, Planning, Designing and Constructing Fixed Offshore Platforms—Working Stress Design, 22nd edition, American Petroleum Institute, 2014.��id�eng_22_006�body���这是再生型自激振动：刀齿总在前一齿留下的波纹表面上切入，瞬时切削厚度取决于相邻两齿波纹的相位差。当主轴转速使该相位差落入不稳定区间，切削过程注入机床结构的能量超过阻尼耗散，振幅便自发增长。稳定性叶瓣图给出每个转速对应的临界切深，把转速选进高阶叶瓣或减小轴向切深即可恢复稳定切削。�:Milling chatter is a regenerative self-excited vibration: each tooth cuts into the wavy surface left by its predecessor, so the instantaneous chip thickness depends on the phase shift between successive tooth paths. When spindle speed places that phase shift in an unstable range, the cutting process pumps more energy into the machine structure than damping dissipates, and vibration grows spontaneously. A stability lobe diagram gives the critical depth of cut at each speed; choosing a speed inside a higher-order lobe or reducing axial depth restores stable cutting.�ans��src�وY.阿尔滕塔斯与E.布达克《铣削稳定性叶瓣的解析预测》，CIRP Annals，第44卷第1期，第357–362页，1995年。�~Y. Altintas & E. Budak, "Analytical Prediction of Stability Lobes in Milling", CIRP Annals, Vol. 44, No. 1, pp. 357-362, 1995.��id�eng_22_013�body���β<1表示失效率随时间递减，属早期失效，多源于制造缺陷或磨合不良，宜用筛选与老炼试验剔除薄弱个体；β=1退化为指数分布，故障随机出现，定时更换不能降低风险，应以状态监测为主；β>1表示失效率随时间上升，属耗损型失效，存在明确的特征寿命，此时按役龄定期更换或翻修才能真正控制风险。β值还能外推不同可靠度下的安全寿命。�3When β < 1 the failure rate falls with time: these are early-life failures driven by manufacturing defects, so screening and burn-in remove weak units. β = 1 reduces the model to the exponential distribution, where failures occur randomly; scheduled replacement cannot reduce risk, and condition monitoring is the rational choice. When β > 1 the failure rate rises, marking wear-out with a characteristic life, so age-based replacement or overhaul genuinely controls risk. The fitted β also supports extrapolation of safe lives at required reliability levels.�ans��src��oRausand, M.与Høyland, A.《系统可靠性理论：模型、统计方法与应用》第2版，Wiley，2004年�yRausand, M. & Hoyland, A., System Reliability Theory: Models, Statistical Methods, and Applications, 2nd ed., Wiley, 2004��id�eng_22_016�body���常规钻井靠钻井液静液柱压力平衡地层孔隙压力，循环时环空摩阻压耗叠加其上；停泵接单根时压耗消失，井底压力骤降，一旦低于地层压力便发生井涌。控压钻井的恒定井底压力模式在井口设置节流管汇与自动控制系统：停泵时施加井口回压补偿损失的摩阻，使井底压力始终保持在溢流压力与漏失压力之间的窄窗内，从而安全钻穿高压易漏互层段。��In conventional drilling the mud column alone balances pore pressure, and annular frictional losses exist only while circulating; when the pumps stop for a connection, bottomhole pressure drops abruptly and can fall below formation pressure, letting reservoir fluids flow into the wellbore. The constant-bottomhole-pressure mode of managed pressure drilling adds a choke manifold with automated control at surface: as flow ceases, applied backpressure replaces the lost friction, holding bottomhole pressure inside the narrow band between pore pressure and fracture pressure so that interbedded, high-pressure, loss-prone sections can be drilled safely.�ans��src�مWilson C. Chin《Managed Pressure Drilling: Modeling, Strategy and Planning》，Gulf Professional Publishing（Elsevier），2012年�yWilson C. Chin, Managed Pressure Drilling: Modeling, Strategy and Planning, Gulf Professional Publishing (Elsevier), 2012��id�eng_22_019�body���张力腿平台的浮力大于其总重，多余净浮力由竖直系索承受，使各系索恒处于张紧状态。拉紧的系索把平台锚定于海面下：垂荡、纵摇、横摇的固有周期被压到约2-4秒，避开海浪能量集中周期而不共振；纵荡、横荡由系索水平分力提供恢复力，运动平缓。单根系索失效会引发张力重分配，设计须校核冗余与极限海况。�]A tension leg platform is designed with buoyancy exceeding its total weight; the excess buoyancy is carried by vertical tendons, keeping every tendon permanently in tension. The taut tendons anchor the platform below the sea surface like stiff springs: the natural periods of heave, pitch, and roll are pushed down to roughly 2-4 s, below the band where most wave energy lies, so resonance is avoided. Surge and sway are restored by horizontal components of tendon tension and remain slow and moderate. Losing one tendon redistributes the loads, so designs must verify redundancy under extreme sea states.�ans��src��`J. F. Wilson 主编《Dynamics of Offshore Structures》，第2版，John Wiley & Sons，2003年�YJ. F. Wilson (ed.), Dynamics of Offshore Structures, 2nd edition, John Wiley & Sons, 2003��id�eng_23_003�body���当天线数远大于同时服务的用户数时，各用户的信道向量趋于相互正交并出现“信道硬化”，简单的线性预编码就能把每路信号在空间上对准各自用户、彼此几乎不干扰，多个用户因而可以共用同一时频资源，频谱效率成倍提升；全部天线的相干叠加还带来阵列增益，用更低的发射功率即可维持原速率。Marzetta的论文最早给出了这一极限性能分析。�-When antenna count greatly exceeds the number of simultaneously served users, user channel vectors become nearly mutually orthogonal and exhibit “channel hardening”: simple linear precoding can focus each signal spatially onto its intended user with little mutual interference, so many users share the same time-frequency resource and spectral efficiency multiplies. Coherent combining across all antennas additionally provides array gain, maintaining throughput at lower transmit power. Marzetta's seminal paper first quantified these asymptotic gains.�ans��src��HRappaport《无线通信》；3GPP 5G 标准；Proakis《数字通信》�VRappaport, Wireless Communications; 3GPP 5G standards; Proakis, Digital Communications��id�eng_23_006�body���水泥水化释放的钾、钠离子使孔隙液pH高达13～14，足以溶解骨料中的活性二氧化硅，生成吸水的碱硅凝胶；凝胶肿胀内压一旦超过抗拉强度，就形成网状“地图裂缝”。粉煤灰玻璃相早期消耗氢氧化钙、拉低孔隙液碱度，其低钙C-S-H产物又能固结碱离子并细化孔道、阻碍水分迁移，因而显著减小膨胀。��Alkalis released by cement hydration push pore-solution pH to about 13-14, dissolving reactive silica from aggregates into a hygroscopic alkali-silica gel; once swelling pressure exceeds tensile strength, map-shaped network cracking appears. Fly ash glass consumes calcium hydroxide and lowers pore alkalinity, and its low-calcium C-S-H binds alkalis while refining pores and blocking moisture paths, sharply reducing expansion.�ans��src�پShehata 与 Thomas,《The effect of fly ash composition on the expansion of concrete due to alkali–silica reaction》,Cement and Concrete Research,2000 (DOI: 10.1016/s0008-8846(00)00283-0)ٺShehata & Thomas, 'The effect of fly ash composition on the expansion of concrete due to alkali–silica reaction', Cement and Concrete Research, 2000, DOI: 10.1016/s0008-8846(00)00283-0��id�eng_23_009�body���ET₀指假想参考植被的蒸散速率——株高12厘米、叶面阻力70 s/m、反照率0.23、水分充足——先剥离作物差异，仅由气象驱动。Penman-Monteith式将能量平衡与空气动力学输送耦合，以冠层阻力刻画气孔调控，物理机理明确、参数全球统一，免去Hargreaves等经验法逐地率定之弊；实际作物需水再乘系数Kc求得。�ET₀ is the evapotranspiration rate of a hypothetical reference vegetation-0.12 m tall, surface resistance 70 s/m, albedo 0.23, well watered-so crop differences are stripped out and weather alone drives it. Penman-Monteith couples the energy balance with aerodynamic transport and expresses stomatal control through canopy resistance; parameters stay consistent worldwide, sparing users the site-by-site calibration empirical formulas such as Hargreaves demand. Actual crop water need is then ET₀ times the crop coefficient Kc.�ans��src��kR.G. Allen 等，《作物蒸散：作物需水量计算指南》，FAO灌溉与排水论文第56号，1998وR.G. Allen et al., Crop Evapotranspiration: Guidelines for Computing Crop Water Requirements, FAO Irrigation and Drainage Paper 56, 1998��id�eng_23_013�body���根源在纤维形态与网上排列。单根纤维素纤维吸湿时直径可膨胀20%以上，而长度几乎不变（约1%）。纸机上纤维多数沿运行方向（MD）取向，横向（CD）因此叠加大量纤维直径方向的溶胀，湿胀幅度远超MD；干燥时受约束冻结的内应力遇高湿又部分释放，进一步放大CD变形。这种各向异性会造成套印失准与卷曲，需靠浆料处理、加填与涂布控制。�QThe origin lies in fibre geometry and its alignment on the wire. A single cellulose fibre can swell more than 20% in diameter upon moisture uptake yet barely changes in length (about 1%). Because most fibres orient along the run direction (MD), the cross direction (CD) sums many diametral swellings and shows far larger hygroexpansion and shrinkage than MD; internal stresses frozen in during restrained drying are partly released at high humidity, amplifying CD distortion further. This anisotropy causes print misregister and curl, controlled through furnish treatment, filling and coating.�ans��src�قNiskanen, K.（主编）《Paper Physics》，Papermaking Science and Technology丛书第16卷，第2版，Paperi ja Puu Oy，2011�zNiskanen, K. (ed.), Paper Physics, Papermaking Science and Technology series, Book 16, 2nd edition, Paperi ja Puu Oy, 2011��id�eng_23_016�body���定向凝固让铸型底部贴合水冷结晶器、整体在加热炉内按设定速率下拉，热量仅沿单一方向导出，柱状晶沿<001>取向纵向生长，横向晶界基本消失。晶界是蠕变孔洞与热疲劳裂纹的优先通道，消除它之后叶片在高温高应力下的持久寿命显著提高；配合选晶器引晶还能得到完全无晶界的单晶叶片。��In Bridgman-type directional solidification the shell mold rests on a water-cooled chill plate inside a furnace and is withdrawn at a controlled rate, so heat flows along one axis and columnar grains grow longitudinally in the <001> orientation while transverse grain boundaries vanish. Boundaries are fast paths for creep cavitation and thermal-fatigue cracking, so their removal markedly raises high-temperature rupture life; a pigtail selector can extend this into a fully single-crystal blade.�ans��src��LJ. Campbell《Complete Casting Handbook》（第2版），Elsevier，2015年�?J. Campbell, Complete Casting Handbook, 2nd ed., Elsevier, 2015��id�eng_23_019�body���这是相控阵原理：基站给阵列中每副天线馈入带独立相位与幅度权值的同一信号，各单元波前仅在目标方向同相叠加、其他方向相消，等效波束即被“电扫”向该用户。权值来自信道估计：TDD制式上下行共用同一频带、信道互易，基站测得上行导频的信道响应即可直接算出下行权值，无需反馈开销，也无需任何机械转动。��This is the phased-array principle: the station feeds every antenna element the same signal with its own phase and amplitude weights, so the elementary wavefronts add coherently only toward the target user and cancel elsewhere, steering the synthesized beam electronically. The weights come from channel estimation: in TDD the uplink and downlink share one band, the channel is reciprocal, and uplink pilots directly yield the downlink weights—no feedback overhead and no moving parts.�ans��src���T.L. Marzetta《Noncooperative Cellular Wireless with Unlimited Numbers of Base Station Antennas》，IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications，2010年，DOI: 10.1109/TWC.2010.092810.091092ٸT.L. Marzetta, Noncooperative Cellular Wireless with Unlimited Numbers of Base Station Antennas, IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications, 2010, DOI: 10.1109/TWC.2010.092810.091092��id�eng_24_002�body��核心概念是零力矩点(ZMP):地面支持力与重力的合力作用点。只要把它始终控制在脚掌支撑多边形内,身体就不会倾覆。控制器以数百赫兹的频率读取IMU与关节编码器,用模型预测控制滚动求解未来半秒内每一步落脚点和髋部轨迹,使ZMP轨迹贴合规划曲线;踩到石头这类扰动时,通过踝策略、跨步或甩臂角动量快速把ZMP拉回安全区。波士顿动力式的后空翻与抗推搡,本质是把这一平衡问题解得又快又鲁棒。�>The core concept is the zero-moment point (ZMP): the point where ground reaction and gravity net out. Keep it inside the foot's support polygon and the body cannot tip over. Running at hundreds of hertz, controllers read IMUs and joint encoders while model-predictive control solves for footholds and hip trajectories half a second ahead, steering the ZMP along its planned path; disturbances like stepping on a stone trigger ankle strategies, recovery steps or arm swings to yank the ZMP back. Backflips and shove-recovery are this balance problem solved fast and robustly.�ans��src��nKajita 等,《ZMP based walking control》引出体系,见 Springer Handbook of Robotics 第2版,Springer,2016�pS. Kajita et al., ZMP-based walking control framework, in Springer Handbook of Robotics, 2nd ed., Springer, 2016��id�eng_24_012�body��天然气冷却到零下162度变成体积缩水六百倍的液体,才值得跨洋运输。LNG船的绝热是生命线:主流薄膜型围护中,NO96系统用平面因瓦合金膜加珍珠岩绝缘箱,Mark III系统用波纹不锈钢膜加聚氨酯泡沫,日蒸发率控制在0.1%量级;蒸发的气体或当燃料烧掉,或再液化回舱。最怕低温液货接触船体钢致其瞬间脆裂,故接触层用耐低温合金并设二次屏障。加上惰性气体置换防爆,LNG船队至今保持着良好的安全记录。�uChilled to minus 162 degrees Celsius, natural gas shrinks six-hundredfold into liquid worth shipping across oceans. Insulation is the lifeline: among mainstream membrane systems, NO96 pairs flat Invar membranes with perlite-filled boxes while Mark III uses corrugated stainless-steel membranes with polyurethane foam, holding boil-off near 0.1 percent daily; evaporated gas burns as fuel or reliquefies into the tank. Cryogenic cargo touching hull steel would embrittle it instantly, so contact layers use cryogenic alloys behind full secondary barriers; with inert-gas purging, LNG fleets have maintained a strong safety record.�ans��src��VMokhatab 等,《Handbook of Liquefied Natural Gas》,Gulf Professional Publishing,2014�|S. Mokhatab, J. Y. Mak, J. V. Valappil and D. A. Wood, Handbook of Liquefied Natural Gas, Gulf Professional Publishing, 2014��id�eng_24_013�body��五倍音速以上,旋转叶轮会被气流磨到失效,发动机只能是一根精心塑形的管子。冲压喷气把来流减速增压后直接燃烧;但超过约六倍音速,减速到亚音速就会把气体加热到分解,于是超燃冲压让气流保持超声速穿过燃烧室,在毫秒停留时间内完成混合与点火燃烧。难点有三:燃料注入混合、火焰稳定、热防护(碳碳材料加主动冷却)。X-51A验证机2013年以约五倍音速完成三分半钟动力飞行,至今仍是工程前沿。�SPast Mach five, spinning blades disintegrate in the flow, so the engine becomes a carefully sculpted duct. Ramjets decelerate incoming air for combustion; beyond roughly Mach six even subsonic slowing heats gas until it dissociates — so scramjets keep flow supersonic through the combustor, mixing and burning within millisecond residence times. Three hard problems: fuel injection and mixing, flameholding, thermal protection with carbon-carbon composites plus active cooling. The X-51A demonstrator flew three and a half minutes at about Mach five in 2013 — still the engineering frontier.�ans��src��aCurran,《Scramjet Engines: The First Forty Years»,Journal of Propulsion and Power 第19卷,2003�_E. T. Curran, Scramjet Engines: The First Forty Years, Journal of Propulsion and Power 19, 2003��id�eng_24_015�body��6诀窍是把纯氧直接吹进铁水当氧化剂。氧枪从炉口插入,高压氧气射流穿入熔池,硅、锰、碳与磷的氧化都是强放热反应,不仅不需外热反而升温到1600度以上;碳氧化成一氧化碳气泡搅动熔池形成金属雨滴喷雾,反应面积暴增,精炼速度比平炉时代快十倍以上。终点用副枪测温取样自动判定碳含量,一键出钢。副产品物尽其用:炉渣铺路造水泥,高炉煤气与转炉煤气回收发电。现代钢铁联合企业里,矿石进门到钢卷出厂可以压缩到数小时。�}The trick is blowing pure oxygen straight into the melt as oxidizer. An oxygen lance pierces the furnace mouth; the jet drives oxidation of silicon, manganese, carbon and phosphorus — all fiercely exothermic, heating the bath past sixteen hundred degrees with no external fuel. Carbon monoxide bubbles churn the pool into a spray of droplets, multiplying reaction area and making refining more than ten times faster than the open hearth. A sublance samples temperature and carbon automatically to call the endpoint. Slag paves roads and feeds cement; converter gas returns as fuel — ore in, coil out within hours at integrated mills.�ans��src��mFruehan 主编,《The Making, Shaping and Treating of Steel: Steelmaking Volume》,AISE Steel Foundation,1998�mR. J. Fruehan ed., The Making, Shaping and Treating of Steel: Steelmaking Volume, AISE Steel Foundation, 1998��id�eng_24_018�body��:大跨桥普遍埋入成百上千个传感器:应变计记录构件受力,加速度计捕捉振动模态——结构的固有频率像指纹,某根拉索松弛或裂缝扩展会让特定频率漂移;位移计与GNSS追踪塔顶摆动,温度计区分真实损伤与热胀冷缩的伪装。数据经边缘计算压缩上传,损伤识别算法比对健康基线发出分级预警。港珠澳大桥与苏通桥都装备了此类系统。挑战在于噪声中分离信号:交通、风、温度都在振动里掺假,统计模式识别与物理模型融合是当前主战场。��Long-span bridges now embed hundreds of sensors: strain gauges log member loads; accelerometers track vibration modes — natural frequencies are fingerprints, and a slackened cable or growing crack drifts them; displacement sensors and GNSS watch tower sway while thermometers unmask fakes from thermal expansion. Edge computing compresses streams, damage-identification algorithms compare against healthy baselines, issuing graded alerts. Hong Kong-Zhuhai-Macao and Sutong both run such systems. The hard part is signal versus noise — traffic, wind and temperature all pollute vibrations, so statistics fused with physics models is the battleground.�ans��src��_Farrar 与 Worden,《Structural Health Monitoring: A Machine Learning Perspective》,Wiley,2013�eC. R. Farrar and K. Worden, Structural Health Monitoring: A Machine Learning Perspective, Wiley, 2013��id�eng_26_004�body���直答：跨膜水通量取决于净驱动压力ΔP−Δπ，压力恰好等于渗透压时通量为零，一滴淡水也产不出。机理：反渗透膜表皮层选择性透水并截留溶解盐，通量近似为J=A(ΔP−Δπ);运行中回收率升高使进料持续浓缩，浓差极化又令膜面盐度高于主体水流，局部渗透压进一步抬高，加上管路与元件的沿程损失，实际操作压力必须在渗透压之上留足裕量，现代装置靠能量回收设备控制能耗。�XWater flux across the membrane scales with the net driving pressure ΔP−Δπ; at a pressure merely equal to osmotic pressure the flux is zero and no permeate is produced. An RO membrane's skin layer passes water selectively and rejects dissolved salts, giving a flux close to J=A(ΔP−Δπ). As recovery rises the feed concentrates, concentration polarization lifts the surface salinity above the bulk flow, local osmotic pressure climbs further, and friction losses add on top, so plants operate with ample margin above osmotic pressure while energy-recovery devices keep power demand acceptable.�ans��src��yS. Sourirajan《Reverse Osmosis》，Academic Press，1970年（基于Loeb-Sourirajan非对称醋酸纤维素膜研究）�{S. Sourirajan, Reverse Osmosis, Academic Press, 1970, building on the Loeb-Sourirajan asymmetric cellulose acetate membrane��id�eng_26_007�body��直答：漏极电场穿透沟道下方的硅体直达源极，栅极失去对沟道势垒的掌控，阈值电压滚降与亚阈漏电随尺寸缩短急剧恶化;FinFET把沟道立成竖直薄鳍，让栅极三面包裹导电通道。机理：栅控强弱取决于栅长与硅体厚度之比，薄鳍把沟道厚度压到几十纳米以下，漏场对源端势垒的影响随之锐减，DIBL与阈值滚降显著缓解，亚阈摆幅向60mV/dec的理论极限逼近，器件得以在更低电压下继续微缩。�The drain field punches through the silicon body under the channel straight to the source, the gate loses command of the barrier, and threshold roll-off plus subthreshold leakage worsen sharply as dimensions shrink. A FinFET stands the channel up as a thin vertical fin that the gate wraps on both sides and the top. Gate authority scales with the ratio of gate length to body thickness: squeezing the fin below a few tens of nanometers starves the drain field of influence over the source-side barrier, easing DIBL and roll-off, driving the subthreshold swing toward the 60 mV/dec limit, and letting devices keep scaling at lower voltage.�ans��src�ٔChenming Hu 等,《FinFET-a self-aligned double-gate MOSFET scalable to 20 nm》,IEEE Transactions on Electron Devices,2000 (DOI: 10.1109/16.887014)ٕChenming Hu et al., 'FinFET-a self-aligned double-gate MOSFET scalable to 20 nm', IEEE Transactions on Electron Devices, 2000, DOI: 10.1109/16.887014��id�eng_26_012�body��直答：岩爆的本质是围岩积聚的弹性应变能超过岩石破坏所需能量后的猛烈释放，深部高强度硬岩恰好具备该条件。机理：地应力随埋深成倍增长，坚硬完整岩体刚度大、储能能力强，开挖卸荷前洞周已积蓄大量弹性应变能；临空面形成后应力向洞壁集中，能量释放速率一旦超过裂纹扩展的耗能速率，破裂便以片帮弹射甚至抛掷形式瞬间发生；软岩强度低，能量经塑性流动提前耗散，故表现为缓慢收敛。��A rockburst is the violent release of strain energy stored in surrounding rock once it exceeds what rock failure consumes — exactly what deep, strong hard rock provides. In-situ stress grows severalfold with depth while stiff intact rock is an able energy reservoir, so plenty of elastic strain accumulates near the opening before excavation unloads it. When the free face forms and stress concentrates on the tunnel wall, any release rate outrunning crack-growth dissipation turns failure explosive — slabbing, ejection, even throwing of rock — whereas weak soft rock bleeds the same energy away through plastic flow and merely squeezes.�ans��src���蔡美峰主编《岩石力学与工程》，科学出版社，2002年 ; 另见: P.K. Kaiser & M. Cai, Design of rock support system under rockburst condition, Journal of Rock Mechanics and Geotechnical Engineering, 2012, 4(3), pp.215-227��P.K. Kaiser & M. Cai, Design of rock support system under rockburst condition, Journal of Rock Mechanics and Geotechnical Engineering, 2012, 4(3), pp.215-227 ; see also: 蔡美峰主编《岩石力学与工程》，科学出版社，2002年��id�eng_26_015�body��直答：薄膜是果蔬与外界之间的气体交换阀，只有氧气与二氧化碳透过量分别等于呼吸耗氧和产二氧化碳的速率，袋内才能稳定保持低氧高二氧化碳的目标气氛。机理：呼吸速率随温度近乎指数上升，膜的渗透遵循溶解扩散规律且温敏性弱；透气太快则袋内接近空气组分，抑菌与降呼吸作用落空，透气太慢则氧气耗尽转入无氧发酵，乙醇乙醛累积导致异味与腐败，故须按呼吸强度与贮运温度核算膜厚与面积。��The film works as a gas-exchange valve between produce and the outside world: only when oxygen ingress and carbon dioxide efflux equal the rates consumed and released by respiration will the headspace settle stably at the target low-oxygen, high-carbon-dioxide mix. Respiration climbs almost exponentially with temperature while film permeation follows solution-diffusion behavior and is far less temperature-sensitive. A film too open leaves the pack near ordinary air and forfeits antimicrobial and respiration-suppressing effects; one too tight exhausts the oxygen into anaerobic fermentation, where ethanol and acetaldehyde build up into off-flavors and rot — so thickness and area must be computed from respiration intensity and storage temperature.�ans��src�ٽ章建浩主编《食品包装学》，中国农业出版社，2017年 ; 另见: A.L. Brody, E.P. Strupinsky & L.R. Kline, Active Packaging for Food Applications, Technomic Publishing, 2001ٿA.L. Brody, E.P. Strupinsky & L.R. Kline, Active Packaging for Food Applications, Technomic Publishing, 2001 ; see also: 章建浩主编《食品包装学》，中国农业出版社，2017年��id�eng_26_016�body��4直答：交通流存在临界密度，主线密度一旦越过临界值，车流失稳且通行能力还会额外跌落约百分之五到十，匝道控制的实质就是把主线状态锁定在临界密度以下的最佳流率附近。机理：密度低于临界点时流量随密度上升，突破瓶颈能力后激波回荡、排队向上游蔓延，形成越堵越少的恶性循环；匝道信号以每次放行一两辆车的节奏调节汇入率，用匝道上数十秒的有序等待换取主线数千辆车的稳定通行，系统总延误因此下降。�KTraffic flow has a critical density: once mainline density crosses it, flow destabilizes and capacity drops an extra five to ten percent, so metering essentially pins the mainline near its best flow rate below that point. Below critical, throughput rises with density; beyond it, shockwaves roll back and queues march upstream, producing the perverse regime where more cars mean fewer vehicles through. Releasing cars one or two at a time paces the merge, so dozens of seconds of orderly waiting on the ramp buy steady movement for thousands on the mainline and total system delay falls.�ans��src���杨佩昆、吴兵主编《交通管理与控制》，人民交通出版社，2003年 ; 另见: M. Papageorgiou & A. Kotsialos, Freeway Ramp Metering: An Overview, IEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems, 2002, 3(4), pp.271-281��M. Papageorgiou & A. Kotsialos, Freeway Ramp Metering: An Overview, IEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems, 2002, 3(4), pp.271-281 ; see also: 杨佩昆、吴兵主编《交通管理与控制》，人民交通出版社，2003年��id�f150e985efa7�body��卡诺效率只取决于高温热源与低温热源的温度比值，表示在理想可逆循环中热量转化为功的最大可能比例。任何实际循环都有摩擦、不可逆传热等损失，因此其效率必然低于这个由温度决定的上限。�Carnot efficiency depends only on the hot and cold reservoir temperatures and represents the maximum fraction of heat convertible to work in an ideal reversible cycle. Real cycles have friction and irreversible heat transfer, so they can never exceed this temperature-limited bound.�ans��src��@Cengel，《工程热力学：一种工程方法》（第9版）�;Cengel, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach' (9th ed.)��id�f4460aceb58e�body���滑移率指车轮在制动或驱动时实际车速与轮速的相对差，纯滚动为0，完全抱死为100%。轮胎与地面的纵向附着力随滑移率先上升后下降，在约15%至20%时出现峰值，之后进入滑动区，附着系数反而降低。ABS把滑移率控制在峰值附近，就是希望始终利用最大附着力，同时保留侧向力能力以维持转向稳定，避免车轮抱死。��Slip ratio is the relative difference between vehicle speed and wheel speed under braking or driving, 0 percent in pure rolling and 100 percent when locked. Longitudinal adhesion between tyre and road first rises with slip, peaks around 15 to 20 percent, then falls as the contact patch slides. ABS holds slip near this peak to use maximum adhesion while retaining lateral force for steering stability, precisely so that the wheels never lock.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�f4595852a5cb�body���流体绕流钝体时周期性交替脱落的旋涡在下游排成两列，形成卡门涡街。其脱落频率与结构固有频率接近时会诱发涡激振动，长期作用可致桥梁、烟囱等疲劳损伤甚至破坏。�(Flow past a bluff body sheds vortices alternately, arranging into two staggered rows downstream known as a Karman vortex street. When the shedding frequency nears a structure's natural frequency it causes vortex-induced vibration, which can fatigue and even destroy bridges or chimneys over time.�ans��src��>Blevins《Flow-Induced Vibration》（Van Nostrand Reinhold）�6Blevins, Flow-Induced Vibration, Van Nostrand Reinhold��id�f8ae2512b6ae�body��␀卡诺定理指出，工作在高温热源与低温热源之间的任何热机，其理想最高效率为1减去低温热源温度除以高温热源温度（温度用热力学温标）。实际热机因摩擦和不可逆损失永远达不到这一上限。��Carnot's theorem says the maximum possible efficiency of any engine between hot reservoir T_h and cold T_c is 1 − T_c/T_h in kelvin. Real engines fall short due to friction and irreversibilities.�ans��src��ICarnot《论火的动力》(1824)；Cengel 与 Boles《工程热力学》�sCarnot, 'Reflections on the Motive Power of Fire' (1824); Cengel & Boles, 'Thermodynamics: An Engineering Approach'��id�f93b54990f25�body���HAZOP由多专业团队按节点（如管路、容器、工序）逐段分析，把设计参数（流量、压力、温度、液位等）与引导词（多、少、无、反向等）组合，推演偏离设计意图的情况及其原因和后果，再评估现有保护措施是否充分。引导词法保证审查全面而不遗漏偏差，最终给出需降低风险的整改建议，是流程工业安全审查的标准方法。�-A HAZOP study is carried out by a multi-disciplinary team node by node (lines, vessels, operations), combining process parameters (flow, pressure, temperature, level) with guide words (more, less, none, reverse) to reason out deviations from design intent, their causes and consequences, and to judge whether existing safeguards are adequate. The guide-word method ensures the review is exhaustive and misses no deviation, and the outcome is a set of recommendations for reducing risk; it is the standard hazard-review methodology of the process industries.�ans��src�و国际电工委员会（IEC）,《Hazard and operability studies (HAZOP studies). Application guide》,IEC 61882 (DOI: 10.3403/30309555)�jIEC, 'Hazard and operability studies (HAZOP studies). Application guide', IEC 61882, DOI: 10.3403/30309555��id�f946b01c67bf�body��受压细长杆在载荷达到欧拉临界力时，直线平衡状态失稳：轴向压力"耗尽"了杆的侧向弯曲刚度，杆会突然横向弯出，即使此时杆内应力还远低于材料强度。临界力与长度的平方成反比、与截面惯性矩成正比，所以长度增加危险性急剧上升，加大截面（如宽翼缘工字钢、钢管混凝土）则能有效抗屈曲。与压碎不同，屈曲本质是几何稳定问题，失效表现为整体弯折或扭转，是钢结构和高层建筑必须验算的内容。��When a slender column's axial load reaches the Euler critical load, its straight equilibrium loses stability: the axial force "spends" the lateral bending stiffness, and the column suddenly bows sideways even though the internal stress is still far below the material strength. Critical load falls with the square of length and rises with the section's moment of inertia, so extra length is dramatically dangerous while a larger section (wide-flange I-beam, concrete-filled steel tube) resists buckling well. Unlike crushing, buckling is a problem of geometric stability, failing as a sudden bend or twist — a required check in steel and tall-building design.�ans��src��E刘鸿文 主编,《材料力学》第6版,高等教育出版社,2017�NLiu Hongwen ed., Mechanics of Materials, 6th ed., Higher Education Press, 2017��id�fa69b1fbc986�body���空气中二氧化碳渗入混凝土孔隙，与氢氧化钙反应生成碳酸钙，使孔溶液碱度下降。当碳化前沿到达钢筋表面时，钝化膜破坏、钢筋开始锈蚀，进而胀裂混凝土、削弱截面。�Atmospheric CO2 penetrates concrete pores and reacts with calcium hydroxide to form calcium carbonate, lowering pore solution alkalinity. When the carbonation front reaches the rebar, the passive film breaks down and corrosion starts, cracking concrete and reducing section.�ans��src��B《混凝土结构设计原理》（中国建筑工业出版社）�RMehta & Monteiro, Concrete: Microstructure, Properties, and Materials, McGraw-Hill��id�fb79afc31efa�body���光刻先在硅片涂光敏光刻胶，用掩模版遮挡后曝光，使受光区域化学性质改变，再经显影去掉相应部分，露出图案，随后刻蚀或掺杂把图形转移到下层。它是决定芯片集成度的关键工艺。��Lithography coats the wafer with photosensitive resist, exposes it through a mask, develops away the changed parts to reveal a pattern, then etches or dopes to transfer it. It sets how densely chips can be integrated.�ans��src��`David Macaulay,《The Way Things Work》,Houghton Mifflin,1988;中译《万物运转的秘密》�ED. Macaulay, The Way Things Work, Houghton Mifflin, 1988; Chinese ed.��id�fece27e7a1a5�body���多个零件的尺寸公差沿同一方向累积，可能使总误差超出设计要求，导致装不上、间隙过大或干涉。公差分析（如极值法或统计法）用来预测并控制这种累积。��Dimensional tolerances of several parts accumulate along one direction and may exceed design limits, causing misfit, excess gap, or interference. Tolerance analysis (worst-case or statistical) predicts and controls it.�ans��src��Z濮良贵 陈国定 吴立言 主编,《机械设计》第10版,高等教育出版社,2019�ePiao Lianggui, Chen Guoding and Wu Liyan eds., Machine Design, 10th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�ff90d343f93a�body��␀这是金属增材制造中的粉末床熔融工艺：激光或电子束按切片数据逐层扫描金属粉末，每层熔化凝固后铺新粉再熔，层层堆积成零件。激光工艺必须在氩气或氮气等惰性气氛中进行，防止高温熔池被氧化——氧化会让材料变脆并产生气孔；电子束工艺则在真空室中完成，真空同样隔绝了氧。但逐层快速熔凝带来两大工程难题：一是残余应力大，热应力会让薄壁件翘曲开裂，所以需要支撑结构和打印后的去应力热处理；二是凝固组织方向性强（柱状晶），力学性能存在各向异性，常需热等静压消除内部孔隙。它擅长制造复杂内腔和拓扑优化结构，但成本和速度仍高于传统加工。��This is the powder-bed fusion process of metal additive manufacturing: a laser or electron beam scans each sliced layer over metal powder, melting and solidifying it, then fresh powder is spread and melted again, building the part up layer by layer. Laser-based processes run in an inert atmosphere (argon or nitrogen) to keep the molten pool from oxidizing — oxidation embrittles the material and creates pores; electron-beam melting instead works in a vacuum chamber, which excludes oxygen just as effectively. Rapid layer-wise melting brings two hard problems: large residual stress, which warps and cracks thin features (hence supports and stress-relief heat treatment), and strongly directional columnar solidification giving anisotropic mechanical properties, usually remedied by hot isostatic pressing to close internal pores. It excels at complex internal channels and topology-optimized parts, but remains slower and costlier than conventional machining.�ans��src���DebRoy、Wei、Zuback 与 Mukherjee,《Additive manufacturing of metallic components – Process, structure and properties》,Progress in Materials Science,2018 (DOI: 10.1016/j.pmatsci.2017.10.001)ٿDebRoy, Wei, Zuback & Mukherjee, 'Additive manufacturing of metallic components – Process, structure and properties', Progress in Materials Science, 2018, DOI: 10.1016/j.pmatsci.2017.10.001��id�ffc47138e315�body��/串联弹性驱动器在电机与负载之间刻意串入一个已知刚度的弹簧，通过测量弹簧变形就能换算出输出力矩。弹簧还能吸收落地冲击、保护减速器，并让力控带宽内的力跟踪更平顺。缺点是弹性降低了位置控制带宽，高频响应变差。��A series elastic actuator deliberately places a spring of known stiffness between the motor and the load, so measuring the spring deflection gives an accurate estimate of output torque. The spring also absorbs landing impacts, protects the gearbox and makes force tracking smoother within the control bandwidth. The drawback is that the added compliance lowers position-control bandwidth and degrades high-frequency response.�ans��src��Koda, Osawa, Nagatsuka, Kariya,《Development of Bidirectional Series Elastic Actuator with Torsion Coil Spring and Implementation to the Legged Robot》,2024 IEEE/RSJ International Conference on Intelligent Robots,2024 (DOI: 10.1109/iros58592.2024.10802064)�␀Koda, Osawa, Nagatsuka, Kariya, 'Development of Bidirectional Series Elastic Actuator with Torsion Coil Spring and Implementation to the Legged Robot', 2024 IEEE/RSJ International Conference on Intelligent Robots, 2024, DOI: 10.1109/iros58592.2024.10802064��id�09cb3cdae45a�body���罗马混凝土用火山灰、石灰和碎石混合，遇海水会生成稀有矿物而越来越硬，故海港建筑千年不倒。它与现代水泥机理不同，近年被重新研究以造耐久低碳混凝土。�Roman concrete mixed volcanic ash, lime, and rubble; in seawater it formed rare minerals that made it harder over time, so harbor structures survive millennia. Its mechanism differs from modern cement and is studied again to make durable, low-carbon concrete.�ans��src��jLehner《完整的金字塔》；Jackson 等《PNAS》2013（罗马混凝土）；中国《赵州桥志》�cLehner, The Complete Pyramids; Jackson et al., PNAS (2013, Roman concrete); Zhaozhou Bridge Records��id�0c4cf67ad420�body���正交异性钢桥面板是用纵肋和横肋加劲的薄钢板，既当桥面又当主梁上翼缘，自重轻、承载力高。它广泛用于大跨钢桥，但焊缝疲劳是常见病害。设计需仔细控制细节以抗疲劳。�LAn orthotropic steel deck is a thin steel plate stiffened by longitudinal and transverse ribs; it serves both as the roadway and the top flange of the girder, so it is light yet strong. It is widely used in long-span steel bridges, but weld fatigue is a common problem. Detailing must be carefully controlled for fatigue resistance.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�0e4e156cb2e4�body��结构冗余度指结构中存在多余传力路径，使局部构件失效后荷载仍能绕行到达支撑。冗余度高的建筑在意外损伤时不易整体倒塌，抗连续倒塌能力强。设计规范常以冗余度区分重要性和安全等级。�Structural redundancy means a structure has extra load paths so that if one member fails, loads can still detour to supports. A highly redundant structure resists progressive collapse when unexpectedly damaged. Design codes often use redundancy to classify importance and safety levels.�ans��src��b中国《混凝土结构设计规范》GB 50010；《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009；ACI 318�nChina Code for Design of Concrete Structures (GB 50010); Load Code for Building Structures (GB 50009); ACI 318��id�0f30c4a962f1�body��v连续倒塌指局部构件（例如底层一根柱）意外失效后，荷载重分配使相邻构件相继失效，破坏范围远超初始损伤，典型案例是伦敦 Ronan Point 公寓和俄克拉何马城 Murrah 联邦大楼。备用荷载路径法要求假想拆除某个关键竖向构件，验算剩余结构能否通过梁的连续性、悬链作用和楼板双向传力把荷载绕过缺口传到基础，并配置足够的水平与竖向拉结件。与之互补的思路是对关键构件做局部加强；由于这属于极端偶然作用，验算允许材料进入大变形与塑性并采用较低的荷载系数。��Progressive collapse is the chain of failures that follows when a local element such as a ground-floor column is lost and redistributed load overwhelms its neighbours, spreading damage far beyond the initial harm, as at Ronan Point and the Murrah Federal Building. The alternate-path method notionally removes a key vertical element and checks whether the remaining structure can bridge the gap through beam continuity, catenary action and two-way slab behaviour, backed by adequate horizontal and vertical ties. The complementary route is specific local strengthening of key elements, and because this is an extreme accidental scenario the check permits large deformation and plastic response with reduced load factors.�ans��src��T美国国防部 UFC 4-023-03《Design of Buildings to Resist Progressive Collapse》�^U.S. Department of Defense, UFC 4-023-03, 'Design of Buildings to Resist Progressive Collapse'��id�150455305391�body���钙钛矿电池用一种钙钛矿结构材料吸光发电，实验室效率已超25%且成本低、可柔性制备。它可与晶硅叠层进一步提升效率。主要瓶颈是长期稳定性和大面积均匀制备。�(A perovskite solar cell uses a perovskite-structured material to absorb light and generate power; lab efficiency exceeds 25% with low cost and flexible fabrication. It can be stacked on silicon to push efficiency higher. The main bottlenecks are long-term stability and uniform large-area making.�ans��src��<Green & Emery《太阳能电池原理》；NREL 光伏研究�7Green & Emery, Solar Cells; NREL photovoltaics research��id�2024bd019b4c�body���卡尔曼滤波把系统模型的预测与传感器的测量按各自不确定度加权融合，不确定度小的一方权重大。在线性系统且噪声为高斯白噪声的假设下，它给出的估计在均方误差意义上是最优的，同时还输出协方差表示置信度。工程上它广泛用于导航和组合定位，非线性问题则用扩展卡尔曼或粒子滤波近似处理。��The Kalman filter blends the model's prediction with the sensor measurement, weighting each by its uncertainty so that the more trustworthy source dominates. Under the assumptions of a linear system with Gaussian white noise its estimate is optimal in the minimum mean-square-error sense, and it also outputs a covariance describing confidence. It is widely used in navigation and integrated positioning, while nonlinear problems are approximated with extended Kalman or particle filters.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�209284d25988�body���信号优先控制在公交或轻轨接近路口时，自动延长绿灯或缩短红灯以减少等待。它提升公共交通准点率和吸引力。需与路网整体配时协调避免连锁延误。��Transit signal priority automatically extends a green or shortens a red when a bus or light rail approaches, reducing its wait. It improves public transit punctuality and attractiveness. It must coordinate with area-wide timing to avoid cascading delays.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�295c6c29985b�body�ٖ结构健康监测用应变、位移、加速度等传感器实时盯挠度、裂缝和振动，预警超载、疲劳或损伤，避免突发垮塌。�Structural health monitoring tracks strain, displacement, and vibration to warn of overload, fatigue, or cracks before failure.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�33751ec383df�body���列车空气动力学研究高速运行时的空气阻力、列车交会和隧道压力波等问题。阻力随速度平方增长，是能耗主因之一。流线型车头和密封车体可减弱隧道微压波噪声。��Train aerodynamics studies air drag, train-passing effects, and tunnel pressure waves at high speed. Drag grows with the square of speed and is a major energy consumer. Streamlined noses and sealed bodies reduce tunnel micro-pressure-wave noise.�ans��src��3Anderson，《空气动力学基础》（第6版）�2Anderson, 'Fundamentals of Aerodynamics' (6th ed.)��id�35b24301b4e2�body���感应电机的磁通近似与电压幅值除以频率成正比。若只降频率不降电压，磁通会大幅增加使铁心饱和，励磁电流暴涨、发热严重；若只升频率不升电压，磁通减小则转矩不足。保持电压与频率之比恒定可维持额定磁通，从而在很宽的转速范围内输出恒定转矩，基频以上则进入恒功率弱磁区。��Flux in an induction motor is roughly proportional to voltage amplitude divided by frequency. Lowering frequency without lowering voltage raises flux, saturating the iron so magnetising current and heating soar, while raising frequency without raising voltage weakens flux and torque. Keeping the voltage-to-frequency ratio constant maintains rated flux and constant torque over a wide speed range, and above base frequency the drive enters the constant-power field-weakening region.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�3bbc7f7f9d1b�body���外骨骼通过多种信号推测意图：关节角与角速度反映当前步态相位，足底压力判断支撑腿与摆动腿切换，表面肌电或人机接触力可在动作发生前几十毫秒捕捉发力趋势。控制器把这些信号送入状态机或学习模型，判定意图后再输出助力力矩。误判会让人对抗设备，因此意图识别的可靠性比助力大小更关键。�An exoskeleton infers intent from several signals: joint angles and rates indicate the current gait phase, insole pressure reveals the switch between stance and swing leg, and surface electromyography or human-machine interaction forces can catch muscle effort tens of milliseconds before motion. A state machine or learned model combines these signals to classify intent before commanding assistive torque. Misclassification makes the wearer fight the device, so reliable intent recognition matters more than raw assistance power.�ans��src���Wang, Zhang, Zhao, He,《Pattern recognition of electromyography applied to Exoskeleton Robot》,2010 3rd International Congress on Image and Signal Processi,2010 (DOI: 10.1109/cisp.2010.5646759)��Wang, Zhang, Zhao, He, 'Pattern recognition of electromyography applied to Exoskeleton Robot', 2010 3rd International Congress on Image and Signal Processi, 2010, DOI: 10.1109/cisp.2010.5646759��id�41cb93d0af9a�body�٦微波约2.45GHz让食物里的水等极性分子高速往复翻转、摩擦生热，是从内部加热；金属腔体把波限制在里面，转盘让受热更匀。ٝAt about 2.45GHz microwaves make polar molecules like water jiggle and heat from inside; the metal cavity confines the waves and the turntable evens heating.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�44fac10c1c7f�body���自修复材料内部含微胶囊或可逆化学键，出现微裂纹时自动释放修复剂或重新结合，恢复性能。它可延长混凝土、涂层和聚合物的寿命。目前多用于防护和航天领域。�Self-healing materials contain microcapsules or reversible bonds that release healing agents or re-bond when microcracks appear, restoring properties. They can extend the life of concrete, coatings, and polymers. Today they are mostly used in protection and aerospace.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�4e972fc5fab6�body�ٖ不一样。超声波型用高频振动把水打成微米水雾；蒸发型靠风扇吹过湿网自然蒸发，不起白雾也不易把水垢吹出。ىUltrasonic ones vibrate water into a fine mist; evaporative ones blow air through a wet wick, with no white plume and less mineral spray.�ans��src��DKinsler、Frey、Coppens & Sanders，《声学基础》（第4版）�GKinsler, Frey, Coppens & Sanders, 'Fundamentals of Acoustics' (4th ed.)��id�55053288f938�body���超高层和异形建筑会在风洞中放置缩尺模型，测量风压分布、风致振动和行人区风环境。试验结果用于优化外形、布置阻尼器和确定幕墙抗风设计。它是复杂外形建筑安全验证的重要手段。�:Very tall and unusually shaped buildings place scaled models in wind tunnels to measure wind pressure, wind-induced vibration, and pedestrian-level wind comfort. The results help optimize the shape, position dampers, and set curtain-wall wind resistance. It is a key tool for verifying the safety of complex forms.�ans��src��L《建筑结构荷载规范》GB 50009-2012,中国建筑工业出版社,2012�hLoad Code for the Design of Building Structures GB 50009-2012, China Architecture & Building Press, 2012��id�5953a4fdf289�body���颤振是风作用下桥梁扭转与弯曲振动相互耦合、振幅自我放大的一种发散性失稳。1940年塔科马大桥就因颤振坍塌。现代设计用风洞试验和气动外形来抑制它。�Flutter is a divergent instability in which torsional and bending vibrations of a bridge couple under wind and amplify each other. The 1940 Tacoma Narrows Bridge collapsed due to flutter. Modern designs use wind tunnel tests and aerodynamic shaping to suppress it.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�5d6517e944af�body���LCA 把原料开采、制造、运输、使用到报废的全链条清单化，再乘排放因子求和。争论多因系统边界、数据来源和分摊方法不同，同一产品结论可差很多。��LCA inventories the whole chain—extraction, manufacturing, transport, use, disposal—then sums emissions by factors. Disputes arise because boundaries, data and allocation methods differ, so the same product gets very different numbers.�ans��src��OISO 14040，《环境管理—生命周期评价—原则与框架》（2006）�cISO 14040, 'Environmental Management — Life Cycle Assessment — Principles and Framework' (2006)��id�5f77ea966214�body�٨它能快速切换产品型号，通过可重构工装、快换夹具和调度系统，在同一产线上高效生产多品种、小批量订单，降低换型时间。٢It switches product types quickly using reconfigurable fixtures and smart scheduling to build many variants in small batches on one line, cutting changeover time.�ans��src��VIEC 61131-3（PLC）；ISO 3691-4（AGV 安全）；Groover《自动化生产系统》�zIEC 61131-3 (PLC); ISO 3691-4 (AGV safety); Groover, Automation, Production Systems, and Computer-Integrated Manufacturing��id�606b30cc3cda�body���第四代核反应堆是六种先进概念的总称，强调更安全、更经济、防扩散和高效利用燃料。例如快堆可增殖燃料，高温气冷堆用惰性气体冷却。部分设计具备被动安全，无需外部干预即可停堆。�,Generation IV refers to six advanced reactor concepts emphasizing safety, economy, proliferation resistance, and efficient fuel use. For example, fast reactors breed fuel and high-temperature gas-cooled reactors use inert gas cooling. Some have passive safety that shuts down without external action.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�64306bb9b47e�body���SMR 功率小、采用被动安全设计，靠自然对流和重力等非能动方式在事故时自动冷却，无需外部电力。工厂预制、批量生产也降低成本和建造周期。��SMRs are lower power with passive safety: natural convection and gravity cool them automatically in accidents without external power. Factory prefabrication and serial production also cut cost and build time.�ans��src��;IAEA，《小型模块化反应堆技术进展》（2020）�HIAEA, 'Advances in Small Modular Reactor Technology Developments' (2020)��id�643c29ad3156�body��R逆作法先施作围护墙和竖向支承桩柱，再自上而下逐层浇筑楼板，把已完成的楼板当作围护结构的水平内支撑，然后在其下方掏挖土方。与顺作法的临时钢支撑相比，永久楼板刚度大、变形小，能显著减小围护墙位移和邻近建筑、管线的沉降，特别适合城市密集区以及需要早期恢复地面交通的场地。代价是地下作业空间受限、出土与通风效率低，竖向支承柱的定位与沉降控制要求极高，新旧混凝土和柱板节点构造复杂，工期与造价往往高于顺作。��Top-down construction first installs the retaining wall and vertical support columns, then casts each floor slab from the top downward and uses those completed slabs as stiff permanent props for the wall while soil beneath is mined out. Compared with temporary steel struts in bottom-up work, permanent slabs are far stiffer, so wall movement and settlement of adjacent buildings and utilities shrink markedly, which suits dense urban sites and cases where the street surface must reopen early. The trade-offs are cramped underground working space, slow muck removal and ventilation, very tight tolerances on column position and settlement, complex joints between old and new concrete, and schedule and cost that often exceed bottom-up methods.�ans��src��QPuller，《Deep Excavations: A Practical Manual》（第2版，Thomas Telford）�HPuller, 'Deep Excavations: A Practical Manual' (2nd ed., Thomas Telford)��id�6663c2f8d0de�body�ٓ采用无缝线路，用扣件把长轨牢牢锁定在轨枕上，靠强大阻力憋住温度应力；铺轨选在适中温度并留释放设计。مContinuously welded rail is clamped so strong fastener resistance contains thermal stress; laying temperature is chosen to manage it.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�76072bcc22ce�body���桥梁健康监测系统在桥上布置传感器，长期采集应变、位移、温度和振动等数据。通过模型比对判断结构是否损伤或退化。它帮助养护部门在事故前发现隐患。�"A bridge health monitoring system places sensors on the structure to continuously collect strain, displacement, temperature, and vibration data. By comparing with models it judges whether damage or deterioration has occurred. It helps maintenance teams find hazards before accidents happen.�ans��src��EChen 与 Duan 主编,《Bridge Engineering Handbook》,CRC Press,2000�IW.-F. Chen and L. Duan eds., Bridge Engineering Handbook, CRC Press, 2000��id�774fb7c1e5c7�body��S机身姿态传感器立刻检测到速度和倾角的突变，控制器据此重新规划落足点，把支撑多边形移到质心运动的前方。这一过程常用简化的质心动力学模型做模型预测控制，在几十毫秒内滚动优化未来几步。同时腿部采用力控实现柔顺着地，避免反弹再次失稳。��Body-mounted sensors immediately detect the sudden change in velocity and tilt, and the controller replans footholds so the support polygon moves ahead of the centre of mass motion. This is usually done with model predictive control on a simplified centroidal dynamics model, re-optimising the next few steps within tens of milliseconds. At the same time the legs use force control for compliant touchdown so the robot does not bounce and destabilise again.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8a8cc54f1da5�body���悬空寺建于恒山峭壁，木梁插入岩体横孔并楔紧形成悬臂支撑，把荷载传到山体。它选址在凹崖避风避雨，减少风化。三教合一的建筑历经1500年不坠。� The Hanging Temple is built on a Hengshan cliff; wooden beams inserted into rock cross-holes and wedged form cantilever supports that transfer loads into the mountain. Sited in a recessed crag, it avoids wind and rain and thus weathering. This three-religion temple has stood 1,500 years.�ans��src��7Hibbeler，《工程力学：静力学》（第14版）�5Hibbeler, 'Engineering Mechanics: Statics' (14th ed.)��id�8e6afc5e0a2d�body�ٽ形状记忆合金（如镍钛诺）在受热后能从变形状态恢复原先形状，因晶体相变可逆。它用于血管支架、眼镜架和温控阀门。还能表现出超弹性。��A shape memory alloy such as Nitinol returns to its original shape after heating from a deformed state, thanks to a reversible crystal phase change. It is used in vascular stents, eyeglass frames, and temperature valves. It can also show superelasticity.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�90f06da9ca65�body���古罗马道路用多层结构：大石块基层、碎石层和楔石路面，并设排水坡度和笔直选线。它们连接帝国各行省，至今部分路基仍结实。俗语“条条大路通罗马”即源于此。�Roman roads used layered construction: large stone foundation, rubble, and fitted surface stones, with drainage camber and straight alignment. They linked the empire's provinces, and some roadbeds remain solid today. The saying 'all roads lead to Rome' comes from this.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�999044da18bb�body���光刻把电路图案通过掩模和光投射到涂有光刻胶的硅片上，再经显影刻蚀转移到芯片。它是决定芯片线宽和集成度的核心工艺。极紫外（EUV）光刻可达几纳米精度。��Photolithography projects a circuit pattern through a mask onto a photoresist-coated silicon wafer, then develops and etches it onto the chip. It is the core process setting line width and integration. EUV lithography reaches a few-nanometer precision.�ans��src��qS.A. Campbell《The Science and Engineering of Microelectronic Fabrication》第4版,Oxford University Press,2018�rS. A. Campbell, The Science and Engineering of Microelectronic Fabrication, 4th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�9990de305210�body���固态电池用固体电解质代替易燃液态电解液，安全性更高且能量密度更大。它有望让电动车续航更长、充电更快。大规模量产仍受材料和界面阻抗制约。�A solid-state battery replaces the flammable liquid electrolyte with a solid one, improving safety and enabling higher energy density. It could give EVs longer range and faster charging. Mass production is still limited by materials and interface resistance.�ans��src��^Janek & Zeier，《电池发展的固态未来》，《自然·能源》1卷，16141（2016）�VJanek & Zeier, 'A solid future for battery development,' Nature Energy 1, 16141 (2016)��id�a72febe3b980�body���增材制造（工业3D打印）按三维模型逐层堆积材料成型，几乎不受形状复杂度限制。它适合小批量和个性化、拓扑优化件。缺点是速度和材料种类仍受限。��Additive manufacturing, or industrial 3D printing, builds parts layer by layer from a 3D model, with almost no limit from shape complexity. It suits small batches, customization, and topology-optimized parts. Limits are speed and available materials.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�a8b58187c409�body���轮对的两个车轮固接在同一车轴上，踏面带约 1:20 到 1:40 的锥度，当轮对偏离轨道中心时，一侧滚动半径变大、另一侧变小，同一转速下两轮行程不同，轮对便自动向中心回摆，这就是不需要转向机构的自导向原理。但这种回复运动与轮轨蠕滑力构成的系统在高速下阻尼不足，轮对会绕垂轴周期性偏摆并沿线路蜿蜒前进，即蛇行运动，超过临界速度后振幅剧增，加剧轮轨磨耗甚至危及行车安全。因此设计要在踏面锥度、一次悬挂纵横向刚度和抗蛇行减振器之间取得平衡，让自导向能力与蛇行临界速度同时满足要求。�Both wheels of a wheelset are rigid on one axle and their treads are coned at roughly 1:20 to 1:40, so when the set shifts off centre one wheel rolls on a larger radius and the other on a smaller one, making the set steer itself back toward the track centre without any steering linkage. That restoring action combined with wheel-rail creep forces forms a lightly damped system, and above a critical speed the wheelset yaws periodically and snakes along the track — hunting — with amplitude growing sharply, causing heavy wheel and rail wear and eventually threatening safety. Vehicle design therefore balances tread conicity, primary suspension longitudinal and lateral stiffness and yaw dampers so self-steering is retained while the hunting critical speed stays above operating speed.�ans��src��SIwnicki（编），《Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics》（CRC Press，2006）�GIwnicki (ed.), 'Handbook of Railway Vehicle Dynamics' (CRC Press, 2006)��id�b369c69f6b4f�body���风-车-桥耦合振动研究强风下行驶车辆、桥梁结构和风三者互相作用引起的振动。它关系到行车安全和舒适，尤其在跨海大桥上突出。分析需用多体动力学与风洞、数值结合的方法。�,Wind-vehicle-bridge coupled vibration studies how a moving vehicle, the bridge structure, and wind interact to cause oscillations under strong wind. It affects driving safety and comfort, especially on sea-crossing bridges. Analysis combines multibody dynamics with wind tunnel and numerical methods.�ans��src�ٵWu, Qiu, Wu, Yao, Guo,《Coupled Vibration Analysis of Ice–Wind–Vehicle–Bridge Interaction System》,Journal of Marine Science and Engineering,2023 (DOI: 10.3390/jmse11030535)ٳWu, Qiu, Wu, Yao, Guo, 'Coupled Vibration Analysis of Ice–Wind–Vehicle–Bridge Interaction System', Journal of Marine Science and Engineering, 2023, DOI: 10.3390/jmse11030535��id�bc0186564997�body���拓扑绝缘体体内绝缘而表面能导电，且表面电流受拓扑保护不易被杂质散射。它在自旋电子和量子计算中有潜力。2016年诺贝尔物理学奖与拓扑相研究相关。�A topological insulator is insulating inside but conducts on its surface, where currents are topologically protected from scattering by impurities. It has potential in spintronics and quantum computing. The 2016 Nobel Prize in Physics related to topological phase research.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�bf5a6484b769�body���串级控制用两个嵌套回路，外环控制最终关心的慢变量并输出内环的设定值，内环控制响应快的中间变量。加热炉的炉温变化慢、滞后大，若直接调燃料阀，燃气压力波动会先破坏温度；把燃气流量做成内环快速稳住，外环温度回路就只需应对慢过程。这样抗扰能力和调节品质都明显提高。�Cascade control uses two nested loops: the outer loop regulates the slow variable that really matters and outputs the setpoint for the inner loop, which regulates a fast intermediate variable. Furnace temperature changes slowly with large lag, so adjusting the fuel valve directly lets gas pressure fluctuations upset the temperature first; making gas flow a fast inner loop stabilises that quickly, leaving the outer temperature loop to handle only the slow process. Disturbance rejection and control quality both improve markedly.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�bf78c8d4e857�body�ٷ金属泡沫是内部充满气孔的多孔金属，密度低、吸能好且可隔音隔热。它用于缓冲吸能、散热和轻量化结构。制备常用发泡或粉末冶金法。��Metal foam is a porous metal full of internal voids, with low density, good energy absorption, and sound and heat insulation. It is used for cushioning, heat dissipation, and lightweight structures. It is usually made by foaming or powder metallurgy.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�c19835bd3786�body���超过临界温度和压力后，流体密度接近液体（溶解力强）又像气体一样易扩散穿透，状态独特。超临界CO2 能钻进咖啡豆带走咖啡因，再降压就变回气体分离，无溶剂残留。� Above critical temperature and pressure the fluid has liquid-like density (strong dissolving) yet gas-like diffusivity and penetration—a unique state. Supercritical CO2 infiltrates coffee beans to pull out caffeine, then drops pressure to revert to gas and separate, leaving no solvent.�ans��src��1McHugh，《超临界流体萃取》（第2版）�2McHugh, 'Supercritical Fluid Extraction' (2nd ed.)��id�cc4971590692�body���交通流量模型用数学描述车流的速度、密度和流量关系，预测拥堵与传播。宏观模型看整体流量，微观模型模拟单车跟驰行为。它们用于信号配时和路网规划。�+A traffic flow model uses mathematics to describe the relationship among speed, density, and flow of vehicles and to predict congestion and its spread. Macroscopic models look at overall flow, while microscopic models simulate individual car-following. They guide signal timing and network planning.�ans��src��+ITE，《交通工程手册》（第7版）�-ITE, 'Traffic Engineering Handbook' (7th ed.)��id�cdd7e11010c6�body���预应力混凝土是在浇筑前后对钢筋施加拉力，使混凝土预先受压，从而抵消使用时的拉应力。它可做出跨度更大、更薄、更省料的梁板。常见形式有先张法和后张法。�Prestressed concrete applies tension to the steel before or after casting so the concrete is pre-compressed, counteracting the tensile stresses in service. It allows longer, thinner, and more material-efficient beams and slabs. Common methods are pretensioning and post-tensioning.�ans��src��B《混凝土结构设计原理》（中国建筑工业出版社）�=Lin & Burns, Design of Prestressed Concrete Structures, Wiley��id�ce99de90f3d1�body�ٟ风机在集烟腔形成负压，把上升的油烟抽进滤网和风道排到室外；风速和罩口形状决定能罩住多大范围，太远就抓不住。مThe fan makes the hood negative-pressure, drawing rising air through filters and out; airflow and hood shape decide the capture zone.�ans��src��.Munson，《流体力学基础》（第8版）�3Munson, 'Fundamentals of Fluid Mechanics' (8th ed.)��id�cfbfcef39f97�body�٢风电光伏出力随天气波动，储能可在富电时充电、缺电时放电，平抑波动、提供调频备用，让电网更稳定地接纳清洁能源。٨Wind and solar vary with weather; storage charges when surplus and discharges when short, smoothing output and providing frequency reserve for stable clean integration.�ans��src��6Linden & Reddy，《林登电池手册》（第4版）�9Linden & Reddy, 'Lindens Handbook of Batteries' (4th ed.)��id�d4cd71e2eb0e�body���粉末冶金把金属粉末压制成形再烧结成零件，可制造难熔、高合金和带孔隙的自润滑件。它材料利用率极高、适合大批量小零件。汽车齿轮和含油轴承常用此法。��Powder metallurgy presses metal powder into shape and sinters it, making refractory, high-alloy, and porous self-lubricating parts. It has very high material use and suits high-volume small parts. Auto gears and oil-impregnated bearings often use it.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�d5f9bf3d560f�body���纯滞后意味着控制动作要等一段时间才在测量上体现，比如长管道输送或大惯量加热。控制器在这段盲区里得不到反馈，容易继续加大动作，等结果出现时已经过量，形成振荡。频域上看滞后带来随频率线性增长的相位滞后，严重压缩相位裕度，因此增益必须调得很低，或采用史密斯预估器用模型补偿滞后。��Pure delay means a control action shows up in the measurement only after some time, as with long transport pipes or high-inertia heating. During that blind period the controller gets no feedback and tends to keep pushing, so by the time the result appears the action has overshot and oscillation follows. In the frequency domain delay adds phase lag growing linearly with frequency, severely eroding phase margin, so gain must be kept low or a Smith predictor used to compensate the delay with a model.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�d8c07df7cafd�body���模型预测控制在每个采样时刻用系统模型预测未来若干步的响应，求解一个带约束的优化问题得到最优控制序列，只执行第一步，下一时刻再重新优化。因为约束直接写进优化问题，执行器限幅、变量上下限和安全边界都能被显式处理。它天然支持多输入多输出耦合系统，代价是计算量大、对模型质量敏感。��At each sampling instant model predictive control uses a model to predict the response over a future horizon, solves a constrained optimisation for the best control sequence, applies only the first move, and re-optimises at the next instant. Because constraints enter the optimisation directly, actuator limits, variable bounds and safety margins are handled explicitly. It naturally handles coupled multi-input multi-output systems, at the cost of heavy computation and sensitivity to model quality.�ans��src��E胡寿松 主编,《自动控制原理》第6版,科学出版社,2013�NHu Shousong ed., Principles of Automatic Control, 6th ed., Science Press, 2013��id�d92aaad657b8�body���阻尼器安装在建筑楼层之间或顶部，把风或地震引起的动能转化为热能消散掉。常见的有调谐质量阻尼器、黏滞阻尼器和黏弹性阻尼器。台北101和大楼抗震设计中广泛使用。�)Dampers are placed between floors or on a building's top to convert the kinetic energy from wind or earthquakes into heat and dissipate it. Common types include tuned mass dampers, viscous dampers, and viscoelastic dampers. They are widely used in structures like Taipei 101 and in seismic design.�ans��src��+Chopra，《结构动力学》（第5版）�*Chopra, 'Dynamics of Structures' (5th ed.)��id�db94a49595ff�body��Z提前加压抵消使用荷载带来的拉应力，延迟开裂、提高刚度与跨径。�dPre-compression cancels the tension from live loads, delaying cracks and raising stiffness and span.�ans��src��3Lin & Burns《预应力混凝土设计》；ACI 318�4Lin & Burns, Design of Prestressed Concrete; ACI 318��id�dbedd7ad5f4d�body���燃气发生器把部分推进剂烧完就排掉，白白损失能量；分级燃烧把所有富燃燃气都送回主燃烧室充分燃烧，比冲更高。代价是极高温高压的预燃室和涡轮，结构复杂、制造苛刻。�A gas generator burns some propellant just to dump it, wasting energy; staged combustion sends all fuel-rich gas back to the main chamber to burn fully, raising specific impulse. The cost is very hot, high-pressure preburners and turbines—complex and demanding to build.�ans��src��CSutton & Biblarz,《Rocket Propulsion Elements》第9版,Wiley,2016�MG. P. Sutton and O. Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements, 9th ed., Wiley, 2016��id�dcc9bd7cc62c�body���三极管是电流控制器件，基极必须持续注入电流才能维持导通。MOSFET是电压控制器件，栅极靠电场控制沟道，静态几乎不耗电流，但栅极存在几纳法的电容。因此高速开关时驱动电路必须能在很短时间内灌入和抽出大电流给栅电容充放电，否则开关变慢、损耗剧增，这就是要用专门栅极驱动芯片的原因。��A bipolar transistor is current controlled, so base current must flow continuously to keep it on. A MOSFET is voltage controlled, its channel governed by the gate field, drawing almost no steady current but presenting a gate capacitance of several nanofarads. For fast switching the driver must therefore source and sink large currents briefly to charge and discharge that capacitance, otherwise switching slows and losses soar, which is why dedicated gate-driver chips exist.�ans��src��PM. Rashid《电力电子：电路、器件与应用》第4版,Prentice Hall,2004�_M. Rashid, Power Electronics: Circuits, Devices, and Applications, 4th ed., Prentice Hall, 2004��id�de347472e524�body���气凝胶是密度极低、孔隙率超90%的固态材料，多为二氧化硅骨架，隔热性能极佳。它轻到能托于花瓣上，用于航天隔热和保暖服。缺点是脆、成本高。�An aerogel is an extremely low-density solid with over 90% porosity, usually a silica skeleton, giving superb thermal insulation. It is so light it can rest on a petal, and is used in aerospace insulation and warm clothing. Its drawbacks are brittleness and cost.�ans��src��NCallister,《Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction》Wiley 多版�`W. D. Callister Jr., Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction, Wiley, various editions��id�eaa8e3eefc47�body��_定子三相绕组产生旋转磁场，转子导条只有在与磁场存在相对运动时才会被切割而产生感应电流，进而受力产生转矩。如果转子转速等于同步转速，相对运动为零，感应电流和转矩都消失。所以异步电机总要慢一点，负载越重转差越大，这也是它被称为异步的原因。��The three-phase stator winding creates a rotating field, and the rotor bars only develop induced current, and hence force, when there is relative motion between them and that field. If the rotor turned at exactly synchronous speed the relative motion would be zero and both induced current and torque would vanish. An induction motor therefore always runs slightly slower, with slip increasing as load increases, which is why it is called asynchronous.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�edcd220bf7b4�body���交流负载中电动机和变压器等感性设备会使电流滞后于电压，真正做功的有功功率与视在功率之比就是功率因数。功率因数低意味着为了输送同样的有功功率必须流过更大电流，线路损耗和变压器容量占用都随之增加。并联电容器或使用静止无功发生器提供超前电流，抵消感性无功，就能把功率因数提到接近一，降低电费和损耗。�In an AC system inductive equipment such as motors and transformers makes current lag voltage, and the ratio of real power that does work to apparent power is the power factor. A low power factor means larger current is needed to deliver the same real power, increasing line losses and the transformer capacity tied up. Connecting capacitors in parallel, or using a static var generator to supply leading current, cancels the inductive reactive power and raises the power factor close to one, cutting losses and electricity charges.�ans��src��P邱关源 主编 罗先觉 修订,《电路》第5版,高等教育出版社,2006�@Qiu Guanyuan ed., Circuit, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2006��id�eng_24_019�body��8激光粉末床逐层熔粉时,新熔化的金属会因表面张力球化、因收缩翘曲,悬空面没有下方材料托底必然失败;同时传热也依赖下方实体把热带入基板。因此超过约45度角的悬垂都要加支撑:块状或格子状的临时柱子。它们不是白给的——去除支撑需要线切割、手工打磨甚至五轴加工,支撑区留下粗糙疤痕;每根支柱还消耗材料与时间。前沿方向是无支撑打印:倾斜重排零件方向、自适应切片压低悬垂角,或用可溶解牺牲材料做智能脚手架。�0In laser powder-bed fusion, fresh melt pools ball up from surface tension and warp from shrinkage; unsupported overhangs have no material beneath to anchor or conduct heat into the plate. Overhangs beyond roughly forty-five degrees therefore get supports — blocky lattice columns. They are not free: removal needs wire EDM, hand finishing even five-axis machining, leaves scars, and eats material and time. Frontiers fight back — reorienting parts so overhang angles stay legal, adaptive slicing, or sacrificial soluble ceramic scaffolds as smart formwork.�ans��src���DebRoy、Wei、Zuback 与 Mukherjee,《Additive manufacturing of metallic components – Process, structure and properties》,Progress in Materials Science,2018 (DOI: 10.1016/j.pmatsci.2017.10.001)ٿDebRoy, Wei, Zuback & Mukherjee, 'Additive manufacturing of metallic components – Process, structure and properties', Progress in Materials Science, 2018, DOI: 10.1016/j.pmatsci.2017.10.001��id�eng_26_002�body���直答：有意让柱强于梁是为了把塑性铰赶到梁端、避免柱端出铰，结构才能以整体延性的梁铰机制耗能而不倒塌。机理：柱是唯一的竖向传力通道，某层柱上下端同时出铰即形成危险的层侧移机构，可能引发整层乃至连续垮塌;分散于众多梁端的塑性铰各自转动耗能，楼层仍具承重能力。设计上要求同一节点柱端抗弯承载力之和乘以增大系数后不低于梁端之和，并对角柱从严加强。�wThe intent is to push plastic hinges into beam ends and keep them out of columns, so the frame dissipates energy through a ductile beam-hinge mechanism instead of collapsing. Columns are the sole gravity-load path; hinges at both ends of one story's columns form a dangerous soft-story mechanism that can drop that story and trigger progressive collapse. Hinges distributed over many beam ends rotate harmlessly while the story keeps carrying load. Codes therefore require the sum of column flexural capacities at a joint, times an amplification factor, to exceed the sum of beam capacities, with stricter rules for corner columns.�ans��src��{T. Paulay、M.J.N. Priestley《Seismic Design of Reinforced Concrete and Masonry Buildings》，John Wiley & Sons，1992年�rT. Paulay & M.J.N. Priestley, Seismic Design of Reinforced Concrete and Masonry Buildings, John Wiley & Sons, 1992��id�eng_26_020�body��%直答：缓冲垫靠自身变形吸收跌落动能，把传递给产品的最大加速度压到脆值以内，而每种材料只在特定静应力区间才具有最高吸能效率。机理：材料常用缓冲系数衡量，即所受应力除以单位体积吸收的应变能，其曲线存在低谷；衬垫过软会在一次冲击中被压到底再硬性回弹，加速度反而陡增，过硬则初始刚度过大致峰值超标，过厚徒增成本与体积，故须按产品重量、承压面积与跌落高度对照缓冲曲线确定尺寸。�}A cushion's job is to deform and absorb the kinetic energy of the fall so the peak acceleration reaching the product stays below its fragility limit, yet every material delivers peak energy absorption only across a narrow static-stress band. Materials are rated by the cushion factor — stress divided by strain energy absorbed per unit volume — whose curve dips to a minimum. A pad too soft bottoms out and rebounds harshly, spiking acceleration; one too stiff starts rigid and overshoots the limit; extra thickness just inflates cost and volume, so dimensions come from weight, bearing area, and drop height read off cushion curves.�ans��src���彭国勋主编《物流运输包装设计》，印刷工业出版社，2006年 ; 另见: R.D. Mindlin, Dynamics of Package Cushioning, Bell System Technical Journal, 1945, 24(3-4), pp.353-461��R.D. Mindlin, Dynamics of Package Cushioning, Bell System Technical Journal, 1945, 24(3-4), pp.353-461 ; see also: 彭国勋主编《物流运输包装设计》，印刷工业出版社，2006年��id�f237c7265afa�body���精密锻造在接近最终形状的条件下锻压金属，尺寸公差小、几乎无需后续切削。它材料利用率高、晶粒流线好，零件更强韧。常用于齿轮和航空发动机盘件。��Precision forging shapes metal near its final form with tight tolerances, needing almost no later cutting. It has high material use and good grain flow, making parts tougher. It is used for gears and aero-engine disks.�ans��src��oKalpakjian & Schmid《制造工程与技术》；Groover《现代制造基础》；AWS 美国焊接学会标准�{Kalpakjian & Schmid, Manufacturing Engineering and Technology; Groover, Fundamentals of Modern Manufacturing; AWS standards��id�f749854877e1�body���吴哥窟周边有庞大的人工水库（巴莱）和运河网，雨季蓄水、旱季灌溉并调节城市用水。它支撑了百万人口的城市运转。近年激光遥感才看清其全貌。��Around Angkor Wat lies a vast network of artificial reservoirs (barays) and canals that stored rain for dry-season irrigation and urban water. It supported a city of up to a million people. Laser remote sensing only recently revealed its full extent.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f7ea25b13457�body���列控系统用信号和通信实时计算列车安全间隔与速度曲线。ATP负责超速防护强制制动，ATO负责自动驾驶巡航和精准停车。它是高铁高密度安全运行的基础。�&A train control system uses signals and communications to compute safe headways and speed profiles in real time. ATP enforces overspeed protection and emergency braking, while ATO handles automatic cruising and precise stopping. It is the basis for safe, high-density high-speed rail operation.�ans��src��《铁路技术管理规程》（高速铁路部分），中国铁路总公司编，中国铁道出版社 ; 另见: Commission Regulation (EU) No 636/2014, Technical Specification for Interoperability relating to the 'control-command and signalling' subsystem (ETCS), European Commission�!Commission Regulation (EU) No 636/2014, Technical Specification for Interoperability relating to the 'control-command and signalling' subsystem (ETCS), European Commission ; see also: 《铁路技术管理规程》（高速铁路部分），中国铁路总公司编，中国铁道出版社��id�1168712894c5�body���传统直流靠换相需强交流支撑，柔性直流用电压源换流器可独立控制有功和无功，能主动建压、黑启动。它因此能连接无源海岛、弱电网和波动的海上风电场。�Conventional DC needs a strong AC system to commutate; VSC-HVDC uses voltage-source converters to control active and reactive power independently, even building voltage and black-starting. So it links passive islands, weak grids and fluctuating offshore wind.�ans��src��1Arrillaga，《高压直流输电》（第2版）�?Arrillaga, 'High Voltage Direct Current Transmission' (2nd ed.)��id�139d5a16b5a0�body�ٜ红外光会被浅色墙面漫反射，部分反射光仍能进入电视接收窗；但红外是视线通信、会被遮挡，所以多数要大致对准。�|IR reflects off light walls so some reaches the receiver, but it is line-of-sight and blocked by obstacles, so aiming helps.�ans��src��GSerway & Jewett，《科学家与工程师的物理学》（第10版）�BSerway & Jewett, 'Physics for Scientists and Engineers' (10th ed.)��id�162e1a14b88c�body�ٜ按场地可能遭遇的地震动概率划分设防等级；太刚易放大某些频率、太柔会晃坏，靠延性和耗能而非单纯硬来抗倒塌。ّSeismic intensity reflects expected ground motion; neither too stiff nor too flexible is best, ductility and energy dissipation prevent collapse.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�1652ad5b2e3c�body�ٔ调度要时刻让发电出力与用电负荷平衡，并把频率稳定在50 Hz（或60 Hz），否则会引发设备跳闸甚至大范围停电。ٌDispatch must constantly balance generation with load and hold frequency at 50 Hz or 60 Hz; imbalance can trip equipment or cause blackouts.�ans��src��AIEEE 电网调度标准；Kundur《电力系统稳定与控制》�HIEEE grid dispatch standards; Kundur, Power System Stability and Control��id�436ba57c05f1�body���它给出火箭速度增量 Δv = v_e·ln(m0/mf)，说明最终速度取决于排气速度和质量比（初始质量与燃料耗尽质量之比），解释了为何要分级和用高效推进剂。ْIt gives Δv = v_e·ln(m0/mf), showing final speed depends on exhaust velocity and mass ratio, explaining staging and high-efficiency propellants.�ans��src��@Sutton《火箭推进原理》；NASA；Tsiolkovsky 火箭方程�ESutton, Rocket Propulsion Elements; NASA; Tsiolkovsky rocket equation��id�4af22de9601a�body�ٙ系统用双冗余甚至三冗余供电与通信，任一通道失效另有备份接替并持续自检；仍保留机械或液压备份以防全失效。�Redundant power, comms, and self-tests let a backup take over on failure, with mechanical or hydraulic fallback for total loss.�ans��src��qSAE International 汽车工程手册（Bosch《汽车手册》）；AASHTO《公路与城市道路几何设计》�kSAE International; Bosch, Automotive Handbook; AASHTO, A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets��id�54cb11efef6d�body��~预警利用先到的纵波比破坏大的横波快的特点，台网测到纵波后用近光速的电磁波抢先发警报。�rIt uses the faster P-wave detected by stations to send near-light-speed alerts before the damaging S-wave arrives.�ans��src��LNFPA 72/13/101；ASCE 7-16《最小设计荷载》；FEMA 抗震设计指南�^NFPA 72/13/101; ASCE 7-16, Minimum Design Loads and Associated Criteria; FEMA seismic guidance��id�7362ae83cc37�body���硫化物遇水会释放有毒的硫化氢，遇空气也易分解，因此全工艺必须在干燥惰性气氛里完成，设备成本飙升。同时它与高电压正极的界面仍不稳定，封装和规模化都很难。��Sulfides release toxic H2S on contact with water and degrade in air, so the whole process needs dry inert atmosphere, raising equipment cost. Their interface with high-voltage cathodes is also unstable, complicating packaging and scale-up.�ans��src��^Janek & Zeier，《电池发展的固态未来》，《自然·能源》1卷，16141（2016）�VJanek & Zeier, 'A solid future for battery development,' Nature Energy 1, 16141 (2016)��id�c110dbba32c7�body�ٱ它在两个共面圆轨道间用两段切向脉冲（先加速到转移椭圆、再在圆轨道上加速圆化），仅用两个冲量完成，是能量最优的轨道变换。ٞBetween two coplanar circular orbits it uses just two tangential burns, onto a transfer ellipse and then circularizing, making it the minimum-energy transfer.�ans��src��SBate, Mueller & White《天体力学基础》；NASA 轨道力学；开普勒定律�[Bate, Mueller & White, Fundamentals of Astrodynamics; NASA orbital mechanics; Kepler's laws��id�d01e1ac1aad2�body�ل凹绿地和植被浅沟滞蓄、下渗并净化径流，延迟峰值、补充地下水，比直接排管更能防内涝和污染。كBioswales and rain gardens detain, infiltrate, and clean runoff, delaying peaks and recharging groundwater better than pipes alone.�ans��src��dASHRAE Standard 90.1；被动房研究所（Passivhaus Institut）；EPA 绿色建筑与雨洪管理�oASHRAE Standard 90.1; Passive House Institute (Passivhaus Institut); EPA green building and stormwater guidance��id�0325b378f329�body���最终一致性是说：如果暂时不再写入，过一段时间后所有副本会自动变成相同的数据。它允许系统先快速响应、各副本暂时不一致，适合对实时一致要求不高的场景，比如社交动态的时间线。��Eventual consistency means that if writes stop, all replicas will become identical after some time. The system can respond fast with temporarily differing copies—fine for feeds where instant agreement isn't critical.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�03eb183d611d�body��#封装是把内部实现隐藏起来，只暴露必要接口，降低耦合。继承允许一个类基于另一个类扩展，复用已有行为。多态让同一接口在不同对象上有不同实现，调用者无需关心具体类型。三者是面向对象最常提及的三大特性。�MEncapsulation hides internal implementation and exposes only needed interfaces, reducing coupling. Inheritance lets one class extend another and reuse its behavior. Polymorphism lets one interface have different implementations across objects, so callers need not know the concrete type. These three are the oft-cited pillars of OOP.�ans��src��+《编程语言实现原理》（Sebesta）�+Concepts of Programming Languages (Sebesta)��id�04b80ead9106�body��#文件系统负责在存储设备上组织、命名、存放和检索文件，让用户可以按文件名而非物理扇区来存取数据。它还记录权限、大小、修改时间等元数据，并管理空间分配。没有文件系统，磁盘只是一片难以使用的原始字节。�6A file system organizes, names, stores, and retrieves files on a storage device so users can access data by name rather than by physical sector. It also records metadata such as permissions, size, and modification time and manages space allocation. Without a file system, a disk is just raw, hard-to-use bytes.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�0544f2d309cf�body��分辨率指屏幕在横向和纵向各有多少个像素，常见写法如 1920×1080，表示宽 1920 像素、高 1080 像素。总像素越多，能显示的细节越丰富。注意它和“屏幕物理大小”不同，同样分辨率在小屏上更清晰。�Resolution is how many pixels a screen has horizontally and vertically, commonly written like 1920×1080, meaning 1920 pixels wide and 1080 tall. More total pixels show richer detail. Note this differs from physical screen size; the same resolution looks sharper on a smaller screen.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�064394dba196�body�پ现代手机充满后会自动停止充电，不必立刻拔。但长期让电池一直满电或一直高温，会稍微加快老化。平时随用随充、别经常用到 0% 最护电池。ٵModern phones stop charging at 100%, so you don't need to unplug instantly. But keeping a battery full and hot for long slightly speeds aging. Top up often and avoid draining to 0%.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�06ceddff9827�body��S布鲁克斯在 1975 年的《人月神话》中提出：软件项目的工作量不等于人数乘以时间，新增成员需要时间上手且加剧了沟通成本，因此赶工期时加人往往适得其反。他同时指出软件本质的复杂性没有『银弹』可一举解决。这部著作是软件工程管理领域的经典。�cIn 'The Mythical Man-Month' (1975), Brooks argued that software effort is not simply people times time: new members need ramp-up time and add communication overhead, so adding staff to catch up often backfires. He also argued there is no single 'silver bullet' for software's essential complexity. The book is a classic of software engineering management.�ans��src�ٗBrooks 1975《人月神话》（Addison-Wesley）；Brooks 1986《No Silver Bullet: Essence and Accidents of Software Engineering》（IFIP Congress）ٖBrooks (1975), The Mythical Man-Month, Addison-Wesley; Brooks (1986), 'No Silver Bullet: Essence and Accidents of Software Engineering', IFIP Congress��id�071a4b8492c7�body���操作系统是管理硬件资源（CPU、内存、磁盘、外设）并为程序提供运行环境的系统软件，典型职责包括进程调度、内存管理和文件读写。上下文切换指 CPU 从一个进程或线程切换到另一个时，保存当前现场（寄存器、程序计数器等）并恢复目标现场的过程。频繁切换会带来开销，但正是它让多个程序看起来能同时运行。��An operating system is system software that manages hardware resources (CPU, memory, disk, devices) and provides a runtime environment for programs, with duties including process scheduling, memory management, and file I/O. A context switch is the act of CPU saving the current execution state (registers, program counter) and restoring that of another process or thread. Frequent switches incur overhead, yet they are what makes multiple programs appear to run at once.�ans��src��kSilberschatz 等《操作系统概念》（Operating System Concepts）；Tanenbaum《现代操作系统》�SSilberschatz et al., Operating System Concepts; Tanenbaum, Modern Operating Systems��id�09ba8303addf�body��位图由像素网格组成，放大到一定程度会出现马赛克，如照片。矢量图用点、线、曲线和公式描述形状，可无限放大而不失真，适合 logo、图标和字体。二者适用场景不同：照片用位图，图形标志用矢量。�7A bitmap is a grid of pixels and becomes blocky when enlarged past a point, as with photographs. A vector image describes shapes with points, lines, curves, and formulas, so it scales without loss of quality, suiting logos, icons, and fonts. They fit different uses: photos as bitmaps, graphic marks as vectors.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�0b3c9c49afe5�body���DNS（域名系统）像互联网的电话簿，把便于记忆的域名如 example.com 翻译成机器用的 IP 地址。没有它，你得记住一长串数字才能访问网站。查询通常由你的运营商或公共 DNS 服务器完成。�
DNS (Domain Name System) is the internet's phone book, translating memorable names like example.com into the IP addresses machines use. Without it you would memorize long number strings to visit sites. Your provider or a public DNS server usually handles the lookup.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�0bcd0bd35c92�body�ٓ进程是运行中的程序，拥有独立内存空间；线程是进程里的执行流，同一进程内的线程共享内存，切换更轻量。٠A process is a running program with its own memory; a thread is an execution flow inside a process. Threads in one process share memory and switch more cheaply.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�0be7d0266e54�body���二分查找要求数据已经排好序，并且能随机访问任意位置。每次取中间元素比较，可把搜索范围缩小一半，因此只需约 log₂ n 步。若数据无序，必须先排序才能使用。��Binary search requires the data to be sorted and randomly accessible. Each step compares the middle element and halves the search range, so it needs about log₂ n steps. If the data is unsorted, you must sort it first.�ans��src��rCormen, T. H., Leiserson, C. E., Rivest, R. L. 与 Stein, C. (2009). 《算法导论（第三版）》. MIT Press.�tCormen, T. H., Leiserson, C. E., Rivest, R. L., & Stein, C. (2009). Introduction to Algorithms (3rd ed.). MIT Press.��id�0c2fb7e7b51f�body�ٰ阿兰·图灵是英国数学家，提出了“图灵机”这个想象中的计算机模型，还帮二战破解了德军密码。他奠定了现代计算和思想的基础。٭Alan Turing was a British mathematician who proposed the 'Turing machine' model of computation and helped break enemy codes in WWII. He laid foundations of modern computing.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�0f331f859bea�body�ف它们用你的注意力（广告）、你的行为数据，或后续的增值服务来变现，羊毛其实出在用户身上。�sThey monetize your attention (ads), your behavioral data, or later paid features—the cost is quietly on the user.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�110d9fe7426b�body��O编译型语言先把整个源代码翻译成机器码再运行，如 C、Rust，启动快、运行效率高。解释型语言由解释器逐行边读边执行，如早期 Python、JavaScript，跨平台方便、开发灵活但运行稍慢。现代很多语言采用折中方案，先编译成中间字节码再在虚拟机中执行。��Compiled languages translate the whole source into machine code before running, such as C and Rust, giving fast startup and high efficiency. Interpreted languages are executed line by line by an interpreter, such as early Python and JavaScript, offering portability and flexibility at some runtime cost. Many modern languages compromise by compiling to intermediate bytecode run on a virtual machine.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�1341d74805e1�body��
栈是一种「后进先出」（LIFO）的结构，最后放进去的元素最先取出，像一摞盘子。队列是「先进先出」（FIFO）的结构，最先进入的元素最先离开，像排队买票。它们是计算机中最基础的线性数据结构。�A stack is a last-in-first-out (LIFO) structure where the most recently added element is removed first, like a pile of plates. A queue is first-in-first-out (FIFO) where the earliest element leaves first, like a ticket line. They are among the most fundamental linear data structures.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�13e9d5b29d79�body�كemoji不是汉字，但它们和汉字一样属于Unicode字符，UTF-8编码下常占用多个字节，所以能跨平台显示。ّEmoji are not Chinese characters, but like them they are Unicode code points, often taking several UTF-8 bytes, so they display across platforms.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�178b78c0d668�body���HTTPS 是在 HTTP 之上加入 TLS 加密的协议，让浏览器和网站之间的通信被加密且可验证身份。它能防止他人窃听、篡改或冒充网站。地址栏出现锁形图标通常就表示使用了 HTTPS。��HTTPS is HTTP with TLS encryption added, so traffic between your browser and a site is encrypted and the site's identity can be verified. It prevents eavesdropping, tampering, and impersonation. A lock icon in the address bar usually means HTTPS is on.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�1a2b902d75f7�body��CPU（中央处理器）是计算机的核心运算部件，负责执行程序中的指令。它通过取指、译码、执行三个基本步骤完成算术、逻辑和控制操作。可以说 CPU 是计算机的“大脑”，决定了一台机器的基本运算能力。�^The CPU (Central Processing Unit) is the core computing component of a computer, responsible for executing the instructions in a program. It performs arithmetic, logic, and control operations through the basic steps of fetch, decode, and execute. Often called the computer's brain, the CPU largely determines a machine's fundamental processing power.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�1e5892cdbe88�body�ٍ数据库是专门用来有组织地存放、查找和管理大量数据的系统，像一座超大的、可快速检索的电子档案柜。ْA database is a system for organizing, finding, and managing large amounts of data, like a giant electronic filing cabinet you can search quickly.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�1f280f067dfc�body���人机交互研究总结出三条经典阈值：约 0.1 秒内的响应会被感知为直接操作，界面像是被手直接推动；约 1 秒内用户的思路不中断，但已经察觉到系统在忙；超过约 10 秒注意力就会转移，必须用进度提示把用户留住。因此按钮按下要在 100 毫秒内给出可见反馈，哪怕只是变个颜色，耗时操作则应立即显示骨架屏或进度条，把等待变成可预期的等待。�>Usability research settled on three classic thresholds: a response within about 0.1 second is perceived as direct manipulation, as if the object moves with your finger; within about 1 second the user's train of thought survives although the delay is noticed; beyond roughly 10 seconds attention wanders and a progress indicator is required to retain the user. So a button press should produce visible feedback inside 100 ms even if only a colour change, and slow operations should immediately show a skeleton screen or progress bar, turning waiting into predictable waiting.�ans��src��_Jakob Nielsen《Usability Engineering》(1993) 第 5 章 Response Times: The 3 Important Limits�^Jakob Nielsen, "Usability Engineering" (1993), ch. 5, "Response Times: The 3 Important Limits"��id�1f8de899396f�body���路由器是连接不同网络的设备，依据目的 IP 地址查表选择最佳路径，把数据包转发到下一站。家庭路由器还常兼任交换机、无线接入和地址分配（NAT/DHCP）功能。�A router is a device that connects different networks; it consults tables based on the destination IP to choose the best path and forwards packets to the next hop. Home routers often also act as a switch, wireless access point, and address allocator (NAT/DHCP).�ans��src��=《计算机网络：自顶向下方法》（Kurose & Ross）�8Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach (Kurose & Ross)��id�212592394ac1�body�٥是的，外挂常利用或改写游戏代码，让自己刀枪不入、看穿墙壁，破坏了公平。多数游戏会封号，所以作弊既不对也不划算。ٟYes, cheats exploit or alter game code for invincibility or x-ray vision, breaking fairness. Most games ban such accounts, so cheating is both wrong and risky.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�21da2582d07a�body��;多核处理器把多个运算核心集成在一颗芯片上，可真正同时处理多个任务或把一个任务拆成多份并行。这让计算机在运行多个程序或并行软件时更流畅，也更易在功耗受限下提升总体算力。不过只有被改写成并行形式的程序才能充分受益。�qA multi-core processor integrates several computing cores on one chip, enabling genuine simultaneous handling of multiple tasks or splitting one task into parallel parts. This makes the machine smoother when running many programs or parallel software and eases raising total compute within a power budget. Only programs rewritten for parallelism fully benefit, however.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�22ac4202f4bc�body�ِ深伪能伪造名人或官员讲话的视频，用来制造谣言、敲诈或干预选举，让“眼见为实”的视频证据不再可靠。َDeepfakes can forge videos of celebrities or officials to spread lies, extort, or sway elections, making video evidence no longer trustworthy.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�269be1ec6f3a�body��G通行密钥用公钥密码学：注册时设备生成一对密钥，私钥留在手机或安全芯片里永不外传，只把公钥交给网站；登录时网站发来一个随机挑战，设备在你用指纹或面容解锁后签名返回。因为不存在可被复用的共享秘密，服务器即使被拖库也拿不到能用来登录的凭据；而且签名绑定了具体域名，浏览器不会在仿冒站点上使用它，钓鱼因此直接失效。短信验证码则是可读、可转述的共享秘密，钓鱼页面能实时中转，SIM 卡交换攻击也可能截获。��A passkey uses public-key cryptography: at registration the device generates a key pair, keeps the private key inside the phone or a secure element where it never leaves, and hands the site only the public key; at login the site sends a random challenge that the device signs after you unlock it with a fingerprint or face. Because no reusable shared secret exists, a breached server yields nothing an attacker can log in with, and the signature is bound to the exact domain so the browser simply refuses to use it on a lookalike site, which defeats phishing outright. An SMS code, by contrast, is a human-readable shared secret that a phishing page can relay in real time and that SIM-swap attacks can intercept.�ans��src�ْW3C《Web Authentication: An API for accessing Public Key Credentials, Level 2》；FIDO Alliance《Client to Authenticator Protocol (CTAP) 2.1》ٍW3C, "Web Authentication: An API for accessing Public Key Credentials, Level 2"; FIDO Alliance, "Client to Authenticator Protocol (CTAP) 2.1"��id�26a67f27e729�body�٥哈希把任意长度输入变成固定长度的指纹，且难以反推原文。存哈希而非明文，即使数据库泄露，攻击者也拿不到真实密码。ٕA hash turns input into a fixed-length fingerprint that is hard to reverse. Storing hashes, not plain text, means a leak won't expose real passwords.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�29e4f08276bf�body�ٟ诈骗电话是陌生人编理由（退款、中奖、抓人）骗你转钱或给信息。接到就挂、别信、别转账，必要时打官方电话核实。ٜA scam call uses fake stories (refund, prize, arrest) to get money or info. Just hang up, don't believe it, don't transfer, and verify via official numbers.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2b5737d52695�body�ِ那是因为设备或字体缺少该字的字形轮廓，生僻字或新造字尤其容易“缺字”，装上对应字库即可正常显示。ىIt means the font lacks a glyph for that character; rare or new characters especially go missing, and installing the right font fixes it.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�2babddcd4eb9�body�٫云盘是把文件存在别人家的大服务器上，你用账号随时上网取。手机坏了也不怕，照片视频还在“云”里，换台设备登录就能看。٣Cloud storage keeps your files on someone else's big servers you reach by account. If your phone breaks, photos stay 'in the cloud' and you see them on any device.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�2e060ab062ee�body���API 是一套约定好的“点单窗口”：你按它规定的格式发请求，它返回数据或帮你完成操作，而不必关心内部怎么实现。就像餐厅服务员，你不必进厨房，只要点菜就能上菜。��An API is an agreed 'order window': you send requests in its format and get data or actions back, without knowing the internals. Like a waiter—you just order and the food comes, no kitchen access needed.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�2e14c630290b�body���迁移学习把在大规模数据上预训练得到的特征或权重，复用到数据较少的目标任务上，大幅降低标注与算力需求，是视觉与 NLP 大模型的常见范式。ٴTransfer learning reuses features or weights pretrained on large data for a smaller target task, sharply cutting labeling and compute needs—a standard paradigm in vision and NLP.�ans��src��Pan & Yang 2010�Pan & Yang 2010��id�2f206fd39960�body�ٙ科大讯飞在中文语音识别和合成上领先，支持方言、远场拾音和实时转写，依靠深度学习加海量语音数据持续进步。٥iFlytek leads in Chinese speech recognition and synthesis, handling dialects, far-field audio, and real-time transcription via deep learning on huge speech datasets.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�30473465fbc8�body��i开放网络可能被嗅探截获明文信息，尽量用手机流量或VPN，避免账号密码被偷。�gOpen networks can be sniffed for plain-text info; use mobile data or a VPN to avoid stolen credentials.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�315a97e6b44b�body���HTTP 是浏览器和网站之间传输网页的协议；HTTPS 是在 HTTP 之上加入 TLS/SSL 加密的版本。HTTPS 能防止通信内容被窃听和篡改，并验证网站身份。如今绝大多数网站都已启用 HTTPS 以保护用户隐私。�HTTP is the protocol for transferring web pages between browsers and websites; HTTPS is the encrypted version that adds TLS/SSL on top of HTTP. HTTPS prevents eavesdropping and tampering and verifies the website's identity. Today most websites enable HTTPS to protect user privacy.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�3198919ba3c4�body���数据冗余指同一信息在多处重复存储，例如客户地址在每张订单里都抄一遍。它浪费空间，还容易导致更新不一致——改了一处忘了另一处。规范化设计正是为了减少这类冗余。��Data redundancy means the same information is stored in many places, like copying a customer's address into every order. It wastes space and risks inconsistency when one copy is updated but another is not. Normalization exists to reduce such redundancy.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�36b5a8332df6�body��{算法是解决某类问题的明确步骤集合，像一份配方。计算机按算法一步步执行就能完成任务。�yAn algorithm is a clear set of steps for solving a problem, like a recipe. A computer follows the steps to finish a task.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�371abfe63172�body�٠当文件保存的编码（如UTF-8）和打开程序以为的编码（如GBK）不一致时，字节被错误翻译成奇怪字符，统一用UTF-8可避免。١When a file’s encoding (e.g. UTF-8) differs from what the opener assumes (e.g. GBK), bytes are misread as odd characters; using UTF-8 consistently avoids this.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�371cb2e1d121�body��{假新闻和水军可以低成本量产，真实信息被稀释，公众的判断成本和被误导的风险都上升了。�yFake news and bots can be mass-produced cheaply, diluting real information and raising the cost and risk of being misled.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�37fad30c793f�body���深度学习是机器学习的一个分支，使用多层（很深）的神经网络从数据中提取由浅入深的特征。它在图像、语音、语言等任务上取得了突破性成果。其发展得益于大数据和 GPU 算力的提升。�Deep learning is a branch of machine learning that uses multi-layer (very deep) neural networks to extract features from shallow to deep. It has achieved breakthrough results in image, speech, and language tasks. Its progress is thanks to big data and GPU computing power.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�395b5be25ad7�body���因为多台机器会各自出错、网络会延迟或断开，而且它们对“现在发生了什么”看法可能不一致。要让它们像一台机器那样可靠协作，就得额外处理同步、容错和冲突，所以更难。��Machines fail independently, networks lag or drop, and they may disagree on 'what happened'. Making them cooperate reliably like one machine means handling sync, faults and conflicts—so it's harder.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�3a51158c238d�body���如果在同一块屏幕上边画边显示，用户会看到半成品的闪烁。双缓冲准备两块内存：一块后台绘制完整画面，画好后一次性切换到前台显示。这样每次呈现的都是完整帧，避免了撕裂和闪烁。�-If you draw and display on the same surface at once, viewers see flickering half-finished frames. Double buffering uses two memory areas: one is drawn in the background, then the finished frame is swapped to the front in one step. This way only complete frames are shown, avoiding tearing and flicker.�ans��src��6《计算机图形学原理及实践》（Foley 等）�9Computer Graphics: Principles and Practice (Foley et al.)��id�3c6ece9083dd�body���加密是把可读的明文通过密钥转换成难以理解的密文，只有掌握正确密钥的人才能还原。它保护信息在传输和存储时不被窃听或篡改。现代加密是网络支付和隐私保护的基础。�)Encryption transforms readable plaintext into incomprehensible ciphertext using a key, and only someone with the correct key can reverse it. It protects information from eavesdropping or tampering during transmission and storage. Modern encryption underpins online payments and privacy protection.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�3d29f779b7ba�body���模型先把你的文字编码成含义向量，再以一张随机噪点图起步，一边理解文字含义一边逐步抹去噪点、显出轮廓与色彩，最终得到符合描述的画面。��The model encodes your text into a meaning vector, starts from random noise, and while 'reading' the text gradually removes noise to reveal shapes and colors, ending with a picture that matches the description.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�3ed435a2e406�body�٧它们把网络通信拆成层次，每层只管自己的事：从物理信号、网络寻址到应用数据。OSI 是理论七层，TCP/IP 是实际常用的四层。ٻThey split networking into layers, each handling its own job, from electrical signals and addressing to application data. OSI is the 7-layer theory; TCP/IP is the practical 4-layer stack.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�408a0629ab13�body�ه浏览器是帮你打开网站的程序，它把网页代码变成你能看到的文字、图片和按钮，比如 Chrome 和 Safari。كA browser is a program that opens websites, turning web code into the text, images, and buttons you see, such as Chrome and Safari.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�439a7c94ad20�body��
冯·诺依曼架构的核心是把程序指令和数据存放在同一个存储器中，由控制单元按顺序取指执行。这种“存储程序”思想让计算机可以通过更换程序来完成不同任务。它至今仍是绝大多数计算机的基础。�BThe core of the von Neumann architecture is that program instructions and data are stored in the same memory, and the control unit fetches and executes them sequentially. This stored-program concept lets a computer perform different tasks simply by loading different programs. It remains the basis of most computers today.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�47aca0f1d863�body���帧率是每秒钟屏幕刷新的画面数量，单位是 FPS（frames per second）。帧率越高，动画和游戏越流畅；一般电影约 24 FPS，流畅游戏常在 60 FPS 以上。若帧率过低，人眼会感到卡顿。��Frame rate is how many images the screen refreshes per second, measured in FPS (frames per second). Higher frame rates make animation and games smoother; film is about 24 FPS while smooth games often exceed 60 FPS. Too low a rate feels choppy to the eye.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�47cbb87721c3�body��5哈希表通过哈希函数把键映射成一个数组下标，从而能在平均 O(1) 时间内完成查找、插入和删除。当两个不同的键被映射到同一个位置时，就会发生「哈希冲突」，常用链地址法或开放寻址法解决。它是字典和集合等类型的底层实现。�A hash table uses a hash function to map a key to an array index, enabling average O(1) lookup, insertion, and deletion. When two different keys map to the same location, a hash collision occurs, commonly resolved by chaining or open addressing. It underlies dictionary and set types.�ans��src��!数据结构与算法标准内容�0Standard topic in data structures and algorithms��id�480d0d09b895�body��普通文件只是把文字存起来，查找和共享都不方便；数据库则按结构化方式组织数据，并提供强大的查询、并发和安全控制。它能让成百上千人同时安全地读写同一份数据。几乎所有现代应用背后都有数据库支撑。�*An ordinary file just stores text, making search and sharing awkward; a database organizes data structurally and offers powerful query, concurrency, and security control. It lets hundreds of users safely read and write the same data at once. Almost every modern application is backed by a database.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�484d2281957b�body���强密码足够长且混合大小写字母、数字和符号，并避免使用生日、姓名等易猜信息。不同网站使用不同密码、配合密码管理器能显著降低被盗风险。��A strong password is long and mixes uppercase, lowercase, digits, and symbols, avoiding guessable info like birthdays or names. Using distinct passwords per site with a password manager greatly lowers theft risk.�ans��src��8美国国家标准与技术研究院（NIST）SP 800-63B�NIST SP 800-63B��id�4bfadc1ae654�body��x编程语言是人用来给计算机下达指令的工具，比机器语言好懂，常见有 Python、Java、C++ 等。ٖA programming language is a tool people use to give computers instructions in a form easier than machine code; examples include Python, Java, and C++.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�4c4cdd9184bd�body���算法偏见指 AI 系统因训练数据或设计选择而系统性地偏向某些群体、产生不公平结果。例如用人脸数据训练不足时，对某些肤色识别更差。缓解需要从数据和评估两端同时改进。�Algorithmic bias means an AI system systematically favors some groups or yields unfair outcomes due to its training data or design. For example, with insufficient face data it may recognize some skin tones worse. Mitigation needs work on both data and evaluation.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�4e26cb0e3f99�body���HDD 在高速旋转的盘片上用磁性材料记录数据，磁头在盘片上移动来读写比特。由于存在机械寻道和旋转等待，它的随机访问速度较慢。优点是容量大、单位成本低、断电后数据不丢失。�-An HDD records data on fast-spinning platters coated with magnetic material, and a moving head reads or writes bits on the surface. Because it involves mechanical seeking and rotational waiting, random access is slow. Its strengths are large capacity, low cost per byte, and persistence without power.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�4ebb96d04e83�body���编译器把你写的、人能读懂的高级语言，经过分析、优化，翻译成计算机 CPU 能直接执行的机器指令（或中间的字节码）。它就像一位把“中文菜谱”改写成“厨房操作清单”的翻译官。��A compiler analyzes and optimizes your human-readable code and translates it into machine instructions (or intermediate bytecode) the CPU can run directly—like rewriting a recipe into kitchen steps.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�5483161aea36�body�٬天河由国防科技大学研制，天河一号在2010年登顶全球超算500强榜首，天河二号曾多次排名第一，广泛用于气象、材料和航天模拟。ٸBuilt by the National University of Defense Technology, Tianhe-1 topped the TOP500 in 2010 and Tianhe-2 led the ranking for years, used in weather, materials, and aerospace simulation.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�551d6eb3bfa6�body�ٱ流水线把一条指令拆成取指、译码、执行等多个阶段，像工厂流水线一样让不同指令的不同阶段同时跑，提高单位时间完成的指令数。ٳPipelining splits an instruction into stages such as fetch, decode, and execute, so different stages of different instructions run at once like a factory line, raising throughput.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�556d385c2fd8�body���当 CPU 请求的数据已经在缓存中，可直接快速取得，称为缓存命中。若不在缓存而必须去更慢的主存甚至磁盘取，称为未命中，会带来明显延迟。命中率越高，系统整体速度越接近缓存的速度。� When the data the CPU requests is already in cache and can be fetched quickly, that is a cache hit. If it is not and the CPU must go to slower main memory or even disk, that is a miss with noticeable latency. The higher the hit rate, the closer overall speed approaches the cache's speed.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�5b2d2ff1e3c3�body���奇偶校验在数据中额外加一位，使 1 的总数为奇数或偶数。接收方统计后发现奇偶性不对，就知道传输出错。它只能检测单个位错误，无法定位也不能纠正。��A parity bit makes the total number of 1s odd or even. The receiver counts and, if parity is wrong, knows transmission failed. It detects only single-bit errors and cannot locate or correct them.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�5c2642432f9e�body���实时通话必须按时播出，晚到的数据就失去价值了。接收端只维持一个几十到几百毫秒的抖动缓冲，用来吸收网络延迟波动；一旦某个包迟到或丢失超过这个窗口，播放器就直接跳过它，于是出现画面停顿、马赛克或声音断裂。相反，看点播视频可以提前缓冲几十秒，所以宁可转圈等待也能保证连续播放——这正是实时通信与流媒体的根本取舍。��A live call must play out on schedule, and data arriving late is worthless. The receiver keeps only a jitter buffer of tens to a few hundred milliseconds to absorb variation in network delay, and anything later than that window is skipped outright, which appears as a frozen frame, blockiness or a clipped syllable. On-demand video, by contrast, buffers many seconds ahead, so it shows a loading spinner instead of glitching — the fundamental trade-off between real-time communication and streaming.�ans��src��oRFC 3550《RTP: A Transport Protocol for Real-Time Applications》；ITU-T 建议 G.114（单向传输时延）�yRFC 3550, "RTP: A Transport Protocol for Real-Time Applications"; ITU-T Recommendation G.114 on one-way transmission time��id�5e431a52bb52�body�ٮ软件是让硬件（手机、电脑）干活的指令集合，看得见摸不着。微信、游戏、浏览器都是软件；没有软件，机器只是一块没用的铁。ٺSoftware is the set of instructions that makes hardware (phone, PC) do things—invisible but essential. WeChat, games, browsers are software; without it, the machine is just dead metal.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�60a04f140a78�body���计算机病毒是一种能自我复制并附着到其他程序上的恶意代码，会在用户不知情时传播和破坏。它可能删除文件、窃取信息或占用资源。安装杀毒软件和及时更新系统是有效的防护手段。�
A computer virus is malicious code that copies itself and attaches to other programs, spreading and causing harm without the user's knowledge. It may delete files, steal information, or consume resources. Antivirus software and timely updates are effective defenses.�ans��src�ُSchweitzer,《A Nontechnical Consideration of the Computer Virus: Why to Worry and What to Do》, EDPACS, 1988 (DOI: 10.1080/07366988809450525)ًSchweitzer, 'A Nontechnical Consideration of the Computer Virus: Why to Worry and What to Do', EDPACS, 1988, DOI: 10.1080/07366988809450525��id�62e5661b2f5f�body��&事件驱动指程序不按顺序死等，而是注册好“点击按钮”“按下按键”等事件的响应函数，由用户操作或系统来触发。图形界面大量采用这种方式：你点哪、程序才做哪。它让交互程序能随时响应用户，而不是卡在某一步。�XEvent-driven means a program does not plod sequentially but registers response functions for events like button clicks or key presses, triggered by user actions or the system. Graphical interfaces rely on this heavily: the program reacts to whatever you do. It lets interactive programs respond at any time instead of getting stuck at one step.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�654ff08d67ee�body���控制单元是 CPU 的“指挥中枢”，它从内存取来指令、译码后发出一系列控制信号，指挥寄存器、ALU、内存等部件协同完成该指令。没有它，各个硬件部件就不知道何时该做什么。�$The control unit is the CPU's command center: it fetches instructions from memory, decodes them, and issues control signals that direct registers, the ALU, memory, and other components to cooperate in executing each instruction. Without it, the hardware pieces would not know when to do what.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�656516ebdfbd�body��QIPv4 地址为 32 位，理论上约 43 亿个，已在全球耗尽；IPv6 地址扩展到 128 位，空间大到足以给地球上每粒沙分配地址，用以解决枯竭并简化路由。IPv4 用点分十进制（如 192.168.1.1），IPv6 用冒号分隔的十六进制。二者由 IETF 分别通过 RFC 791 与 RFC 8200 标准化。��An IPv4 address is 32 bits, allowing about 4.3 billion addresses that are now exhausted globally; IPv6 expands to 128 bits, a space large enough to address far more than every grain of sand, solving exhaustion and simplifying routing. IPv4 uses dotted decimal (e.g., 192.168.1.1) while IPv6 uses colon-separated hexadecimal. They are standardized by the IETF in RFC 791 and RFC 8200 respectively.�ans��src��IETF RFC 791；IETF RFC 8200�IETF RFC 791; IETF RFC 8200��id�65b29839923e�body�ٰ源代码是程序员用人能读懂的编程语言写出的指令文本，如 Python 或 C 写成的文件。它经由编译器或解释器转换成机器能执行的指令。��Source code is the human-readable text of instructions written in a programming language, such as files in Python or C. It is converted by a compiler or interpreter into instructions a machine can execute.�ans��src��+《编程语言实现原理》（Sebesta）�+Concepts of Programming Languages (Sebesta)��id�6631bedab0d2�body��可用性衡量一个系统被特定用户在特定场景下有效、高效且满意地达成目标的程度。它关注易学性、效率、容错和主观满意度等方面。提升可用性常靠简洁的界面、清晰的反馈和符合直觉的操作。�$Usability measures how effectively, efficiently, and satisfactorily a system lets particular users achieve goals in a given context. It covers learnability, efficiency, error tolerance, and satisfaction. Improving it usually means simpler interfaces, clear feedback, and intuitive operations.�ans��src��ISO 9241-11 可用性标准�#ISO 9241-11 Ergonomics of Usability��id�66f2490ca667�body���Bug 是程序中的错误或缺陷，会导致运行结果不符合预期。调试是寻找并修复这些错误的过程，常用方法包括打印日志、单步执行和单元测试。几乎所有程序员都花大量时间在与 Bug 斗争上。��A bug is an error or defect in a program that makes the result unexpected. Debugging is the process of finding and fixing such errors, often using logs, step-by-step execution, and unit tests. Almost every programmer spends much time fighting bugs.�ans��src��[Andrew Hunt 与 David Thomas《The Pragmatic Programmer》(1999) 第 3 章 Debugging 一节�RAndrew Hunt & David Thomas, "The Pragmatic Programmer" (1999), ch. 3, on debugging��id�67fa5d4acb45�body�ٴ递归是函数调用自身来分解问题，代码往往更直观。迭代是用循环重复执行，通常更省内存。两者常可互相改写，深度递归可能栈溢出。��Recursion solves a problem by a function calling itself, often making code clearer. Iteration repeats with a loop and usually uses less memory. They can often be rewritten into each other, but deep recursion may overflow the call stack.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�69e0b3fe03f1�body�ٮ幻觉是指模型生成看似通顺却与事实不符或根本不存在的内容。它源于模型在预测下一个词时追求流畅，而非核对真实世界的事实。ٶA hallucination is when the model produces fluent text that is false or fabricated. It happens because the model predicts plausible next words rather than verifying real-world facts.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�6aa5620011fe�body��图灵测试由阿兰·图灵在 1950 年提出，用来判断机器是否表现出与人无异的智能。测试者通过文字与机器和真人交谈，若无法分辨哪边是机器，则该机器被认为通过了测试。它是 AI 领域最具代表性的思想实验。�Proposed by Alan Turing in 1950, the Turing test judges whether a machine exhibits human-like intelligence. A tester converses by text with both a machine and a human; if unable to tell which is which, the machine is said to pass. It is the most representative thought experiment in AI.�ans��src��0图灵 1950 年论文《计算机器与智能》�8Turing's 1950 paper Computing Machinery and Intelligence��id�6aebb24759f7�body�ٖ二维码是用黑白小方块把网址、文字等编成图案。手机扫它就把图案翻译回信息，于是打开了链接或跳到付款页。ٞA QR code encodes info like a web link into black-and-white squares. Your phone reads the pattern and turns it back into text, opening a link or payment page.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�6dc6e545369a�body�ف密码是一串只有你知道的字或数字，用来证明“你是你”、打开你的账号。就像自家门锁的钥匙。لA password is a secret string of letters or numbers that proves it's you and unlocks your account—like the key to your front door.�ans��src��8美国国家标准与技术研究院（NIST）SP 800-63B�NIST SP 800-63B��id�6f688f509e11�body���黑客原指爱钻研技术、找系统漏洞的人。有人用来做好事（帮公司找漏洞），也有人用来干坏事（偷东西），后者更准确叫“黑帽”。所以不能一概说黑客是坏人。ٰA hacker originally means someone who tinkers and finds system flaws. Some do good (report bugs); some do harm (theft)—better called 'black hats'. So not all hackers are bad.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�75359a676991�body�ٚCDN 把内容缓存到离用户近的节点。你访问时从最近的节点取数据，路程短、延迟低，所以加载更快、源站压力也小。ٟA CDN caches content on servers near users. You fetch from the closest node, so the trip is short and latency low, speeding loads and easing the origin server.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�77a527661723�body���大 O 记号用来刻画算法运行时间或空间随输入规模增长的渐近上界，常用于表述最坏情况代价，例如 O(n) 表示与输入长度成线性增长。它由巴赫曼在 1894 年引入数学界，后经高德纳在《计算机程序设计艺术》中用于算法分析并系统化。它只关注规模变大时的主导增长趋势，忽略常数因子与低阶项。��Big-O notation characterizes the asymptotic upper bound on an algorithm's running time or space as the input size grows, and is commonly used to state worst-case cost, e.g., O(n) means linear growth with input length. Introduced by Bachmann in 1894 and adopted for algorithm analysis by Knuth in The Art of Computer Programming, it is the standard tool of the field. It captures only the dominant growth trend at scale, ignoring constant factors and lower-order terms.�ans��src��c高德纳《计算机程序设计艺术》卷1（The Art of Computer Programming）；Bachmann 1894�?Knuth, The Art of Computer Programming, Vol. 1; Bachmann (1894)��id�77e9dd49cf47�body��SSD 用闪存芯片存储数据，没有机械部件，因此读写尤其是随机访问远超 HDD，也更抗震、省电。缺点是单位容量成本较高，且闪存存在写入寿命限制。为延长寿命，控制器会做磨损均衡，把写入均匀分散到各存储单元。�aAn SSD stores data in flash memory chips with no moving parts, so its read and especially random access speeds far exceed an HDD, and it is also shock-resistant and power-efficient. The downsides are higher cost per byte and limited write endurance of flash. To extend life, the controller performs wear leveling that spreads writes evenly across cells.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�7b3565ab4a63�body���训练就是让模型从大量例子中不断调整内部参数，使它对类似新问题也能给出正确答案的过程。好比学生通过大量练习掌握规律。训练得越多、数据越好，模型通常越准确，但也可能学过头。�(Training is the process of letting a model repeatedly adjust its internal parameters from many examples so it can answer similar new questions correctly, like a student mastering patterns through practice. More and better training data usually means higher accuracy, though it can also overlearn.�ans��src��SGoodfellow, I., Bengio, Y. 与 Courville, A. (2016). 《深度学习》. MIT Press.�MGoodfellow, I., Bengio, Y., & Courville, A. (2016). Deep Learning. MIT Press.��id�7d0596c6ad85�body�ٮ对称加密用同一把钥匙加解密，快但难安全传钥匙；非对称用公钥加密、私钥解密，解决了传钥匙问题但更慢。实际常用混合加密。پSymmetric uses one key for both steps, fast but hard to share safely. Asymmetric uses a public key to encrypt and a private key to decrypt, solving sharing but slower. Real systems mix both.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�834f4b93dc64�body��␀ALU 是 CPU 中真正做计算的部分，负责对操作数执行加法、减法等算术运算以及与、或、非等逻辑运算。控制单元送来指令和数据，ALU 算出结果并返回，还会产生进位、零等状态标志供后续判断。�JThe ALU is the part of the CPU that actually computes: it performs arithmetic operations like addition and subtraction and logic operations like AND, OR, and NOT on its operands. The control unit supplies instructions and data, the ALU returns results, and it also produces status flags such as carry and zero for later decisions.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�8568bfb29b92�body���分治法把大问题拆成几个结构相同的子问题，分别解决后再合并结果。它让复杂问题变得可管理，并常带来对数级的效率提升。归并排序和快速排序都是典型例子。��Divide-and-conquer splits a big problem into smaller subproblems of the same kind, solves them, then combines the results. It makes hard problems manageable and often yields logarithmic efficiency gains. Merge sort and quicksort are classic examples.�ans��src��rCormen, T. H., Leiserson, C. E., Rivest, R. L. 与 Stein, C. (2009). 《算法导论（第三版）》. MIT Press.�tCormen, T. H., Leiserson, C. E., Rivest, R. L., & Stein, C. (2009). Introduction to Algorithms (3rd ed.). MIT Press.��id�8674b4869391�body��TCP 和 UDP 是互联网传输层两大协议。TCP 提供可靠、有序、面向连接的传输，适合网页和文件传输；UDP 不保证可靠但速度更快、延迟更低，适合视频通话和游戏。选择哪一种取决于对可靠性和实时性的要求。�]TCP and UDP are the two main transport-layer protocols of the Internet. TCP provides reliable, ordered, connection-oriented transmission, suited to web pages and file transfer; UDP is faster with lower latency but no reliability guarantee, suited to video calls and games. The choice depends on the need for reliability versus real-time performance.�ans��src��j互联网工程任务组（IETF）,《Transmission Control Protocol》,RFC 793,1981 (DOI: 10.17487/rfc793)�JIETF, 'Transmission Control Protocol', RFC 793, 1981, DOI: 10.17487/rfc793��id�86c371404130�body��.中断是外设或程序向 CPU 发出的一种信号，要求它暂停当前工作去处理更紧急的事件，比如键盘按键或网卡来数据。CPU 收到中断后会保存现场、执行对应的中断处理程序，再恢复原工作。它让 CPU 不必反复轮询外设，提高了效率。�FAn interrupt is a signal from a peripheral or program asking the CPU to pause its current work and handle a more urgent event, such as a keypress or incoming network data. The CPU saves its context, runs the matching interrupt handler, then resumes. This spares the CPU from constantly polling devices and improves efficiency.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�8805a4cb5e4a�body���指令集是 CPU 能听懂的“基本命令表”，软件最终都翻译成这些命令。RISC-V 因为免费开放、可自由裁剪，让学校和公司都能自己设计芯片，所以很受关注。��An instruction set is the basic command list a CPU understands; all software ultimately becomes these commands. RISC-V is free and open and can be trimmed to taste, so schools and firms can design their own chips.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�88249d52db9b�body��响应式设计让同一界面能根据屏幕大小、方向自动调整布局，在手机、平板、桌面都好看且好用。常见手段是用弹性网格、相对单位和媒体查询重新排列元素。它的目标是“一套内容，多种设备”。�1Responsive design lets one interface automatically adapt its layout to screen size and orientation, looking and working well on phones, tablets, and desktops. Common techniques use flexible grids, relative units, and media queries to rearrange elements. The goal is one content source across many devices.�ans��src�ٽCasalánguida, Eduardo Durán,《User Interface Design for Responsive Web Applications》, Proceedings of the 11th International Conference on Web Info, 2015 (DOI: 10.5220/0005454101040111)ٹCasalánguida, Eduardo Durán, 'User Interface Design for Responsive Web Applications', Proceedings of the 11th International Conference on Web Info, 2015, DOI: 10.5220/0005454101040111��id�8a7a1f02bcd8�body�٢测试金字塔建议底层大量廉价快速的单元测试，中层少量集成测试，顶层少量昂贵的端到端测试，以最低成本获得高信心。ٳThe test pyramid suggests many cheap fast unit tests at the base, fewer integration tests in the middle, and few expensive end-to-end tests at top, maximizing confidence per cost.�ans��src��=Cohn《Succeeding with Agile》第13章 (Prentice Hall), 2009�aM. Cohn, Succeeding with Agile: Software Development Using Scrum, Chapter 13, Prentice Hall, 2009��id�8dac6f069fe7�body�ٮ语音输入让你对着手机说话，它就自动写成文字，不用打字。它先把声音切成小段，再识别成对应的词，常用于发微信、写备忘录。ٖVoice input lets you speak and the phone writes it as text, no typing. It chops sound into pieces and recognizes words—handy for messages and notes.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�8de399e0c821�body���栈是一种后进先出（LIFO）的线性数据结构：最后压入的元素最先弹出，就像一摞盘子只能从顶端取放。栈常用于函数调用、撤销操作和表达式求值。�	A stack is a linear data structure that follows last-in, first-out (LIFO): the most recently pushed item is the first to be popped, like a pile of plates you can only take from the top. Stacks are used for function calls, undo operations, and expression evaluation.�ans��src��!《数据结构与算法分析》�&Data Structures and Algorithm Analysis��id�8e2e4bad58c6�body���在非对称加密中，公钥可以公开给任何人用来加密或验证签名，私钥必须严格保密用来解密或生成签名。用公钥加密的内容只能用对应私钥解开。这种机制支撑了 HTTPS 和数字签名。�;In asymmetric encryption, the public key can be shared with anyone to encrypt or verify signatures, while the private key must be kept secret to decrypt or create signatures. Content encrypted with the public key can only be opened by the matching private key. This mechanism underpins HTTPS and digital signatures.�ans��src��'公钥密码学（Diffie-Hellman/RSA）�,Public-key cryptography (Diffie-Hellman/RSA)��id�8fc1c317f9e4�body�ٓ版本控制记录文件每次改动的历史，可随时回到旧版本、看清谁改了什么，多人还能并行修改同一项目而不乱。ًVersion control records every change history, lets you revert, shows who changed what, and lets many people edit one project without chaos.�ans��src��3Scott Chacon & Ben Straub,《Pro Git》,Apress,2014�0Scott Chacon & Ben Straub, Pro Git, Apress, 2014��id�8fc434081f1b�body��u核对多个权威来源、查发布时间和原图、警惕情绪化标题，必要时用事实核查网站求证。هCross-check several authoritative sources, verify the date and original image, beware emotional headlines, and use fact-checking sites.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�90fc1a9e4737�body���是的。我们记的是“example.com”这样的名字，电脑要的是 IP 地址。DNS 负责把名字翻译成数字地址，就像电话簿把人名查成电话号码，你才连得上网站。ٿYes. We remember names like 'example.com' but computers need IP addresses. DNS translates names to numeric addresses, like a phone book turning a name into a number so you can reach the site.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�932fcf3a21dc�body�٬弹性伸缩按 CPU、请求量等指标自动增减实例数量：超过阈值扩容保性能，低于阈值缩容省成本，通常配合健康检查剔除故障节点。��Auto scaling adds or removes instances based on metrics like CPU or request rate—scale out above threshold for performance, scale in below to save cost—often with health checks to drop bad nodes.�ans��src��NAmazon Web Services,《Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling User Guide》(AWS 官方文档)�KAmazon Web Services, Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling User Guide (AWS documentation)��id�94369f830e70�body���像素（picture element）是数字图像中最小的独立显示单元，屏幕上的一点就对应一个像素。每个像素用若干比特记录颜色，整幅图像就是像素的二维阵列。像素越密，画面看起来越细腻。�A pixel (picture element) is the smallest independent unit of a digital image, with one point on screen corresponding to one pixel. Each pixel records its color in a few bits, and the whole image is a two-dimensional array of pixels. Denser pixels make the picture look finer.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�94625d74920a�body��[栈是后进先出（LIFO）结构，只能在一端压入和弹出，像一摞盘子；队列是先进先出（FIFO）结构，从一端入队、另一端出队，像排队买票。两者的插入删除顺序截然相反，分别对应函数调用回溯和任务缓冲等典型场景。它们是几乎所有程序都依赖的基础线性结构。��A stack is last-in-first-out (LIFO): you push and pop only from one end, like a pile of plates. A queue is first-in-first-out (FIFO): items enter at one end and leave at the other, like a ticket line. Their insertion and removal orders are opposite, serving function-call unwinding and task buffering respectively, and both are fundamental linear structures used by nearly every program.�ans��src��OCormen 等《算法导论》（CLRS）；Knuth《计算机程序设计艺术》�XCormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms (CLRS); Knuth, The Art of Computer Programming��id�991619105bf2�body��~人工智能是让机器模仿人类智能去感知、学习、推理和决策的技术，比如语音助手和推荐系统。٪Artificial intelligence is technology that lets machines imitate human intelligence to perceive, learn, reason, and decide, like voice assistants and recommender systems.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�9928ae06bdb7�body���深度伪造是用 AI 生成高度逼真的假视频或音频，让人看起来说了或做了从未发生的事。它可被用于诈骗或散布谣言。检测水印和来源认证是应对方向之一。��A deepfake uses AI to fabricate highly realistic video or audio of people saying or doing things they never did. It can enable scams or rumors. Watermarking and provenance authentication are among the countermeasures.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�9bb82cc73a91�body���人工智能指让机器表现出通常需要人类智能的行为，如理解语言、识别图像、推理决策和学习。「人工智能」一词最早出现在麦卡锡、明斯基、罗切斯特与香农 1955 年撰写的达特茅斯会议提案中，1956 年夏举行的达特茅斯会议被视为该领域诞生的标志。现代 AI 大量依赖机器学习与数据驱动方法，而非仅靠手工规则。��Artificial intelligence means building machines that exhibit behaviors usually requiring human intelligence, such as understanding language, recognizing images, reasoning, deciding, and learning. The term first appeared in the 1955 proposal for the Dartmouth workshop written by McCarthy, Minsky, Rochester, and Shannon, and the summer 1956 workshop is regarded as the birth of the field. Modern AI relies heavily on machine learning and data-driven methods rather than hand-coded rules alone.�ans��src�ٔMcCarthy, Minsky, Rochester & Shannon 1955《达特茅斯人工智能夏季研究项目提案》；Russell & Norvig《人工智能：现代方法》ٽMcCarthy, Minsky, Rochester & Shannon (1955), 'A Proposal for the Dartmouth Summer Research Project on Artificial Intelligence'; Russell & Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach��id�9ca2f36b9b64�body��数组在内存中是连续存放的，可以通过下标在 O(1) 时间随机访问任意元素，但插入删除可能需要移动大量数据。链表由一个个节点通过指针连接，插入删除方便，但只能顺序遍历访问。两者各有适用场景。�'An array stores elements contiguously in memory, allowing O(1) random access by index but possibly requiring large data moves for insertion or deletion. A linked list connects nodes via pointers, making insertion and deletion easy but access only sequential. Each has its own suitable use cases.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�9e6929283e92�body��(寄存器是 CPU 内部速度最快、容量最小的存储单元，用来临时存放正在参与运算的数据和指令地址。相比主存，寄存器离运算单元最近，访问几乎不耗时，但数量非常有限。程序运行时，数据通常先被调入寄存器再参与计算。�mA register is the fastest and smallest storage unit inside the CPU, used to temporarily hold data being operated on and instruction addresses. Compared with main memory, registers sit closest to the arithmetic units and can be accessed almost instantly, but their number is very limited. During execution, data is typically loaded into registers before computation.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�a1231fd731be�body���队列是一种先进先出（FIFO）的线性结构：元素从一端入队、从另一端出队，如同排队买票先来先服务。它被广泛用于任务调度、打印缓冲和广度优先搜索。�A queue is a linear structure that follows first-in, first-out (FIFO): elements enter at one end and leave at the other, like a ticket line where the earliest arrival is served first. It is widely used in task scheduling, print buffering, and breadth-first search.�ans��src��!《数据结构与算法分析》�&Data Structures and Algorithm Analysis��id�a55b973c8792�body���主键是唯一标识表中每一行的字段，不能重复也不能为空。外键是引用另一张表主键的字段，用来建立表之间的关联。它们共同保证数据的唯一性和引用完整性。��A primary key uniquely identifies each row and cannot repeat or be empty. A foreign key references another table's primary key to link the tables. Together they ensure uniqueness and referential integrity.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�a5672550afa2�body�ٝ杀毒软件像门卫，扫描下载的文件、拦住可疑程序，防止病毒偷密码或搞坏电脑。手机也类似，别乱装来路不明的 App。٪Antivirus is like a guard that scans downloads and blocks suspicious programs, stopping viruses from stealing passwords or breaking the PC. On phones, avoid unknown apps.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�a6cbdd4d5b28�body��计算机视觉是让机器「看懂」图像和视频的技术，包括识别物体、检测人脸、理解场景等。它结合了图像处理和机器学习，是自动驾驶、医疗影像分析和安防的核心。近年来深度学习大幅提升了其准确率。�GComputer vision is the technology that lets machines see images and video, including recognizing objects, detecting faces, and understanding scenes. It combines image processing with machine learning and is central to self-driving, medical imaging, and security. Deep learning has greatly improved its accuracy in recent years.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�a970fffbf064�body��_CPU（中央处理器）是电脑的"大脑"，负责执行程序里的各种计算和指令。�{The CPU (central processing unit) is the computer's 'brain' that carries out the calculations and instructions in programs.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�adb8a276e75e�body�ٺ流媒体是边下载边播放，不用等整部下完。你点的那刻，服务器一小段一小段把内容传过来，所以叫“流”。看电影、听歌大多都是流媒体。ٮStreaming plays while downloading, so you don't wait for the whole file. The server sends it in small chunks as you watch—hence 'stream'. Most video and music is streaming.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�ae122971e0a9�body���生成时每输出一个新词元都要让它与之前所有词元做注意力计算。KV Cache 把已算好的历史 K、V 缓存起来，避免每步重复计算，使每步开销从与序列长度平方相关降到近似线性。��When generating, each new token attends to all previous ones. The KV cache stores the already-computed past keys and values so they are not recomputed, dropping per-step cost from roughly quadratic to near-linear in sequence length.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�af9c3068d3e1�body���推荐系统发现你爱看什么就一直推类似的，加上每条都很短、划一下就来新的，大脑容易一直想“再看一条”。这是设计出来的，定个闹钟能帮你停下。ٚThe recommender keeps feeding similar clips, each short and instantly replaced, so the brain wants 'just one more'. It's by design—set an alarm to stop.�ans��src��Resnick, Iacovou, Suchak & Bergstrom,《GroupLens》,Proceedings of the 1994 ACM conference on Computer supported,1994 (DOI: 10.1145/192844.192905)；Koren, Bell & Volinsky,《Matrix Factorization Techniques for Recommender Systems》,Computer,2009 (DOI: 10.1109/mc.2009.263)�Resnick, Iacovou, Suchak & Bergstrom, 'GroupLens', Proceedings of the 1994 ACM conference on Computer supported, 1994, DOI: 10.1145/192844.192905; Koren, Bell & Volinsky, 'Matrix Factorization Techniques for Recommender Systems', Computer, 2009, DOI: 10.1109/mc.2009.263��id�b61f80d10290�body���双因素认证要求除了密码外再提供第二种证明，如手机验证码或指纹。即便密码泄露，攻击者没有第二因素也难以登录。它显著提升了账号安全性。��Two-factor authentication requires a second proof beyond the password, such as a phone code or fingerprint. Even if the password leaks, the attacker lacks the second factor and cannot easily log in. It greatly strengthens account security.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�b7de0ec75855�body�يUnicode给每个字符一个唯一码点，例如“中”是U+4E2D，全球文字统一编号，UTF-8是它的一种变长存储方式。ّUnicode assigns each character a unique code point, e.g. 中 is U+4E2D, unifying scripts worldwide; UTF-8 is one variable-length way to store it.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�bd2eed157bbf�body��时钟频率表示 CPU 内部时钟每秒震荡的次数，单位是赫兹，GHz 即十亿次每秒。每个时钟周期推动流水线前进一步，频率越高通常单核吞吐越快。但它不是性能的唯一指标，核心数、架构效率同样关键。�XClock frequency is how many times per second the CPU's internal clock oscillates, measured in hertz, with GHz meaning billions of cycles per second. Each cycle advances the pipeline a step, so higher frequency usually means faster single-core throughput. It is not the only performance factor; core count and architecture efficiency matter too.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�bdc2d7183089�body���总线是计算机各部件之间传输数据、地址和控制信号的公共通道，类似一条共享公路。CPU、内存、外设都通过总线互相通信。总线的宽度和频率会影响数据传输的速率。�A bus is the shared pathway through which a computer's components transfer data, addresses, and control signals, much like a shared highway. The CPU, memory, and peripherals all communicate over buses. A bus's width and frequency affect how fast data can move.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�c09cdf717f40�body���每个词元生成 Q、K、V 三个向量：用某个词的 Q 与其余词的 K 做点积得到相似度，再softmax成权重，最后用这些权重对 V 加权求和，从而得到融合了上下文信息的表示。��Each token produces Q, K and V vectors: a token's Q is compared with others' K via dot product to get similarity, softmaxed into weights, then used to take a weighted sum of the V vectors, yielding a context-aware representation.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�c2a4638340a3�body�ٯ代码是用编程语言写给电脑看的“说明书”，一行行告诉它该做什么。人把想法写成代码，电脑照着做，于是有了游戏、App 和网站。٩Code is a set of instructions written in a programming language telling the computer what to do. People write code; computers follow it to make games, apps and websites.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�c33222d0790a�body�٧内存比 CPU 慢很多，缓存用更快但更小的 SRAM 暂存常用数据。L1 最快最小、常在每个核心内；L2 次之；L3 更大、常由多核共享。��Memory is much slower than the CPU, so caches use faster but smaller SRAM to hold frequently used data. L1 is fastest and smallest per core, L2 is next, and L3 is larger and often shared across cores.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�c6f5cabc5a64�body�ٯ鸿蒙是华为2019年发布的分布式操作系统，采用微内核设计，面向手机、汽车、家电等全场景设备，目标是“一次开发、多端部署”。ٸHarmonyOS, released by Huawei in 2019, is a distributed operating system with a microkernel design for phones, cars, and appliances, aiming to let one app run across many device types.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c8b4cfb9012d�body��分布式系统由多台通过网络协作的计算机组成，对外看起来像一个整体，共同完成某项任务。它能通过增加机器来提升性能和可靠性，例如大型网站和云服务。难点在于处理机器故障和网络延迟。�@A distributed system consists of multiple computers collaborating over a network that appears as a single coherent system to users, jointly completing a task. It scales performance and reliability by adding machines, as in large websites and cloud services. The hard part is handling machine failures and network delays.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�cb4451cf8d75�body���防火墙像一道关卡，按规则检查进出网络的数据包，拦截可疑或未经允许的流量。它可以部署在个人电脑、路由器或云端。防火墙减少攻击面，但不能替代杀毒和加密。�A firewall acts like a checkpoint, inspecting incoming and outgoing packets against rules and blocking suspicious or unauthorized traffic. It can sit on a PC, a router, or the cloud. It shrinks the attack surface but does not replace antivirus or encryption.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�cbc4de06af27�body�ٕ寄存器是 CPU 内部极少、极快、临时存放正在运算数据的小格子。内存大但慢，数据要先搬进寄存器才能被计算。ُRegisters are a tiny, ultra-fast on-CPU storage for data being computed. Memory is large but slow, so data must be loaded into registers first.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�cc311c302769�body��URL（统一资源定位符）是网页或资源在互联网上的地址，通常包含协议、域名和路径。例如 https://example.com/page 中，https 是协议，example.com 是主机，/page 是路径。它告诉浏览器去哪里、用什么方式获取内容。�A URL (Uniform Resource Locator) is the address of a web page or resource, usually with a protocol, domain, and path. In https://example.com/page, https is the protocol, example.com the host, and /page the path. It tells the browser where and how to fetch content.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�ce6a80764dfd�body�ٚ客户端发 SYN 请求连接，服务器回 SYN-ACK 表示收到并同意，客户端再发 ACK 确认。三次往返确保双方收发能力都正常。نThe client sends SYN, the server replies SYN-ACK, and the client sends ACK. These three steps confirm both sides can send and receive.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�cef46c4cfe9a�body��h防火墙是保护网络或电脑的"门卫"，按规则检查进出的数据，挡住可疑的连接。لA firewall is a guard at the door of a network or computer that checks incoming and outgoing data and blocks suspicious connections.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�cf576efbf879�body�ِ用同一批数据训练和打分，模型可能只是背答案。分开测试才能公平检验它在没见过的数据上是否真会做题。نScoring on the same data used to train lets the model just memorize answers. A separate test fairly checks performance on unseen data.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�cs_24_004�body���因为系统并没有立刻复制整份内存。fork 只复制页表:两边映射同一批物理页并统一标成只读,耗时仅毫秒级;之后任何一方第一次写入某个共享页都会触发缺页异常,内核此时才分配新的物理页、复制内容,并把双方对应的页表项改回可写。这种写时复制机制让 fork 加 exec 的典型流程近乎零成本,也是内存去重等技术的基础。��Nothing is copied up front. fork duplicates only the page tables: both sides map the same physical frames, all marked read-only, which takes milliseconds. The first write from either side raises a page fault, and only then does the kernel allocate a fresh frame, copy the contents and turn both entries writable again. This copy-on-write scheme makes the classic fork-plus-exec pattern nearly free and underpins memory-deduplication techniques.�ans��src���Rashid 等,Machine-Independent Virtual Memory Management for Paged Uniprocessor and Multiprocessor Architectures,ASPLOS,1987;McKusick、Neville-Neil《The Design and Implementation of the FreeBSD Operating System》,Addison-Wesley,2004��Rashid et al., Machine-Independent Virtual Memory Management for Paged Uniprocessor and Multiprocessor Architectures, ASPLOS, 1987; McKusick and Neville-Neil, The Design and Implementation of the FreeBSD Operating System, Addison-Wesley, 2004��id�cs_24_006�body���一条完整接力:域名先经 DNS 解析为 IP(缓存未中则逐级询问根、顶级域与权威服务器);TCP 三次握手建连,TLS 握手协商加密并验证证书链;浏览器发出 HTTP 请求取回 HTML;解析中再对 CSS、JS、图片并行发起请求,常经 CDN 就近返回;渲染引擎排版绘制。每一跳靠路由器逐包转发,BGP 决定洲际路径。任一环节慢几十毫秒用户都能感知——这正是性能优化的战场地图。�jA full relay: the resolver turns the domain into an IP via DNS (asking root, TLD then authoritative servers on cache miss); TCP performs its three-way handshake for a reliable pipe; TLS negotiates ciphers and validates the certificate chain; the browser sends HTTP and receives HTML; parsing triggers parallel fetches for CSS, JS and images, often served from a nearby CDN edge; finally the engine lays out and paints. Each hop rides router-by-router packet forwarding with BGP quietly choosing intercontinental paths. Tens of milliseconds anywhere in this chain are user-visible — hence the performance battlefield.�ans��src��RKurose 与 Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�]J. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�cs_24_011�body��D显卡的通用货币是三角形:任何曲面都能被三角网格逼近,顶点带位置、法线与纹理坐标。渲染流水线把每个三角形经矩阵变换投影到屏幕,光栅化阶段判断哪些像素被覆盖,再按插值的属性跑像素着色器算颜色——金属反光还是布料漫反射全在这段小程序里。当模型离得太远或朝向侧面时,贴图分辨率不足或面片过少,纸片感与锯齿便出现;Mipmap预生成缩放版纹理与抗锯齿采样就是对症药。实时渲染的本质是用每秒上百次的三角洪水骗过人眼。�cTriangles are GPU currency: any surface approximates as a triangle mesh whose vertices carry position, normals and texture coordinates. The pipeline transforms each triangle into screen space, rasterization finds covered pixels, and fragment shaders compute colors per pixel — metallic glint or cloth diffuse lives in those small programs. Distant or edge-on models reveal low-resolution textures and coarse meshes as cardboard flatness and jaggies; mipmapped textures and antialiasing sampling are the remedies. Real-time rendering is a flood of triangles per frame, fooling the eye a hundred times a second.�ans��src��SAkenine-Moller、Haines 与 Hoffman,《Real-Time Rendering》第4版,CRC Press,2018�GT. Akenine-Moller et al., Real-Time Rendering, 4th ed., CRC Press, 2018��id�cs_24_017�body��6关键在一个词:复用。朴素递归会反复求解同一个子问题,调用量随规模指数膨胀——直接按定义求斐波那契第n项约需1.618^n次调用;动态规划察觉这些子问题高度重叠、且最优解可由子问题的最优解组合而成,于是用一张表缓存答案,自顶向下记忆化或自底向上按依赖顺序填表,保证每个子问题只算一次。总复杂度变为子问题总数乘以单个子问题的开销,斐波那契就此降到O(n)。动规是否适用,正看重叠子问题与最优子结构这两张门票。��One word: reuse. Naive recursion solves identical subproblems over and over, so calls explode exponentially — deriving the nth Fibonacci number straight from the definition takes about 1.618^n function calls. Dynamic programming notices that these subproblems overlap heavily and that optimal solutions assemble from optimal subsolutions, so it caches every answer in a table, memoized top-down or filled bottom-up in dependency order, ensuring each subproblem is computed once. Total cost becomes the number of subproblems times the cost of solving one, dropping Fibonacci from exponential to linear time. Overlap plus optimal substructure is precisely the two-ticket test for whether dynamic programming applies.�ans��src��ABellman,《Dynamic Programming》,Princeton University Press,1957�AR. Bellman, Dynamic Programming, Princeton University Press, 1957��id�cs_24_019�body��直答:低视力与色觉障碍用户以及烈日下看屏幕的人,都需要字符和背景拉开足够明度差才能辨认字形,4.5:1是对常见视力损失实测得到的可读底线。机理上,WCAG先把前景色与背景色折算为0到1之间的相对亮度再取比值;AA级据此要求正文4.5:1,大号粗体笔画厚实易认放宽到3:1。注意指标度量的是亮度差而非色相差——红底绿字可能双双偏暗而不达标,这也解释了浅灰正文为何在手机屏幕上格外费眼。��Readers with low vision or color-vision deficiencies — and anyone squinting at a screen in harsh daylight — need enough luminance separation between glyphs and background to recognize letterforms, and 4.5:1 is the empirically grounded readability floor for common vision loss. Mechanically, WCAG converts foreground and background colors into relative luminance between zero and one, then takes their ratio: AA level asks 4.5:1 of body text while large bold strokes, easier to recognize, get a relaxed 3:1. The metric measures luminance difference, not hue difference — red on green can clash loudly yet fail on brightness, which is why pale gray paragraphs strain eyes on phone screens.�ans��src��\W3C,《Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1》推荐标准,成功准则1.4.3,2018�gW3C, Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, W3C Recommendation, Success Criterion 1.4.3, 2018��id�cs_26_003�body���困惑度刻画模型在读到验证文本的每个位置时预测下一个词的平均犹豫程度,大致等于模型平均要在多少个等概率候选词里做选择。比如困惑度为20,可以粗略理解为模型每一步都像在20个词里猜。它由交叉熵损失指数化而来,数值越低说明模型对真实文本的拟合越好;但它只考核逐词命中,反映不了回答是否实用、事实是否正确。��Perplexity captures how uncertain a model is, on average, about the next word at each position of held-out text, roughly how many equally likely candidates it chooses among. A perplexity of 20 can be read loosely as the model guessing every next word from about twenty options. It is the exponentiated cross-entropy loss, so lower values mean a better fit to real text; however it only rewards word-by-word hits and cannot tell whether answers are useful or factually correct.�ans��src��_D. Jurafsky 与 J. H. Martin,《Speech and Language Processing》,第2版,Prentice Hall,2009年�^D. Jurafsky and J. H. Martin, Speech and Language Processing, 2nd edition, Prentice Hall, 2009��id�cs_26_006�body���核心原因是局部连接加参数共享恰好契合图像的统计规律。相邻像素相关性强、远距离像素相关性弱,小卷积核只看一个局部窗口就能提出边缘、纹理这类基元;同一组核在整个图上滑动复用,参数量从与像素数成正比降到与核大小成正比,还附带平移等变性——目标挪个位置,特征响应也跟着挪。全连接层给每个像素配独立权重,不仅参数爆炸,还把这些宝贵先验全部丢弃。�sLocal connectivity plus weight sharing happens to match how images behave statistically. Nearby pixels correlate strongly while distant ones hardly at all, so a small kernel inspecting a local window already extracts primitives like edges and textures; one set of kernels slides and reuses itself across the whole picture, dropping parameters from scaling with pixel count to scaling with kernel size, and bringing translation equivariance — shift the target and the feature responses shift too. Fully connected layers assign an independent weight to every pixel, exploding parameters and throwing away these valuable priors.�ans��src�ٵY. LeCun 等,Gradient-Based Learning Applied to Document Recognition,Proceedings of the IEEE 1998年;I. Goodfellow、Y. Bengio 与 A. Courville,《Deep Learning》,MIT Press,2016年ٲY. LeCun et al., Gradient-Based Learning Applied to Document Recognition, Proceedings of the IEEE, 1998; I. Goodfellow, Y. Bengio and A. Courville, Deep Learning, MIT Press, 2016��id�cs_26_010�body��SIEM 是安全事件的汇聚与分析枢纽。它持续采集防火墙、终端、身份认证系统等来源的日志,统一格式后归一存储,再沿时间、资产、账号三个维度做关联分析:某个账号深夜异地登录,随后提权、批量外发数据,单看每条都像例行操作,连成一条线就是典型的入侵路径。日志集中让分析师在一个界面看到全局,告警带上上下文,排查从挨个设备翻记录变成顺着关联链追击,漏报与响应迟滞都显著减少。��A SIEM is the collection-and-analysis hub for security events. It keeps pulling in logs from firewalls, endpoints, identity systems and other sources, stores them in a unified normalized form, and correlates events along the dimensions of time, assets and accounts: an account logging in remotely late at night and then escalating privileges and shipping data out looks routine event by event, yet chained together it traces a textbook intrusion path. With logs centralized, analysts see the whole picture in one console, alerts carry context, and investigation turns from flipping through records device by device into following a correlation chain, cutting both misses and slow responses.�ans��src�٩B. Cichonski 等,Computer Security Incident Handling Guide,NIST SP 800-61 第2版,2012年;R. Bejtlich,The Practice of Network Security Monitoring,No Starch Press,2013年ٰB. Cichonski et al., Computer Security Incident Handling Guide, NIST SP 800-61 Revision 2, 2012; R. Bejtlich, The Practice of Network Security Monitoring, No Starch Press, 2013��id�cs_26_013�body��人脑解码不同视觉属性的精度天生不同：沿公共刻度比较位置与长短相当可靠，而估计面积、角度或颜色深浅时误差会明显放大。心理物理实验给出的准确度排序大致是位置、长度、斜率、角度、面积、色彩饱和度，越靠后越不可信；面积感知还服从幂定律，圆的大小常被系统性误判。因此严谨的图表把关键数值交给条形长度或点的位置来编码，颜色只用于区分类别，不承担精确读数。�aThe brain decodes different visual attributes with very different precision: comparing positions and lengths along a shared scale is highly reliable, while estimating areas, angles or color shades carries much larger errors. Psychophysical experiments rank the channels roughly as position, length, slope, angle, area, color saturation, with accuracy falling down the list, and area perception obeys a power law, so circles get systematically misjudged. Careful charts therefore encode key numbers with bar lengths or point positions and reserve color for telling categories apart rather than precise reading.�ans��src��W. Cleveland 与 R. McGill，Graphical Perception: Theory, Experimentation, and Application to the Development of Graphical Methods，Journal of the American Statistical Association 第79卷第387期，1984年；W. Cleveland，《The Elements of Graphing Data》，Hobart Press，1994年�W. Cleveland and R. McGill, Graphical Perception: Theory, Experimentation, and Application to the Development of Graphical Methods, Journal of the American Statistical Association 79(387), 1984; W. Cleveland, The Elements of Graphing Data, Hobart Press, 1994��id�cs_26_020�body��.因为再充分的预发测试也覆盖不了真实生产环境的全部状况，小流量先行能把未知缺陷的影响面限制在一小批用户身上。新版上线先承接百分之几的请求，与旧版并行运行；平台持续对比错误率、延迟、转化率等关键指标，一旦偏离历史基线就自动切回旧版，绝大多数用户毫无察觉；指标平稳则逐级放大流量直至全量。发布由此从一锤子买卖变成可观测、可随时逆转的常规操作，配合灰度路由还能顺带完成A/B对照实验。��However thorough pre-production testing is, it never covers everything a live environment will throw at the software; sending a trickle first confines any unknown defect to a handful of users. The new build starts by serving a few percent of requests alongside the old one; the platform keeps comparing error rates, latency and conversion against historical baselines, and rolls back automatically the moment numbers drift, leaving most users untouched. Steady metrics earn progressively larger traffic shares until full rollout. Releases stop being all-or-nothing gambles and become observable, reversible routines — and gray routing doubles as an A/B experiment for free.�ans��src��J. Humble 与 D. Farley，《Continuous Delivery: Reliable Software Releases through Build, Test, and Deployment Automation》，Addison-Wesley，2010年；B. Beyer 等，《Site Reliability Engineering: How Google Runs Production Systems》，O'Reilly Media，2016年��J. Humble and D. Farley, Continuous Delivery: Reliable Software Releases through Build, Test, and Deployment Automation, Addison-Wesley, 2010; B. Beyer et al., Site Reliability Engineering: How Google Runs Production Systems, O'Reilly Media, 2016��id�d1969b1df734�body���AI 更可能替代重复性、规则明确的任务，如数据录入、基础翻译和客服初筛。需要创造、共情和复杂判断的工作较难被取代。多数情况下 AI 是辅助人而非完全替代。�AI is more likely to take over repetitive, rule-based tasks like data entry, basic translation, and first-line support. Jobs needing creativity, empathy, and complex judgment are harder to replace. In most cases AI assists rather than fully replaces people.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�d21b9a17ba46�body�ي密码像钥匙，给了别人，他就可能用你的名字做坏事、看你的私信。就算是好朋友，也尽量不共用密码。ٌA password is like a key; giving it away lets someone act as you and read your private messages. Even with friends, avoid sharing passwords.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d256f88959e9�body���因为芯片里加入了专为矩阵运算设计的 NPU，并且模型被压缩得很小，再加上很多计算在手机本地完成，所以语音助手、拍照美颜等 AI 功能能在不打云的情况下运行。ٵPhones now have NPUs built for matrix math, models are shrunk small, and much computing happens on the device, so features like voice assistants and camera AI run without the cloud.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�d3ce8b5e521b�body��摩尔定律由戈登·摩尔提出，观察认为集成电路上可容纳的晶体管数量约每两年翻一番，带动算力持续提升、成本下降。它更像一条经验趋势而非物理定律，近年在工艺逼近原子尺度后增速已放缓。�/Moore's Law, observed by Gordon Moore, holds that the number of transistors on an integrated circuit roughly doubles about every two years, driving steady gains in compute and falling costs. It is an empirical trend rather than a physical law, and its pace has slowed as fabrication nears atomic scales.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�d6a2a6f5da3c�body��!内存（随机存取存储器）是计算机运行时临时存放程序和数据的场所，CPU 需要的数据大多从这里快速读取。它的读写速度远快于硬盘，但断电后内容会丢失。程序启动或文件打开时，相关的内容会被加载到内存中运行。�HMemory (random-access memory) is the temporary workspace where a computer holds programs and data while they run, and the CPU mostly reads what it needs from here. It is far faster than a disk but loses its contents when power is off. When you launch a program or open a file, the relevant content is loaded into RAM to execute.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�d7b1e768638a�body�ٺ智能合约是写在区块链上、满足条件就自动执行的程序，像一台没人能偷偷改动的自动售货机：规则公开、到点就按约定办事，无需中间人。��A smart contract is a program on a blockchain that runs automatically when conditions are met—like a tamper-proof vending machine: the rules are public and it executes as agreed, with no middleman.�ans��src��FButerin《Ethereum: A Next-Generation Smart Contract Platform》(2014)�cV. Buterin, Ethereum: A Next-Generation Smart Contract and Decentralized Application Platform, 2014��id�d913b5dee3b7�body�� 守护进程是在后台运行、通常不依赖终端的系统服务进程，比如网络服务、日志服务、定时任务。它们在系统启动时拉起，长期待命处理请求或周期性工作。用户一般不直接与之交互，而是通过它提供的服务间接使用。�9A daemon is a background system service process that usually has no controlling terminal, such as networking, logging, or scheduling services. They are launched at system start and stand by to handle requests or run periodic work. Users rarely interact with them directly, instead using the services they provide.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�db14592117a6�body�ه充电宝是一个自带电池的小盒子，能帮手机在外面补电。出门前充满它，手机没电时插上就能继续用。ُA power bank is a small box with its own battery that recharges your phone on the go. Charge it at home, then plug in your phone when it's low.�ans��src�ُWu, Moo, Hou，《A Battery Power Bank with Series-Connected Buck–Boost-Type Battery Power Modules》,Energies,2017 (DOI: 10.3390/en10050650)ًWu, Moo, Hou, 'A Battery Power Bank with Series-Connected Buck–Boost-Type Battery Power Modules', Energies, 2017, DOI: 10.3390/en10050650��id�ddb452ea69f6�body���图由一组顶点（节点）和连接它们的边组成，用来表示对象之间的任意关系。社交网络中的好友关系、地图上的道路都是图的例子。根据边是否有方向，图可分为有向图和无向图。�$A graph consists of a set of vertices (nodes) and edges connecting them, used to represent arbitrary relationships between objects. Examples include friendships in a social network and roads on a map. Depending on whether edges have direction, graphs are divided into directed and undirected.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�dfc4829a2671�body��}操作系统是管理电脑硬件、并为你运行的其他程序提供舞台的软件，比如 Windows、macOS 和 Linux。ًAn operating system is software that manages a computer's hardware and provides a stage for other programs, like Windows, macOS, and Linux.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�e18fb98b04b9�body�كIP地址是分配给联网设备的数字编号，就像每家每户的门牌号，用来在网络中找到并互相发送数据。�|An IP address is a numeric label assigned to a device on a network, like a house number, used to locate and send data to it.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�e27a06e4632d�body��AUSB-C 只规定了插头的机械形状，能力取决于线里实际接了哪些导线以及有没有内置电子标记芯片。仅充电线可能只接了电源和两根低速数据线，缺少高速差分对，因此无法承载 DisplayPort 替代模式的视频或 USB 3.2/4 的信号，而视频与高速传输需要四对高速通道齐全。功率同理：超过 3 安或 20 伏的供电必须靠电子标记向两端声明线材额定值，没有它就只能协商到低档功率。所以选购要看线上标注的具体协议与瓦数，而不是只看接口形状。��USB-C specifies only the connector's mechanical shape; what a cable can do depends on which wires are physically present and whether it carries an e-marker chip. A charge-only cable may include just power plus two low-speed data lines and omit the high-speed differential pairs, so it cannot carry DisplayPort Alt Mode video or USB 3.2/4 signalling, both of which need all four high-speed lanes. Power works the same way: anything above 3 A or 20 V requires the e-marker to declare the cable's rating to both ends, and without it the pair negotiates down to a lower tier. Buy by the printed protocol and wattage rating rather than by the plug shape.�ans��src�ٍUSB Implementers Forum《USB Type-C Cable and Connector Specification, Revision 2.3》与《USB Power Delivery Specification, Revision 3.1》ىUSB Implementers Forum, "USB Type-C Cable and Connector Specification, Revision 2.3" and "USB Power Delivery Specification, Revision 3.1"��id�e3d180209905�body���硬件故障、误删或勒索软件都可能让数据丢失，备份是最后一道防线。恢复演练能确保在灾难发生时真的能找回数据。常见策略包括全量备份加增量备份。��Hardware failure, accidental deletion, or ransomware can all lose data, and backup is the last line of defense. Recovery drills ensure data can actually be restored in a disaster. Common strategies combine full and incremental backups.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�e47742a684f7�body���一旦某个网站发生泄露，攻击者会拿这套账号密码去尝试其他网站，称为“撞库”。不同网站使用不同密码，可把损失限制在一个账户内。配合密码管理器更易做到。��If one site leaks, attackers try the same credentials elsewhere, called credential stuffing. Using different passwords per site confines the damage to a single account. A password manager makes this easier.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�e50a9c217adb�body�ٍ多数量产车是L2（辅助驾驶），少数在试点L3，完全无人（L4/L5）仍局限在固定场景，手还不能离开方向盘。قMost cars are L2 (assisted); a few pilot L3; full autonomy (L4/L5) remains confined to fixed scenarios—hands still on the wheel.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�e514133cd616�body�ٸShor 算法能在多项式时间内分解大整数和求离散对数，直接攻破 RSA 与椭圆曲线等经典公钥体系，因此催生了后量子密码学的研究与标准化。٨Shor's algorithm factors integers and solves discrete logs in polynomial time, breaking RSA and ECC; this drives post-quantum cryptography research and standardization.�ans��src��Shor 1994�Shor 1994��id�e719b217b9e1�body�٨北斗是中国自主建设的全球卫星导航系统，由约30颗卫星组成，2020年完成全球组网，能为全球用户提供定位、导航和授时服务。��BeiDou is China’s independently built global satellite navigation system, made of about 30 satellites and completed for global service in 2020, providing positioning, navigation, and timing worldwide.�ans��src��n国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》白皮书：北斗卫星导航系统建设与应用（2022）�\SCIO white paper 'China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective': BeiDou navigation system, 2022��id�eaef7f63ae4d�body��N人机交互研究人与计算机之间如何设计与评估交互方式，目标是让系统易学、高效且令人满意。它融合心理学、设计与计算机科学，常由 ACM 的 SIGCHI 专业组推动。诺曼在《设计心理学》中强调以用户心智模型为中心的设计原则，是该领域的奠基性著作。��Human-computer interaction studies how to design and evaluate the ways people interact with computers, aiming for systems that are learnable, efficient, and satisfying. It blends psychology, design, and computer science and is advanced by ACM's SIGCHI. Norman's 'The Design of Everyday Things' emphasizes design centered on users' mental models and is a foundational work in the field.�ans��src��KNorman《设计心理学》（The Design of Everyday Things）；ACM SIGCHI�1Norman, The Design of Everyday Things; ACM SIGCHI��id�ec09aa16cbac�body���自然语言中字符和单词的出现频率很不均匀，且存在大量重复和规律。压缩算法利用这些冗余，用更短的符号表示常见内容。理想情况下数据越有规律、越冗余，压缩效果越好。�In natural language, characters and words appear with very uneven frequency and show much repetition and structure. Compression exploits this redundancy by representing common content with shorter symbols. The more regular and redundant the data, the better it compresses.�ans��src��bShannon, C. E. (1948). 《通信的数学理论》. Bell System Technical Journal, 27(3), 379-423.�mShannon, C. E. (1948). A Mathematical Theory of Communication. Bell System Technical Journal, 27(3), 379-423.��id�ec8f2141c69e�body���软件工程是用系统化、可度量的方法开发、运行和维护软件的学科，关注质量、成本与进度。它涵盖需求分析、设计、编码、测试到运维的完整生命周期。��Software engineering is the disciplined, measurable approach to developing, running, and maintaining software, concerned with quality, cost, and schedule. It spans the full life cycle from requirements, design, coding, and testing to operations.�ans��src�ٗBrooks 1975《人月神话》（Addison-Wesley）；Brooks 1986《No Silver Bullet: Essence and Accidents of Software Engineering》（IFIP Congress）ٖBrooks (1975), The Mythical Man-Month, Addison-Wesley; Brooks (1986), 'No Silver Bullet: Essence and Accidents of Software Engineering', IFIP Congress��id�ed09502075bd�body���面向对象编程把数据和操作数据的方法打包成“对象”，以对象为单元来组织程序。它强调用类来描述一类事物的结构与行为，让代码更贴近现实模型。常见好处是易于复用、扩展和维护。�.Object-oriented programming bundles data and the methods that operate on it into objects and organizes programs around them. It uses classes to describe the structure and behavior of a kind of thing, making code closer to real-world models. Common benefits are easier reuse, extension, and maintenance.�ans��src��C《面向对象软件构造》Bertrand Meyer，Prentice Hall，1997�JObject-Oriented Software Construction, Bertrand Meyer, Prentice Hall, 1997��id�eedd4f62d656�body�٨屏幕阅读器把屏幕上的文字、按钮念出来或用盲文显示，盲人靠键盘和听读来浏览网页、写文档，因此网页结构要清晰语义化。ٗA screen reader speaks or brailles the text and buttons on screen; blind users navigate by keyboard and audio, so pages need clear, semantic structure.�ans��src�فW3C，《可访问富互联网应用（WAI-ARIA）1.2》与《Web 内容无障碍指南（WCAG）2.2》，W3C 建议标准，2023وW3C, Accessible Rich Internet Applications (WAI-ARIA) 1.2 and Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2, W3C Recommendations, 2023��id�f0fe8613ed48�body���Cookie 是网站保存在你浏览器里的一小段文本数据，用来记住你的登录状态、偏好等信息。下次访问同一网站时浏览器会把 Cookie 发回服务器。它让无状态的 HTTP 协议能够「记住」用户。�A cookie is a small piece of text data a website stores in your browser to remember your login status, preferences, and similar information. On your next visit the browser sends the cookie back to the server. It lets the stateless HTTP protocol remember users.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�f287830d40ba�body�ٱ电子书是把文字存在手机或阅读器里的书，能调字号、搜关键词、随身带几百本。它省纸、方便，但有些人还是喜欢翻纸质书的感觉。٠An e-book stores text on a phone or reader; you resize fonts, search words and carry hundreds. It saves paper and is handy, though some still love paper's feel.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�f2efa6e18515�body��位（bit）是信息的最小单位，只能取 0 或 1。字节（byte）通常由 8 个位组成，是计算机存储和寻址的基本单位，可表示 0 到 255 的一个数值。文件大小、内存容量一般都按字节及其倍数（KB、MB）来计量。�A bit is the smallest unit of information, taking only 0 or 1. A byte is usually 8 bits and is the basic unit of storage and addressing, representing one value from 0 to 255. File sizes and memory capacities are generally measured in bytes and their multiples like KB and MB.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�f45365004272�body�٤WiFi 是用无线电波代替网线，把手机电脑连到路由器和互联网的方式。路由器像个小广播站，把网络信号发到家里各个角落。٬WiFi is a way to connect phones and laptops to the internet without cables, using radio waves. The router acts like a small broadcast tower sending signal around your home.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�f65a321af3ab�body���双因素认证在密码之外增加第二重验证，例如手机验证码或指纹，证明登录者确实是你。即使密码泄露，攻击者也难以通过第二关。它显著提升了账户安全性。��Two-factor authentication adds a second proof beyond the password, such as a phone code or fingerprint, confirming the login is really you. Even if the password leaks, an attacker still cannot pass the second step. It greatly improves account security.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�f68c76fc510c�body���词元是模型处理文本时切分出的基本单位，可能是一个字、词或标点。模型按输入和输出的词元数计费与计算力，因此同样一段话，切得越碎、生成越长，花费就越高。��A token is the basic unit a model splits text into—a character, word piece or punctuation. Models bill and compute by the number of input and output tokens, so more (or longer) tokens cost more.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�f8c32601d70a�body��函数式编程把计算看作数学函数的求值，强调用纯函数描述“做什么”而非“怎么改状态”。它倾向于不可变数据和避免共享可变状态，从而减少并发中的意外。典型语言有 Haskell、OCaml，以及多语言中的函数式特性。�nFunctional programming treats computation as the evaluation of mathematical functions and emphasizes describing what to do with pure functions rather than how to mutate state. It favors immutable data and avoids shared mutable state, reducing surprises in concurrency. Representative languages include Haskell and OCaml, and many languages offer functional features.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�fac3de55f9aa�body��x人机交互研究人和电脑如何互相交流，包括屏幕、鼠标、语音等人能轻松使用电脑的方式。ٌHuman-computer interaction studies how people and computers communicate, including screens, mice, and voice that make computers easy to use.�ans��src��-《人机交互》（清华大学出版社）�9Sweller, Ayres & Kalyuga, Cognitive Load Theory, Springer��id�fcc8a4757555�body���关系型数据库把数据组织成一张张带行和列的表，表与表之间可以通过共同字段建立关联。它用 SQL 进行查询，并强调数据的一致性和结构清晰。MySQL、PostgreSQL 都是典型代表。��A relational database organizes data into tables of rows and columns, with relationships between tables via shared fields. It is queried with SQL and emphasizes consistency and clear structure. MySQL and PostgreSQL are typical examples.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�ffad02baeaaf�body��@数据中心耗电大、需要大量冷却，而算力需求集中在东部沿海，那里电价高、土地紧张、能耗指标受限；西部则有充裕的水电、风电与光伏，气温低还能省下制冷用电。该方案在京津冀、长三角、粤港澳、成渝以及内蒙古、贵州、甘肃、宁夏布局八大算力枢纽和十个国家数据中心集群，把对时延不敏感的离线训练、数据备份、视频渲染等任务西迁。留在东部的是实时交互业务，因为跨越数千公里的光纤往返延迟无法用工程手段消除。��Data centres consume enormous electricity and cooling, yet demand concentrates in the eastern coastal provinces where power is expensive, land is scarce and energy quotas are tight, while western regions offer abundant hydro, wind and solar power plus cool climates that cut cooling load. The plan designates eight national computing hubs and ten data centre clusters across Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei, the Yangtze and Pearl River deltas, Chengdu-Chongqing, Inner Mongolia, Guizhou, Gansu and Ningxia, relocating latency-tolerant work such as offline training, backup and video rendering westward. Interactive services stay in the east because the fibre round-trip delay across thousands of kilometres cannot be engineered away.�ans��src�َ国家发展改革委等四部门《全国一体化大数据中心协同创新体系算力枢纽实施方案》(发改高技〔2021〕709 号)ٯChina's National Development and Reform Commission et al., "Implementation Plan for Computing Hubs in the Integrated National Big Data Centre System" (NDRC document 709, 2021)��id�2ce429d47869�body�ٙ在已排序数组中，二分查找每次取中点与目标比较，丢弃一半区间，重复直到找到或区间为空，时间复杂度 O(log n)。ٝOn a sorted array, binary search compares the midpoint to the target and discards half the range each step, repeating until found or empty, in O(log n) time.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�6e4030bb1493�body���自底向上为物理层、数据链路层、网络层、传输层、会话层、表示层、应用层；它用于分层理解网络通信职责，实际互联网常用简化的 TCP/IP 四层模型。��From bottom: physical, data link, network, transport, session, presentation, application; it frames networking responsibilities, though the Internet practically uses the simpler four-layer TCP/IP model.�ans��src��ITU-T X.200�ITU-T X.200��id�080f7aee2814�body�ٿCISC 指令丰富、单条可完成复杂操作但译码复杂；RISC 指令少而规整、单周期执行、靠编译器调度，现代 x86 与 ARM 在内部都已相互借鉴对方思想。ٻCISC has rich complex instructions but hard decoding; RISC uses few regular single-cycle instructions scheduled by the compiler; modern x86 and ARM both borrow from each other internally.�ans��src��Patterson & Hennessy�Patterson & Hennessy��id�42111b1c3a05�body��m还没有。现在的AI多是“窄AI”，擅长特定任务但缺乏真正的理解和常识迁移能力。�~Not yet. Today’s AI is mostly 'narrow AI'—good at specific tasks but lacking real understanding and common-sense transfer.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�4f837964618f�body���缺陷发现得越晚，定位与修复成本越高：排查线上回归往往要翻日志、复现环境、协调发布，而单元测试能在几秒内把责任范围缩小到刚改动的那几行。有了一套可信的测试，重构和升级依赖时不必靠「小心一点」来保证不破坏功能，改动的心理成本大幅下降。测试驱动开发进一步把测试当成设计工具：先写一个会失败的测试来明确需求边界，再写最少的代码让它通过，然后重构。�GThe later a defect surfaces, the more it costs to locate and fix: chasing a production regression means digging through logs, reproducing an environment and coordinating a release, whereas a unit test narrows the blame to the lines you just touched within seconds. A trustworthy suite also removes the fear tax on refactoring and dependency upgrades, since correctness no longer depends on being careful. Test-driven development pushes further and treats tests as a design tool — write a failing test to pin down the requirement, write the least code that passes it, then refactor.�ans��src��8Kent Beck《Test-Driven Development: By Example》(2002)�7Kent Beck, "Test-Driven Development: By Example" (2002)��id�5060a4e19baf�body��流程包括：DNS 解析得到 IP；TCP 三次握手与 TLS 握手建立连接；浏览器发送 HTTP 请求；服务器返回 HTML；解析 DOM/CSSOM 生成渲染树；执行 JS、布局与绘制；期间可能触发多次重定向、预连接与缓存判断。��It involves DNS resolution to an IP, a TCP and TLS handshake, an HTTP request, HTML response parsing into a render tree from DOM/CSSOM, JS execution, layout and paint, plus redirects, preconnects and cache checks along the way.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�5b6484185de2�body�ٴ多态允许用统一接口操作不同类型的对象，运行时根据实际类型调用对应实现（如子类重写父类方法），提升代码可扩展性与可替换性。ټPolymorphism lets one interface operate on different object types, dispatching to the actual type's implementation at runtime (e.g. overriding), improving extensibility and replaceability.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�678fec50f14b�body��取决于用途：用AI辅助理解、查资料通常可以，但让AI代写代考会损害学习，学校需要明确规则。مIt depends: using AI to understand or research is fine, but having it write or sit exams harms learning, so schools need clear rules.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�8fa061936107�body���读已提交只允许看到已提交的数据，避免脏读但可能出现不可重复读；可重复读保证同一事务内多次读同一行结果一致，进一步避免不可重复读，但仍可能幻读，具体由数据库实现决定。�Read committed only sees committed data, avoiding dirty reads but allowing non-repeatable reads; repeatable read keeps repeated reads of a row consistent within a transaction, avoiding non-repeatable reads but possibly allowing phantoms, depending on the DB.�ans��src��Database System Concepts�Database System Concepts��id�9a8ab6c1e0e7�body��	关系库强一致、支持复杂事务与联表，适合结构化强、一致性要求高的场景；NoSQL（文档/键值/列族/图）以灵活 schema 和高可扩展性见长，适合海量、结构多变或低延迟的场景，常牺牲强一致换可用性。��Relational DBs give strong consistency, transactions and joins for structured, consistency-critical data; NoSQL (document/key-value/column/graph) offers flexible schema and scale, trading strong consistency for availability.�ans��src��MongoDB 白皮书�MongoDB whitepaper��id�a9cc73312d13�body���模型偏差高表现为欠拟合（假设太简单），方差高表现为过拟合（对训练噪声敏感）；总误差是二者之和加噪声，好的模型要在复杂度上取得平衡。٪High bias means underfitting (too simple), high variance means overfitting (sensitive to noise); total error is their sum plus noise, so a good model balances complexity.�ans��src��bHastie、Tibshirani 与 Friedman,《The Elements of Statistical Learning》第2版, Springer, 2009�dT. Hastie, R. Tibshirani, J. Friedman, The Elements of Statistical Learning, 2nd ed., Springer, 2009��id�adca5f7bf481�body�ـ消费级无人机多靠人操控或预设航线，军用有一定自主能力，但目标识别仍受AI局限与伦理约束。َConsumer drones are mostly human-controlled or pre-planned; military ones have some autonomy, but targeting is still limited by AI and ethics.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�cf33f405ef24�body��w深伪和AI编辑让照片、视频都能被伪造，眼见不再为实，所以任何惊人内容都要交叉验证。�yDeepfakes and AI editing can fake photos and video, so seeing is no longer believing—stunning claims need verification.�ans��src��`Coalition for Content Provenance and Authenticity《C2PA Technical Specification, Version 2.1》�^Coalition for Content Provenance and Authenticity, "C2PA Technical Specification, Version 2.1"��id�dcf6868f7ff6�body���BGP（边界网关协议）是自治系统之间的路由协议，通过路径向量交换可达性信息，决定跨运营商的流量走向；配置错误或劫持会导致大规模路由异常。ٷBGP is the inter-AS routing protocol; it exchanges reachability via path vectors to decide cross-ISP traffic paths, so misconfiguration or hijacks cause large-scale routing incidents.�ans��src��RFC 4271�RFC 4271��id�f7e7fcf2d96b�body���二分查找每一步都取中间元素与目标比较，据此砍掉一半区间；这个『砍半』的推理前提是剩下的区间里目标要么在左要么在右，只有有序才能保证。若无序，丢掉的那一半里可能正藏着答案。��Each step of binary search compares the middle element and discards half the range; that halving only works if the discarded half provably cannot contain the target, which requires order. On unsorted data the discarded half might hold the answer.�ans��src�هKnuth《计算机程序设计艺术 第3卷：排序与查找》(The Art of Computer Programming, Vol 3)；Cormen 等《算法导论》�tKnuth, 'The Art of Computer Programming, Vol 3' (Sorting and Searching); Cormen et al., 'Introduction to Algorithms'��id�0b1d112804c7�body�ي机器学习让计算机从大量数据中发现规律，而不是由人把每条规则都写死，学会后就能对新数据做预测。مMachine learning lets computers find patterns from lots of data instead of being given every rule, then make predictions on new data.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�0c5b4a764a49�body���手机内存有限，又不像桌面系统那样大量依赖交换分区，所以内存吃紧时系统必须主动回收。Android 的低内存守护进程按重要性给进程排序：前台 App 最后被杀，其次是仍可见的、承载服务的，最先被回收的是纯缓存的空进程，所以你切走后不再可见的 App 最容易被清掉。这也是应用必须在 onPause/onStop 里保存状态并支持恢复的原因，否则用户切回来会发现进度丢失。�Phones have limited RAM and, unlike desktops, lean very little on swap, so the system must reclaim memory itself when it gets tight. Android's low-memory killer daemon ranks processes by importance — foreground apps last, then visible ones, then those hosting services, and cached empty processes first — so the app you just switched away from is the earliest candidate. That is why apps are expected to persist state in onPause/onStop and restore it later; otherwise the user comes back to find their progress gone.�ans��src��]Android 官方开发者文档《Processes and app lifecycle》与《The activity lifecycle》�\Android Developers documentation, "Processes and app lifecycle" and "The activity lifecycle"��id�12ae0d69dc2a�body��电脑的运算由电子线路以接近光速的速度完成，每秒可执行数十亿次操作。它不知疲倦、不犯错（在给定指令下），而且能并行处理很多任务。所以像大数乘法这样的重复计算，电脑远胜过人脑。�4A computer's operations are done by electronic circuits at near-light speed, performing billions of actions per second. It never tires, makes no mistakes under given instructions, and can process many tasks in parallel. So for repetitive calculations like large multiplications, computers far surpass humans.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�21eadac8f1e6�body��{开机后，电脑先跑一段小检查程序看看零件好不好。确认没问题，再把操作系统请出来站岗。٘On startup the computer runs a small check to see if parts are well, then brings up the operating system to take charge. Only after that can you use it.�ans��src��_UEFI Forum,《Unified Extensible Firmware Interface (UEFI) Specification》(uefi.org 现行版)�bUEFI Forum, Unified Extensible Firmware Interface (UEFI) Specification (uefi.org, current edition)��id�264479693dfe�body��l开源软件把做法公开，谁都能看、能改、能分享。大家一起修，程序就越变越好。نOpen-source software publishes its recipe so anyone can see, change, and share it. Everyone helps fix it, and the program gets better.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�2891896c7cd5�body��{HTTPS 给路上消息加了一层隐形信封，只有对方能拆。小锁亮着，说明你的话不会被路人偷看。ْHTTPS wraps messages in an invisible envelope that only the other side can open. When the lock shows, your words can't be peeked at by passers-by.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�334e2b76f8d8�body�ل内存像你写作业的桌面，关机就清空；硬盘像书包，关了机东西还在。桌面越大，同时做的事越多。٠Memory is like your desk where you work and clears when off; storage is like a backpack that keeps things even when off. A bigger desk lets you do more at once.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�39b1e59899b5�body���手机传感器很小，单张长曝光会因手抖而模糊，所以夜景模式改为连拍十几张较短曝光的照片，再逐张对齐叠加。多帧平均能把随机噪声降低约帧数的平方根倍，等效于一次长曝光却避开了运动模糊，举着不动是为了让对齐算法有稳定的参考。随后的色调映射会大幅提亮暗部并压缩高光，因此成片比肉眼观感更亮、细节更多，而拍摄期间移动的人容易出现重影。�FA phone sensor is tiny, and a single long exposure would blur from hand shake, so night mode captures a burst of a dozen or more short frames and aligns and merges them. Averaging N frames cuts random noise by roughly the square root of N, giving the light-gathering of a long exposure without motion blur, and holding still gives the alignment stage something stable to work with. Tone mapping then lifts the shadows and compresses highlights, which is why the result looks brighter and more detailed than the scene did, and why anyone who moved during the burst comes out ghosted.�ans��src�ٔHasinoff 等《Burst Photography for High Dynamic Range and Low-Light Imaging on Mobile Cameras》(ACM Transactions on Graphics, SIGGRAPH Asia 2016)ٖHasinoff et al., "Burst Photography for High Dynamic Range and Low-Light Imaging on Mobile Cameras," ACM Transactions on Graphics (SIGGRAPH Asia 2016)��id�3a94eda3b56f�body���简单的密码（如 123456）很容易被自动程序试出来，就像用小钥匙开大门。使用长且包含字母、数字、符号的组合能大幅提高破解难度。再加上双因素认证就更安全了。��Simple passwords like 123456 are easily guessed by automated programs, like using a tiny key on a big door. Long combinations of letters, digits, and symbols greatly raise the difficulty of cracking. Adding two-factor authentication makes it even safer.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�49ce2b09bf65�body��{钓鱼是坏人假装成熟人或银行骗你点链接给秘密。真机构不会这样要密码，看到就先问大人。٫Phishing is when crooks pretend to be someone you know or a bank to trick you into giving secrets. Real groups never ask for passwords this way; when seen, ask a grown-up.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�53f65ebad51d�body���睡眠对应 ACPI 的 S3 状态：CPU 停止、硬盘停转，但内存持续供电以保存现场，因此恢复只要一两秒，代价是一旦断电内容就丢失。休眠对应 S4 状态：系统把整个内存内容写进硬盘上的休眠文件后完全断电，恢复时再读回来，因此几乎不耗电但唤醒较慢，还需要与内存等量的磁盘空间。Windows 的快速启动是混合方案，只把内核会话写盘，速度和耗电都介于两者之间。�Sleep is ACPI state S3: the CPU halts and disks spin down, but RAM keeps drawing power to hold your session, so resume takes a second or two and everything is lost if power is cut. Hibernation is S4: the full memory image is written to a file on disk and the machine powers off completely, so it draws essentially nothing but wakes more slowly and needs disk space equal to installed RAM. Windows fast startup is a hybrid that hibernates only the kernel session, landing between the two in both speed and power draw.�ans��src��fUEFI Forum《Advanced Configuration and Power Interface (ACPI) Specification, Version 6.5》第 16 章�bUEFI Forum, "Advanced Configuration and Power Interface (ACPI) Specification, Version 6.5," ch. 16��id�60ded0150e87�body�٨最早的大型计算机像几间房那么大，满是发光的电子管和电线，要用整间屋子放。它们算得比人快，但干一件事要很多人伺候。ّThe first big computers filled rooms with glowing tubes and wires. They computed faster than people but needed a crowd of operators for one task.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�6c0b50efd394�body��{长消息会被切成很多小包裹，每包写上收件地址分头走。到了终点，电脑再把它们拼回原样。٢A long message is cut into many small packets, each labeled with the destination and sent by different paths. At the end the computer stitches them back together.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�75ad65c12d98�body�ف社交媒体是大家共用的留言板，你发一条就存在大服务器上。朋友刷一刷，就能看到你的新鲜事。�zSocial media is a shared bulletin board where your post is kept on big servers. When friends scroll, they see your update.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�78c8cc7aa58c�body�ي电脑用一本代码表，把每个字母换成专属数字，比如 A 是 65。这样文字就能像数数一样被电脑搬来搬去。ٚThe computer uses a code table that swaps each letter for its own number, like A is 65. That lets text be moved around by the computer just like counting.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�7f90275e3847�body�ٍ处理器是电脑里最爱动脑的小方块，每秒做几十亿次微小计算。它把每个任务拆开，排好队一个一个解决。ٖThe processor is the busy little square that does billions of tiny calculations each second. It splits every task and solves them one by one in order.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�810565085603�body��{两步验证在输入密码后还要第二次证明身份，比如短信验证码，即使密码泄露别人也难登录。ىTwo-step verification asks for a second proof of identity after the password, like a text code, so a leaked password alone is not enough.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�877eac4d8dbc�body���可以，但不是靠读书，而是从大量数据中总结规律。例如给它看成千上万张猫的照片，它就能学会认出猫。这种「从例子中学习」的方法叫机器学习，是人工智能的重要部分。�Yes, but not by reading books; they find patterns from large amounts of data. For example, after seeing thousands of cat photos, a model can learn to recognize cats. This learning-from-examples method is called machine learning and is an important part of AI.�ans��src��8Mitchell, T. M. (1997). 《机器学习》. McGraw-Hill.�6Mitchell, T. M. (1997). Machine Learning. McGraw-Hill.��id�8979db299fec�body��,这个惯例来自贝尔实验室：Brian Kernighan 在 1972 年为 B 语言写的教程里首次用它做例子，1978 年 Kernighan 与 Ritchie 的《The C Programming Language》把它放在全书第一页，随 C 语言传遍全世界。它之所以合适，是因为它是最小的端到端验证：这句话能打印出来，就说明编译器、链接器、运行环境和输出通道全都配好了；万一失败，可能的原因也少得可以逐一排查。今天几乎所有语言的入门文档仍沿用它，本质上是一次环境自检。�MThe convention began at Bell Labs: Brian Kernighan first used it in a 1972 tutorial for the language B, and the 1978 Kernighan and Ritchie book on C put it on the opening page, from which it spread worldwide along with the language. It works so well because it is the smallest possible end-to-end check: if the line appears, the compiler, linker, runtime and output path are all correctly configured, and if it fails the set of possible causes is small enough to check one by one. Nearly every language's getting-started guide still opens with it, essentially as an environment smoke test.�ans��src�ٙKernighan 与 Ritchie《The C Programming Language》(1978) 第 1 章；Kernighan《A Tutorial Introduction to the Language B》(Bell Laboratories, 1972)ّKernighan & Ritchie, "The C Programming Language" (1978), ch. 1; Kernighan, "A Tutorial Introduction to the Language B," Bell Laboratories (1972)��id�c8fa5a8ad213�body���字符串是由字符组成的序列，用来表示文字。计算机内部用数字编码（如 UTF-8）把每个字符变成字节来保存。不同的编码决定了同一个字符占用多少字节。��A string is a sequence of characters used to represent text. Internally, computers use numeric encodings such as UTF-8 to turn each character into bytes for storage. The encoding determines how many bytes a character occupies.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�caca815c1ee4�body�ى文件是电脑里一段存起来的信息，比如一张画或一首歌；电脑用文件夹把文件分门别类地放进"柜子"里。�A file is a saved piece of information like a picture or song; computers use folders to sort files into categorized 'cabinets'.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�cd0f396904c7�body��mGPU 是专门画画的快手脚，能同时给成千上万颗小点涂色。游戏和动画靠它才顺滑。�~The GPU is a fast painter that colors thousands of tiny dots at the same time. Games and animations stay smooth because of it.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�cs_25_014�body��C导航App把数百万部开启定位的手机变成流动传感器:匿名汇总各路段的车速,慢下来就是拥堵信号,再结合路况报告生成红色路段。你的数据经过匿名化处理,且可关闭贡献选项。这展示了众包的威力——每个人贡献一小部分,合成一幅实时全景地图。�FNavigation apps turn millions of location-enabled phones into moving sensors: anonymized speeds along roads reveal slowdowns, colored red on your map combined with reports. Data gets anonymized and you can opt out of contributing. Crowdsourcing power at work — everyone contributes a little to paint a live citywide picture.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�cs_25_015�body��i人眼的视觉暂留会让图像在消失后残留约十分之一秒,加上大脑天生爱把相似画面脑补成连续运动(似动现象),于是快速切换的静止画面被读成了流畅动作。翻页小人书就是原理演示。现代电影用24帧、游戏追求60帧以上,帧率越高动作越顺滑,但超过一定程度人眼就分辨不出了。�NVision lingers about a tenth of a second after images vanish; brains also love connecting similar frames into motion (phi phenomenon), so rapid stills read as fluid action — flipbooks demonstrate the principle. Films use twenty-four frames per second, games chase sixty-plus; higher framerates smooth further until eyes cannot tell.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�d7953fb4658c�body��q一个叫 DNS 的电话本把网址翻译成数字门牌号。电脑拿着号码，才找得到那台服务器。قA phone book called DNS translates the web address into a number address. With that number the computer can find the right server.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�dc69b1850c4d�body��{两步验证在密码之外再加一把临时小锁，比如手机验证码。就算钥匙被偷，坏人还是进不来。ٓTwo-step verification adds a temporary second lock beyond the password, like a phone code. Even if the key is stolen, the crook still can't get in.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�dd0ec0fe9a27�body���消息先被切成小「数据包」，沿着网络经过路由器一跳一跳地传向朋友的手机。每个包都写着对方的地址，到达后再重新拼成完整消息。就算中间某段线路断了，也能绕别的路过去。��The message is split into small packets that travel hop by hop through routers toward the friend's phone. Each packet carries the destination address and is reassembled into the full message on arrival. Even if one link breaks, it can take another route.�ans��src��fPostel, J.,《Internet Protocol》,互联网工程任务组 (IETF) RFC 791,1981 (DOI: 10.17487/rfc791)�HJ. Postel, 'Internet Protocol', IETF RFC 791, 1981, DOI: 10.17487/rfc791��id�01059140f5c4�body�ٓ验证码是用来确认“真的是你本人在操作”。网站给你手机发一串数字，只有你填对了，才让你登录或改密码。ٌA verification code confirms it's really you. The site sends digits to your phone; only by entering them can you log in or reset a password.�ans��src��NIST SP 800-63B�NIST SP 800-63B��id�02f98cc00697�body��l网址是网站的门牌号，像家里的地址一样。把它输进浏览器，就能找到那个网站。�~A web address is the house number of a website, just like your home address. Type it into the browser and you reach that site.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�0766a1ede34a�body��x注释是写给人的说明文字，电脑会忽略它，但能帮自己和别人以后看懂这段代码在做什么。�tComments are notes for humans that the computer ignores, helping you and others understand what the code does later.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�0d7a4729a7c4�body��o程序是一张写给电脑的菜谱，一步一步教它做菜。没有程序，电脑就不知道该干啥。لA program is a recipe written for the computer, teaching it step by step. Without a program, the computer would not know what to do.�ans��src��ILinda Liukas,《Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding》,Feiwel & Friends,2015�FLinda Liukas, Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding, Feiwel & Friends, 2015��id�1fb1b865e959�body��F勒索软件会加密你的文件再索要赎金，加密本身无法硬破解，付钱也常常拿不到可用的密钥，所以真正能救回数据的只有一份未被感染的副本。3-2-1 原则是：至少保留 3 份数据，存放在 2 种不同介质上，其中 1 份放在异地。关键在于至少有一份是离线或不可改写的，比如拔下来的移动硬盘或写一次读多次的对象存储，否则勒索软件会连着映射的网络盘和自动同步的云盘一起加密；另外要定期做恢复演练，没验证过能还原的备份不算备份。��Ransomware encrypts your files and then demands payment, the encryption itself cannot be broken by force, and paying often fails to yield a working key, so the only reliable rescue is a copy the malware never reached. The 3-2-1 rule says keep at least 3 copies of the data on 2 different kinds of media with 1 copy stored off-site. What matters most is that at least one copy be offline or immutable — an unplugged external drive, or write-once object storage — because otherwise ransomware encrypts the mapped network share and the auto-syncing cloud folder along with everything else, and restores must be rehearsed, since a backup you have never restored is not yet a backup.�ans��src��b美国网络安全和基础设施安全局（CISA）《#StopRansomware Guide》(2023 年修订版)�\U.S. Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency, "#StopRansomware Guide" (2023 update)��id�254452e06712�body�٫高对比度让文字与背景更分明，帮助弱视用户；深色模式在暗光下更省眼、更省电（尤其 OLED 屏），是普遍受欢迎的无障碍特性。ٰHigh contrast sharpens text from background for low-vision users; dark mode is easier on the eyes in dim light and saves power on OLED screens, a popular accessibility feature.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�269d1c5ec791�body�ي标注就是给人看的图片、文字等打上正确答案标签，比如圈出图片里的猫并写上猫，模型才能从中学习。كLabeling means tagging data with correct answers, e.g., drawing a box around a cat and writing cat, so the model can learn from it.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�2c7a99aec2e6�body���微服务把一个大软件拆成许多小而独立的小服务，各管一摊（如登录、支付、搜索），彼此用网络沟通。这样哪块要改或要扩容，只需动那一块，不像“巨无霸”程序那样牵一发动全身。��Microservices split a big app into small independent services (login, payment, search…) that talk over the network. You can change or scale just one piece without disturbing the whole, unlike a monolithic program.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�2d9a6306c2ef�body��\防火墙是一种根据预设规则监控和过滤进出网络流量的安全设备或软件，像一道门卫挡住未经授权的访问。它可以基于 IP、端口、协议等条件放行或阻断连接，是网络边界防护的第一道屏障。其使用由美国国家标准与技术研究院（NIST）在 SP 800-41 中给出权威指南。��A firewall is a security device or software that monitors and filters incoming and outgoing network traffic according to preset rules, acting like a gatekeeper that blocks unauthorized access. It permits or blocks connections based on criteria such as IP, port, and protocol, forming the first line of network perimeter defense. The NIST SP 800-41 provides authoritative guidance on firewall use.�ans��src��{NIST SP 800-41 Rev. 1《Guidelines on Firewalls and Firewall Policy》（2009）；IETF RFC 2979（防火墙行为要求）�}NIST SP 800-41 Rev. 1, 'Guidelines on Firewalls and Firewall Policy' (2009); IETF RFC 2979 (firewall behavioral requirements)��id�2f7dc5c545e1�body�ِ你打拼音后，输入法在候选字库里找出同音字，再用语言模型根据上下文挑出最可能的词，还能联想和纠错。ٗAfter you type pinyin, the method lists homophones and uses a language model to pick the most likely word from context, with prediction and correction.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�327896eb5acf�body���我们平时用 0 到 9 十个数字，叫十进制；计算机只用 0 和 1 两个数字，叫二进制。开关的「开」表示 1、「关」表示 0，所有信息都由无数个 0 和 1 组合而成。这就是计算机能处理一切的基础。�We normally use ten digits from 0 to 9, called decimal; computers use only two digits, 0 and 1, called binary. A switch on means 1 and off means 0, and all information is made of countless 0s and 1s. This is the foundation that lets computers process everything.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�3670fcee0675�body��做法很简单：把代码逐行讲给桌上的橡皮鸭，或者任何不会回话的东西听，要求把每一步打算做什么说清楚。人在心里默读代码时会自动跳过和补全细节，一旦被迫用自然语言说出来，隐含假设就必须变成明确的句子，你以为成立的前提和实际写下的逻辑之间的差距随之暴露。这个名字出自《The Pragmatic Programmer》里的一则轶事，而同事之间「刚讲一半就自己想通了」的现象正是同一个原理。�SThe method is literally to explain your code line by line to a rubber duck on your desk — or anything else that cannot answer — stating aloud what each step is supposed to accomplish. Reading code silently, the mind skims and auto-completes; forcing it into natural language turns hidden assumptions into explicit sentences, and the gap between what you believed the code does and what it actually does becomes visible. The name comes from an anecdote in the book "The Pragmatic Programmer", and it is the same mechanism behind solving a problem halfway through describing it to a colleague.�ans��src��[Andrew Hunt 与 David Thomas《The Pragmatic Programmer》(1999) 第 3 章 Debugging 一节�RAndrew Hunt & David Thomas, "The Pragmatic Programmer" (1999), ch. 3, on debugging��id�377cd217f9d3�body��o网上有时藏着不适合小孩的东西，大人能帮我们挡开。有疑问，马上叫爸爸妈妈看。�{The internet sometimes hides things not for kids, and grown-ups help block them. When in doubt, call mom or dad right away.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�3eff8c0a9e99�body���AI 本身没有想法，它只是从你给的数据里学规律。如果数据里混进了错误、偏见或不良内容，它就会原样学进去并表现出来，所以“学坏”的根源通常在训练数据，而非它自己使坏。��AI has no intentions; it just learns patterns from the data you give. If that data contains errors, bias or harmful content, the AI learns and repeats them—so the root of 'bad learning' is usually the data, not the AI misbehaving on its own.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�3fb4bfb403fc�body�ٟ端到端加密中，消息只在你的设备和对方设备上加解密，连提供服务的中间服务器也看不到内容，所以服务商无法偷看。ِIn E2EE, messages are encrypted only on your device and the recipient's, so even the service's servers can't read them; the provider can't peek.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�41bc35cde211�body�ٟHTTP（超文本传输协议）是浏览器与服务器之间传输网页数据的应用层协议，基于请求-响应模型，默认通过 80 端口通信。ٶHTTP (HyperText Transfer Protocol) is the application-layer protocol browsers and servers use to exchange web data; it follows a request-response model and typically runs on port 80.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�46729d43c7c0�body�ِ电脑看到很多例子后，会慢慢找出其中的规律，下次遇到新的就能猜对，这就像小朋友多看几次就学会认猫。ٕAfter seeing many examples, a computer finds the pattern and can guess right on new ones—like a child learning to recognize cats after a few tries.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�491b32e3ff75�body���长时间运行的程序会积累泄漏的内存、失效的缓存、没释放的锁和互相矛盾的内部状态，这些错误彼此纠缠，很难在不停机的情况下修好。重启把这一切丢弃，让系统回到经过充分测试的初始状态，所有资源重新分配，于是症状消失。软件工程里有意利用这一点的设计思路叫「仅崩溃软件」：把组件做成随时可安全重启、重要状态存在可恢复的存储里，用重启代替复杂的错误处理。�_A process running for a long time accumulates leaked memory, stale caches, unreleased locks and inconsistent internal state, and those faults interact in ways that are very hard to repair while it keeps running. A restart discards all of it and returns the system to the well-tested state it was designed to begin from, with every resource freshly allocated, so the symptom disappears. Researchers turned this into a design principle called crash-only software: make components safe to restart at any moment, keep important state in recoverable storage, and use restart in place of intricate error handling.�ans��src��>Candea 与 Fox《Crash-Only Software》(USENIX HotOS IX, 2003)�;Candea & Fox, "Crash-Only Software," USENIX HotOS IX (2003)��id�4a67994ac377�body���Cookie 是网站存在你浏览器里的一小段信息。因为网页每次访问都是“不认识你”的，Cookie 帮网站记住你是谁、登录状态或购物车，下次访问就能接着上次的体验。��A cookie is a small piece of info a site stores in your browser. Since each web visit is 'anonymous', cookies let the site remember who you are, your login or cart, so the next visit continues where you left off.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�4a7652215177�body�هWi-Fi 用看不见的无线电波在电脑和无线路由器之间传送信息，路由器再连到更大的网络把信息送出去。كWi-Fi uses invisible radio waves to send information between your computer and a router, which then connects to the bigger network.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�4e674c92f209�body��~电脑把颜色一点一点涂在小灯上，拼成整幅画。程序员用代码告诉它哪里该涂红、哪里该涂蓝。قThe computer dabs color onto tiny lights to build a whole picture. Programmers use code to say where red goes and where blue goes.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�4f19009193ba�body�٬更新会带来新功能、修掉出错的 bug、补上安全漏洞。就像给房子补漏补缺。更新前看一眼改了什么，重要的安全更新最好及时装。ْUpdates add features, fix bugs and patch security holes—like repairing a house. Check what changed; install important security updates promptly.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�57f8395c5131�body��c机器人不会自己想，它照着写好的程序一步步做。程序说往前，它就往前。ـA robot does not think on its own; it follows a written program step by step. When the program says go forward, it goes forward.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�58d5a104a796�body���通常被认为最早的大型电子计算机是 1940 年代的 ENIAC，它用约一万八千个电子管运算，占地一房间，原本用于炮兵弹道计算。它标志着人类进入电子计算时代。��Often cited as the first large electronic computer, ENIAC (1940s) used about 18,000 vacuum tubes, filled a room, and was built for artillery ballistic calculations—marking the start of the electronic computing era.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�5d9f995a4c43�body���SSR 在服务器生成完整 HTML 再发给浏览器，首屏快且利于 SEO；CSR 由浏览器用 JS 拉取数据并渲染，交互更流畅但首屏慢、对搜索引擎不友好，常结合使用。��SSR sends server-generated HTML for fast first paint and good SEO; CSR lets the browser fetch data and render via JS for smoother interaction but slower first paint and weaker SEO—often combined.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6123fca7ebf1�body��l屏幕下藏着会数手指的小网，你一碰它就报告位置。电脑马上在那一处打开东西。يUnder the screen hides a little net that counts your fingers; when you tap, it reports the spot. The computer opens something right there.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�61d5a52aa64d�body���没错。每台联网设备都有一个 IP 地址，就像每家每户的门牌号，数据包靠着它才能准确找到目的地、再原路把回信送回来。没有地址，信息就会迷路。ٻExactly. Every networked device has an IP address like a house number; data packets use it to reach the right destination and send replies back. Without an address, information gets lost.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�63e4f1fff92c�body��{摄像头把你的脸拍成小包裹，通过互联网飞到对方那里。对方也发回来，于是你们就见面啦。ْThe camera packs your face into little parcels and sends them over the internet to the other person. They send back too, so you meet face to face.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�64da3bf3a4dd�body��r路由器是家里网络的小邮差，把消息分给每部手机和电脑。没有它，大家就抢不着网。وA router is the little postman of your home network, handing messages to every phone and computer. Without it, nobody gets the internet.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�67ca0009a696�body���它把你说的话或打的字，交给会多种语言的电脑模型去“猜”对应的另一种语言怎么说，再把结果显示或念出来。现在大多靠人工智能学习过海量双语例子。٪It feeds your words to a multilingual model that guesses the equivalent in another language, then shows or speaks it. Today it learns from huge bilingual examples via AI.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�68d3b120051c�body��o文件是你的画或作文，文件夹是把它们收在一起的盒子。整理好，找起来就不费劲。�tA file is your drawing or story, and a folder is a box that keeps them together. When tidy, things are easy to find.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�68e8e497e5f7�body��数组下标从 0 开始时，元素地址正好等于起始地址加上下标乘元素大小，不用每次减一，早期语言这样设计既省一次运算也贴近硬件寻址方式。更重要的是它让区间表示变漂亮：用含头不含尾的 [0, n) 表示 n 个元素，长度恰好等于 n，两个相邻区间 [0,k) 与 [k,n) 首尾正好衔接、既不重叠也不留缝，切片和循环边界都不容易写错。Dijkstra 在 1982 年一篇短文里正是用这个论证说明从零开始最自然。�9With zero-based indexing an element's address is exactly the base address plus index times element size, with no subtraction, which saved an operation and matched hardware addressing in early languages. The deeper reason is that it makes ranges elegant: writing n elements as the half-open interval [0, n) makes the length exactly n, and two adjacent ranges [0, k) and [k, n) meet with neither overlap nor gap, so slices and loop bounds are far harder to get wrong. Dijkstra made precisely this argument in a short 1982 note titled "Why numbering should start at zero".�ans��src��PEdsger W. Dijkstra《Why numbering should start at zero》(手稿 EWD 831, 1982)�SEdsger W. Dijkstra, "Why numbering should start at zero" (manuscript EWD 831, 1982)��id�76966f86c672�body�ٳ编程语言是人和电脑之间的“共同语言”，像 Python、Scratch。它比日常话更死板、更讲规矩，电脑才能准确照做。不同语言适合不同活。ٻA programming language is a shared language between people and computers, like Python or Scratch. Stricter than speech so the computer follows exactly; different ones suit different jobs.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�7bd6b5b14adc�body�٠频率表示每秒时钟脉冲次数，类似节拍。频率高通常更快，但还要看每周期能做多少事（IPC）和散热，所以不能只看 GHz。٩Frequency is clock pulses per second, like a metronome. Higher is usually faster, but it also depends on work per cycle (IPC) and cooling, so GHz alone isn't everything.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�88e9f2ad9572�body��u触摸屏能感知你手指碰到的位置，把碰触变成电脑能懂的指令，所以不用鼠标也能操作。نA touchscreen senses where your finger touches and turns it into commands the computer understands, so you can use it without a mouse.�ans��src��Barrett, Omote,《Projected‐Capacitive Touch Technology》,Information Display,2010 (DOI: 10.1002/j.2637-496x.2010.tb00229.x)�}Barrett, Omote, 'Projected‐Capacitive Touch Technology', Information Display, 2010, DOI: 10.1002/j.2637-496x.2010.tb00229.x��id�8eb2253f82e2�body���因为硬件最易区分两种状态：电压高或低、磁极正或反、光通或断。用“开/关”两种状态来表示 0 和 1 最简单可靠，再把很多位组合起来，就能表示任意数字、文字和图像。��Hardware most easily tells two states apart: high/low voltage, north/south magnetism, on/off light. Representing 0 and 1 as 'off/on' is simplest and most reliable; stacking many bits encodes any number, text or image.�ans��src��~Charles Petzold & David Sullivan,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,No Starch Press,2022�uC. Petzold & D. Sullivan, Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software, 2nd ed., No Starch Press, 2022��id�8f476f0af366�body��u云存储是把照片存在别处的大电脑里，不是真的天上云。这样换手机也能拿到自己的画。�|Cloud storage keeps your photos on big computers far away, not in the sky. So you can get your pictures even on a new phone.�ans��src��_AUBINEAU, CLEMENT, MAURY,《Cloud Storage》,Industrie du futur,2012 (DOI: 10.51257/a-v1-h6010)�]AUBINEAU, CLEMENT, MAURY, 'Cloud Storage', Industrie du futur, 2012, DOI: 10.51257/a-v1-h6010��id�9af25420a850�body��p卡住常因某程序占用过多内存或 CPU，关掉它释放资源，系统就能继续响应其他任务。�A freeze often means one program hogs memory or CPU; closing it frees resources so the system can respond to other tasks again.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�9c3bb1c939a5�body�ٌ电路用高、低电压表示0和1最简单可靠，二进制又和逻辑门天然契合，用十进制电路会更复杂也容易出错。٘Circuits represent 0 and 1 with low and high voltage most simply; binary also fits logic gates, while decimal circuits would be complex and error-prone.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�9f4bff76e1a3�body�ف电脑用内存临时记住正在做的事，用硬盘像抽屉一样长期保存文件，断电后内存会忘，硬盘不会。٫A computer uses memory to remember what it is doing right now and a hard drive like a drawer to keep files long-term; memory forgets when power is off, the drive does not.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�a1b2ac28d9e7�body�ٍ重复性、规则明确的任务如客服、翻译、制图更容易被辅助或替代，而需要创造力和共情的工作相对更稳。ّRepetitive, rule-based tasks like support, translation, and drawing are easier to assist or replace, while creative and empathetic work is safer.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�a24c2dd288ec�body�٨优点是解放双手、对不识字或视障友好；局限是嘈杂环境识别差、有隐私顾虑、公开场合不便说话，且复杂操作不如点按精确。٥Pros: hands-free and friendly to non-readers or the blind. Limits: poor in noise, privacy worries, awkward in public, and imprecise for complex tasks versus tapping.�ans��src��_D. Jurafsky 与 J. H. Martin,《Speech and Language Processing》,第2版,Prentice Hall,2009年�^D. Jurafsky and J. H. Martin, Speech and Language Processing, 2nd edition, Prentice Hall, 2009��id�a2c4dce763c1�body�ٔ可能是网络断连、服务器太忙、域名解析失败或浏览器缓存出错；刷新、检查 Wi-Fi 或换个时间再试通常能解决。ّIt could be a dropped connection, a busy server, failed name resolution or a bad cache; refreshing, checking Wi-Fi or trying later usually helps.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�a4d04c0681bb�body���电脑用二进制小数存储数字，而 0.1 和 0.2 在二进制里是无限循环的，只能近似保存，舍入误差让相加结果变成 0.30000000000000004 这样的数。这是浮点数表示的固有局限，不是 bug。��Computers store decimals in binary, where 0.1 and 0.2 are repeating fractions that get rounded, so the sum comes out as 0.30000000000000004. It's an inherent limit of floating-point, not a bug.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�aac32bd46214�body�٫分辨率是照片由多少小点（像素）组成。点越多，放大后越清楚；点少，放大就糊。手机常说的 1200 万像素就是约 1200 万个小点。ْResolution is how many dots (pixels) a photo has. More dots stay clear when zoomed; fewer get blurry. '12 megapixels' means about 12 million dots.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�ab357919e646�body��o浏览器是帮你打开网站的小窗户，像看书用的放大镜。点一下，网页就在窗里展开。�|A browser is a little window that opens websites, like a magnifier for reading. Tap once and the page unfolds in the window.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�bb8d218446ce�body��r退出账号像锁上自己的小抽屉，别人就翻不到你的东西。在公共电脑上更要把门锁好。�~Logging off is like locking your little drawer so others can't peek at your stuff. On a public computer, always lock the door.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�be521e470c7b�body�ٓ蓝牙是用很短距离的无线电把两个设备连起来，比如手机连耳机、手表连手机。它很省电，但只能在几米内用。٘Bluetooth links two devices over a very short radio range—like phone to earbuds, or watch to phone. It saves power but only works within a few meters.�ans��src��~Charles Petzold & David Sullivan,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,No Starch Press,2022�uC. Petzold & D. Sullivan, Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software, 2nd ed., No Starch Press, 2022��id�bff7166674d7�body�ٜBug 是程序里让结果出错的缺陷或小错误，可能来自写错逻辑、漏掉情况或数据异常；找出并修复它叫做调试（debug）。ٝA bug is a defect or small error that makes a program behave wrongly—from wrong logic, missed cases or bad data; finding and fixing it is called debugging.�ans��src��[Andrew Hunt 与 David Thomas《The Pragmatic Programmer》(1999) 第 3 章 Debugging 一节�RAndrew Hunt & David Thomas, "The Pragmatic Programmer" (1999), ch. 3, on debugging��id�c801f7967ae3�body�ٖ如果密码曾泄露而你不知道，定期更换能缩短攻击者可用的窗口；更重要的是用长且独特的密码并开启两步验证。ّIf a password leaked unnoticed, rotating it shrinks the attacker's window; even better is using long unique passwords plus two-step verification.�ans��src��NIST SP 800-63B�NIST SP 800-63B��id�c8239a97e391�body�ه字幕帮助听障人士理解视频，也方便在嘈杂或静音环境观看。实时字幕还能辅助语言学习和会议纪要。ّCaptions help deaf and hard-of-hearing viewers and anyone in noisy or muted settings; live captions also aid language learning and meeting notes.�ans��src���Kushalnagar, Behm, Stanislow, Gupta，《Enhancing caption accessibility through simultaneous multimodal information》,Proceedings of the 16th international ACM SIGACCESS conferen,2014 (DOI: 10.1145/2661334.2661381)��Kushalnagar, Behm, Stanislow, Gupta, 'Enhancing caption accessibility through simultaneous multimodal information', Proceedings of the 16th international ACM SIGACCESS conferen, 2014, DOI: 10.1145/2661334.2661381��id�cdecc5856a0d�body��l密码是只属于你的大门钥匙，给别人就能进你的小世界。想分享，先问爸爸妈妈。مA password is your own key to the front door; giving it away lets others into your little world. Want to share? Ask mom or dad first.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�cs_25_006�body��它用最朴素的办法:把数字排成一排,从第一个开始记住目前最大,逐个往后比较,遇到更大的就换记忆。一百个数字只要比九十九次,一眨眼完成。人一次能看一排,电脑一次只看一个,但每秒能做几十亿次,快就快在这里。�It uses the simplest plan: line numbers up, remember current champion, compare one by one, swap when a bigger appears. A hundred numbers need ninety-nine comparisons — done in a blink. People see rows at once while computers see one number at a time but compare billions per second.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�cs_25_007�body���程序是写给电脑的菜谱,一步一步写得清清楚楚。电脑没有常识,只会照字面执行:你说把文件都删掉,它连重要的也不问就删。所以写程序的人要把每个细节想到,电脑出错多半是菜谱没写清。�A program is a recipe for computers, every step spelled out exactly. Computers have no common sense and follow words literally: say delete everything and it deletes the important files too without asking. Most mistakes are recipes missing details, not stubborn machines.�ans��src��ILinda Liukas,《Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding》,Feiwel & Friends,2015�FLinda Liukas, Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding, Feiwel & Friends, 2015��id�cs_25_008�body��镜头把光变成电信号,芯片把它翻译成几百万个小色点(像素),按顺序存进手机的存储芯片里——那是一小块能记住电信号的神奇材料。存储芯片断电也不忘事,所以相册里的照片一直都在,还能复制发给奶奶。�The lens turns light into electric signals; a chip translates them into millions of tiny colored dots called pixels, stored in a memory chip — a magic material that remembers even when powered off. That is why photos stay in albums and can be copied to Grandma.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�d5e0abe58f53�body���CPU 遇到“如果……就……”这种判断时，会提前猜走哪条路并先算起来。猜对就省时间；猜错就得把已算的部分丢掉重来，这种“清空流水线”会让程序短暂变慢。��When hitting an 'if…then…' choice, the CPU guesses the path and computes ahead. A correct guess saves time; a wrong one discards the work and restarts, briefly slowing things down—a 'pipeline flush'.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�dea9efedf041�body��n电脑的"大脑"很快地在不同任务间来回切换，快到看起来像同时在做，这叫多任务。�uThe computer's brain switches between tasks so quickly it looks like doing them at once; this is called multitasking.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�e0e8e46a02d6�body��u点链接就像请浏览器去另一个网页做客，浏览器会找到那个网页并把内容搬回来给你看。�xClicking a link asks the browser to visit another page; the browser finds it and brings the content back for you to see.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�e1f3397c6849�body�ٟ适老化设计考虑老年人视力下降、手抖、不熟悉科技等特点，用大字号、大按钮、清晰语音和简单流程，降低使用门槛。ٟAge-friendly design accounts for weaker vision, shaky hands, and tech unfamiliarity, large text, big buttons, clear speech, and simple flows lower the barrier.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ed031fd9a890�body���缓存是 CPU 旁边极近、极快但很贵的小存储器，用来放最近用过的数据，下次直接取就不用去慢吞吞的内存。因为它用昂贵的 SRAM 制造，所以容量做不大，只能在“快”和“大”之间取舍。��A cache is a tiny, super-fast, expensive memory next to the CPU holding recently used data, so the next fetch skips slow RAM. Built from pricey SRAM, it stays small—a trade-off between speed and size.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�f2d948cd4d76�body��r我们把想做的事写成一行行小命令，电脑从上往下照做。做错一步，结果就会不一样。ـWe write what we want as lines of tiny commands, and the computer follows them top to bottom. One wrong step changes the result.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�f43f39c2e7ab�body���DNA 是一长串由 A、T、C、G 四个字母组成的密码。实验仪器先把它们读成文字，电脑再用比对、统计等算法找出哪段像基因、和哪种生物相似，相当于用搜索引擎去翻一本极其庞大的生命字典。��DNA is a long code of four letters A, T, C, G. Machines read it into text, and computers use alignment and statistics to spot which parts look like genes or match other organisms—like searching a vast book of life.�ans��src��:Nature (2020) 578:297-301，生物信息算法方法综述�JNature (2020) 578:297-301, review on bioinformatics algorithms and methods��id�1ce4fd25871a�body���它其实像一位飞快变魔术的厨师：把时间切成极短的小片，这片做饭、下片洗菜，快到看起来像在同时做。这叫“轮流切换”，让我们觉得电脑一心多用。��It's like a super-fast chef: it cuts time into tiny slices, cooking in one slice and washing in the next, so fast it looks simultaneous. This 'taking turns' makes the computer seem to multitask.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�1fe614ebae9d�body��l电脑把喜欢的画面藏进它的小仓库里，关掉也不丢。下次打开，它就又拿给你看。ٖThe computer hides your favorite pictures in its little storage, and they stay even when it is off. Next time you open it, it shows them to you again.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�23c3dfee7e0e�body�ٵCPU 是电脑的大脑，负责一条条地执行指令、做加减乘除等运算。你点的每个操作都要靠它快速处理，就像人脑思考并指挥身体行动一样。��The CPU is the computer's brain: it executes instructions one by one and performs arithmetic like addition and multiplication. Every action you trigger is processed by it, much like a mind that thinks and directs the body.�ans��src��6《操作系统概念》（Abraham Silberschatz 等）�/Operating System Concepts (Silberschatz et al.)��id�23eaae6e6807�body��~App 是手机里的小玩具或小工具，点一下就能画画、听歌或算数。每个 App 都会做一件特别的事。�tAn app is a tiny toy or tool inside the phone that you tap to draw, sing, or count. Each app does one special thing.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�240131615a73�body��c编程是教电脑做事情的方法，像给机器人写小纸条。你写一步，它做一步。قProgramming is teaching the computer to do things, like writing little notes for a robot. You write one step and it does one step.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�27d478ddde7d�body��r你写好的信坐上互联网的小火车，叮咚一声跑到朋友的邮箱里。它比纸信快好多好多。فYour finished letter hops on the internet's little train and dings into your friend's mailbox. It is much faster than paper mail.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�34fae6579d8b�body��u网站是电脑里的一本会发光的图画书，你点一下就能翻页看。每个网站都有自己的名字。�qA website is a glowing picture book inside the computer that you flip by tapping. Every website has its own name.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�353b80a59da6�body��]网上的人可能藏着真样子，我们不能随便信。见面更要先问爸爸妈妈。�xPeople online may hide their real face, so we should not trust them easily. Always ask mom or dad before meeting anyone.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�39603a5743c0�body��r屏幕像很多很多小灯排成队，电脑让小灯亮起来拼成画。亮灯的地方多，画就出来了。ٌThe screen is like many tiny lights lined up, and the computer lights them to make a picture. Where more lights shine, the picture shows up.�ans��src��6《计算机图形学原理及实践》（Foley 等）�9Computer Graphics: Principles and Practice (Foley et al.)��id�3b27ff6a9714�body���手机屏幕下面有一层看不见的细网格，一直在测量每个交叉点上能存住多少电。手指里有带盐的水，能导电，靠近时会把一点电引走，网格发现哪个点变了，就知道你点在哪里。厚手套是绝缘的，把手指挡得太远，网格察觉不到变化，所以没反应；触屏手套的指尖织进了导电的丝线，于是又能用了。��Under the glass there is an invisible grid that constantly measures how much electric charge each crossing point can hold. A fingertip contains salty water and conducts, so bringing it close pulls a little charge away, and the grid notices which point changed and reports where you touched. A thick glove is an insulator that keeps your finger too far away for the grid to sense any change, so nothing happens — touchscreen gloves work again because conductive thread is woven into their fingertips.�ans��src��Barrett, Omote,《Projected‐Capacitive Touch Technology》,Information Display,2010 (DOI: 10.1002/j.2637-496x.2010.tb00229.x)�}Barrett, Omote, 'Projected‐Capacitive Touch Technology', Information Display, 2010, DOI: 10.1002/j.2637-496x.2010.tb00229.x��id�3c9b48781ffe�body���数据结构是用来组织、存放数据的方式，比如用盒子装东西、用书架放书。选对结构能让程序存得省、找得快，就像分类整理好的衣柜比乱堆更容易找到衣服。��A data structure is a way of organizing and storing data, like boxes for things or shelves for books. Choosing the right one lets a program store economically and retrieve quickly—much like a tidy, sorted wardrobe beats a messy pile.�ans��src��!《数据结构与算法分析》�&Data Structures and Algorithm Analysis��id�41e9cba0fe09�body�ْU 盘是个小得能挂钥匙扣的随身存储器，插进电脑就能存照片、拷文件。它不像云盘要上网，拔下来就能带走。ٖA USB drive is a tiny pocket storage you plug into a computer to save or copy files. Unlike cloud, it needs no internet—unplug and take it anywhere.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�54f219e2f315�body�ٮAI 能陪你聊天、帮你翻译、认照片里的东西、推荐好看的动画片，还能提醒你天气。它像个聪明的小帮手，但也需要人来判断对错。ٳAI can chat with you, translate, recognize things in photos, suggest cartoons and remind you of the weather. It's a smart helper, but a person should still judge right from wrong.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�5d445a91d1b8�body���数据库的表像一张大表格，由许多行和列组成：每一列是一种信息（如姓名、年龄），每一行是一个具体对象（如一个人）。它把杂乱的数据整整齐齐地排好，方便查找。��A database table is like a big grid of rows and columns: each column is a kind of information (name, age) and each row is one concrete object (a person). It lines messy data up neatly so it is easy to find.�ans��src��9《数据库系统概念》（Abraham Silberschatz 等）�.Database System Concepts (Silberschatz et al.)��id�623a5313d0c4�body�ٖ姓名、学校、住址、电话、密码和家人的信息都不要随便说。就像不给陌生人开家门一样，网上也要保护好自己。ٔDon't share your name, school, address, phone, passwords or family info. Just as you wouldn't open your door to a stranger, protect yourself online.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6997627366fa�body��f机器人身体里藏着小马达，电脑一下令它就转。于是机器人的手和脚就动啦。�lA robot hides tiny motors inside, and the computer tells them to spin. Then the robot's hands and feet move.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�6b499645b618�body���开机时机器先运行主板上的固件，也就是 UEFI 或 BIOS，它要做一次开机自检，数一数有多少内存、看看接了哪些硬盘和键盘鼠标。查完以后固件才去硬盘里找操作系统，把它读进内存并交出控制权，操作系统接着启动一大堆驱动和后台服务。这些步骤必须一个接一个完成，所以要等；换成固态硬盘或打开快速启动能省掉一部分等待。��When you press power, the firmware on the motherboard — UEFI or BIOS — runs first and performs a self-test, counting how much memory is installed and checking which disks, keyboard and mouse are attached. Only then does it look for an operating system on the disk, load it into memory and hand over control, after which the system starts many drivers and background services. All of those steps must happen one after another, which is why you wait, and an SSD or fast startup removes part of it.�ans��src��aUEFI Forum《Unified Extensible Firmware Interface (UEFI) Specification, Version 2.10》第 2 章�]UEFI Forum, "Unified Extensible Firmware Interface (UEFI) Specification, Version 2.10," ch. 2��id�72534dceffc3�body��]名字和家是只有家人才知道的小秘密。告诉陌生人，坏蛋可能找上门。�rYour name and home are little secrets only family should know. Telling strangers might bring trouble to your door.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8b3b912334eb�body�ٖ手机靠里面的电池存电，屏幕、声音、上网都在花电。用得越久、越亮、联网越多，电就用得越快，最后就没了。٠The phone stores power in its battery, and the screen, sound and internet all spend it. The more you use it, the brighter it is, the faster the battery empties.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8c54ba5e3a6d�body�فWi-Fi 像看不见的小翅膀，把网上消息变成飞进屋里的风。电脑接住风，就能和你远方的朋友说话。٤Wi-Fi is like invisible little wings that turn internet messages into a breeze flying into your room. The computer catches the breeze and talks to far-away friends.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�95d69244c998�body���电脑本身不会用眼睛看，但装上摄像头并运行视觉程序后，它能认出照片里的小猫或红绿灯。这就像给它配了一双电子眼，帮它理解看到的图像。��A computer can't literally see with eyes, but with a camera and vision software it can recognize a cat or a traffic light in a photo. It's like giving it electronic eyes to understand what it sees.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�99e603003f71�body���排序是把一组杂乱的数据按从小到大（或从大到小）的顺序重新排列。比如把全班同学的身高从矮到高排好，方便之后快速查找和比较。计算机里排序是很多程序的基础步骤。��Sorting means rearranging a messy collection of data into order, from smallest to largest (or the reverse). For example, lining up students by height makes later searching and comparing easier. In computing, sorting is a fundamental step in many programs.�ans��src��,《算法导论》（Thomas H. Cormen 等）�*Introduction to Algorithms (Cormen et al.)��id�9a6cff3fcba4�body�٫可以这么理解：你的照片和文件被保存到互联网另一端的数据中心，并通过账号随时取回，数据通常还会自动备份多份以防丢失。٥Roughly yes: your photos and files are saved in a data center far away and retrieved anytime via your account, usually with automatic backups so they don't get lost.�ans��src�ًMell, Grance,《The NIST definition of cloud computing》,NIST 特别出版物 800-145, 美国商务部,2011 (DOI: 10.6028/nist.sp.800-145)ٙMell, Grance, 'The NIST definition of cloud computing', NIST Special Publication 800-145, U.S. Department of Commerce, 2011, DOI: 10.6028/nist.sp.800-145��id�a06899f8de7c�body�٨它看了成千上万张标好『这是猫』的照片，反复调整内部参数，直到能从新图片里找出猫的特征，就像小朋友看多了就认识了。��It looks at thousands of photos labeled 'this is a cat' and keeps adjusting its internal settings until it can spot cat features in new pictures—much like a child learning by seeing many examples.�ans��src��_LeCun, Y., Bengio, Y. 与 Hinton, G. E. (2015). 《深度学习》. Nature, 521(7553), 436-444.�YLeCun, Y., Bengio, Y., & Hinton, G. E. (2015). Deep learning. Nature, 521(7553), 436-444.��id�a556300d06a2�body��]奇怪的链接像不认识的门，打开可能跑出捣蛋鬼。点之前要先问大人。�wStrange links are like doors we don't know; opening them might let mischief out. Always ask a grown-up before clicking.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a641696a3cc6�body�٥AR 像给真实世界贴会动的小贴纸，比如手机相机里出现一只跳舞的小恐龙；VR 像戴上一副魔法眼镜，把你送到另一个世界里。ٔAR is like putting moving stickers on the real world, a dancing dinosaur in your phone camera. VR is magic glasses that send you into another world.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a7c820fcfa9e�body��{电脑是一台会听我们说话、帮我们画画和算数的聪明机器。它就像一位什么都会做的小助手。يA computer is a clever machine that listens to us and helps draw pictures and do math. It is like a little helper that can do many things.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�b366ab4ceb8d�body��l电脑很乖，只会照着写好的步骤一条一条做，先这样再那样，才能得出正确结果。�pA computer is obedient and only follows written steps one by one, doing this then that, to get the right result.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�b372e0b6e8b7�body�ٲ现在有些聪明的 AI 能根据要求写出简单代码，但大多还要人检查、修改。真正“完全自己发明程序”的机器人还没有，人还是总指挥。ٝSome smart AI can write simple code from a request, but a human still checks and fixes it. No robot fully invents programs alone yet—people stay in charge.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�b8e2671bae46�body�ٴ电脑屏幕大、能开很多窗口一起干活，还能接键盘鼠标；手机小、能随身带、用手指点。它们都能上网、看视频，只是样子和用法不同。ٮA computer has a big screen and runs many windows with a keyboard; a phone is small, pocketable and tapped by finger. Both surf the web and play video, just used differently.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�baae61de28a3�body�ٍ最早的电脑很大很大，要占满一整个房间，还要很多人帮忙开关。现在同样厉害的电脑能装进你的口袋里。يThe first computers were enormous, filling whole rooms with many people operating them. Today an equally powerful one fits in your pocket.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�bdeb36e38103�body��~先别急着转发，去官方机构或权威媒体看看有没有通报，很多“紧急通知”其实是旧谣言翻新。�zDon’t forward in a hurry; check official or authoritative sources, since many 'urgent' messages are recycled old rumors.�ans��src�ٶHaouari, Elsayed, Mansour,《Who can verify this? Finding authorities for rumor verification in Twitter》, Information Processing & Management, 2023 (DOI: 10.1016/j.ipm.2023.103366)ٲHaouari, Elsayed, Mansour, 'Who can verify this? Finding authorities for rumor verification in Twitter', Information Processing & Management, 2023, DOI: 10.1016/j.ipm.2023.103366��id�bf3e7cdb65b3�body���机器学习就像小朋友看很多例子来认字：给它看成千上万张苹果的照片，并告诉它这是苹果，它就慢慢学会认苹果。看得越多、答对越多，它就学得越好。��Machine learning is like a child learning to read from examples: show it thousands of apple photos labeled this is an apple, and it gradually learns to recognize apples. The more it sees and the more it gets right, the better it learns.�ans��src��!《机器学习》（周志华）�Machine Learning (Zhou Zhihua)��id�c29d227d6a04�body�ِbug 就是程序写错了，导致它做错事或卡住，比如游戏突然闪退。程序员要找出 bug 修好它，让程序乖乖听话。ِA bug is a mistake in the program that makes it misbehave or freeze, like a game crashing. Programmers find and fix bugs so the program behaves.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�cs_25_001�body���键盘下面有一排小开关。你按下A,开关就告诉电脑:A来啦!电脑用只有它懂的电信号飞快地查表,然后在屏幕上画出A。这一切只用眨眼的万分之一时间。ټLittle switches live under every key. Press A and the switch tells the computer: A is here! It checks its code super fast and draws an A on screen — all in one ten-thousandth of a blink.�ans��src��ILinda Liukas,《Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding》,Feiwel & Friends,2015�FLinda Liukas, Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding, Feiwel & Friends, 2015��id�cs_25_002�body�ٷ扫地机器人有小眼睛(传感器),一边跑一边给家里画地图,像你玩迷宫记住走过的路。碰到桌腿就说声抱歉绕开,电量低了还会自己回家充电呢!��A robot vacuum has little eyes — sensors — that draw a map as it goes, like remembering your way through a maze. It steers around table legs and drives home to charge when battery runs low.�ans��src��0《概率机器人》Thrun等，MIT Press，2005�=Probabilistic Robotics, Thrun, Burgard & Fox, MIT Press, 2005��id�cs_25_003�body�٫你按方向键,就是在给小人下命令:向左!向右!电脑每秒检查你的按键几十次,小人就听话地一步步走。其实是你当司令,它当士兵呀。ټEvery arrow key press is an order: left! right! The computer checks your buttons dozens of times each second and the character obeys step by step. You are the commander; it is the soldier.�ans��src��ILinda Liukas,《Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding》,Feiwel & Friends,2015�FLinda Liukas, Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding, Feiwel & Friends, 2015��id�cs_25_004�body�ٰ密码就像你家门的钥匙。可是钥匙会被复制呀——万一别人拿了钥匙冒充你,拿走你的画和小饼干怎么办?秘密只放在自己心里最安全。ٞA password is your house key. Keys can be copied — someone could pretend to be you and take your drawings and cookies. Secrets stay safest in your own head.�ans��src��ILinda Liukas,《Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding》,Feiwel & Friends,2015�FLinda Liukas, Hello Ruby: Adventures in Coding, Feiwel & Friends, 2015��id�d13e193075ad�body��r电子游戏是程序员用代码搭的小乐园，你在里面跑跳闯关。电脑帮你把画面变得会动。كA video game is a little playground that programmers build with code, where you run and jump. The computer makes the pictures move.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�d217545afe5a�body��~键盘像一排会说话的小牙齿，你按一下，它就告诉电脑一个字母。这样我们就能和电脑聊天啦。هThe keyboard is like a row of little talking keys; press one and it tells the computer a letter. That is how we chat with the computer.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�e517f1ca3074�body��{目前机器人都只是按程序响应、做统计匹配的工具，没有自我感知，也不会真的难过或开心。لToday’s robots are tools that follow programs and match patterns; they have no self-awareness and don’t truly feel sad or happy.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�eaa39433b4a5�body���陌生链接可能藏着坏程序，一点就会偷偷装进手机或电脑、偷看你的信息。就像陌生人递来的糖果不一定安全，不确定的链接最好先问大人或别去点。��Strange links may hide bad programs that sneak onto your phone or computer and peek at your information once clicked. Like candy from a stranger, an unknown link isn't safe—when unsure, ask an adult or just don't click.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�ed15bc725c6c�body��l屏幕发光是手机最耗电的部分之一，更亮就要发出更多光，自然要吃掉更多电量。�cScreen light is among the biggest power users; brighter means more light and more battery consumed.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�eedea9d61829�body��i互联网是把全世界电脑连起来的看不见的线。它让远方的朋友也能和你打招呼。�zThe internet is an invisible string that connects computers all over the world. It lets far-away friends say hello to you.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�f75e764b9ddb�body��l鼠标里有个会发光的小眼睛，它看出你手往哪边滑。电脑就让你的小箭头跟着跑。�yThe mouse has a tiny glowing eye that sees which way your hand slides. The computer makes your little arrow follow along.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�fa254d93a643�body���幂等指同一操作执行一次或多次结果相同；网络重试和重复消息很常见，接口设计成幂等可避免重复扣款、重复下单等错误，常用去重键或状态机实现。��Idempotency means repeating an operation yields the same result; since retries and duplicates are common in networks, idempotent APIs prevent double-charging or double-ordering, often via dedup keys or state machines.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�fa9af53e50ea�body�ِ程序借了内存却忘了还，就像借了小朋友的玩具一直不还，时间久了玩具越来越少，电脑也会变慢甚至卡住。٭A program borrows memory but forgets to give it back, like borrowing a friend's toy and never returning it; soon there are fewer toys and the computer slows down or freezes.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�fb94f76a5411�body�ٷ很像！目录告诉你“某主题在第几页”，索引告诉数据库“某条数据在哪个位置”，这样不用一页页翻就能直接跳过去找到，速度快很多。پVery much! A contents page tells you 'this topic is on page X'; an index tells the database 'this record is at position Y', so it jumps straight there instead of flipping through everything.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�0186d5910afb�body��上下文学习指大模型仅凭提示中给出的若干示例即可在新任务上表现，而不进行任何梯度更新。研究认为这是一种隐式的贝叶斯推断或算法模仿，模型在预训练阶段已习得在上下文中「遵循模式」的能力。�In-context learning means a large model performs a new task from a few examples given in the prompt, without any gradient updates. It is viewed as implicit Bayesian inference or algorithm imitation, a capability the model already acquired during pre-training.�ans��src��IBrown et al., Language Models are Few-Shot Learners (GPT-3), NeurIPS 2020�IBrown et al., Language Models are Few-Shot Learners (GPT-3), NeurIPS 2020��id�01a3fa938b84�body��它把节点和数据都映射到一个首尾相接的哈希环上，每个数据只交给环上顺时针最近的节点。新增或移除一个节点时，只有它相邻区间的数据需要迁移，而不是全部重新分配，从而把动荡降到最低。��It maps both nodes and data onto a circular hash ring, each item going to the nearest node clockwise. Adding or removing one node only moves the data in its neighboring arc, not everything, minimizing churn.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�01a7287f9b28�body�ي哈希把任意数据变成固定长度的摘要且通常不可逆，用于校验完整性；加密可逆，需密钥还原原始数据。٦A hash turns data into a fixed-length digest that is usually irreversible, used to verify integrity; encryption is reversible with a key to recover the original data.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�03facc1c8977�body��分段按程序的逻辑意义（代码段、数据段、栈段）划分不定长的内存块，更贴近程序结构但易产生外部碎片。分页则按固定大小切分，便于分配但和程序逻辑无关。现代系统多用分页，分段只保留少量保护用途。�bSegmentation divides memory into variable-length blocks by logical meaning (code, data, stack segments), matching program structure but causing external fragmentation. Paging splits memory into fixed-size blocks, easy to allocate but unrelated to program logic. Modern systems mostly use paging, keeping segmentation only for limited protection purposes.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�04f72f54eff2�body��alpha 通道是颜色之外额外记录的一个数值，表示像素的“不透明度”，范围通常 0（全透明）到 1（不透明）。它让图像可以半透明叠加，实现淡入淡出、阴影和图层混合等效果。没有它，图像只能整体不透明地覆盖。�The alpha channel is an extra value beyond color that records a pixel's opacity, typically from 0 (fully transparent) to 1 (fully opaque). It lets images blend semi-transparently, enabling fades, shadows, and layer compositing. Without it, an image can only cover opaquely as a whole.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�05b95506bc57�body��因为它的数据组织成“关系”——也就是二维表，行是记录、列是字段，表之间通过主键和外键建立联系。关系模型是 Codd 在1970年提出的数学化模型，以集合论为基础，让查询基于逻辑条件而非手写的遍历方式。�>Because data is organized as relations—two-dimensional tables where rows are records and columns are fields, linked by primary and foreign keys. The relational model is a mathematical framework introduced by Codd in 1970, built on set theory, so queries express logical conditions rather than manual traversal steps.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�070a10bf5c12�body��1朴素两两比较需要 O(n²) 时间。分治法把点按 x 坐标分成左右两半，递归求出两半内部的最小距离 d，再只检查"中线两侧 d 宽度条带"内的跨半候选点；利用按 y 排序后每个点最多只需与常数个点比较的性质，总复杂度降到 O(n log n)。�sNaive pairwise checking costs O(n²). A divide-and-conquer algorithm splits the points by x-coordinate, recursively finds the minimum distance d within each half, then checks only cross-half candidates inside a strip of width d around the midline; because each point compares against only a constant number of y-sorted neighbors, the total complexity drops to O(n log n).�ans��src��!《算法导论》(CLRS) 第33章�)Introduction to Algorithms (CLRS), ch. 33��id�0a81ec2978fa�body�ٖCI 是开发者一提交代码就自动构建和测试，尽早发现问题；CD 则把通过测试的代码自动部署上线，缩短发布周期。يCI automatically builds and tests on every commit to catch issues early; CD automatically deploys passing code, shortening release cycles.�ans��src�ٔFowler《Continuous Integration》（martinfowler.com，2006 修订版）；Beck《解析极限编程》1999；Humble & Farley《持续交付》2010ٛFowler, 'Continuous Integration' (martinfowler.com, 2006 revision); Beck, Extreme Programming Explained (1999); Humble & Farley, Continuous Delivery (2010)��id�0ab7fe7cbde9�body�٠HTTP/1.1 同域名要排队建多个连接，队头阻塞会拖慢页面。HTTP/2 在一条连接上并行传多个请求，减少等待、提升加载速度。٧HTTP/1.1 queued requests across several connections, and head-of-line blocking slowed pages. HTTP/2 sends many requests in parallel over one connection, cutting waits.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�0b0f574a5792�body���信号格只反映接收到的信号强度，不代表可用带宽。Wi-Fi 是共享介质，所有设备用 CSMA/CA 轮流抢同一个信道，邻居的路由器占用重叠信道会让大家互相退避；2.4 GHz 只有 1、6、11 三个互不重叠的 20 MHz 信道，公寓楼里极易拥塞。此外隐藏节点导致的碰撞、旧设备以低速率长时间占用空口，都会拉低整体吞吐，而真正的瓶颈也常在宽带线路或对端服务器上——这些都不体现在信号格里。�BThe bars report received signal strength, not available throughput. Wi-Fi is a shared medium in which every device takes turns under CSMA/CA, so neighbouring access points on overlapping channels force everyone to back off, and the 2.4 GHz band offers only three non-overlapping 20 MHz channels, numbers 1, 6 and 11, which saturates fast in an apartment block. Hidden-node collisions and legacy clients that hog airtime at low data rates drag the whole cell down as well, and often the real bottleneck is the broadband line or the remote server, none of which the bars can show.�ans��src��yIEEE 802.11-2020 标准（CSMA/CA 与 DCF 机制）；Tanenbaum 与 Wetherall《Computer Networks》(第 5 版) 第 4 章فIEEE 802.11-2020 (CSMA/CA and the distributed coordination function); Tanenbaum & Wetherall, "Computer Networks" (5th ed.), ch. 4��id�0bd4503000ad�body���面向对象把数据和操作数据的方法封装成“对象”，靠状态变化和对象间消息协作，代表有 Java、C++；函数式把计算看成函数对数据的变换，强调不可变数据和纯函数（同样输入必有同样输出），代表有 Haskell、Elixir，JavaScript 也支持。函数式在并发和测试上更省心，OOP 在建模现实实体上更直观。��Object-oriented programming bundles data with the methods that operate on it into objects, collaborating through state changes and messages—Java and C++ are examples. Functional programming treats computation as functions transforming data, stressing immutability and pure functions (same input, same output)—Haskell and Elixir, with JavaScript also supporting it. Functional code eases concurrency and testing; OOP models real-world entities intuitively.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0c3a56e1f15c�body���自注意力本身对词序不敏感，位置编码用于注入序列顺序信息。RoPE 把位置信息以旋转矩阵形式融入查询和键，使相对位置可通过内积自然表达，在长上下文和长度外推上表现更优。�Self-attention is order-agnostic, so positional encoding injects sequence order. RoPE encodes position as a rotation applied to queries and keys, so relative position is expressed naturally through the dot product, yielding better behavior on long contexts and length extrapolation.�ans��src��eSu et al., RoFormer: Enhanced Transformer with Rotary Position Embedding, ACL 2021 (arXiv:2104.09864)�eSu et al., RoFormer: Enhanced Transformer with Rotary Position Embedding, ACL 2021 (arXiv:2104.09864)��id�0e08614973e5�body���传统架构要把数据从内存搬到 CPU 再算，来回搬运消耗大量能量；存算一体让运算直接在存储阵列附近发生，省掉了频繁搬运，因此特别适合低功耗的 AI 推理。��Classic architectures haul data from memory to the CPU and back, burning energy in movement; in-memory computing does the math right where data sits, skipping the transfers—great for low-power AI inference.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�10284662b46d�body���CDN（内容分发网络）把网站内容缓存到离用户更近的多个节点，用户从就近服务器获取，减少距离带来的延迟。它还能分摊源站压力、提升可用性和抗攻击能力。视频和大图网站尤其依赖它。�␀A CDN (content delivery network) caches site content on many nodes closer to users, so they fetch from a nearby server and cut distance latency. It also offloads the origin and improves availability and resilience. Video and image-heavy sites depend on it.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�1290282a4034�body���Transformer 本身不自带词序信息，RoPE 把位置编码成旋转矩阵乘到 Q、K 上，使两个词元的内积只依赖它们的相对位置与夹角，既注入顺序又便于外推到更长的序列。��Transformers have no built-in word order; RoPE rotates Q and K by position-dependent angles so their dot product depends mainly on relative position, injecting order while helping extrapolation to longer sequences.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�12cc7837d66c�body�ٝ眼动追踪用摄像头或红外感知你看哪里，可用于无障碍（用眼神控制光标）、界面热度图研究和 VR 注视点渲染省算力。٘Eye tracking senses where you look via camera or infrared; it enables accessibility, eye-controlled cursor, UI heatmaps, and gaze-based rendering in VR.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�12e67c62ed0f�body���LSM 树把随机写先落入内存再批量顺序刷到磁盘的有序文件，把大量随机写转化为顺序写，写入极快，读则需合并多层；被 LevelDB、RocksDB、Cassandra 等采用。��An LSM tree buffers random writes in memory then flushes them as sorted files sequentially, turning random writes into fast sequential ones; reads merge levels. Used by LevelDB, RocksDB, Cassandra.�ans��src��O'Neil 等 1996�O'Neil et al. 1996��id�13532db20c08�body�پPDF 是一种固定版式的文件格式，不管谁打开，排版、字体都和原来一样，不会乱跑。适合发合同、简历、说明书，对方看到的跟你的一模一样。ٙPDF fixes layout so it looks identical on any device—no shifting text. Great for contracts, resumes and manuals; the reader sees exactly what you made.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�14ac5a932fad�body�١TCP 是全双工，关闭时双方要各自说一声我发完了。服务器收到 FIN 后先回 ACK，等自己数据发完再发 FIN，因此多一次往返。ٓTCP is full-duplex, so each side must say it is done. The server ACKs your FIN, then sends its own FIN after finishing, adding an extra round trip.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�165cfef4adf8�body��2系统调用是用户程序请求操作系统内核替它做事的受控接口，例如读写文件、创建进程、分配内存。因为硬件资源受内核保护，普通程序不能直接操作，必须通过系统调用进入内核态完成。它既是能力的入口，也是安全隔离的边界。��A system call is the controlled interface by which a user program asks the OS kernel to do something for it, such as reading a file, creating a process, or allocating memory. Because hardware resources are protected by the kernel, normal programs cannot manipulate them directly and must enter kernel mode via a system call. It is both a capability entry point and a security boundary.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�17624f9c2aa8�body��S文件系统把磁盘划分成固定大小的块，用索引结构（如 Unix 的 inode）记录文件名、权限、大小和指向数据块的指针。删除文件通常只是清除元数据并把块标记为空闲，数据本身并不清零，所以再大的文件也能瞬间“删掉”。文件内容在块里不一定连续存放。�ZThe file system divides the disk into fixed-size blocks and records each file's name, permissions, size, and block pointers in an index structure such as the Unix inode. Deleting usually just clears the metadata and marks the blocks free without erasing data, which is why even huge files vanish instantly. A file's blocks need not be contiguous.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�18a5ad8ba250�body��~电量靠电压变化和电流积分来估算，老化和温度会让误差变大，并不是对化学余量的精确测量。َCharge is estimated from voltage changes and current integration; aging and temperature add error, so it is not an exact chemical measurement.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�199870082892�body�ن目前多是VR社交、会议或游戏的雏形，头显笨重、内容稀疏，距离《头号玩家》那种沉浸世界还很远。نToday it is mostly VR social, meetings, or games in early form—bulky headsets and sparse content, far from a ready-player-one world.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1cc6f63e625d�body��t存储层次结构按照速度、容量、成本把寄存器、缓存、内存、硬盘等组织成金字塔：越往上越快越贵容量越小，越往下越慢越便宜容量越大。程序运行时把最频繁访问的数据放在上层，从而在成本和性能间取得平衡。这种分层利用了“局部性”原理，即程序常反复访问相近的数据。��The memory hierarchy organizes registers, caches, RAM, and disks into a pyramid by speed, capacity, and cost: higher levels are faster, pricier, and smaller, while lower levels are slower, cheaper, and larger. The most frequently used data is kept in upper levels to balance cost and performance. This layering exploits locality, the tendency of programs to repeatedly access nearby data.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�1f297558b527�body��(经典流程是“取指—译码—执行”，有的还包含“访存”和“写回”。取指从内存读入指令，译码分析它要做什么、操作数在哪，执行让 ALU 或访存完成运算，结果再写回寄存器或内存。流水线就是把这几个阶段重叠起来做。�ZThe classic flow is fetch, decode, and execute, sometimes extended with memory access and write-back. Fetch reads the instruction from memory, decode figures out what it does and where its operands are, execute lets the ALU or memory perform the operation, and the result is written back to a register or memory. Pipelining overlaps these stages.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�1fc0da8d437d�body��GCPU 缓存是位于 CPU 与主存之间的高速小容量存储器，用来暂存最近或即将使用的数据，缓解 CPU 远快于内存的速度差距。当 CPU 需要的数据已在缓存中时称为“命中”，否则需到慢得多的主存去取。多级缓存（L1/L2/L3）按速度与容量逐级权衡来组织。�kCPU cache is a small, fast memory between the CPU and main memory that holds recently or soon-to-be-used data, bridging the large speed gap between a fast CPU and slower RAM. When the needed data is already in cache it is a hit; otherwise the CPU must fetch it from much slower main memory. Multi-level caches (L1/L2/L3) trade speed against capacity at each tier.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�1ffefb27c33d�body���过拟合指模型在训练数据上表现极好、却在未见过的测试数据上表现明显变差，相当于把训练样本中的噪声也当成了规律。直观表现是训练误差很低而验证误差很高，二者差距很大。�Overfitting happens when a model performs extremely well on training data but much worse on unseen test data, having memorized noise as if it were a real pattern. The intuitive sign is a very low training error paired with a much higher validation error, a large gap between the two.�ans��src��9Bishop《模式识别与机器学习》第1章 (Springer)�MC. Bishop, Pattern Recognition and Machine Learning, Chapter 1 (Introduction)��id�205e7850640e�body��NTLS 握手在传输业务数据前完成三件事：协商密码套件（协议版本与加密算法）、用服务器证书验证服务器身份、通过密钥交换（如 ECDHE）在不暴露密钥的前提下生成共享的会话密钥。此后双方用对称密钥加密通信，保证机密性、完整性并具备身份认证。��Before any application data, the TLS handshake does three things: negotiate the cipher suite (protocol version and encryption algorithms), verify the server's identity using its certificate, and establish a shared session key via key exchange such as ECDHE without exposing the key. Both sides then encrypt traffic with symmetric keys, providing confidentiality, integrity and authentication.�ans��src��《计算机网络》第7章�2Computer Networking (《计算机网络》), ch. 7��id�20d0418e93fc�body��回溯是一种系统地尝试所有可能、遇到死路就退回上一步的搜索方法，常用于数独、八皇后和组合问题。它配合剪枝可以提前放弃不可能成功的分支，显著减少搜索量。本质上是在解空间树上做深度优先遍历。�,Backtracking systematically tries possibilities and undoes a step when it hits a dead end, used for sudoku, the eight queens, and combinatorial problems. With pruning it can abandon hopeless branches early and cut the search dramatically. It is essentially a depth-first walk over the solution space.�ans��src��lRussell, S. J. 与 Norvig, P. (2010). 《人工智能：一种现代方法（第三版）》. Prentice Hall.�iRussell, S. J., & Norvig, P. (2010). Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach (3rd ed.). Prentice Hall.��id�22c164435263�body���物联网是把传感器、家电、设备接入互联网，让它们采集数据、接受远程控制。智能家居里，传感器（温度、人体感应）和开关通过 Wi-Fi、蓝牙、ZigBee 连到网关或云平台，你的指令和自动化规则（“湿度低就开加湿器”）在那里被解释执行。好处是自动化，风险是每个设备都可能是网络攻击面。��The IoT connects sensors, appliances, and gadgets to the internet so they collect data and accept remote control. In a smart home, sensors (temperature, motion) and switches link via Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, or ZigBee to a hub or cloud where your commands and automation rules (“if humidity drops, turn on the humidifier”) are interpreted and executed. The upside is automation; the risk is every device becomes an attack surface.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�23ed902da90e�body��闭包是一个函数加上它捕获的外层变量环境，即使外层已执行完毕，函数仍记得并使用那些变量。它常用于回调、事件处理和实现私有状态。闭包让函数携带“记忆”，是函数式与很多现代语言的重要特性。�VA closure is a function together with the environment of outer variables it captures, so even after the outer scope finishes, the function still remembers and uses those variables. It is common in callbacks, event handling, and implementing private state. By giving a function memory, closures are key in functional and many modern languages.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�24b5bc3e72a7�body�ٖ零信任假定网络内外都不可信，每次访问都要验证身份、设备和权限，遵循最小权限原则，不再默认内网即安全。ٝZero Trust assumes no implicit trust inside or outside the network; every access is verified for identity, device, and permission, following least privilege.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�24b6e20929c2�body���Raft 中节点在超时未收到心跳时转为候选者并发起选举，获得多数票者成为领导人，任期号随之递增。任期号作为逻辑时钟标识领导代次，能快速检测并废弃过期领导人的决策。�In Raft a node that times out without a heartbeat becomes a candidate and starts an election; the one receiving a majority of votes becomes leader and increments the term. The term acts as a logical clock marking leadership epochs, quickly detecting and invalidating stale leaders.�ans��src��_Ongaro & Ousterhout, In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm (Raft), USENIX ATC 2014�_Ongaro & Ousterhout, In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm (Raft), USENIX ATC 2014��id�25a60fd37343�body��{过度授权让App收集你的位置、通讯录用于画像或转卖，按需开放、用完收回能降低泄露风险。فOver-permission lets apps harvest location and contacts for profiling or resale; granting only what’s needed reduces leak risk.�ans��src��LTanenbaum《现代操作系统》；Silberschatz 等《操作系统概念》�STanenbaum, Modern Operating Systems; Silberschatz et al., Operating System Concepts��id�27dc251273f2�body�قTTS 把文字转成自然语音，让视障者听文章、帮助阅读困难者，也为导航和智能音箱提供发声能力。هTTS turns text into natural speech, letting the blind hear articles and helping poor readers, and powers navigation and smart speakers.�ans��src��_D. Jurafsky 与 J. H. Martin,《Speech and Language Processing》,第2版,Prentice Hall,2009年�^D. Jurafsky and J. H. Martin, Speech and Language Processing, 2nd edition, Prentice Hall, 2009��id�27f3cfa9e621�body�لIPC 表示每个时钟周期平均完成的指令数。同频率下 IPC 越高性能越强，是衡量架构效率的重要指标。٦IPC is the average number of instructions completed per clock cycle. At the same frequency, higher IPC means better performance and reflects architectural efficiency.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�2832a399cc96�body���IPv6 是新一代 IP 协议，地址长达 128 位，可提供几乎无限的地址空间。IPv4 地址已耗尽，难以支撑物联网等海量设备。IPv6 还简化了报头并内置更好的安全性。��IPv6 is the new generation IP with 128-bit addresses, offering a nearly unlimited space. IPv4 addresses are exhausted and cannot support the huge number of IoT devices. IPv6 also simplifies headers and builds in better security.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�28d0e9085188�body���训练集用于拟合模型参数，验证集用于在训练过程中选择超参数并监控是否过拟合，测试集则只在最后评估模型的真实泛化能力。测试集应始终不参与任何训练或调参，以免乐观估计性能。�3The training set fits the model parameters, the validation set selects hyperparameters and monitors overfitting during training, and the test set is used only at the end to estimate true generalization. The test set must never take part in training or tuning, or the performance estimate becomes optimistic.�ans��src��0Hastie《统计学习基础》第7章 (Springer)�wT. Hastie, R. Tibshirani, J. Friedman, The Elements of Statistical Learning, Chapter 7 (Model Assessment and Selection)��id�291d9175b44a�body���发送方用私钥对消息哈希签名，接收方用其公钥验证：只有对应私钥能生成该签名，且任何篡改都会改变哈希导致验证失败，从而同时保证来源可信与内容未被改动。��The sender signs a hash of the message with their private key; the receiver verifies with the public key—only the matching private key could produce it, and any tampering changes the hash and fails verification, proving origin and integrity.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�2a5a98fe3b70�body��z深度伪造用生成对抗网络（GAN）等模型训练出能生成逼真假视频、假声音的网络：生成器不断造假，判别器不断鉴别，互相逼对方变强。它难防范是因为人眼和耳朵难以分辨，且生成成本越来越低；应对靠检测模型、内容来源认证和平台治理，本质上是一场“造假—检测”的军备竞赛。��Deepfakes are made with models like generative adversarial networks (GANs): a generator keeps forging, a discriminator keeps detecting, and each pushes the other to improve until fake video and audio look and sound real. They are hard to stop because humans struggle to tell, and the cost keeps dropping; defenses rely on detection models, provenance verification, and platform governance—an arms race between forgery and detection.�ans��src��#arXiv（生成对抗网络论文）�arXiv (GAN paper)��id�2ad4a786aaba�body���哈夫曼编码给出现频率高的字符分配短码、频率低的分配长码，使平均码长最短。它先统计频率，再构造一棵最优二叉树，从根到叶的路径即为编码。解码端持有同样的树即可无损还原。�Huffman coding assigns short codes to frequent characters and long codes to rare ones, minimizing average code length. It counts frequencies, builds an optimal binary tree, and the path from root to leaf is the code. The decoder uses the same tree to recover data losslessly.�ans��src��LCover 与 Thomas《信息论基础》(Elements of Information Theory, Wiley)�6Cover & Thomas, Elements of Information Theory (Wiley)��id�2b211c9863e6�body��~运营商有公平使用策略，用量超过阈值后会降速，以防止少数用户占满网络、保证大家都能用。�mOperators use fair-use policies that slow heavy users past a threshold to keep the network fair for everyone.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版电子与信息分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�lTen Thousand Whys: Electronics and Information volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�2b7bd195bd1a�body��递归用函数自己调用自己来表达重复，代码往往更贴近问题的数学定义，如树遍历。迭代用循环变量反复推进，通常更省内存、速度更可控。递归若过深可能栈溢出，但很多结构天然适合递归表达。�CRecursion expresses repetition by a function calling itself, often matching a problem's mathematical definition such as tree traversal. Iteration uses loops to advance step by step, usually saving memory and giving more control over speed. Deep recursion can overflow the stack, yet many structures are naturally recursive.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�2c25dd93029e�body��n可用性衡量一个产品对目标用户是否有效、高效、满意地完成任务。好界面遵循学习成本低、可记忆、容错、可恢复等原则，比如一致的操作、清晰的反馈、把常用操作放大。它背后是人机交互（HCI）研究，连按钮大小都有规律——费茨定律说明目标越大越近，点击越快越准。��Usability measures how effectively, efficiently, and satisfactorily a product lets target users finish tasks. Good interfaces follow principles like low learning cost, memorability, error tolerance, and recovery—consistent actions, clear feedback, and prominent placement of frequent operations. Behind it lies human-computer interaction (HCI) research, down to the physics of buttons: Fitts's law shows larger, closer targets are clicked faster and more accurately.�ans��src�ّFitts P M., The Information Capacity of the Human Motor System in Controlling the Amplitude of Movement, Journal of Experimental Psychology, 1954ّFitts P M., The Information Capacity of the Human Motor System in Controlling the Amplitude of Movement, Journal of Experimental Psychology, 1954��id�2dd193608ae2�body���泛型让你写出与具体数据类型无关的代码，比如一个能装任意类型的列表，而不必为每种类型重写。它在保持类型安全的同时减少重复代码。C++ 的模板、Java 的泛型、Rust 的泛型都是典型实现。�Generics let you write code independent of concrete data types, such as a list that can hold any type without rewriting it for each one. They reduce duplication while preserving type safety. C++ templates, Java generics, and Rust generics are typical implementations.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�2e0d69bd701e�body��l恶意软件是专门用来损害设备或窃取信息的程序，包括病毒、木马、勒索软件等。�jMalware is software made to harm devices or steal information, including viruses, trojans, and ransomware.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�2e4b960972ae�body���量化把原本用 16 位或 32 位浮点存储的权重改用 8 位甚至 4 位整数表示，数据量成倍减少、内存占用下降，且整数运算通常比浮点更快，代价是少量精度损失。��Quantization stores weights as 8-bit or even 4-bit integers instead of 16/32-bit floats, cutting size and memory bandwidth while integer math is often faster—at the cost of slight accuracy loss.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�2f634d4d3e5a�body�ل优先级调度让重要任务先跑；轮转则给每个任务固定时间片轮流执行，保证公平。两者常结合使用。ٍPriority scheduling runs important tasks first; round-robin gives each task a fixed time slice in turn for fairness. They are often combined.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�300f185c6fad�body���BFS 从起点逐层向外扩展，先访问距离近的节点，因此能求出无权图上从一个顶点到其余顶点的最短路径。它也常用于连通分量检测、社交网络中的一度二度关系发现等按层遍历的场景。�7BFS expands outward layer by layer from the start, visiting nearer nodes first, so it finds shortest paths on unweighted graphs from one vertex to all others. It is also used for connected-component detection and level-by-level traversal such as finding first- and second-degree connections in a social network.�ans��src��8Cormen《算法导论》第22章 (机械工业出版社)�fT. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms (CLRS), 4th ed., Chapter 22 (Elementary Graph Algorithms)��id�306068ca0a45�body���DNS 是互联网的「电话簿」，负责把人类易记的域名（如 example.com）翻译成机器使用的 IP 地址。当在浏览器输入网址时，系统会向 DNS 服务器查询对应的地址。它让用户无需记忆复杂的数字串。�DNS is the Internet's phone book, translating human-friendly domain names such as example.com into the IP addresses machines use. When you type a URL in a browser, the system queries a DNS server for the corresponding address. It lets users avoid memorizing complex numeric strings.�ans��src��~互联网工程任务组（IETF）,《Domain names - implementation and specification》,RFC 1035,1987 (DOI: 10.17487/rfc1035)�^IETF, 'Domain names - implementation and specification', RFC 1035, 1987, DOI: 10.17487/rfc1035��id�30be1b934f66�body�ي微调是在已训练好的大模型基础上，用特定领域数据继续训练，让它学会专业任务，比从零训练省得多。ِFine-tuning continues training a pre-trained large model on domain data so it learns a specialized task, far cheaper than training from scratch.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�311cface0468�body�ٵGC 自动回收不再被引用的对象所占内存，常见有标记-清除和分代回收：先标记可达对象，再清除不可达对象，减少手动内存管理的错误。ٻGC automatically reclaims memory of unreachable objects; common schemes like mark-sweep and generational collection mark reachable objects then free the rest, reducing manual memory bugs.�ans��src��Jones 等 GC 手册�Jones et al. GC Handbook��id�325621daafe9�body�ي很多设备出厂弱口令会被黑客扫描利用，入侵后可能被用来偷拍或发动攻击，设置强密码是第一道防线。يMany devices ship with weak default passwords that hackers scan and exploit for spying or attacks; a strong password is the first defense.�ans��src���KASAMA, ISAWA, KAMINO, HAGIWARA,《Unveiling the Security Risks in Default Wi-Fi Passwords of Consumer-Grade Routers》, IEICE Transactions on Information and Systems, 2025 (DOI: 10.1587/transinf.2024icp0007)��KASAMA, ISAWA, KAMINO, HAGIWARA, 'Unveiling the Security Risks in Default Wi-Fi Passwords of Consumer-Grade Routers', IEICE Transactions on Information and Systems, 2025, DOI: 10.1587/transinf.2024icp0007��id�335664f1bd72�body���归并排序在合并两个已排序片段时，遇到相等元素总是先取前半部分原来的元素，因此相同键的相对顺序不会改变。它的稳定性在需要按多字段排序时很有用。代价是需要额外 O(n) 的存储空间。��When merging two sorted runs, merge sort takes the element from the earlier run first when keys are equal, so equal items keep their original order. This stability matters when sorting by multiple fields. The cost is extra O(n) working space.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�33e8ac3736b9�body��区块链由按时间顺序排列的区块组成，每个区块除自身数据外还包含前一个区块的哈希值，从而像指针一样把区块前后串接成链。任何对历史区块的篡改都会改变其哈希，并导致后续所有区块的链接失效。�
A blockchain is an ordered sequence of blocks, each containing not only its own data but also the hash of the previous block, chaining them together like pointers. Any tampering with a historical block changes its hash and breaks the links of every subsequent block.�ans��src��BNakamoto《Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System》(2008)�AS. Nakamoto, Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System, 2008��id�361ac451d238�body��在类 Unix 系统中，文件描述符是内核返回给进程的一个小整数，用来代表一个已打开的文件、管道或网络套接字等 I/O 对象。进程之后读写都靠这个编号，而非文件名。标准输入、输出、错误通常固定为 0、1、2。�-In Unix-like systems, a file descriptor is a small integer the kernel gives a process to represent an open file, pipe, or network socket and other I/O objects. The process then reads or writes using that number rather than a file name. Standard input, output, and error are conventionally 0, 1, and 2.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�363935b7c7c0�body���端到端延迟包括输入采样、处理、渲染与显示刷新等各环节的累积时间。即使帧率相同，高延迟也会让操作感觉黏滞，HCI 研究通常把低于约 10 到 20 毫秒视为难以察觉。��End-to-end latency is the sum of input sampling, processing, rendering, and display refresh times. Even at the same frame rate, high latency makes interaction feel sluggish; HCI research often treats below about 10 to 20 milliseconds as imperceptible.�ans��src��aNVIDIA, Latency in Games / Beyond 60 FPS 技术白皮书系列, NVIDIA Developer Technical Briefs�]NVIDIA, Latency in Games / Beyond 60 FPS Whitepaper Series, NVIDIA Developer Technical Briefs��id�384bf4a6d714�body��{备份是把重要数据另外存一份副本，当硬盘损坏、中毒或误删时，还能用备份把数据找回来。كA backup is a separate copy of important data so that if a disk fails, malware strikes, or files are deleted, you can recover them.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�38e6f25cad3e�body�ٛ汇编是离机器码最近的人读语言，每条通常对应一条 CPU 指令。它用于嵌入式、驱动、性能极限优化和安全逆向分析。ٸAssembly is the human-readable form closest to machine code, roughly one line per CPU instruction. It is used in embedded systems, drivers, extreme optimization, and security analysis.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�390a1c4f1e4d�body��非对称加密中，公钥可以公开，用来加密或验证签名；私钥必须保密，用来解密或生成签名。用公钥加密的内容只有对应私钥能解开，反过来私钥签名可用公钥验证身份。这种机制是安全通信和数字货币的基础。�LIn asymmetric cryptography, the public key is shared and used to encrypt or verify; the private key stays secret and is used to decrypt or sign. What the public key encrypts only the matching private key can open, and a private-key signature is verified with the public key. This underpins secure communication and digital currency.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�3a53fa697505�body��q签名方对消息做哈希得到摘要，再用自己的私钥加密摘要形成签名；验证方用公钥解开签名恢复摘要，与对收到的消息重新计算的哈希比对。由于私钥只有签名者持有，能通过验证的签名必然出自持钥者；消息一旦被改动哈希就对不上，因此签名同时提供了完整性与不可抵赖性。��The signer hashes the message and encrypts the digest with their private key; the verifier decrypts the digest with the public key and compares it with a freshly computed hash of the received message. Because only the signer holds the private key, any signature that verifies must come from them, and any modification breaks the hash match — so signatures provide both integrity and non-repudiation.�ans��src��《计算机网络》第7章�2Computer Networking (《计算机网络》), ch. 7��id�3c332c9269b6�body��a内联是把被调用函数的函数体复制到调用点，从而消除函数调用开销（压栈、跳转、传参），并为后续优化（如常量传播、死代码消除）创造机会。代价是代码体积膨胀、编译时间增加，因此编译器通常只对"小而热"的函数自动内联，并用启发式策略和优化等级控制。�}Inlining copies the callee's function body into the call site, eliminating call overhead such as stack frames, jumps and argument passing, while enabling later optimizations like constant propagation and dead-code elimination. The cost is larger code and longer compile times, so compilers usually inline only small, hot functions, controlled by heuristics and optimization levels.�ans��src��(《编译原理》（Aho 等，龙书）�9Compilers: Principles, Techniques, and Tools (Aho et al.)��id�3c4b08d9938e�body�٢WCAG 是 Web 无障碍指南，提出可感知、可操作、可理解、健壮四大原则，并分 A、AA、AAA 等级，许多法规据此要求网站可达。٤WCAG is the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines built on four principles, perceivable, operable, understandable, robust, with A, AA, AAA levels cited by many laws.�ans��src��W3C WCAG 2.1 无障碍指南�W3C WCAG 2.1 Guidelines��id�3dcb37f9bff0�body��三次握手让客户端和服务器各自确认对方的发送与接收能力都正常：客户端发 SYN，服务器回 SYN-ACK，客户端再回 ACK。若只用两次握手，服务器无法确认客户端的接收能力，可能建立无效连接并浪费资源。�&The three-way handshake lets both client and server confirm each other's send and receive capability: the client sends SYN, the server replies SYN-ACK, and the client returns ACK. With only two steps the server cannot confirm the client's receive ability, risking a wasted half-open connection.�ans��src��MKurose《计算机网络:自顶向下方法》第3章 (机械工业出版社)�bJ. Kurose, K. Ross, Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach, 7th ed., Chapter 3 (Transport Layer)��id�3f9f31ffcde8�body�ٓ为了赶进度而写的凑合代码，以后要花更多精力改，就像借债要还利息。适度可控可以，积累太多会拖慢开发。كRushed, good-enough code costs more to fix later, like debt with interest. Some is fine if managed, but too much slows development.�ans��src��gRobert C. Martin,《Clean Code》Prentice Hall,2008;中译《代码整洁之道》人民邮电出版社�:R. C. Martin, Clean Code, Prentice Hall, 2008; Chinese ed.��id�402c5bb9ffba�body���BMC 把「在 k 步内是否存在违反性质的反例」编码为命题逻辑公式，交给 SAT 求解器判定。它能在有界深度内找到反例，但无法证明更深或全局的性质，需配合循环归纳。�BMC encodes the question of whether a counterexample violating the property exists within k steps as a propositional formula and hands it to a SAT solver. It can find counterexamples within the bound but cannot prove global properties beyond it without loop unwinding or induction.�ans��src��*Biere et al., Bounded Model Checking, 2003�*Biere et al., Bounded Model Checking, 2003��id�414ed89f18ad�body��纯函数对相同输入永远返回相同输出，且不产生可观察的副作用（如修改全局变量、写文件）。它易于测试、缓存结果（记忆化），也更利于并行。很多 bug 来自隐藏的副作用，纯函数能让代码行为更可预测。�&A pure function always returns the same output for the same input and has no observable side effects such as mutating globals or writing files. It is easy to test, can be memoized, and suits parallel execution. Many bugs come from hidden side effects, so purity makes behavior more predictable.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�425e9dff114e�body���聚簇索引的叶子节点直接存放整行数据，表中数据按索引键物理排序，因此一个表只能有一个。非聚簇索引的叶子指向数据行位置，查找需一次额外的书签定位（回表）。��A clustered index's leaf nodes store the whole row and the table is physically sorted by the key, so a table can have only one. A non-clustered index's leaf points to the row location, requiring an extra bookmark lookup (back to table) to fetch data.�ans��src��JGarcia-Molina, Ullman, Widom, Database Systems: The Complete Book, 2nd ed.�JGarcia-Molina, Ullman, Widom, Database Systems: The Complete Book, 2nd ed.��id�43bbe9b6eb40�body���它们用类型论或高阶逻辑表达证明，由用户一步步构造并交由机器检查，适合无法自动判定的深层数学与算法性质。人工参与在于提供证明策略与中间引理，机器只负责严格验证每步。�>They express proofs in type theory or higher-order logic, with the user constructing steps that the machine checks, suited to deep mathematical or algorithmic properties that are not automatically decidable. Human input supplies proof strategies and intermediate lemmas; the machine only rigorously verifies each step.�ans��src��/The Coq Proof Assistant Reference Manual, INRIA�/The Coq Proof Assistant Reference Manual, INRIA��id�44d81640d4a2�body�٫服务器用 Cache-Control 告诉浏览器能缓存多久，用 ETag 给资源一个版本标识。再请求时浏览器可凭 ETag 问没变吧，没变就免传整份。١Servers use Cache-Control to say how long to cache, and ETag to tag a version. On later requests the browser can ask if unchanged, and skip re-downloading if so.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�44ee2e547196�body���条件判断让程序做选择：满足某个条件就走一条路，否则走另一条。比如“如果下雨就提醒带伞，否则不用”。这是让程序“会思考”的基本方式。ٚA conditional makes the program choose: if a condition holds, do one thing, else another—like 'if raining, remind umbrella'. It's how programs 'decide'.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�46d5ecbb55a7�body��加盐是在每个密码后拼接一段随机字符串再哈希，使相同密码也得到不同结果。这能抵御彩虹表等预先计算的攻击，并防止通过比对哈希批量猜出常用密码。即使数据库泄露，破解成本也大幅提高。�
Salting appends a random string to each password before hashing, so identical passwords yield different digests. This defeats precomputed attacks like rainbow tables and stops bulk guessing by hash comparison. Even if the database leaks, cracking cost rises sharply.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�474f932626ab�body���301 表示资源被永久移动到新地址，浏览器和搜索引擎会把 SEO 权重转移到新 URL 并缓存重定向；302 表示临时重定向，客户端应继续用原地址，不转移权重。��301 means the resource moved permanently, so clients and search engines transfer SEO weight and cache the redirect; 302 is temporary, so clients keep using the original URL and no weight is transferred.�ans��src��]互联网工程任务组（IETF）,《HTTP Semantics》,RFC 9110,2022 (DOI: 10.17487/rfc9110)�=IETF, 'HTTP Semantics', RFC 9110, 2022, DOI: 10.17487/rfc9110��id�481ad87fce89�body��k解释器逐条读取并执行源代码或字节码，启动快但运行慢；AOT 静态编译先把整个程序翻译成机器码再运行，执行快但构建和部署较慢；JIT 编译器在运行时把热点代码动态编译成机器码，兼顾启动速度与运行性能。Java 虚拟机、V8 等主流运行时都采用解释器加 JIT 的分层策略。��Interpreters read and execute source code or bytecode statement by statement — fast to start, slow to run. Ahead-of-time compilers translate the whole program to machine code first — fast at runtime but slower to build and deploy. JIT compilers dynamically compile hot code at runtime, balancing startup speed and runtime performance. Major runtimes like the JVM and V8 use a tiered interpreter-plus-JIT strategy.�ans��src��+《编程语言实现原理》（Sebesta）�+Concepts of Programming Languages (Sebesta)��id�49a18b57a39b�body���敏捷把开发切分为固定长度（如两周）的迭代，每个迭代都交付可运行的增量并获取反馈。这样能尽早暴露需求偏差，逐步逼近用户真正需要的功能，而不是等到末期才一次性交付。�Agile breaks development into fixed-length iterations, such as two weeks, each delivering a working increment and gathering feedback. This surfaces requirement mismatches early and gradually converges on what users truly need, rather than delivering everything only at the end.�ans��src��,Beck《解析极限编程》(Addison-Wesley)�FK. Beck, Extreme Programming Explained: Embrace Change, Addison-Wesley��id�49b0a28a2bb5�body�ٜ负载均衡器把大量请求分摊到多台服务器上，避免单机过载，同时某台宕机时还能把流量转到健康机器，提升可用性。ّA load balancer spreads many requests across servers to avoid overloading one, and reroutes traffic when a machine fails, improving availability.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�4a3d0d35a8a3�body��不可篡改来自区块间的哈希链接、分布式多副本存储以及共识机制的经济成本：改一处历史需重算其后所有区块的工作量并说服多数节点接受。由于全网共同维护同一账本，单一节点难以悄悄伪造记录。�DImmutability comes from hash chaining between blocks, distributed replication across many nodes, and the economic cost of consensus: rewriting history means redoing the proof-of-work of all later blocks and convincing the majority. Because the whole network maintains one ledger, a single node cannot silently forge records.�ans��src��BNakamoto《Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System》(2008)�AS. Nakamoto, Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System, 2008��id�4a79084eb37a�body��大O表示法描述算法运行时间如何随输入规模增长，忽略常数和次要项。比如顺序查找是O(n)，数据翻倍时间约翻倍；二分查找是O(log n)，数据翻倍只多一步。它让我们不依赖具体机器就能比较算法的快慢。�FBig O notation describes how an algorithm's runtime grows with input size, ignoring constants and minor terms. Linear search is O(n), so doubling the data roughly doubles the time, while binary search is O(log n), where doubling the data adds only one more step. It lets us compare algorithms independent of specific hardware.�ans��src�� 《算法导论》(CLRS) 第3章�,Introduction to Algorithms (CLRS), Chapter 3��id�4b18f9d2dbfc�body���通常分别用文本编码器和图像编码器把两者变成向量，再通过对比学习让“相配”的图片-文字向量靠近、不配的远离，于是同一语义在两种模态下落到相近的位置。��A text encoder and an image encoder turn each modality into vectors; contrastive learning pulls matching image-text pairs closer and pushes mismatches apart, so the same meaning lands near the same spot across modalities.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�4bff9d5b8003�body��2不可变数据一旦创建就不能被修改，任何“改动”都产生新副本。这让程序更容易推理，因为值不会在别处被悄悄改变；在并发场景下也不必加锁就能安全共享。代价是需要更多内存或复制开销，现代实现常用结构共享来降低代价。�_Immutable data cannot be changed after creation; any modification produces a new copy. This makes programs easier to reason about because a value will not be silently altered elsewhere, and in concurrent settings it can be shared safely without locks. The cost is more memory or copying, which modern implementations reduce through structural sharing.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�4d197666ac46�body���显示器对信号做非线性响应，人眼对暗部更敏感，伽马校正把存储值转换到感知均匀的空间。光照计算应在线性空间进行，否则叠加会偏暗失真，最后再编码回伽马空间显示。�2Displays respond nonlinearly to signal and human eyes are more sensitive to darks, so gamma correction maps stored values into a perceptually uniform space. Lighting should be computed in linear space, otherwise addition looks too dark and wrong; the result is then encoded back to gamma space for display.�ans��src��APoynton, Digital Video and HD: Algorithms and Interfaces, 2nd ed.�APoynton, Digital Video and HD: Algorithms and Interfaces, 2nd ed.��id�4e2cbfd71be8�body��U现代软件大量复用第三方组件，供应链攻击指攻击者通过污染依赖库、构建工具或更新通道，把恶意代码带入受害者系统，例如 2021 年的 SolarWinds 事件和 2024 年的 XZ utils 后门。防御手段包括依赖锁定与校验、软件物料清单（SBOM）、代码签名和持续漏洞扫描。��Modern software heavily reuses third-party components; a supply-chain attack compromises dependencies, build tools or update channels to smuggle malicious code into victims' systems — for example SolarWinds in 2021 and the XZ utils backdoor in 2024. Defenses include dependency locking and verification, software bills of materials (SBOM), code signing, and continuous vulnerability scanning.�ans��src��[DIMVA（Ohm 等, Backstabber's Knife Collection: 开源软件供应链攻击综述, 2020）�oDIMVA (Ohm et al., Backstabber's Knife Collection: A Review of Open Source Software Supply Chain Attacks, 2020)��id�4e2dce29c101�body���位置、行为、通讯录等数据让产品可以做个性化推荐、广告定向和功能优化，所以商业上被极力收集。技术层面保护隐私的手段包括数据最小化（只用必要数据）、匿名化、去标识化（去掉能认出你的字段）和加密；其中去标识化并不绝对安全，结合多份数据仍可能重新识别出个人，这正是隐私研究的难点。��Location, behavior, contacts, and more enable personalized recommendations, targeted ads, and product optimization, so there is commercial pressure to collect aggressively. Technical privacy safeguards include data minimization (only what's needed), anonymization, de-identification (stripping identifying fields), and encryption; de-identification is not foolproof, because combining datasets can still re-identify individuals—the crux of privacy research.�ans��src�٠Dwork 与 Roth,《The Algorithmic Foundations of Differential Privacy》,Foundations and Trends® in Theoretical Computer Science,2014 (DOI: 10.1561/0400000042)٤Dwork, C. & Roth, A., 'The Algorithmic Foundations of Differential Privacy', Foundations and Trends® in Theoretical Computer Science, 2014, DOI: 10.1561/0400000042��id�4e9ccedc109d�body��SFAT 简单、兼容性极广，但单文件大小和分区容量受限，且无权限管理。NTFS 是 Windows 主流，支持权限、加密、日志和超大文件。ext4 是 Linux 常用文件系统，支持日志、大容量和较好的性能。它们都解决“如何把文件映射到磁盘块”这一问题，但侧重点不同。�^FAT is simple and widely compatible but limits file and partition size and lacks permissions. NTFS is the mainstream Windows system, supporting permissions, encryption, journaling, and huge files. ext4 is common on Linux, offering journaling, large capacity, and good performance. All solve mapping files onto disk blocks but with different emphases.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�4eb57ead9758�body�ٻHTTPS 在 TCP 之上使用 TLS：先用非对称加密（如 RSA/ECDHE）协商出对称会话密钥，之后海量数据用对称加密（如 AES）传输，并用 MAC 保证完整性。��HTTPS runs TLS over TCP: an asymmetric exchange (RSA or ECDHE) negotiates a symmetric session key, then bulk data is encrypted with a symmetric cipher (e.g. AES) and protected by a MAC for integrity.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�50cf2ca7d908�body�ٍ微服务把一个大系统拆成多个小服务，各自独立开发、部署和扩容，用接口互相调用，灵活但运维更复杂。ٛMicroservices split a system into small services that develop, deploy, and scale independently and talk via interfaces, flexible but more operational work.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�51e39d42180f�body�ِVPN（虚拟专用网络）在公共网络上建立一条加密的隧道，让设备像直接连在私有网络里一样安全地收发数据。ٜA VPN (virtual private network) creates an encrypted tunnel over a public network so a device can send and receive data as if directly on a private network.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�536b4ecabf41�body�� CPU 追求用少量强核心处理复杂、串行的多样化任务，强调低延迟。GPU 则堆大量简单核心，专为同时处理海量同质计算（如像素、顶点）而设计，强调吞吐。因此图形渲染、矩阵运算等高度并行的任务特别适合交给 GPU。�5A CPU uses few powerful cores to handle complex, serial, varied tasks, optimizing for low latency. A GPU packs many simple cores designed to process massive homogeneous work like pixels and vertices at once, optimizing for throughput. Thus highly parallel tasks such as rendering and matrix math suit the GPU.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�540aa9646b65�body���同步代码按顺序阻塞执行，一步完成才进行下一步；异步允许在等待 IO 等耗时操作时让出控制权去处理别的事，最终通过回调、Promise 或 async/await 取结果。ٺSynchronous code runs in order and blocks; asynchronous code yields control while waiting on slow tasks like I/O and resumes via callbacks, Promises or async/await, improving throughput.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�554a564a4218�body���训练数据可能包含个人信息，若未脱敏会泄露隐私，模型甚至可能“记住”并复现敏感样本。成员推断攻击能从模型反推某人是否在训练集中。做法上需要脱敏、授权与差分隐私等技术。�Training data may contain personal information that leaks privacy if not anonymized, and models can even memorize and reproduce sensitive samples. Membership inference can tell whether someone was in the training set. Techniques include anonymization, consent, and differential privacy.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�55dda15d7a94�body��协调者先让所有参与者准备并就绪（阶段一），全部同意后发出提交指令，否则统一回滚（阶段二）。它保证原子性，但协调者阻塞是主要缺陷：若协调者在提交前崩溃，参与者将不确定而长时间持锁。�7The coordinator first asks all participants to prepare and vote (phase one); if all agree it issues a commit, otherwise it rolls back uniformly (phase two). It guarantees atomicity, but a key flaw is coordinator blocking: if the coordinator crashes before committing, participants stay uncertain and hold locks.�ans��src��ZBernstein, Hadzilacos, Goodman, Concurrency Control and Recovery in Database Systems, 1987�ZBernstein, Hadzilacos, Goodman, Concurrency Control and Recovery in Database Systems, 1987��id�56b8dccd7c5d�body��类型推断让编译器根据上下文自动判断变量或表达式的类型，程序员不必处处手写类型标注。这既保留了静态类型的安全，又让代码更简洁，如用 var 或 let 声明。典型代表有 Haskell、ML 家族和现代 C++ 的 auto。�-Type inference lets the compiler determine a variable or expression's type from context, so programmers need not annotate types everywhere. It keeps the safety of static typing while making code terser, as with var or let declarations. Haskell, the ML family, and modern C++ auto are typical examples.�ans��src��LB. C. Pierce,《类型与程序设计语言》,MIT 出版社,2002,第 15 章�PBenjamin C. Pierce, Types and Programming Languages, MIT Press, 2002, Chapter 15��id�5705ab467d2d�body��随机、无规律的数据没有冗余可去，压缩后平均长度无法长期低于信息熵。若一种压缩对所有文件都缩小，就会有两个文件映射到同一结果，导致无法唯一还原。因此总存在压不动甚至变大的情况。�Random, patternless data has no redundancy to remove, and average length cannot stay below entropy. If one compressor shrank every file, two files would map to the same output and could not be uniquely restored. So some files simply will not compress, and may even grow.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�59ed465d7caf�body�ٗ盐是加在密码上的随机值，让相同密码也得到不同哈希，防止查表破解。bcrypt 等故意算得慢，增加暴力破解成本。٨A salt is random data added to a password so identical passwords yield different hashes, defeating lookup tables. Slow hashes like bcrypt raise the cost of brute force.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�5a38a0140817�body���欧拉证明：要一次不重复地走完所有桥，图中最多只能有两个奇度顶点。这个问题把“能不能走通”抽象成顶点与边的图，标志着图论的诞生，也引出了一笔画（欧拉路径）的判断准则。��Euler showed a route crossing every bridge once needs at most two odd-degree vertices. Abstracting 'can we walk it' into vertices and edges birthed graph theory and the rule for Eulerian paths.�ans��src��A《什么是数学》(柯朗)（拓扑章：柯尼斯堡七桥）�>What Is Mathematics? (Courant), topology (Königsberg bridges)��id�5a9fc47132f7�body�ٸEmbedding 把离散对象（词、用户、商品）映射为低维稠密向量，使语义相近的对象在向量空间中距离更近，便于相似度计算与下游模型使用。ٳAn embedding maps discrete objects (words, users, items) to low-dimensional dense vectors so semantically similar ones are close in space, easing similarity and downstream models.�ans��src��Mikolov 等 2013�Mikolov et al. 2013��id�5af175c9f734�body���VLM 在语言模型之外接入了图像编码器，能把图片转成模型能读的“视觉词元”，于是你可以拿着一张图问它问题、让它描述或推理，而不只是处理纯文字。ٺA VLM adds an image encoder to a language model, turning a picture into 'visual tokens' the model can read, so you can ask about, describe, or reason over an image—not just plain text.�ans��src�ًLiu、Li、Wu 与 Lee,《Visual Instruction Tuning》,Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems 36,2023 (DOI: 10.52202/075280-1516)مLiu, Li, Wu & Lee, 'Visual Instruction Tuning', Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems 36, 2023, DOI: 10.52202/075280-1516��id�5b35412c6350�body���UTF-8 用 1 到 4 个字节表示 Unicode 字符，英文字母仍占 1 字节，与 ASCII 完全兼容。它用首字节的高位标记总长度，后续字节以 10 开头以便识别。这样既节省空间又支持全球所有文字。�UTF-8 represents Unicode characters with 1 to 4 bytes; English letters stay 1 byte and remain ASCII-compatible. The leading bits of the first byte mark the total length, and continuation bytes start with 10 for easy detection. This saves space while supporting every script.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�5bfab422228b�body���测试通过抽样执行检查特定输入是否出错，无法穷尽所有情况；形式化验证用严格的数学逻辑证明程序满足规约，从而覆盖全部可能行为。代价是建模成本高，通常只对关键模块使用。�Testing samples specific inputs and cannot exhaust all cases, while formal verification uses rigorous mathematical logic to prove a program satisfies its specification, covering all possible behaviors. The cost is high modeling effort, so it is usually applied only to critical modules.�ans��src��7Clarke, Grumberg, Peled, Model Checking, MIT Press 1999�7Clarke, Grumberg, Peled, Model Checking, MIT Press 1999��id�5c2ce893e000�body�٢反向代理站在服务器前面，替后端接收请求并转发，可做负载均衡、缓存、HTTPS 卸载和隐藏真实服务器，是网站常见入口。٦A reverse proxy sits in front of servers, receiving and forwarding requests; it can load-balance, cache, terminate HTTPS, and hide backends, a common web entry point.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�5c9445281e76�body��X强化学习没有现成标签，智能体在环境里试错，通过动作获得奖励或惩罚来学习策略，目标是最大化长期累计奖励。AlphaGo 就靠和自己对弈强化训练。它和“喂标签学映射”的监督学习最大的不同是：训练数据来自智能体自己的行为序列，奖励稀疏且带有延迟。��Reinforcement learning has no ready-made labels: an agent explores an environment, taking actions and receiving rewards or penalties, learning a policy that maximizes long-run cumulative reward. AlphaGo trained this way by playing against itself. The biggest difference from supervised “learn a mapping from labels” is that training data comes from the agent's own action sequences, with sparse, delayed rewards.�ans��src��Nature（AlphaGo 论文）�Nature (AlphaGo paper)��id�5de1155deba7�body���键值存储是最简单的 NoSQL 模型，数据以“键—值”对形式保存，通过键直接读写，速度极快。它适合缓存、会话和配置等简单场景。Redis 和 DynamoDB 是常见例子。��A key-value store is the simplest NoSQL model, saving data as key-value pairs accessed directly by key, very fast. It fits caching, sessions, and config. Redis and DynamoDB are common examples.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�5e4ac1ff0489�body�ي厂商按1GB=10亿字节计算，系统按2的30次方计算，再加上系统和恢复分区占用，可用空间通常少一成以上。وVendors count 1 GB as a billion bytes while the system uses 2^30, plus system and recovery partitions, so usable space is over 10% less.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�5f02037ebce6�body���典型状态包括新建、就绪、运行、阻塞（等待）和终止。就绪表示已具备运行条件只等 CPU，运行表示正占用 CPU，阻塞表示在等某事件（如 I/O 完成）。操作系统调度器在这些状态间迁移进程。�!Typical states are new, ready, running, blocked (waiting), and terminated. Ready means the process can run but awaits the CPU, running means it currently uses the CPU, and blocked means it is waiting for an event such as I/O completion. The OS scheduler moves processes among these states.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�5fb67a8c42c0�body��␀如果训练数据本身就不均衡或有刻板倾向（例如某类人脸样本偏少），模型就会把这种偏差学进去并在预测中放大。所以 AI 的偏见往往反映的是训练数据与人类社会的既有偏见，而非凭空产生。��If training data is unbalanced or skewed (e.g. too few faces of some group), the model learns and amplifies that bias in its predictions. AI bias usually mirrors the bias already present in data and society, not something invented from nothing.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�6211ef91b8ff�body��9CPU 用两种特权级别运行：用户态权限低，只能访问自己的内存和受限指令，应用程序多在此运行。内核态权限高，可执行所有指令、直接操作硬件，操作系统核心代码运行于此。切换二者需要系统调用或中断，目的是防止程序破坏系统。�zThe CPU runs at two privilege levels: user mode has low rights and can access only its own memory and restricted instructions, where most applications run. Kernel mode has high rights and can execute all instructions and touch hardware directly, where OS core code runs. Switching between them requires a system call or interrupt, preventing programs from corrupting the system.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�6332b90c0622�body���最坏情况分析看单次操作的最大开销，而摊还分析看一系列操作的总开销除以次数，允许偶尔很贵、平时很便宜。例如动态数组偶尔扩容很慢，但平均每次插入仍是常数时间。��Worst-case looks at the cost of a single operation; amortized analysis averages the total cost of a sequence, allowing rare expensive steps. A dynamic array occasionally resizes slowly, yet average insertion stays O(1).�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�637ce03d4a4a�body��路由器根据目标 IP 地址查询路由表，选择下一跳把数据包转发出去，逐跳逼近目的地。每跳可能走不同路径，因此包可能乱序到达，由 TCP 负责重组。路由协议让路由器交换拓扑信息以选最优路。�Routers consult a routing table by destination IP and forward each packet to the next hop, getting closer hop by hop. Packets may take different paths and arrive out of order, with TCP reassembling them. Routing protocols let routers exchange topology to pick good paths.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�64a37d959ca6�body���同态加密使第三方可在不解密的前提下对加密数据做运算，结果解密后与在明文上运算一致。这能在把数据交给不可信云处理时仍保护内容，是隐私计算的核心原语。�Homomorphic encryption lets a third party compute on encrypted data without decrypting it, and the decrypted result matches computing on the plaintext. This protects content even when data is processed by an untrusted cloud, a core primitive of privacy computing.�ans��src��HGentry, A Fully Homomorphic Encryption Scheme, PhD Thesis, Stanford 2009�HGentry, A Fully Homomorphic Encryption Scheme, PhD Thesis, Stanford 2009��id�6655ba97adc0�body�٨要符合直觉（如滑动返回）、给操作反馈、避免误触、兼顾不同手型与单手操作，并别把重要按钮放在太易被拇指误碰的位置。نMake gestures intuitive, give feedback, prevent mis-taps, support one-handed use, and keep key buttons away from easy thumb accidents.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6803eca66c7b�body���JPEG 先把图像分块并转换到频率域，丢弃人眼不敏感的高频细节，再做量化与熵编码。它是有损压缩，所以体积远小于原始像素。压缩质量可调，越高保真则文件越大。�
JPEG splits an image into blocks, transforms to the frequency domain, discards high-frequency details the eye barely notices, then quantizes and entropy-codes. Being lossy, it is far smaller than raw pixels. Quality is adjustable: higher fidelity means larger files.�ans��src��图像压缩�Image compression��id�69b45a50ed6d�body��{个人数据被用于训练后很难撤回，遗忘权让公民有权要求删除，在创新与隐私之间取得平衡。ٗOnce personal data is used for training it is hard to retract; the right to be forgotten lets people demand deletion, balancing innovation and privacy.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�69cfc74b7bb8�body�ٳ免费 App 常靠广告、内购（买皮肤、去广告）或把你的数据用于推荐来赚钱。天下没有真免费，用之前看看它怎么赢利，留意隐私条款。٩Free apps earn via ads, in-app purchases (skins, ad-free) or using your data for recommendations. Nothing is truly free—check how it makes money and the privacy terms.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6a2014f822f2�body���多数司法辖区要求作品有“人类作者”，纯 AI 自动生成的内容往往难以获得版权保护。训练数据若未经授权使用他人作品，还可能涉及侵权。相关规则仍在快速演化。��Most jurisdictions require a human author, so purely AI-generated output often cannot be copyrighted. Training on unauthorized works may also raise infringement issues. The rules are still evolving quickly.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�6aeb4bf83aa7�body���每个区块都包含上一个区块的哈希，像锁链一样环环相扣；一旦改了某个历史区块，后面所有哈希都会失效，且要改写需控制全网多数算力或权益，因此成本高到不划算。��Each block contains the hash of the previous one, chaining them together; altering a past block breaks every later hash, and rewriting history would require controlling the majority of the network's power or stake—prohibitively costly.�ans��src��BNakamoto《Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System》(2008)�AS. Nakamoto, Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System, 2008��id�6b8dc3972475�body���音频压缩利用心理声学，屏蔽掉人耳难以分辨的微弱声音和频率细节。再结合预测和熵编码去除冗余，可在几乎听不出差别的前提下大幅减小体积。它是有损压缩。��Audio compression uses psychoacoustics to hide faint sounds and fine frequencies the ear barely detects. Prediction and entropy coding then remove redundancy, shrinking files with little perceived difference. It is lossy.�ans��src��mCharles Petzold,《Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software》第2版,Microsoft Press,2022�IC. Petzold, Code, 2nd ed., Microsoft Press, 2022; Chinese ed.《编码》��id�6b90feba381c�body��0鸭子类型是一种动态类型风格：不关心对象属于哪个类，只在意它“能不能做这件事”，比如有 quack 方法就当鸭子用。这让代码更灵活、耦合更低，同一函数可处理多种不同类型的对象。代价是类型错误可能推迟到运行时才暴露。�8Duck typing is a dynamic style: rather than caring what class an object belongs to, it cares whether the object can do the job, such as having a quack method. This makes code flexible and loosely coupled, letting one function handle many different types. The cost is that type errors may surface only at runtime.�ans��src�ٞMilojkovic, Ghafari, Nierstrasz,《It's Duck (Typing) Season!》,2017 IEEE/ACM 25th International Conference on Program Compr,2017 (DOI: 10.1109/icpc.2017.10)ٜMilojkovic, Ghafari, Nierstrasz, 'It's Duck (Typing) Season!', 2017 IEEE/ACM 25th International Conference on Program Compr, 2017, DOI: 10.1109/icpc.2017.10��id�6cb5a3f5fa35�body�ٷ智能体在环境中通过试错采取动作，依据奖励信号调整策略以最大化长期回报，核心是权衡探索与利用，典型算法有 Q-learning 和策略梯度。��An agent acts in an environment, adjusting its policy from reward signals to maximize long-term return, balancing exploration vs exploitation; key algorithms include Q-learning and policy gradients.�ans��src��Sutton & Barto�Sutton & Barto��id�6f83915f9a85�body�ٖ容器把应用和依赖打包在一起，共享操作系统内核，启动快、更轻量；虚拟机则虚拟整套系统，隔离更强但更重。ٗA container bundles an app with its dependencies and shares the OS kernel, fast and light; a VM virtualizes a whole OS, stronger isolation but heavier.�ans��src��LSean Doyle & Matt Hite,《Docker: Up & Running》第2版,O'Reilly Media,2018�KSean Doyle & Matt Hite, Docker: Up & Running, 2nd ed., O'Reilly Media, 2018��id�6fd3614c715e�body���负责任 AI 是一套原则和实践，要求系统在公平、透明、隐私、安全和可问责等方面达标。它强调从设计到部署全程考虑社会影响。许多公司和监管机构都发布了相应准则。�Responsible AI is a set of principles and practices requiring systems to meet fairness, transparency, privacy, safety, and accountability. It stresses considering social impact from design through deployment. Many companies and regulators have published such guidelines.�ans��src��URussell & Norvig,《Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach》第4版,Pearson,2020�\S. Russell and P. Norvig, Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach, 4th ed., Pearson, 2020��id�708ad0a0b05c�body���游程编码把连续重复的值记成“值+重复次数”，例如把白白白黑记为 白3黑1。它对大面积同色、扫描线式的数据非常高效，如简单图标和传真。遇到频繁变化的数据反而可能越压越大。��Run-length encoding records consecutive repeats as value plus count, e.g. white white white black becomes white3 black1. It is very efficient for large uniform areas like simple icons and faxes. On frequently changing data it can even grow the size.�ans��src��数据压缩入门�Compression primer��id�7114c12e26c9�body��垃圾回收器自动找出程序不再使用的对象并回收其内存，免得程序员手动释放而遗漏或重复释放。常见策略有标记-清除、分代回收等，依据对象存活时间分区处理。它降低了内存错误，但会在回收时产生停顿。�TA garbage collector automatically finds objects the program no longer uses and reclaims their memory, sparing programmers from manual freeing that can be forgotten or duplicated. Common strategies include mark-sweep and generational collection, partitioning by object lifetime. It reduces memory bugs but can cause pauses during collection.�ans��src��aAbelson & Sussman,《Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs》MIT Press,1996 第二版�3H. Abelson and G. J. Sussman, SICP, MIT Press, 1996��id�712f9f6fed07�body�ي单元测试只测一个最小函数是否正确；集成测试检查多个模块拼起来能否协同工作，二者互补保证质量。َA unit test checks one small function; an integration test checks that combined modules work together. They complement each other for quality.�ans��src��gRobert C. Martin,《Clean Code》Prentice Hall,2008;中译《代码整洁之道》人民邮电出版社�:R. C. Martin, Clean Code, Prentice Hall, 2008; Chinese ed.��id�7307f41f69c1�body��
哈希表用哈希函数把键映射到一个数组下标，理想情况下查找只需一次计算，时间接近 O(1)。不同键可能映射到同一位置，称为冲突，常用链地址法或开放寻址解决。负载因子过高时会扩容并重新哈希。�"A hash table uses a hash function to map a key to an array index, so a lookup ideally needs just one computation, close to O(1). Different keys may map to the same slot, called a collision, resolved by chaining or open addressing. When the load factor gets too high it resizes and rehashes.�ans��src��WCormen, Leiserson, Rivest, Stein,《Introduction to Algorithms》第3版,MIT Press,2009�IT. H. Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, 3rd ed., MIT Press, 2009��id�7646e9992091�body�ٴ中间人攻击是攻击者暗中截获并可能篡改通信双方的数据，常见手段有伪造证书、ARP 欺骗；使用 HTTPS、证书固定和 VPN 可削弱此类风险。ٱA MITM attack secretly intercepts and possibly alters traffic between two parties, e.g. via forged certificates or ARP spoofing; HTTPS, certificate pinning and VPNs mitigate it.�ans��src��DFerguson、Schneier、Kohno,《Cryptography Engineering》Wiley,2010�LN. Ferguson, B. Schneier and T. Kohno, Cryptography Engineering, Wiley, 2010��id�770f7b5d8df3�body�٨死锁是多个进程互相等待对方持有的资源，谁都无法前进。常见避免方法：按固定顺序加锁、设置超时、一次性申请全部资源。ٳA deadlock is when processes each wait for a resource the other holds, so none proceeds. Avoid it by locking in a fixed order, using timeouts, or requesting all resources at once.�ans��src��BTanenbaum & Bos,《Modern Operating Systems》第4版,Pearson,2014�LA. S. Tanenbaum and H. Bos, Modern Operating Systems, 4th ed., Pearson, 2014��id�770fe2553850�body�ٜ重构是在不改变外部行为的前提下改进内部结构，提升可读性与可维护性，常与测试配合，避免代码腐化和功能退化。ٟRefactoring improves internal structure without changing external behavior to boost readability and maintainability, usually with tests to prevent regressions.�ans��src��Martin Fowler�Martin Fowler��id�78ce07bdd9dc�body��类型系统是一套给程序中的值分类并规定它们如何组合使用的规则。它能在编译或运行期捕获许多错误，比如把字符串当数字相加。好的类型系统还能充当文档，帮助IDE自动补全并支持更安全的重构。�4A type system is a set of rules that classify values in a program and govern how they may be combined. It can catch many errors at compile or run time, such as adding a string where a number is expected. A good type system also serves as documentation, powers IDE autocomplete, and enables safer refactoring.�ans��src��LB. C. Pierce,《类型与程序设计语言》,MIT 出版社,2002,第 15 章�PBenjamin C. Pierce, Types and Programming Languages, MIT Press, 2002, Chapter 15��id�79e1fc46bcdd�body��浏览器先通过 DNS 把域名解析成 IP，再与服务器建立 TCP 连接（HTTPS 还需 TLS 握手），随后发送 HTTP 请求并接收响应。浏览器解析返回的内容（HTML/CSS/JS）并渲染成页面，期间可能并行加载更多资源。�%The browser first resolves the domain to an IP via DNS, then establishes a TCP connection with the server (and a TLS handshake for HTTPS), and sends an HTTP request to receive a response. It parses the returned HTML/CSS/JS and renders the page, often fetching additional resources in parallel.�ans��src��MKurose《计算机网络:自顶向下方法》第1章 (机械工业出版社)�uJ. Kurose, K. Ross, Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach, 7th ed., Chapter 1 (Computer Networks and the Internet)��id�7a7db18fe965�body���JOIN 把两个或多个表中满足关联条件的行组合起来，使一次查询就能跨表获取分散在不同表中的相关数据。常见的内连接只保留匹配行，外连接还会保留一侧未匹配的行并补空值。�JOIN combines rows from two or more tables that satisfy a related condition, letting one query pull related data spread across tables. An inner join keeps only matched rows, while an outer join also retains unmatched rows from one side, filling them with nulls.�ans��src��FSilberschatz《数据库系统概念》第4章 (机械工业出版社)�[A. Silberschatz, H. Korth, S. Sudarshan, Database System Concepts, 7th ed., Chapter 4 (SQL)��id�7ad2810d551f�body�ٸISA 是 CPU 能理解的指令规范。x86 是复杂指令集（CISC），单条指令能做复杂事；ARM 是精简指令集（RISC），指令简单、功耗低，常见于手机。٭An ISA is the specification of instructions a CPU understands. x86 is CISC with complex instructions, while ARM is RISC with simple, low-power instructions common in phones.�ans��src��eHennessy & Patterson,《Computer Architecture: A Quantitative Approach》第6版,Morgan Kaufmann,2017�YJ. L. Hennessy and D. A. Patterson, Computer Architecture, 6th ed., Morgan Kaufmann, 2017��id�7afd76ef4550�body���规范化是一套把表拆细、消除重复数据的设计方法，常用到第一到第三范式。它减少更新异常，让数据更一致。过度规范化也可能让查询需要太多连接，因此实际会折中。��Normalization splits tables and removes duplication, typically through first to third normal forms. It reduces update anomalies and keeps data consistent. Over-normalizing can force too many joins, so practice seeks a balance.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019��id�7d2e066f85c5�body�ٟHTTP 是一问一答、连完就断；WebSocket 先握手再升级成一条长连接，之后服务器可主动随时推消息，适合聊天和实时行情。ٯHTTP is request-response and closes; WebSocket upgrades to one long-lived connection after a handshake, so the server can push messages anytime, great for chat and live feeds.�ans��src��PKurose & Ross,《Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach》第8版,Pearson,2021�HJ. F. Kurose and K. W. Ross, Computer Networking, 8th ed., Pearson, 2021��id�7e694b97d29f�body���各设备先用本地数据训练模型，只把更新后的参数或梯度（而非原始数据）加密上传，服务器聚合成一个更好的全局模型再下发。原始数据始终留在设备上，从而保护隐私。��Each device trains locally and uploads only model updates or gradients—not raw data—which the server aggregates into a better global model and sends back. Raw data never leaves the device.�ans��src�٪《Federated Learning: Collaborative Machine Learning Without Data Sharing》,Journal of Computational Analysis and Applications,2025 (DOI: 10.48047/jocaaa.2025.34.12.02)٧'Federated Learning: Collaborative Machine Learning Without Data Sharing', Journal of Computational Analysis and Applications, 2025, DOI: 10.48047/jocaaa.2025.34.12.02��id�7f28f99e8f87�body�ٳ别点里面的链接、别回短信、别填信息。正规机构不会用短信问你要银行卡号。拿不准就自己打开官方 App 查，而不是点短信里的网址。٤Don't click links, reply, or fill in info. Legit organizations won't ask for your card by text. When unsure, open the official app yourself instead of the SMS link.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�80c5fd11a4aa�body���NoSQL 泛指非关系型数据库，包括文档、键值、列族和图等多种模型。它们通常放弃严格模式和跨行事务，以换取易扩展和高性能。适合结构多变或海量数据的场景。��NoSQL broadly means non-relational stores: document, key-value, column-family, and graph models. They usually drop strict schemas and cross-row transactions for easy scaling and performance. They suit evolving or massive data.�ans��src��GSilberschatz 等,《Database System Concepts》第7版,McGraw-Hill,2019�LA. Silberschatz et al., Database System Concepts, 7th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2019